<?xml version="1.0" encoding="UTF-8"?>
<usx version="3.0">
  <book code="JER" style="id"/>
  <para style="h">Jérémie</para>
  <para style="toc1">JÉRÉMIE</para>
  <para style="toc2">Jérémie</para>
  <para style="toc3">Jr</para>
  <para style="mt2">Liv</para>
  <para style="mt1">JÉRÉMIE</para>
  <chapter number="1" style="c" sid="JER 1"/>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="JER 1:1"/>Pawòl a <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">1:1 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="2CH 35:25">II Kwo 35:25</ref></char></note>Jérémie yo, fis a Hilkija a, yon nan prèt yo ki te nan Anathoth nan peyi Benjamin. <verse eid="JER 1:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="JER 1:2"/>Pawòl SENYÈ a te vini kote li nan jou <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">1:2 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="1KI 13:2">I Wa 13:2</ref></char></note>Josias yo, fis a Amon an, wa Juda a, nan trèzyèm ane règn li an. <verse eid="JER 1:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="JER 1:3"/>Li te anplis, vin rive nan jou <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">1:3 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="2KI 23:34">II Wa 23:34</ref></char></note>Jojakim yo, fis a Josias la, wa Juda a, jis rive nan fen onzyèm ane Sédécias, fis a Josias la, wa Juda a, jis rive nan egzil a Jérusalem nan senkyèm mwa a. <verse eid="JER 1:3"/><verse number="4" style="v" sid="JER 1:4"/>Alò, pawòl SENYÈ a te vin kote mwen e te di:<verse eid="JER 1:4"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="JER 1:5"/>Avan Mwen te fòme ou nan vant, Mwen te konnen ou,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 1:5">e avan ou te fèt mwen te konsakre ou.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 1:5">Mwen te <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">1:5 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="JER 1:10">Jr 1:10</ref></char></note>deziye ou kon yon pwofèt a nasyon yo.<verse eid="JER 1:5"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="JER 1:6"/>Konsa, mwen te di: “Malè a mwen, Senyè BONDYE! Gade byen, mwen pa menm konnen kijan pou m pale, paske <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">1:6 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="1KI 3:7">I Wa 3:7</ref></char></note>mwen se sèlman yon jennonm.”<verse eid="JER 1:6"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="JER 1:7"/>Men SENYÈ a te di mwen: “Pa di: ‘Mwen se sèlman yon jennonm’, paske tout kote Mwen voye ou, ou va ale, e <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">1:7 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="NUM 22:20">Nonb 22:20</ref></char></note>tout sa ke Mwen kòmande ou, ou va pale l. <verse eid="JER 1:7"/><verse number="8" style="v" sid="JER 1:8"/><note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">1:8 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="EXO 3:12">Egz 3:12</ref></char></note>Pa pè yo, Paske Mwen avèk ou pou delivre ou”, SENYÈ a di.<verse eid="JER 1:8"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="JER 1:9"/>Epi SENYÈ a te lonje men L e te <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">1:9 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ISA 6:7">És 6:7</ref></char></note>touche bouch mwen. Konsa, SENYÈ a te di mwen: “Gade byen, Mwen te mete pawòl Mwen nan bouch ou. <verse eid="JER 1:9"/><verse number="10" style="v" sid="JER 1:10"/>Ou wè, <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">1:10 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="REV 11:3-6">Rev 11:3-6</ref></char></note>Mwen te deziye ou nan jou sa a sou nasyon yo, ak sou wayòm yo, pou rache, pou demoli, pou detwi, pou boulvèse, pou bati ak pou plante.”<verse eid="JER 1:10"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="JER 1:11"/>Pawòl SENYÈ a te rive kote mwen. Li te di: “Se kisa ou wè, <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">1:11 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="JER 24:3">Jr 24:3</ref></char></note>Jérémie?” Mwen te reponn: “Mwen wè yon bout branch zanmann.”<verse eid="JER 1:11"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="JER 1:12"/>Konsa, SENYÈ a te di mwen: “Ou te wè byen; paske <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">1:12 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="JER 31:28">Jr 31:28</ref></char></note>Mwen ap veye sou pawòl Mwen pou pawòl Mwen vin fèt.”<verse eid="JER 1:12"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="JER 1:13"/>Pawòl SENYÈ a te vin kote mwen yon dezyèm fwa epi te di: “Se kisa ou wè”?</para>
  <para style="p" vid="JER 1:13">Epi mwen te di: “Mwen wè yon chodyè k ap bouyi, k ap apiye fas li kont nò a.” <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">1:13 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ZEC 4:2">Za 4:2</ref></char></note> <verse eid="JER 1:13"/><verse number="14" style="v" sid="JER 1:14"/>Konsa, SENYÈ a te di mwen: <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">1:14 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ISA 41:25">És 41:25</ref></char></note>“Depi nan nò a, mal la va pete vin parèt sou tout sila ki rete nan peyi a. <verse eid="JER 1:14"/><verse number="15" style="v" sid="JER 1:15"/>Paske gade byen, Mwen ap rele tout fanmi a wayòm yo nan nò”, deklare SENYÈ a;</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 1:15">“Yo va vini, e yo chak va <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">1:15 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ISA 22:7">És 22:7</ref></char></note>plase twòn yo</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 1:15">nan antre pòtay Jérusalem nan,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 1:15">kont tout miray antoure li yo, e kont tout vil Juda yo.<verse eid="JER 1:15"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="JER 1:16"/>Mwen va pwononse jijman Mwen sou yo pou tout mechanste yo,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 1:16">akòz yo te abandone Mwen,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 1:16">te <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">1:16 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="JER 7:9">Jr 7:9</ref></char></note>ofri sakrifis a lòt dye yo,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 1:16">e te adore pwòp zèv men pa yo.<verse eid="JER 1:16"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="JER 1:17"/>“Alò, pou sa a, <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">1:17 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="1KI 18:46">I Wa 18:46</ref></char></note>mare senti ou, epi leve pou pale yo tout sa ke M kòmande ou. Pa pè devan yo, sinon Mwen va fè ou pè devan yo. <verse eid="JER 1:17"/><verse number="18" style="v" sid="JER 1:18"/>Gade byen, Mwen te fè ou menm jodi a kon yon vil fòtifye, kon yon pilye fè e kon miray an bwonz kont yon peyi nèt—a wa Juda yo, ak prens li yo, vè prèt li yo e a pèp a peyi a. <verse eid="JER 1:18"/><verse number="19" style="v" sid="JER 1:19"/>Yo va goumen kont ou, men yo p ap reyisi; paske <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">1:19 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="NUM 14:9">Nonb 14:9</ref></char></note>Mwen avèk ou pou delivre ou,” deklare SENYÈ a.<verse eid="JER 1:19"/></para>
  <chapter eid="JER 1"/>
  <chapter number="2" style="c" sid="JER 2"/>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="JER 2:1"/>Alò pawòl SENYÈ a te vin kote mwen epi te di: <verse eid="JER 2:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="JER 2:2"/>“Ale e pwoklame nan zòrèy a Jérusalem pou di: ‘Konsa pale SENYÈ a:</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 2:2">“Mwen sonje de ou, <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">2:2 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="EZK 16:8">Éz 16:8</ref></char></note>jan ou te renmen M lè ou te jenn;</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 2:2">lanmou ou lè ou te fiyanse avè M,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 2:2">jan ou te swiv Mwen nan dezè a,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 2:2">nan yon peyi ki pa t konn simen.<verse eid="JER 2:2"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="JER 2:3"/>Israël te sen a SENYÈ, <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">2:3 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="JAS 1:18">Jc 1:18</ref></char></note>premye a rekòlt Li a.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 2:3">Tout moun ki te manje de li va vin koupab.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 2:3">Se mal ki va rive yo,’” deklare SENYÈ a.”<verse eid="JER 2:3"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="JER 2:4"/>Tande pawòl SENYÈ a, O lakay Jacob ak tout fanmi lakay Israël yo.<verse eid="JER 2:4"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="JER 2:5"/>Konsa pale SENYÈ a:</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 2:5">
    <note caller="+" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">2:5 </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="ISA 5:4">És 5:4</ref>
      </char>
    </note>“Ki enjistis papa zansèt nou yo</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 2:5">te jwenn nan Mwen,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 2:5">pou yo te ale lwen Mwen,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 2:5">pou yo te mache dèyè sa ki vid</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 2:5">pou te vin vid yo menm?<verse eid="JER 2:5"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="JER 2:6"/>Yo pa t mande: ‘Kote SENYÈ a</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 2:6">ki te mennen nou sòti nan peyi Égypte la,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 2:6">ki te mennen nou nan dezè a,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 2:6">pou travèse yon peyi dezè ak fòs yo,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 2:6">nan yon peyi ak sechrès e ak fon tenèb,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 2:6">yon peyi ke pèsòn pa t konn travèse</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 2:6">e kote okenn moun pa t rete?’<verse eid="JER 2:6"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="JER 2:7"/>Mwen te mennen ou antre nan yon peyi fètil</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 2:7">pou manje fwi li ak bon bagay li yo.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 2:7">Men nou te vini, e nou te <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">2:7 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="PSA 106:38">Sòm 106:38</ref></char></note>souye peyi Mwen an ak eritaj Mwen an,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 2:7">nou te fè li vin abominab.<verse eid="JER 2:7"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="JER 2:8"/>Prèt yo pa t di: ‘Kote SENYÈ a ye?’</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 2:8">Epi sila yo ki te responsab lalwa a <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">2:8 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="JER 4:22">Jr 4:22</ref></char></note>pa t rekonèt Mwen.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 2:8">Chèf yo tou te fè transgresyon kont Mwen;</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 2:8">pwofèt yo te pwofetize pou Baal,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 2:8">e te mache dèyè bagay ki pa t gen benefis.<verse eid="JER 2:8"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="JER 2:9"/>“Pou sa, jiska prezan, Mwen va <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">2:9 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="JER 2:35">Jr 2:35</ref></char></note>fè kont avèk nou”, deklare SENYÈ a:</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 2:9">“Menm avèk pitit a pitit nou yo, Mwen va fè kont.<verse eid="JER 2:9"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="JER 2:10"/>Alò, <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">2:10 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ISA 23:12">És 23:12</ref></char></note>travèse rive nan peyi kot yo nan Kittim pou wè;</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 2:10">voye Kédar pou obsève e wè si janmen te gen yon bagay konsa!<verse eid="JER 2:10"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="JER 2:11"/>Èske yon nasyon janm te chanje dye pa yo,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 2:11">malgre, se pa dye yo te ye?</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 2:11">Men pèp Mwen an te <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">2:11 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="PSA 106:20">Sòm 106:20</ref></char></note>fè echanj glwa pa yo pou sa ki san benefis.<verse eid="JER 2:11"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="JER 2:12"/>Menm <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">2:12 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ISA 1:2">És 1:2</ref></char></note> syèl yo etonnen, jis yo vin fremi.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 2:12">Reste byen dezole, deklare SENYÈ a.<verse eid="JER 2:12"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="JER 2:13"/>Paske pèp Mwen an te komèt de kalite mal:</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 2:13">Yo te abandone Mwen, <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">2:13 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="PSA 36:9">Sòm 36:9</ref></char></note>fontèn dlo vivan yo,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 2:13">epi yo te fouye pou kont yo lòt sitèn;</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 2:13">sitèn yo ki kraze ki pa ka kenbe dlo.<verse eid="JER 2:13"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="JER 2:14"/>Èske Israël se yon <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">2:14 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="JER 5:19">Jr 5:19</ref></char></note>esklav?</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 2:14">Èske li se yon esklav ki te fèt lakay nou?</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 2:14">Pou ki rezon li te devni yon kaptif?<verse eid="JER 2:14"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="JER 2:15"/>Jenn <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">2:15 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="JER 50:17">Jr 50:17</ref></char></note>lyon yo gwonde sou li;</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 2:15">ak gwo bri yo leve vwa yo.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 2:15">Yo te fin gate peyi li nèt.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 2:15">Vil li yo brile nèt.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 2:15">Pa gen moun ki pou rete ladann.<verse eid="JER 2:15"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="JER 2:16"/>Anplis, mesye Memphis ak Tachpanès yo</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 2:16">te brize <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">2:16 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="DEU 33:20">Det 33:20</ref></char></note>kouwòn tèt ou a.<verse eid="JER 2:16"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="JER 2:17"/>Èske Se pa ou menm ki <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">2:17 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="DEU 32:10">Det 32:10</ref></char></note>fè sa</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 2:17">lè ou kite SENYÈ Bondye ou a,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 2:17">pandan Li t ap mennen ou nan chemen an?<verse eid="JER 2:17"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="JER 2:18"/>Men koulye a, se kisa w ap fè <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">2:18 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ISA 30:2">És 30:2</ref></char></note>nan wout pou rive Égypte la,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 2:18">lè w ale pou bwè dlo nan Rivyè Nil lan?</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 2:18">Oswa se kisa w ap fè nan wout pou ale Assyrie a,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 2:18">pou bwè dlo nan flèv pa yo a?<verse eid="JER 2:18"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="JER 2:19"/>Pwòp mechanste ou va korije ou,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 2:19">e <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">2:19 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ISA 3:9">És 3:9</ref></char></note>enfidelite ou va repwoche ou.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 2:19">Pou sa, konnen e wè ke se mal e anmè ke ou</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 2:19">te abandone SENYÈ a, Bondye ou a.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 2:19">Laperèz Mwen pa nan ou,” deklare Senyè BONDYE dèzame yo.<verse eid="JER 2:19"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="JER 2:20"/>Paske lontan sa, <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">2:20 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="LEV 26:13">Lev 26:13</ref></char></note>Mwen te kraze jouk ou a.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 2:20">Mwen te chire kòd mare ou yo.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 2:20">Men ou te di: “Mwen p ap sèvi!’</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 2:20">Paske sou chak kolin ki wo, e anba chak bwa vèt,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 2:20">ou te kouche tankou pwostitiye.<verse eid="JER 2:20"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="JER 2:21"/>Sepandan, Mwen te plante chan rezen pi chwazi pou ou,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 2:21">yon grenn ki fidèl nèt.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 2:21">Alò kòman konsa ou te vin detounen devan M</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 2:21">pou tounen yon <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">2:21 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ISA 5:4">És 5:4</ref></char></note>boujon ki dejenere nèt</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 2:21">sou yon chan rezen etranje?<verse eid="JER 2:21"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="JER 2:22"/>Malgre se ak savon lesiv ou ta savonnen ak anpil savon,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 2:22">
    <note caller="+" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">2:22 </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="JOB 14:7">Job 14:7</ref>
      </char>
    </note>tach inikite ou rete devan M,”</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 2:22">deklare Senyè BONDYE a.<verse eid="JER 2:22"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="JER 2:23"/>
    <note caller="+" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">2:23 </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="PRO 30:12">Pwov 30:12</ref>
      </char>
    </note>“Kòman ou ka di: ‘Mwen pa sal,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 2:23">Mwen pa t kouri dèyè Baal yo?’</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 2:23">Gade chemen ou nan vale a!</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 2:23">Konnen byen sa ou te fè a!</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 2:23">Ou se yon jenn femèl chamo byen rapid,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 2:23">k ap fè chemen l kote li pito.<verse eid="JER 2:23"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="JER 2:24"/>Yon <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">2:24 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="JER 14:6">Jr 14:6</ref></char></note>femèl bourik mawon ki abitye nan savann nan,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 2:24">k ap pran sant van pou lè l bezwen kwaze ak mal.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 2:24">Nan lè chalè li, se kilès ki ka detounen l?</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 2:24">Tout moun k ap chache l p ap fatige kò yo;</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 2:24">nan mwa li, yo va jwenn ak li.<verse eid="JER 2:24"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="JER 2:25"/>Kenbe bon fè sou pye ou e mouye gòj ou pou ou pa swaf;</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 2:25">men ou te di: ‘Sa p ap ka fèt, Non!</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 2:25">Paske mwen te fè renmen ak etranje yo;</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 2:25">se dèyè yo m ap prale.’<verse eid="JER 2:25"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="JER 2:26"/>Tankou <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">2:26 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="JER 48:27">Jr 48:27</ref></char></note>vòlè vin wont lè l vin dekouvri,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 2:26">se konsa lakay Israël vin wont—</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 2:26">wa yo, prens yo, ak prèt yo ak pwofèt yo!<verse eid="JER 2:26"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="JER 2:27"/>kap di pyebwa a: ‘Se ou ki papa mwen’,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 2:27">epi a yon wòch: ‘Se ou ki fè mwen.’</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 2:27">Paske yo te <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">2:27 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="JER 18:17">Jr 18:17</ref> </char></note>vire do ban Mwen olye figi yo;</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 2:27">men nan tan gwo pwoblèm yo,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 2:27">yo va di Mwen: ‘Leve pou sove nou.’<verse eid="JER 2:27"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="JER 2:28"/>Men kote <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">2:28 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="DEU 32:37">Det 32:37</ref></char></note>dye ke ou te fè pou kont ou yo ye?</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 2:28">Kite yo leve, si yo ka sove ou nan tan twoub ou yo;</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 2:28">paske selon fòs kantite vil ou yo, kantite dye ou ye, O Juda.<verse eid="JER 2:28"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="JER 2:29"/>Poukisa ou fè kont avè M?</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 2:29">
    <note caller="+" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">2:29 </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="JER 5:1">Jr 5:1</ref>
      </char>
    </note>Nou tout te fè transgresyon kont Mwen,” deklare SENYÈ a.<verse eid="JER 2:29"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="30" style="v" sid="JER 2:30"/>
    <note caller="+" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">2:30 </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="ISA 1:5">És 1:5</ref>
      </char>
    </note>“Anven Mwen te frape fis ou yo;</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 2:30">men yo pa t aksepte okenn chatiman.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 2:30">Nepe ou te fin devore pwofèt ou yo tankou lyon k ap detwi.<verse eid="JER 2:30"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="31" style="v" sid="JER 2:31"/>O jenerasyon, koute byen a pawòl SENYÈ a.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 2:31">Èske Mwen te yon dezè pou Israël,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 2:31">oswa yon peyi fènwa byen pwès?</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 2:31">Poukisa pèp Mwen an di: <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">2:31 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="DEU 32:15">Det 32:15</ref></char></note> ‘Nou lib pou nou gaye toupatou.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 2:31">Nou p ap vin kote Ou ankò?’<verse eid="JER 2:31"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="32" style="v" sid="JER 2:32"/>Èske vyèj la ka bliye dekorasyon li yo,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 2:32">oswa fi maryaj la, vètman li an?</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 2:32">Sepandan, pèp Mwen an fin <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">2:32 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="PSA 106:21">Sòm 106:21</ref></char></note>bliye Mwen</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 2:32">pandan jou ki pa ka menm konte.<verse eid="JER 2:32"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="33" style="v" sid="JER 2:33"/>A la byen ou prepare chemen ou pou chache lanmou!</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 2:33">Konsa, menm fanm mechan yo, ou te enstwi nan chemen ou yo.<verse eid="JER 2:33"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="34" style="v" sid="JER 2:34"/>Anplis, sou jip ou, yo twouve <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">2:34 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="2KI 21:16">II Wa 21:16</ref></char></note>san lavi a malere ki inosan yo.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 2:34">Ou pa t jwenn yo t ap kase kay ou.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 2:34">Men se akoz tout bagay sa yo,<verse eid="JER 2:34"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="35" style="v" sid="JER 2:35"/>Sepandan, ou te di: ‘Mwen inosan.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 2:35">Asireman, kòlè Li pa sou mwen.’</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 2:35">Gade byen, Mwen va <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">2:35 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="PRO 28:13">Pwov 28:13</ref></char></note>antre nan jijman avèk ou, paske ou di:</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 2:35">‘Mwen pa t peche.’<verse eid="JER 2:35"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="36" style="v" sid="JER 2:36"/>Poukisa ou mache toupatou konsa nan chanje wout ou?</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 2:36">Anplis, <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">2:36 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="2CH 28:16">II Kwo 28:16</ref></char></note>Égypte va fè ou wont,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 2:36">menm jan ke Assyrie te fè ou wont lan.<verse eid="JER 2:36"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="37" style="v" sid="JER 2:37"/>Soti kote sa a tou, ou va sòti ak men ou sou tèt;</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 2:37">paske SENYÈ a te rejte <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">2:37 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="JER 37:7-10">Jr 37:7-10</ref></char></note>sila ke ou te fè konfyans yo</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 2:37">e ou p ap jwenn avantaj avèk yo.”<verse eid="JER 2:37"/></para>
  <chapter eid="JER 2"/>
  <chapter number="3" style="c" sid="JER 3"/>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="JER 3:1"/>Bondye di: <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">3:1 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="DEU 24:1-4">Det 24:1-4</ref></char></note>“Si yon mari divòse ak madanm li, e li kite li pou jwenn yon lòt gason, èske li va retounen kote li? Èske tè sa a p ap souye nèt? Men ou se yon pwostitiye ak anpil renmen; sepandan, se bò kote M, ou vin vire,” deklare SENYÈ a.<verse eid="JER 3:1"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="JER 3:2"/>“Leve zye ou pou wè mòn toutouni yo epi gade: “Se ki kote yo pa t kouche ak nou? Akote chemen yo, ou te chita tann yo. Tankou yon Arab nan dezè, ou te <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">3:2 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="JER 2:7">Jr 2:7</ref></char></note>pouri peyi a ak pwostitisyon ou ak mechanste ou. <verse eid="JER 3:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="JER 3:3"/>Akoz sa, farinaj lapli te vin sispann e lapli sezon prentan pa t rive. Men fon ou te gen yon fontèn <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">3:3 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="LEV 26:19">Lev 26:19</ref></char></note>pwostitiye; ou te refize vin wont. <verse eid="JER 3:3"/><verse number="4" style="v" sid="JER 3:4"/>Se pa depi koulye a, ou va rele a Mwen: ‘Papa mwen, ou se zanmi jenès mwen’?<verse eid="JER 3:4"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="JER 3:5"/>
    <note caller="+" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">3:5 </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="PSA 103:9">Sòm 103:9</ref>
      </char>
    </note> “‘Èske Li va fache jis pou tout tan? Èske Li va ensanse ak kòlè jiska lafen?’ Gade byen, ou te pale, ou te fè bagay ki mal e ou te fè pwòp volonte ou.”<verse eid="JER 3:5"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="JER 3:6"/>Alò, SENYÈ a te di m nan jou a wa Josias yo: “Èske ou te wè sa ke Israël enfidèl te fè a? Li te <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">3:6 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="JER 17:2">Jr 17:2</ref></char></note>monte sou tout kolin ki wo yo e anba tout bwa vèt. La, li te yon pwostitiye. <verse eid="JER 3:6"/><verse number="7" style="v" sid="JER 3:7"/><note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">3:7 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="2KI 17:13">II Wa 17:13</ref></char></note>Mwen te reflechi: ‘Apre li fin fè tout bagay sa yo, li va retounen kote Mwen.’ Men li pa t retounen e sè trèt li a, Juda, te wè l. <verse eid="JER 3:7"/><verse number="8" style="v" sid="JER 3:8"/>Konsa, lè Mwen te wè tout enfidelite ak pwostitiye li yo, Mwen te voye li ale, e Mwen te fè yon dekrè pou divòse ak li. Men <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">3:8 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="EZK 16:46-47">Éz 16:46-47</ref></char></note>sè trèt li a, Juda, pa t gen lakrent, men li te ale fè pwostitiye tou. <verse eid="JER 3:8"/><verse number="9" style="v" sid="JER 3:9"/>Akoz li te pran pwostitiye li a kon yon bagay lejè, li te pouri peyi a e te fè adiltè ak <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">3:9 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ISA 57:6">És 57:6</ref></char></note>wòch ak pyebwa. <verse eid="JER 3:9"/><verse number="10" style="v" sid="JER 3:10"/>Men malgre tout sa, sè trèt li a, Juda, pa t retounen kote Mwen ak tout kè l, men pito ak <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">3:10 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="JER 12:2">Jr 12:2</ref></char></note>desepsyon”, deklare SENYÈ a.<verse eid="JER 3:10"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="JER 3:11"/>Konsa, SENYÈ a te di m: “Israël enfidèl la te montre li pi dwat pase trèt la, Juda. <verse eid="JER 3:11"/><verse number="12" style="v" sid="JER 3:12"/>Ale pwoklame pawòl sa yo vè nò, epi di: <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">3:12 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="JER 3:14-22">Jr 3:14-22</ref></char></note> ‘Retounen, Israël enfidèl’, deklare SENYÈ a; ‘Mwen p ap gade ou ak kòlè. Paske Mwen gen mizerikòd, deklare SENYÈ a; Mwen p ap rete fache jis pou tout tan. <verse eid="JER 3:12"/><verse number="13" style="v" sid="JER 3:13"/>Sèlman <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">3:13 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="DEU 30:1-3">Det 30:1-3</ref></char></note>rekonèt inikite ou, ke ou te transgrese kont SENYÈ a, Bondye ou a. Ou te gaye favè ou bay etranje yo anba tout bwa vèt e ou pa t obeyi vwa M,’” deklare SENYÈ a. <verse eid="JER 3:13"/><verse number="14" style="v" sid="JER 3:14"/>“Retounen, O fis enfidèl,” deklare SENYÈ a, “paske Mwen se yon <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">3:14 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="JER 31:32">Jr 31:32</ref></char></note>mèt pou nou. Mwen va retire de nou, youn nan yon vil e de nan yon fanmi, e Mwen va mennen nou Sion.” <verse eid="JER 3:14"/><verse number="15" style="v" sid="JER 3:15"/>“Konsa, Mwen va bannou bèje selon pwòp kè Mwen, ki va <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">3:15 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ACT 20:28">Trav 20:28</ref></char></note>fè nou manje sou konesans ak bon konprann. <verse eid="JER 3:15"/><verse number="16" style="v" sid="JER 3:16"/>Li va vin rive nan jou sa yo ke lè nou vin ogmante, e vin anpil nan peyi a”, deklare SENYÈ a, “yo <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">3:16 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ISA 65:17">És 65:17</ref></char></note>p ap di mo ankò: ‘Lach akò SENYÈ a’. Ni sa p ap vini nan tèt yo. Yo p ap sonje li, yo p ap remake pèt li, ni li p ap refèt ankò. <verse eid="JER 3:16"/><verse number="17" style="v" sid="JER 3:17"/>Nan lè sa a, yo va rele Jérusalem: <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">3:17 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="JER 17:12">Jr 17:12</ref></char></note> ‘Twòn SENYÈ a’ e tout nasyon yo va rasanble vè li; vè Jérusalem, vè non SENYÈ a. Ni yo p ap ankò mache ak tèt di ak kè mechan yo. <verse eid="JER 3:17"/><verse number="18" style="v" sid="JER 3:18"/>Nan jou sa yo, lakay Juda va mache ak lakay Israël, e yo va vini ansanm sòti nan peyi nò pou rive nan <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">3:18 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="AMO 9:15">Am 9:15</ref></char></note>peyi ke Mwen te bay a papa zansèt nou yo kon eritaj la.”<verse eid="JER 3:18"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="JER 3:19"/>“Epi Mwen te di: ‘Kòman Mwen fè lanvi pou plase ou pami fis Mwen yo, e bay ou yon bèl peyi, eritaj ki <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">3:19 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="PSA 16:6">Sòm 16:6</ref></char></note>pi bèl pami nasyon yo!’ Epi Mwen te di: ‘Ou va rele Mwen: “Papa Mwen”, e ou p ap detounen sispann swiv Mwen.’”<verse eid="JER 3:19"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="JER 3:20"/>“Anverite, kon yon fanm fè trèt pou kite mari li, se konsa ou te <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">3:20 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ISA 48:8">És 48:8</ref></char></note>fè trèt kite Mwen, O lakay Israël”, deklare SENYÈ a. <verse eid="JER 3:20"/><verse number="21" style="v" sid="JER 3:21"/>Yon vwa vin tande sou wotè mòn vid yo; vwa k ap kriye ak vwa siplikasyon a fis Israël yo; akoz yo te pèvèti chemen yo, yo te <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">3:21 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ISA 17:10">És 17:10</ref></char></note>bliye SENYÈ a, Bondye yo. <verse eid="JER 3:21"/><verse number="22" style="v" sid="JER 3:22"/>“Retounen, O fis enfidèl, Mwen va geri enfidelite ou.”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="JER 3:22">“Gade byen, nou vin kote Ou; paske Ou se SENYÈ a, Bondye nou an. <verse eid="JER 3:22"/><verse number="23" style="v" sid="JER 3:23"/>Anverite, soutyèn <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">3:23 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="JER 17:2">Jr 17:2</ref></char></note>kolin yo se yon desepsyon, yon zen sou mòn yo. Anverite, SENYÈ a, Bondye nou an, se sali Israël. <verse eid="JER 3:23"/><verse number="24" style="v" sid="JER 3:24"/>Men <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">3:24 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="HOS 9:10">Os 9:10</ref></char></note>afè wont sa a te manje fòs zèv zansèt nou yo depi nan jenès nou. Li te manje bann mouton yo ak twoupo yo, fis ak fi yo. <verse eid="JER 3:24"/><verse number="25" style="v" sid="JER 3:25"/>Kite nou kouche nan wont nou, e kite imilyasyon kouvre nou. Paske nou te peche kontre Senyè a, nou menm ak papa nou yo, depi nan jenès nou yo, jis rive menm jodi a. E nou pa t obeyi lavwa Senyè a, papa nou.<verse eid="JER 3:25"/></para>
  <chapter eid="JER 3"/>
  <chapter number="4" style="c" sid="JER 4"/>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="JER 4:1"/>“Si ou va <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">4:1 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="JER 3:22">Jr 3:22</ref></char></note>retounen, O Israël”, deklare SENYÈ a, “si ou va retounen kote Mwen, e si ou va retire bagay abominab ou yo devan prezans Mwen; konsa, ou p ap deplase. <verse eid="JER 4:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="JER 4:2"/>Si ou va sèmante: ‘Kon SENYÈ a vivan an’, <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">4:2 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ISA 48:1">És 48:1</ref></char></note>anverite, ak jistis, e nan ladwati; konsa, nasyon yo va beni tèt yo nan Li, e nan Li yo va gen glwa.”<verse eid="JER 4:2"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="JER 4:3"/>Paske se konsa SENYÈ a pale a mesye a Juda ak Jérusalem yo: “Kraze e prepare tè ki poze a; <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">4:3 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="MAT 13:7">Mat 13:7</ref></char></note>pa simen pami pikan yo. <verse eid="JER 4:3"/><verse number="4" style="v" sid="JER 4:4"/>Sikonsi tèt nou a SENYÈ a e retire prepuce kè nou, mesye Juda yo, ak sila ki rete Jérusalem yo, sinon kòlè Mwen va vin parèt tankou dife e brile <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">4:4 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="AMO 5:6">Am 5:6</ref></char></note>pou okenn moun pa ka tenyen l, akoz mechanste a zèv nou yo. <verse eid="JER 4:4"/><verse number="5" style="v" sid="JER 4:5"/>Deklare nan Juda e pwoklame nan Jérusalem, pou di: ‘Soufle twonpèt nan peyi a!’ Kriye fò! Di yo: <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">4:5 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="JOS 10:20">Jos 10:20</ref></char></note> ‘Rasanble nou pou nou antre nan vil fòtifye yo.’ <verse eid="JER 4:5"/><verse number="6" style="v" sid="JER 4:6"/>Leve yon drapo vè Sion! Chache sekou! Pa kanpe anplas, paske Mwen ap mennen <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">4:6 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="JER 1:14-15">Jr 1:14-15</ref></char></note>malè sòti nan nò, ak gwo destriksyon.”<verse eid="JER 4:6"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="JER 4:7"/>Yon <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">4:7 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="JER 5:6">Jr 5:6</ref></char></note>lyon ale soti nan rak bwa li; yon destriktè a nasyon yo gen tan derape. Li fin kite plas li pou fè peyi ou a vin yon savann. Vil ou yo va pil mazi ki san moun pou rete ladan yo. <verse eid="JER 4:7"/><verse number="8" style="v" sid="JER 4:8"/>Pou sa, <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">4:8 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ISA 22:12">És 22:12</ref></char></note>abiye an twal sak! Rele fò! Kriye anmwey! Paske gwo kòlè SENYÈ a pa t kite nou. <verse eid="JER 4:8"/><verse number="9" style="v" sid="JER 4:9"/>“Li va vin rive nan jou sa a,” deklare SENYÈ a: “ke kè a wa a ak kè prens yo va fè fayit. Prèt yo va sezi e <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">4:9 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ISA 29:9-10">És 29:9-10</ref></char></note>pwofèt yo va etone.”<verse eid="JER 4:9"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="JER 4:10"/>Nan lè sa a, mwen te di: “O, Senyè BONDYE! Asireman ou te pase pèp sa <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">4:10 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="EZK 14:9">Éz 14:9</ref></char></note>nan rizib nèt lè Ou te di: ‘Ou va gen lapè’. Men alò, yon nepe parèt sou gòj yo.”<verse eid="JER 4:10"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="JER 4:11"/>Nan lè sa a, li va pale a pèp sa a, e a Jérusalem: “Yon <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">4:11 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="JER 13:24">Jr 13:24</ref></char></note>van sechrès ki sòti nan mòn sèk nan dezè a, nan direksyon fi a pèp Mwen an—— li pa pou vannen ni pou netwaye. <verse eid="JER 4:11"/><verse number="12" style="v" sid="JER 4:12"/>Yon van fò depase sa a——va vini sou lòd Mwen. Alò, anplis Mwen va pwononse jijman kont yo.”<verse eid="JER 4:12"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="JER 4:13"/>Gade byen, li monte tankou nwaj, e cha lagè li yo kon toubiyon. Cheval li yo <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">4:13 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="LAM 4:19">Lam 4:19</ref></char></note>pi vit ke èg. Malè a nou menm, paske nou vin detwi nèt! <verse eid="JER 4:13"/><verse number="14" style="v" sid="JER 4:14"/>Lave kè ou retire mal la, O Jérusalem, pou ou ka sove. Pou jiskilè <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">4:14 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="PRO 1:22">Pwov 1:22</ref></char></note>panse mechan nou yo va rete anndan ou? <verse eid="JER 4:14"/><verse number="15" style="v" sid="JER 4:15"/>Paske yon vwa deklare soti <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">4:15 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="JER 8:16">Jr 8:16</ref></char></note>Dan e pwoklame mechanste soti mòn Éphraïm. <verse eid="JER 4:15"/><verse number="16" style="v" sid="JER 4:16"/>“Livre rapò li bay nasyon yo koulye a! Pwoklame sou Jérusalem, ‘Moun syèj yo sòti nan yon <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">4:16 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ISA 39:3">És 39:3</ref></char></note>peyi lwen! Yo leve vwa yo kontra vil Juda yo. <verse eid="JER 4:16"/><verse number="17" style="v" sid="JER 4:17"/>Tankou gadyen k ap veye yon chan an, yo kont li toupatou, akoz li te <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">4:17 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ISA 1:20-23">És 1:20-23</ref></char></note>fè rebèl kont Mwen’”, deklare SENYÈ a. <verse eid="JER 4:17"/><verse number="18" style="v" sid="JER 4:18"/><note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">4:18 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="PSA 107:17">Sòm 107:17</ref></char></note>“Chemen pa ou yo ak zèv pa ou yo te mennen fè bagay sa yo rive ou. Sa se mal ou. Li amè anpil! A la sa rive jis nan kè ou!”<verse eid="JER 4:18"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="JER 4:19"/>
    <note caller="+" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">4:19 </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="ISA 15:5">És 15:5</ref>
      </char>
    </note>Nanm mwen, nanm mwen! Mwen nan gwo soufrans! O kè mwen! Kè m ap bat anndan m. Mwen p ap ka rete an silans, pwiske ou te tande, O nanm mwen, son de twonpèt la, alam lagè a. <verse eid="JER 4:19"/><verse number="20" style="v" sid="JER 4:20"/><note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">4:20 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="PSA 42:7">Sòm 42:7</ref></char></note>Dega sou dega vin pwoklame, paske tout peyi a fin detwi nèt. Sibitman, tant mwen yo vin devaste; rido mwen yo vin devaste nan yon moman. <verse eid="JER 4:20"/><verse number="21" style="v" sid="JER 4:21"/>Pou konbyen de tan mwen va oblije wè drapo a, e koute son twonpèt la?<verse eid="JER 4:21"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="JER 4:22"/>“Paske, pèp mwen an rete nan foli. Yo pa rekonèt Mwen. Yo se timoun sòt ki pa gen konprann. Yo koken nan <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">4:22 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="JER 9:3">Jr 9:3</ref></char></note>fè mal, men pou fè sa ki bon, yo pa konnen.” <verse eid="JER 4:22"/><verse number="23" style="v" sid="JER 4:23"/>Mwen te gade sou tè a e, gade byen, li te <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">4:23 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="GEN 1:2">Jen 1:2</ref></char></note>san fòm e vid; vè syèl yo men yo pa t gen limyè. <verse eid="JER 4:23"/><verse number="24" style="v" sid="JER 4:24"/>Mwen te gade vè mòn yo, e gade byen, yo t ap <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">4:24 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ISA 5:25">És 5:25</ref></char></note>souke; tout kolin yo te fè mouvman ale retou. <verse eid="JER 4:24"/><verse number="25" style="v" sid="JER 4:25"/>Mwen te gade, e gade byen, pa t gen moun, e tout <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">4:25 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="JER 9:10">Jr 9:10</ref></char></note>zwazo syèl yo te vin sove ale. <verse eid="JER 4:25"/><verse number="26" style="v" sid="JER 4:26"/>Mwen te gade e gade byen, bon peyi fètil la te vin yon dezè, e tout vil li yo te fin demoli devan SENYÈ a, devan gwo kòlè Li. <verse eid="JER 4:26"/><verse number="27" style="v" sid="JER 4:27"/>Paske konsa pale SENYÈ a: <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">4:27 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="JER 12:11-12">Jr 12:11-12</ref></char></note>“Tout peyi a va dezole; malgre, Mwen p ap fin detwi li nèt. <verse eid="JER 4:27"/><verse number="28" style="v" sid="JER 4:28"/>Pou sa, tout latè va kriye ak doulè, e syèl anwo yo va fènwa, akoz Mwen te pale sa a. Mwen te fè plan sa a, e Mwen p ap chanje lide Mwen. Ni Mwen p ap detounen sou sa.”<verse eid="JER 4:28"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="JER 4:29"/>Ak bri chevalye a, ak mèt banza yo, <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">4:29 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="2KI 25:4">II Wa 25:4</ref></char></note>tout vil yo vin sove ale. Yo antre nan gran rak bwa, e yo monte sou wòch yo. Tout vil yo vin abandone e nanpwen pèsòn ki rete ladan yo. <verse eid="JER 4:29"/><verse number="30" style="v" sid="JER 4:30"/>Ou menm, O sila ki dezole a, <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">4:30 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ISA 10:3">És 10:3</ref></char></note>se kisa ou va fè? Malgre ou abiye an kramwazi, malgre ou dekore kò ou ak dekorasyon an lò, malgre ou agrandi zye ou ak penti, se anven ou fè kò ou bèl la. Sila ki renmen ou yo meprize ou. Yo chache lavi ou. <verse eid="JER 4:30"/><verse number="31" style="v" sid="JER 4:31"/>Paske mwen te tande kri yon fanm nan doulè l; doulè a yon fanm k ap fè premye pitit, kri fi a Sion an, k ap <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">4:31 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ISA 42:14">És 42:14</ref></char></note>soufle fò, lonje men l e rele, “Anmwey! Mwen pedi kouraj nèt devan asasen yo.”<verse eid="JER 4:31"/></para>
  <chapter eid="JER 4"/>
  <chapter number="5" style="c" sid="JER 5"/>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="JER 5:1"/>“Mache ale retou toupatou nan lari Jérusalem. Gade koulye a, e byen nòte. Chèche nan plas ouvri li yo. Si ou ka twouve yon moun <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">5:1 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="GEN 18:26-32">Jen 18:26-32</ref></char></note>ki fè jistis, k ap chache verite, alò Mwen va padone Jérusalem. <verse eid="JER 5:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="JER 5:2"/>E <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">5:2 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ISA 48:1">És 48:1</ref></char></note>poutan, yo di: ‘Tankou SENYÈ a viv la’! Anverite y ap fè fo temwayaj.”<verse eid="JER 5:2"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="JER 5:3"/>O SENYÈ, èske zye Ou pa chache verite? Ou te frape yo, men yo pa t sanse doulè. Ou te fè yo megri, men yo pa t aksepte korije. Yo fè figi yo pi di pase wòch. Yo refize repanti.<verse eid="JER 5:3"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="JER 5:4"/>Alò, mwen te di: “Se sèlman malere ke yo ye. Se ensanse yo ye; <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">5:4 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ISA 27:11">És 27:11</ref></char></note>yo pa konnen chemen SENYÈ a, ni règleman a Bondye yo. <verse eid="JER 5:4"/><verse number="5" style="v" sid="JER 5:5"/>Mwen va ale kote moun pwa yo. Se ak yo ke mwen va pale, paske <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">5:5 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="MIC 3:1">Mi 3:1</ref></char></note>yo menm konnen chemen SENYÈ a, ak règleman a Bondye yo.” Men yo menm tou, ak volonte ansanm te kraze jouk la, e chire tout kòd yo. <verse eid="JER 5:5"/><verse number="6" style="v" sid="JER 5:6"/>Akoz sa, yon lyon ki sòti nan forè va touye yo. Yon lou dezè a va detwi yo, yon <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">5:6 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="HOS 13:7">Os 13:7</ref></char></note>leyopa ap veye vil yo. Tout moun ki sòti kote yo va chire an mòso, akoz transgresyon yo anpil, enfidelite yo bokou.<verse eid="JER 5:6"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="JER 5:7"/>Pou ki rezon Mwen ta padone ou? Fis ou yo te abandone Mwen pou yo <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">5:7 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="JOS 23:7">Jos 23:7</ref></char></note>sèmante pa sila ki pa dye yo. Lè M te fin bay yo manje vant plen, yo te fè adiltè. Yo te mache rive lakay pwostitiye a. <verse eid="JER 5:7"/><verse number="8" style="v" sid="JER 5:8"/>Yo te tankou gwo cheval kò dyanm, byen nouri, yo chak t ap ranni dèyè <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">5:8 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="JER 13:27">Jr 13:27</ref></char></note>madanm vwazen yo. <verse eid="JER 5:8"/><verse number="9" style="v" sid="JER 5:9"/>“Èske Mwen pa dwe pini pèp sa a,” deklare SENYÈ a: “Sou yon nasyon konsa, <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">5:9 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="JER 9:9">Jr 9:9</ref></char></note>èske Mwen pa dwe pran vanjans?<verse eid="JER 5:9"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="JER 5:10"/>“Ale monte nan ranje chan rezen li yo e detwi yo, men pa fin detwi nèt. Rache branch li yo, paske se pa pou SENYÈ a yo ye. <verse eid="JER 5:10"/><verse number="11" style="v" sid="JER 5:11"/>Paske lakay Israël ak lakay Juda te fè M trèt anpil”, deklare SENYÈ a.<verse eid="JER 5:11"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="JER 5:12"/>Yo te manti sou SENYÈ a, pou di: “Li pa la; malè p ap rive nou e nou <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">5:12 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="JER 23:17">Jr 23:17</ref></char></note>p ap wè nepe ni gwo grangou. <verse eid="JER 5:12"/><verse number="13" style="v" sid="JER 5:13"/><note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">5:13 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="JOB 8:2">Job 8:2</ref></char></note>Pwofèt yo se tankou van, e pawòl la pa nan yo. Se konsa, li va rive yo!”<verse eid="JER 5:13"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="JER 5:14"/>Pou sa, pale SENYÈ a, Bondye dèzame yo: “Akoz nou te pale pawòl sa a, gade byen, Mwen ap fè <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">5:14 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ISA 24:6">És 24:6</ref></char></note>pawòl Mwen nan bouch ou vin dife, pèp sa a vin bwa a, e li va manje yo nèt. <verse eid="JER 5:14"/><verse number="15" style="v" sid="JER 5:15"/>Gade byen, M ap <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">5:15 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="DEU 28:49">Det 28:49</ref></char></note>fè parèt yon nasyon kont nou soti byen lwen, O lakay Israël,” deklare SENYÈ a. “Li se yon nasyon ki dire anpil, yon nasyon depi nan tan lansyen yo, yon nasyon ak yon lang ou pa konnen, ni ou p ap ka konprann sa y ap di. <verse eid="JER 5:15"/><verse number="16" style="v" sid="JER 5:16"/>Fouwo pa yo se kon yon tonm tou <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">5:16 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="PSA 5:9">Sòm 5:9</ref></char></note>louvri; yo tout se gèrye vanyan. <verse eid="JER 5:16"/><verse number="17" style="v" sid="JER 5:17"/>Yo va devore rekòlt ou ak manje ou. Yo va devore fis ou yo ak fi ou yo. Yo va devore bann mouton ou yo ak twoupo ou yo. Yo va devore chan rezen ou yo ak figye etranje ou yo. Yo va kraze ak nepe, tout <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">5:17 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="HOS 8:14">Os 8:14</ref></char></note>vil fòtifye ou yo, kote ou te konn mete konfyans ou.”<verse eid="JER 5:17"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="JER 5:18"/>“Malgre, menm nan jou sa yo”, deklare SENYÈ a, “Mwen p ap fin detwi nou nèt. <verse eid="JER 5:18"/><verse number="19" style="v" sid="JER 5:19"/>Li va vin rive ke lè yo di: ‘Poukisa SENYÈ Bondye nou an te fè nou tout bagay sa yo?’ ke ou va di yo: ‘Jan nou te abandone M nan pou te sèvi dye etranje nan peyi nou; alò, se konsa nou va <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">5:19 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="DEU 28:48">Det 28:48</ref></char></note>sèvi etranje nan yon peyi ki pa pou nou.’<verse eid="JER 5:19"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="JER 5:20"/>“Deklare sa a nan kay Jacob la e pwoklame li nan Juda, pou di: <verse eid="JER 5:20"/><verse number="21" style="v" sid="JER 5:21"/>‘Tande sa, O pèp ki plen foli, ki san konprann, ki gen <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">5:21 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ISA 6:9">És 6:9</ref></char></note>zye, men ki pa ka wè, ki gen zòrèy, men ki pa tande. <verse eid="JER 5:21"/><verse number="22" style="v" sid="JER 5:22"/>Èske nou pa <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">5:22 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="DEU 28:58">Det 28:58</ref></char></note>krent Mwen?’ deklare SENYÈ a. ‘Èske nou pa tranble devan prezans Mwen? Paske Mwen te poze sab la kon lizyè lanmè a; yon dekrè etènèl, pou l pa ka travèse l. Malgre lanm lanmè yo vole, yo p ap ka enpoze yo; malgre yo fè raj, yo p ap ka travèse li.’<verse eid="JER 5:22"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="JER 5:23"/>“Men pèp sa a gen kè rebèl ak kè ki <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">5:23 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="DEU 21:18">Det 21:18</ref></char></note>di; yo te vire sou kote e yo te ale. <verse eid="JER 5:23"/><verse number="24" style="v" sid="JER 5:24"/>Yo pa di nan kè yo: ‘Alò koulye a, annou gen lakrent SENYÈ a, Bondye nou an, ki <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">5:24 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="PSA 147:8">Sòm 147:8</ref></char></note>bay lapli nan sezon li, ni lapli sezon otòn ak lapli sezon prentan, Sila ki kenbe pou nou semèn rekòlt nou yo.’<verse eid="JER 5:24"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="JER 5:25"/>
    <note caller="+" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">5:25 </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="JER 2:17">Jr 2:17</ref>
      </char>
    </note>“Inikite nou yo fin detounen bagay sa yo, e peche nou yo te retire tout sa ki bon pou nou. <verse eid="JER 5:25"/><verse number="26" style="v" sid="JER 5:26"/>Paske moun mechan twouve yo pami pèp Mwen an. Y ap <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">5:26 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="PSA 10:9">Sòm 10:9</ref></char></note>veye tankou moun k ap pran bèt nan pèlen. Yo ranje pèlen an. Se moun yo pran. <verse eid="JER 5:26"/><verse number="27" style="v" sid="JER 5:27"/>Kon yon kalòj plen zwazo, se konsa lakay yo plen <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">5:27 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="JER 9:6">Jr 9:6</ref></char></note>desepsyon. Akoz sa, yo te vin moun byen enpòtan ak anpil byen. <verse eid="JER 5:27"/><verse number="28" style="v" sid="JER 5:28"/>Yo fin <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">5:28 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="DEU 32:15">Det 32:15</ref></char></note>gra. Kò yo plen ak grès e yo vin reyisi depase ak zèv fèt ak mechanste yo. Yo pa plede koz òfelen an, pou yo ta reyisi; ni yo pa defann dwa malere yo.<verse eid="JER 5:28"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="JER 5:29"/>
    <note caller="+" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">5:29 </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="JER 5:9">Jr 5:9</ref>
      </char>
    </note> “Èske Mwen p ap pini pèp sa a?” deklare SENYÈ a, “Sou yon nasyon konsa, èske Mwen p ap pran vanjans Mwen?<verse eid="JER 5:29"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" sid="JER 5:30"/>“Yon bagay degoutan e <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">5:30 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="JER 23:14">Jr 23:14</ref></char></note>etonan te rive nan peyi a: <verse eid="JER 5:30"/><verse number="31" style="v" sid="JER 5:31"/><note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">5:31 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="EZK 13:6">Éz 13:6</ref></char></note>Pwofèt yo fè fo pwofesi e prèt yo domine selon pwòp otorite yo. Epi, a la renmen pèp Mwen an renmen l konsa! Men se kisa n ap fè lè sa rive nan bout pou l fini?<verse eid="JER 5:31"/></para>
  <chapter eid="JER 5"/>
  <chapter number="6" style="c" sid="JER 6"/>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="JER 6:1"/>“Pran flit pou sove, O fis a <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">6:1 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="JOS 18:28">Jos 18:28</ref></char></note>Benjamin yo! Sòti nan mitan Jérusalem! Soufle yon twonpèt Tekoa e leve sinyal la sou Beth-Hakkérem, paske malè ap veye nou soti nan nò, yon gwo destriksyon. <verse eid="JER 6:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="JER 6:2"/>Sila ki bèl e delika a, <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">6:2 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ISA 1:8">És 1:8</ref></char></note>fi a Sion an, Mwen va koupe retire l nèt. <verse eid="JER 6:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="JER 6:3"/><note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">6:3 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="JER 12:10">Jr 12:10</ref></char></note>Bèje yo ak bann mouton pa yo va vin kote li. Yo va monte tant yo antoure li, e yo chak va fè pak bèt yo nan plas yo.<verse eid="JER 6:3"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="JER 6:4"/>
    <note caller="+" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">6:4 </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="JER 6:23">Jr 6:23</ref>
      </char>
    </note>“Prepare lagè kont li! Leve! Annou atake a midi. Malè a nou menm, paske joune a ap vin bese, paske lonbraj lannwit yo ap vin pi long! <verse eid="JER 6:4"/><verse number="5" style="v" sid="JER 6:5"/>Leve e annou atake pandan nwit lan pou <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">6:5 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ISA 32:14">És 32:14</ref></char></note>detwi palè li yo!” <verse eid="JER 6:5"/><verse number="6" style="v" sid="JER 6:6"/>Paske konsa pale SENYÈ dèzame yo; “Koupe pyebwa li yo, e fè monte yon <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">6:6 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="JER 32:24">Jr 32:24</ref></char></note>ran syèj kont Jérusalem. Se vil ki dwe pini an, vil ki plen opresyon an. <verse eid="JER 6:6"/><verse number="7" style="v" sid="JER 6:7"/>Kon yon pwi kenbe dlo li fre, se konsa li rafrechi mechanste li. <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">6:7 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="JER 20:8">Jr 20:8</ref></char></note>Vyolans ak destriksyon vin tande nan li. Maladi ak blesi devan M tout tan. <verse eid="JER 6:7"/><verse number="8" style="v" sid="JER 6:8"/>Se pou ou vin avèti, O Jérusalem, <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">6:8 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="EZK 23:18">Éz 23:18</ref></char></note>pou M pa vin about ak ou, pou vin fè ou dezole, yon peyi ki san moun.”<verse eid="JER 6:8"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="JER 6:9"/>Konsa pale SENYÈ dèzame yo: “Yo va <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">6:9 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="JER 16:16">Jr 16:16</ref></char></note>fè yon rekòlt nèt, tankou chan rezen retay Israël la. Repase men ou ankò sou branch yo konsi se dènye ranmase rezen yo.”<verse eid="JER 6:9"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="JER 6:10"/>Se a kilès pou m ta pale e bay avètisman pou yo ka tande? Gade byen, zòrèy yo bouche e yo p ap ka koute. Gade byen, <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">6:10 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="JER 20:8">Jr 20:8</ref></char></note>pawòl SENYÈ a vin sèvi kon repwòch pou yo. Yo pa twouve okenn plezi ladann. <verse eid="JER 6:10"/><verse number="11" style="v" sid="JER 6:11"/>Men mwen <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">6:11 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="JOB 32:18-19">Job 32:18-19</ref></char></note>plen ak kòlè SENYÈ a. Mwen vin bouke ak kenbe l anndan.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 6:11">“Vide li sou timoun lari yo ak sou jenn gason k ap rasanble;</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 6:11">paske ni mari, ni madanm, yo va vin pran,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 6:11">menm sa ki nan laj ak granmoun.<verse eid="JER 6:11"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="JER 6:12"/>
    <note caller="+" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">6:12 </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="DEU 28:30">Det 28:30</ref>
      </char>
    </note>Lakay pa yo va bay a lòt moun, chan yo</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 6:12">ak madanm yo ansanm;</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 6:12">paske M ap lonje men M kont tout sila ki rete</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 6:12">nan peyi yo,” deklare SENYÈ a.<verse eid="JER 6:12"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="JER 6:13"/>Paske soti nan pi piti pami yo jis rive nan pi gran yo;</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 6:13">yo tout se <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">6:13 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ISA 56:11">És 56:11</ref></char></note>voras dèyè richès.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 6:13">Soti nan pwofèt la, jis rive nan prèt la.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 6:13">Tout se malonèt.<verse eid="JER 6:13"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="JER 6:14"/>Yo te <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">6:14 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="JER 8:11">Jr 8:11</ref></char></note>geri gwo blese pèp Mwen an ak pansman lejè.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 6:14">Y ap di: “Lapè, lapè”, men nanpwen lapè.<verse eid="JER 6:14"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="JER 6:15"/>Èske yo te vin <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">6:15 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="JER 3:3">Jr 3:3</ref></char></note>wont akoz bagay abominab yo te fè?</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 6:15">Yo pa t wont menm.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 6:15">Yo pa t menm konnen kijan pou yo ta vin wont.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 6:15">Akoz sa, yo va tonbe pami sila ki tonbe yo.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 6:15">Nan lè ke Mwen fè vizit ak yo,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 6:15">yo va vin jete anba”, di SENYÈ a.<verse eid="JER 6:15"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="JER 6:16"/>Konsa pale SENYÈ a: “Kanpe akote chemen yo e gade. Mande pou ansyen wout yo, ‘Kote bon chemen an ye?’ Mache ladann l. Konsa, <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">6:16 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="MAT 11:29">Mat 11:29</ref></char></note>nou va jwenn repo pou nanm nou.” Men yo te di: ‘Nou p ap mache ladann’. <verse eid="JER 6:16"/><verse number="17" style="v" sid="JER 6:17"/>Mwen te mete <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">6:17 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ISA 21:11">És 21:11</ref></char></note>gadyen yo sou nou. Mwen te di: ‘Koute son a twonpèt la!’ Men yo te di: ‘Nou p ap koute.’ <verse eid="JER 6:17"/><verse number="18" style="v" sid="JER 6:18"/>Pou sa, tande, O nasyon yo e konnen, O asanble a, sa ki pami yo. <verse eid="JER 6:18"/><verse number="19" style="v" sid="JER 6:19"/>Koute, O latè! Gade byen, Mwen ap mennen gwo dega sou pèp sa a; menm <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">6:19 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="PRO 1:31">Pwov 1:31</ref></char></note>fwi a panse pa yo, akoz yo pa t koute pawòl Mwen yo, e selon lalwa Mwen an, yo te rejte li. <verse eid="JER 6:19"/><verse number="20" style="v" sid="JER 6:20"/>Paske kisa sa sèvi, <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">6:20 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="EXO 30:23">Egz 30:23</ref></char></note>lansan an ki rive kote Mwen sòti Séba, ak kann dous soti nan yon peyi lwen? Ofrann brile nou yo pa fè M plezi.”<verse eid="JER 6:20"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="JER 6:21"/>Pou sa, pale SENYÈ a: “Gade byen, <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">6:21 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ISA 8:14">És 8:14</ref></char></note>Mwen ap poze blòk k ap fè pèp sa a bite. Yo va bite kont yo. Papa yo ak fis yo va bite ansanm. Vwazen ak zanmi li va peri.” <verse eid="JER 6:21"/><verse number="22" style="v" sid="JER 6:22"/>Konsa pale SENYÈ a: “Gade byen, <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">6:22 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="JER 1:15">Jr 1:15</ref></char></note>yon pèp ap sòti nan peyi nò, yon gwo nasyon va leve soti nan ekstremite latè byen lwen. <verse eid="JER 6:22"/><verse number="23" style="v" sid="JER 6:23"/>Yo kenbe rèd ak <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">6:23 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ISA 13:18">És 13:18</ref></char></note>banza ak lans. Yo mechan anpil e yo pa gen mizerikòd menm. Vwa pa yo fè raj tankou lanmè, e yo monte sou cheval yo, byen alinyen kon yon sèl moun pou batay kont ou, O fi Sion nan!”<verse eid="JER 6:23"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="JER 6:24"/>Nou konn tande rapò sa a. Men nou yo vin lage nèt. Gwo <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">6:24 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ISA 21:3">És 21:3</ref></char></note>doulè fin sezi nou tankou doulè a yon fanm k ap akouche. <verse eid="JER 6:24"/><verse number="25" style="v" sid="JER 6:25"/>Pa antre nan chan an, ni pa mache sou wout la, paske nepe lènmi a ak <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">6:25 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="JER 20:10">Jr 20:10</ref></char></note>gwo laperèz sou tout kote. <verse eid="JER 6:25"/><verse number="26" style="v" sid="JER 6:26"/>O fi a pèp mwen an, mete twal sak! Woule nan sann! <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">6:26 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="AMO 8:10">Am 8:10</ref></char></note>Kriye fò konsi se pou sèl fis ke ou te fè a! Fè yon lamantasyon ki anmè pase tout lòt yo. Paske sibitman destriktè a va parèt sou nou.<verse eid="JER 6:26"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="JER 6:27"/>“Mwen te <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">6:27 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="JER 1:18">Jr 1:18</ref></char></note>fè ou eseyis la pou sonde metal pami pèp Mwen an, pou ou ka sonde e konnen chemen yo. <verse eid="JER 6:27"/><verse number="28" style="v" sid="JER 6:28"/>Yo tout fè rebèl ak tèt di. Y ap mache toupotou bay move rapò a lòt. Se <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">6:28 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="EZK 22:18">Éz 22:18</ref></char></note>bwonz ak fè yo ye; yo tout konwonpi. <verse eid="JER 6:28"/><verse number="29" style="v" sid="JER 6:29"/>Ponp fòj la soufle fò. Plon an manje nèt nan dife a. Anven, yo rafine toujou, men <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">6:29 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="JER 15:9">Jr 15:9</ref></char></note>mechan yo pa janm vin separe. <verse eid="JER 6:29"/><verse number="30" style="v" sid="JER 6:30"/>Moun va rele yo ajan rejte, akoz <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">6:30 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="JER 7:29">Jr 7:29</ref></char></note>SENYÈ a te rejte yo.”<verse eid="JER 6:30"/></para>
  <chapter eid="JER 6"/>
  <chapter number="7" style="c" sid="JER 7"/>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="JER 7:1"/>Pawòl ki te vini a Jérémie soti nan SENYÈ a, ki te di: <verse eid="JER 7:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="JER 7:2"/><note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">7:2 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="JER 17:19">Jr 17:19</ref></char></note>“Kanpe nan pòtay lakay SENYÈ a. La, pwoklame pawòl sa a. Di l konsa: ‘Koute pawòl SENYÈ a, nou tout nan Juda, ki antre nan pòtay sa yo pou adore SENYÈ a!’”<verse eid="JER 7:2"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="JER 7:3"/>Konsa pale SENYÈ dèzame yo, Bondye Israël la, <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">7:3 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="JER 4:1">Jr 4:1</ref></char></note>“Korije chemen nou yo ak zèv nou yo, e Mwen va kite nou rete nan plas sa a. <verse eid="JER 7:3"/><verse number="4" style="v" sid="JER 7:4"/><note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">7:4 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="JER 7:8">Jr 7:8</ref></char></note>Pa mete konfyans nan pawòl manti k ap di nou: ‘Sa se tanp SENYÈ a, tanp SENYÈ a, tanp SENYÈ a.’ <verse eid="JER 7:4"/><verse number="5" style="v" sid="JER 7:5"/>Paske si, anverite, nou korije chemen nou yo, ak zèv nou yo; si, anverite, nou <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">7:5 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="1KI 6:12">I Wa 6:12</ref></char></note>pratike jistis antre yon nonm ak vwazen li, <verse eid="JER 7:5"/><verse number="6" style="v" sid="JER 7:6"/>si nou pa oprime etranje a, òfelen an, oswa vèv la e pa vèse san inosan a nan plas sa, ni <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">7:6 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="DEU 6:14-15">Det 6:14-15</ref></char></note> mache dèyè lòt dye anvè pwòp destriksyon nou, <verse eid="JER 7:6"/><verse number="7" style="v" sid="JER 7:7"/>alò, Mwen va kite nou rete nan plas sa a, nan <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">7:7 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="JER 3:18">Jr 3:18</ref></char></note>peyi ke M te bay a papa zansèt nou yo jis pou tout tan. <verse eid="JER 7:7"/><verse number="8" style="v" sid="JER 7:8"/>Gade byen, nou ap mete konfyans nan <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">7:8 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="JER 7:4">Jr 7:4</ref></char></note>pawòl riz yo. Yo p ap ka fè anyen pou nou. <verse eid="JER 7:8"/><verse number="9" style="v" sid="JER 7:9"/>Èske nou va vòlè, touye moun, komèt adiltè, bay fo temwayaj, ofri sakrifis a Baal, e mache dèyè <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">7:9 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="EXO 20:3">Egz 20:3</ref></char></note>lòt dye ke nou pa t konnen, <verse eid="JER 7:9"/><verse number="10" style="v" sid="JER 7:10"/>epi konsa,<note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">7:10 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="EZK 23:39">Éz 23:39</ref></char></note>vin kanpe devan Mwen nan kay sila a, ki rele pa non Mwen an, pou di M: ‘Nou delivre,’ —konsa pou nou ka fè tout bagay abominab sila yo? <verse eid="JER 7:10"/><verse number="11" style="v" sid="JER 7:11"/>Èske kay sila a, ki rele pa non pa M nan, èske non l vin chanje pou l vin yon <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">7:11 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="MAT 21:13">Mat 21:13</ref></char></note>kav plen vòlè devan zye nou? Gade byen, Mwen menm, Mwen te wè l,” deklare SENYÈ a.<verse eid="JER 7:11"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="JER 7:12"/>“Men ale koulye a kote plas Mwen an <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">7:12 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="JDG 18:31">Jij 18:31</ref></char></note>Silo, kote non Mwen te rete an premye a. Gade la pou wè sa M te fè li akoz mechanste a pèp Mwen an, Israël la. <verse eid="JER 7:12"/><verse number="13" style="v" sid="JER 7:13"/>Konsa, akoz nou te fè tout bagay sa yo,” deklare SENYÈ a: “akoz Mwen te pale ak nou, lè M te <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">7:13 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="JER 7:25">Jr 7:25</ref></char></note>leve bonè pou nou te pale, men nou pa t tande. Mwen te rele nou, men nou pa t reponn. <verse eid="JER 7:13"/><verse number="14" style="v" sid="JER 7:14"/>Akoz sa a, Mwen va fè rive nan <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">7:14 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="DEU 12:5">Det 12:5</ref></char></note>kay ki rele pa non Mwen an, nan sila nou mete konfyans lan e plas ke M te bay a nou menm ak papa zansèt nou yo, menm sa M te fè nan Silo a. <verse eid="JER 7:14"/><verse number="15" style="v" sid="JER 7:15"/>Mwen va <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">7:15 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="JER 15:1">Jr 15:1</ref></char></note>jete nou deyò pou zye m pa wè nou, tankou Mwen te jete tout frè nou yo deyò, tout desandan Éphraïm yo.<verse eid="JER 7:15"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="JER 7:16"/>“Pou ou menm, <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">7:16 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="EXO 32:10">Egz 32:10</ref></char></note>pa priye pou pèp sila a. Pa leve yon kri pou yo, ni entèsede avè M, paske Mwen pa tande ou. <verse eid="JER 7:16"/><verse number="17" style="v" sid="JER 7:17"/>Èske ou pa wè ki sa y ap fè nan vil Juda yo ak nan lari Jérusalem yo? <verse eid="JER 7:17"/><verse number="18" style="v" sid="JER 7:18"/>Timoun yo ranmase bwa, papa yo mete dife ladann e fanm yo bat pat farin nan pou fè gato pou rèn syèl la. Yo vide ofrann bwason bay lòt dye yo pou yo ka <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">7:18 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="DEU 32:16-21">Det 32:16-21</ref></char></note>vekse M. <verse eid="JER 7:18"/><verse number="19" style="v" sid="JER 7:19"/><note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">7:19 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="JOB 35:6">Job 35:6</ref></char></note>Èske yo vekse M? deklare SENYÈ a. “Èske se pa tèt yo ke y ap vekse jis rive nan malkonprann ki rive sou pwòp figi yo?”<verse eid="JER 7:19"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="JER 7:20"/>Pou sa, pale Senyè BONDYE a, <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">7:20 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ISA 42:25">És 42:25</ref></char></note> “Kòlè Mwen ak chalè Mwen va vide sou plas sa a, ni sou lòm, ni bèt, ni bwa chan, ak sou tout fwi tè yo. Li va brile, e li p ap ka etenn.”<verse eid="JER 7:20"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="JER 7:21"/>Konsa pale SENYÈ dèzame yo, Bondye Israël la: “Ajoute ofrann nou yo sou sakrifis nou yo e <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">7:21 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="EZK 33:25">Éz 33:25</ref></char></note>manje chè. <verse eid="JER 7:21"/><verse number="22" style="v" sid="JER 7:22"/>Paske Mwen pa t <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">7:22 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="1SA 15:22">I Sam 15:22</ref></char></note>pale ak papa zansèt nou yo, ni kòmande yo nan jou ke M te mennen yo sòti nan peyi Égypte la, pou ofrann brile, ni pou sakrifis. <verse eid="JER 7:22"/><verse number="23" style="v" sid="JER 7:23"/>Men sa ke M te kòmande yo e Mwen te di: <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">7:23 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="EXO 15:26">Egz 15:26</ref></char></note> ‘Obeyi vwa M, e Mwen va Bondye nou e nou va pèp Mwen. Mache nan tout vwa ke M kòmande nou yo, pou tout bagay ale byen ak nou.’ <verse eid="JER 7:23"/><verse number="24" style="v" sid="JER 7:24"/>Sepandan, yo pa t obeyi, ni yo pa t panche zòrèy vè Mwen. Men yo te mache nan pwòp konsèy pa yo, nan tèt di a kè mechan yo, e yo <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">7:24 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="JER 15:6">Jr 15:6</ref></char></note>te fè an aryè olye yo fè devan. <verse eid="JER 7:24"/><verse number="25" style="v" sid="JER 7:25"/>Depi nan jou ke papa zansèt nou yo te sòti nan peyi Égypte la, jis rive nan jou sila a, <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">7:25 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="2CH 36:15">II Kwo 36:15</ref></char></note>Mwen te voye bannou tout sèvitè Mwen yo ak pwofèt yo. Chak jou Mwen te leve granmmaten pou voye yo. <verse eid="JER 7:25"/><verse number="26" style="v" sid="JER 7:26"/>Sepandan, yo pa t koute Mwen, ni panche zòrèy yo, men yo te fè tèt di. Yo te <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">7:26 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="JER 16:12">Jr 16:12</ref></char></note>fè plis mal pase papa yo.<verse eid="JER 7:26"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="JER 7:27"/>“Ou va <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">7:27 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="JER 1:7">Jr 1:7</ref></char></note>pale tout pawòl sa yo avèk yo, men yo p ap koute ou. Ou va rele kote yo, men yo p ap reponn ou. <verse eid="JER 7:27"/><verse number="28" style="v" sid="JER 7:28"/>Ou va di yo: ‘Sa se nasyon ki <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">7:28 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="JER 6:17">Jr 6:17</ref></char></note>pa t obeyi vwa SENYÈ a, Bondye pa yo a, ni ki pa t aksepte koreksyon. Verite fin peri e koupe retire nèt nan bouch yo. <verse eid="JER 7:28"/><verse number="29" style="v" sid="JER 7:29"/>Koupe retire cheve ou, e jete li. Kòmanse fè gwo kri sou wotè vid yo. Paske SENYÈ a fin <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">7:29 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="JER 6:30">Jr 6:30</ref></char></note>rejte e abandone jenerasyon kòlè Li a.’<verse eid="JER 7:29"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" sid="JER 7:30"/>“Paske fis a Juda yo te fè mal nan zye M,” deklare SENYÈ a. “Yo te <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">7:30 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="2KI 21:3">II Wa 21:3</ref></char></note>mete bagay abominab pa yo nan kay ki rele pa non Mwen an, pou souye li. <verse eid="JER 7:30"/><verse number="31" style="v" sid="JER 7:31"/>Yo te bati wo plas la nan Topheth, ki nan vale a fis a Hinnom an, pou <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">7:31 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="LEV 18:21">Lev 18:21</ref></char></note>brile fis ak fi pa yo nan dife, ke M pa t kòmande, ni sa pa t rive nan tèt Mwen. <verse eid="JER 7:31"/><verse number="32" style="v" sid="JER 7:32"/><note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">7:32 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="JER 19:6-11">Jr 19:6-11</ref></char></note>Pou sa, gade byen, jou yo ap vini,” deklare SENYÈ a: “lè li p ap rele Topheth ankò, ni vale a fis a Hinnom an, men vale a masak la; paske yo va fè antèman Topheth, jis pa gen plas pou antere ankò. <verse eid="JER 7:32"/><verse number="33" style="v" sid="JER 7:33"/><note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">7:33 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="DEU 28:26">Det 28:26</ref></char></note>Kadav mouri a pèp sila yo va fè manje pou zwazo syèl yo ak pou bèt latè yo. Epi nanpwen moun k ap chase yo ale. <verse eid="JER 7:33"/><verse number="34" style="v" sid="JER 7:34"/>Nan moman sa a, Mwen va fè sispann soti nan vil a Juda yo ak lari a Jérusalem yo, vwa a kè kontan ak vwa a jennonm k ap marye a, ak fi maryaj la; paske <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">7:34 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="LEV 26:33">Lev 26:33</ref></char></note>peyi a va devaste nèt.”<verse eid="JER 7:34"/></para>
  <chapter eid="JER 7"/>
  <chapter number="8" style="c" sid="JER 8"/>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="JER 8:1"/>“Nan lè sa a”, deklare SENYÈ a: “yo va <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">8:1 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="EZK 6:5">Éz 6:5</ref></char></note>mennen fè vin parèt zo a wa a Juda yo, ak zo a prens pa yo, zo a prèt yo ak zo a pwofèt yo, e zo a pèp Jérusalem yo soti nan tonm pa yo. <verse eid="JER 8:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="JER 8:2"/>Yo va gaye yo parèt devan solèy la, lalin nan ak tout <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">8:2 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="2KI 23:5">II Wa 23:5</ref></char></note>lame syèl, ke yo te renmen yo, ke yo te sèvi yo, ke yo te kouri dèyè yo, e ke yo te adore yo. Yo p ap ranmase, ni yo p ap antere; yo va rete kon fimye bèt sou sifas latè. <verse eid="JER 8:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="JER 8:3"/>Epi pami retay sila ki rete nan fanmi mechan sila yo, se <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">8:3 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="JOB 3:21-22">Job 3:21-22</ref></char></note>lanmò ke y ap chwazi pito ke lavi, retay ki rete nan tout plas ke M te konn bourade yo rive yo,” deklare SENYÈ dèzame yo. <verse eid="JER 8:3"/><verse number="4" style="v" sid="JER 8:4"/>“Ou va di yo: ‘Konsa pale SENYÈ a,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 8:4">“‘Èske moun konn <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">8:4 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="PRO 24:16">Pwov 24:16</ref></char></note>tonbe pou l pa leve ankò?</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 8:4">Èske moun konn vire kite pou l pa retounen<verse eid="JER 8:4"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="JER 8:5"/>Poukisa pèp sa a, Jérusalem, te <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">8:5 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="JER 5:6">Jr 5:6</ref></char></note>vire akote nan enfidelite san rete a?</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 8:5">Yo kenbe rèd a desepsyon.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 8:5">Yo refize retounen.<verse eid="JER 8:5"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="JER 8:6"/>Mwen te koute e te tande, men yo pa t pale sa ki dwat;</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 8:6">
    <note caller="+" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">8:6 </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="EZK 22:30">Éz 22:30</ref>
      </char>
    </note>okenn moun pa t repanti de mechanste yo pou l ta di:</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 8:6">‘Kisa mwen te fè la a?’</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 8:6">Yo chak vin vire nan pwòp chemen pa yo,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 8:6">tankou yon cheval k ap kouri antre nan batay.<verse eid="JER 8:6"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="JER 8:7"/>Menm zwazo sigòy anlè a konnen sezon li.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 8:7">Toutrèl ak iwondèl ak valèt kontwole lè antre sòti pa yo;</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 8:7">men <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">8:7 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="PRO 6:6-8">Pwov 6:6-8</ref></char></note>pèp Mwen an pa konnen règleman SENYÈ a.<verse eid="JER 8:7"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="JER 8:8"/>
    <note caller="+" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">8:8 </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="JOB 5:12-13">Job 5:12-13</ref>
      </char>
    </note>“‘Kòman nou ka di: “Mwen saj’,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 8:8">epi lalwa SENYÈ a avèk nou?”</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 8:8">Men gade byen, fo plim a skrib yo fè sa tounen gwo manti.<verse eid="JER 8:8"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="JER 8:9"/>Mesye saj yo <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">8:9 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ISA 19:11">És 19:11</ref></char></note>vin wont, yo vin deranje e sezi.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 8:9">Gade byen, yo te rejte pawòl SENYÈ la.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 8:9">Ki kalite sajès ka rete nan yo?<verse eid="JER 8:9"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="JER 8:10"/>Akoz sa, Mwen va bay madanm pa yo a lòt moun,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 8:10">ak chan pa yo a lòt moun k ap okipe yo.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 8:10">Paske soti nan pi piti a jis rive nan pi gran an,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 8:10">yo tout <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">8:10 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ISA 56:11">És 56:11</ref></char></note>lanvi gen sa ki pou lòt.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 8:10">Soti nan pwofèt la jis rive nan prèt la, tout aji ak desepsyon.<verse eid="JER 8:10"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="JER 8:11"/>Yo <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">8:11 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="JER 6:4">Jr 6:4</ref></char></note>fè gerizon pèp Mwen an ak pansma lejè.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 8:11">Y ap di: “Lapè, lapè,” men nanpwen lapè.<verse eid="JER 8:11"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="JER 8:12"/>Èske yo pa t wont akoz zak abominab yo te fè yo?</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 8:12">Anverite, yo pa t wont.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 8:12">Yo pa t konprann menm ki jan pou yo ta vin wont.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 8:12">Akoz sa, yo va <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">8:12 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ISA 9:14">És 9:14</ref></char></note>tonbe pami sila k ap tonbe yo.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 8:12">Nan lè pinisyon pa yo, yo va abese,” di SENYÈ a.<verse eid="JER 8:12"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="JER 8:13"/>
    <note caller="+" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">8:13 </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="JER 14:12">Jr 14:12</ref>
      </char>
    </note>“‘Anverite, Mwen va detwi yo nèt, “deklare SENYÈ a.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 8:13">P ap gen rezen sou chan rezen an,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 8:13">ni fig sou pye figye etranje a.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 8:13">Fèy yo va fennen,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 8:13">epi sa ke M te bay yo va disparèt.’”<verse eid="JER 8:13"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="JER 8:14"/>“Poukisa nou chita an plas?</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 8:14">Rasanble nou!</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 8:14">Annou antre nan vil fòtifye yo,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 8:14">epi la, annou rete an silans;</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 8:14">paske SENYÈ a, Bondye nou an,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 8:14">te fè nou tonbe an silans.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 8:14">Li te bannou <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">8:14 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="DEU 29:18">Det 29:18</ref></char></note>dlo anpwazone pou nou bwè,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 8:14">paske nou te peche kont SENYÈ a.<verse eid="JER 8:14"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="JER 8:15"/>Nou <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">8:15 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="JER 8:11">Jr 8:11</ref></char></note>te tann lapè, men anyen bon pa t vini;</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 8:15">yon tan gerizon, men gade byen, gwo laperèz.<verse eid="JER 8:15"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="JER 8:16"/>Soti nan Dan te tande gwo souf cheval.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 8:16">Ak son ranni a etalon li yo, tout tè a souke;</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 8:16">paske yo te vini <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">8:16 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="JER 3:24">Jr 3:24</ref></char></note>devore peyi a ak tout ki sa ki ladann,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 8:16">vil la ansanm ak tout moun ki rete ladann.<verse eid="JER 8:16"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="JER 8:17"/>“Paske gade byen, Mwen ap <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">8:17 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="NUM 21:6">Nonb 21:6</ref></char></note>voye sèpan yo kont nou,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 8:17">vipè yo ki p ap ka chame;</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 8:17">e yo va mòde nou,” deklare SENYÈ a.<verse eid="JER 8:17"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="JER 8:18"/>Tristès Mwen depase gerizon;</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 8:18">
    <note caller="+" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">8:18 </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="JER 23:9">Jr 23:9</ref>
      </char>
    </note>kè M fennen anndan m!<verse eid="JER 8:18"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="JER 8:19"/>Gade byen! Koute kri a fi pèp mwen an</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 8:19">soti nan yon peyi byen lwen:</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 8:19">“Èske SENYÈ a pa nan Sion?</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 8:19">Èske wa li a pa nan li?”</para>
  <para style="b" vid="JER 8:19"/>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 8:19">“Poukisa yo pwovoke fachez Mwen ak imaj taye yo;</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 8:19">ak <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">8:19 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="PSA 31:6">Sòm 31:6</ref></char></note>zidòl etranje yo?”<verse eid="JER 8:19"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="JER 8:20"/>“Rekòlt la fin pase.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 8:20">Gran sezon an fini,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 8:20">e nou poko sove.”<verse eid="JER 8:20"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="JER 8:21"/>Akoz fi a pèp mwen an brize,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 8:21">mwen menm brize tou;</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 8:21">mwen fè dèy konsi pou yon mò.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 8:21">Mwen kraze ba nèt.<verse eid="JER 8:21"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="JER 8:22"/>Èske pa gen pomad gerizon nan Galaad?</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 8:22">Èske nanpwen doktè la?</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 8:22">Alò <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">8:22 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="JER 14:19">Jr 14:19</ref></char></note>poukisa lasante fi a pèp mwen an pa t restore?<verse eid="JER 8:22"/></para>
  <chapter eid="JER 8"/>
  <chapter number="9" style="c" sid="JER 9"/>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="JER 9:1"/>O ke tèt mwen te dlo,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 9:1">e ke zye m yo te yon fontèn dlo,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 9:1">pou m ta ka kriye lajounen kon lannwit</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 9:1">pou lanmò a <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">9:1 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="JER 6:26">Jr 6:26</ref></char></note>fi a pèp mwen an!<verse eid="JER 9:1"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="JER 9:2"/>O ke m ta gen nan dezè a,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 9:2">yon plas pou moun k ap vwayaje rete,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 9:2">pou m ta ka sòti nan mitan pèp mwen an.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 9:2">Pou m kite yo nèt!</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 9:2">Paske yo tout se <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">9:2 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="JER 5:7-8">Jr 5:7-8</ref></char></note>adiltè, yon bann moun trèt.<verse eid="JER 9:2"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="JER 9:3"/>“Yo koube lang yo konsi se banza pou tire ak fo prensip.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 9:3">Yo fò nan peyi a, men pa pou verite a.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 9:3">Yo kite yon kalite mal pou antre nan yon lòt,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 9:3">e yo pa rekonèt Mwen”, deklare SENYÈ a.<verse eid="JER 9:3"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="JER 9:4"/>“Fòk chak <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">9:4 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="PSA 12:2">Sòm 12:2</ref></char></note>byen veye kont vwazen li,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 9:4">pou l pa mete konfyans nan okenn frè;</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 9:4">akoz tout frè yo aji nan koken,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 9:4">e tout vwazen yo ap voye kout lang.<verse eid="JER 9:4"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="JER 9:5"/>Yo tout <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">9:5 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="MIC 6:12">Mi 6:12</ref></char></note>pase vwazen parèy yo nan rizib.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 9:5">Yo refize pale verite.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 9:5">Yo fin enstwi pwòp lang yo pou pale manti;</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 9:5">yo vin fatige nèt nan fè inikite.<verse eid="JER 9:5"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="JER 9:6"/>Abitasyon ou se nan mitan desepsyon.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 9:6">Nan desepsyon yo <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">9:6 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="JOB 21:14-15">Job 21:14-15</ref></char></note>refize rekonèt Mwen”, deklare SENYÈ a.<verse eid="JER 9:6"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="JER 9:7"/>Pou sa, konsa pale SENYÈ dèzame yo:</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 9:7">“Gade byen, Mwen va fann yo nèt, e <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">9:7 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="HOS 11:8">Os 11:8</ref></char></note>fè yo pase a leprèv;</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 9:7">paske se kisa anplis ke M ka fè, akoz fi a pèp Mwen an?<verse eid="JER 9:7"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="JER 9:8"/>Lang pa yo se yon flèch mòtèl;</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 9:8">li pale <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">9:8 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="PSA 28:3">Sòm 28:3</ref></char></note>manti.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 9:8">Avèk bouch li, li pale lapè ak vwazen li,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 9:8">men anndan li fè plan anbiskad pou pran l.<verse eid="JER 9:8"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="JER 9:9"/>Èske mwen p ap pini yo pou bagay sa yo?” deklare SENYÈ a.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 9:9">“Sou yon nasyon konsa, èske Mwen p ap pran vanjans?<verse eid="JER 9:9"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="JER 9:10"/>Paske mòn yo va tanmen fè gwo kri</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 9:10">ak dèy pou patiraj dezè a,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 9:10">gwo plent, akoz yo vin <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">9:10 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="JER 12:4-10">Jr 12:4-10</ref></char></note>brile nèt,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 9:10">jiskaske pèsòn pa pase ladann.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 9:10">Menm vwa a bèt yo p ap tande la ankò;</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 9:10">ni zwazo syèl yo ak bèt latè yo fin sove ale;</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 9:10">yo ale nèt.<verse eid="JER 9:10"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="JER 9:11"/>“Mwen va fè Jérusalem tounen yon pil mazi,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 9:11">yon kote abandone pou chen mawon.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 9:11">Mwen va fè vil Juda yo yon <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">9:11 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ISA 25:2">És 25:2</ref></char></note>kote ki kraze nèt,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 9:11">san pèsòn pou rete ladan.”<verse eid="JER 9:11"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="JER 9:12"/>Ki moun saj ki ka konprann sa a? Epi kilès li menm bouch SENYÈ a te pale, pou l ka fè deklarasyon sa a? <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">9:12 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="PSA 107:34">Sòm 107:34</ref></char></note>Poukisa peyi a vin detwi konsa, brile nèt kon yon dezè, pou pèsòn pa menm pase ladann?<verse eid="JER 9:12"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="JER 9:13"/>SENYÈ a di: “Akoz yo te <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">9:13 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="2CH 7:19">II Kwo 7:19</ref></char></note>abandone Lalwa ke Mwen te mete devan yo a e yo pa t obeyi vwa Mwen, ni mache selon li, <verse eid="JER 9:13"/><verse number="14" style="v" sid="JER 9:14"/>men te <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">9:14 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="JER 7:24">Jr 7:24</ref></char></note>mache dèyè tèt di a pwòp kè yo, e dèyè Baal yo, kon papa yo te montre yo a.” <verse eid="JER 9:14"/><verse number="15" style="v" sid="JER 9:15"/>Pou sa, pale SENYÈ dèzame yo, Bondye Israël la: “Gade byen, Mwen va <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">9:15 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="PSA 80:5">Sòm 80:5</ref></char></note>fè yo manje bwa anmè e bay yo dlo anpwazone pou yo bwè. <verse eid="JER 9:15"/><verse number="16" style="v" sid="JER 9:16"/>Mwen va <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">9:16 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="LEV 26:33">Lev 26:33</ref></char></note>gaye yo pami nasyon, ke ni yo menm, ni papa zansèt yo pa t janm konnen. Mwen va voye nepe pou swiv yo jiskaske yo vin detwi nèt.”<verse eid="JER 9:16"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="JER 9:17"/>Konsa pale SENYÈ dèzame yo:</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 9:17">“Konsidere e rele <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">9:17 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="2CH 35:25">II Kwo 35:25</ref></char></note>fanm pou fè dèy, pou yo ka vini.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 9:17">Voye fanm instwi sa yo, pou yo ka vini!<verse eid="JER 9:17"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="JER 9:18"/>Kite yo fè vit pran rele anmwey pou nou,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 9:18">pou <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">9:18 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ISA 22:4">És 22:4</ref></char></note>zye nou ka vide dlo e pòpyè zye nou ka</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 9:18">fè dlo kouri desann.<verse eid="JER 9:18"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="JER 9:19"/>Paske vwa ki rele anmwey la tande soti nan Sion:</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 9:19">‘A la detwi nou vin detwi nèt!</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 9:19">Nou te vin mete nan gwo wont,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 9:19">paske nou <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">9:19 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="DEU 28:29">Det 28:29</ref></char></note>te kite peyi la,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 9:19">akoz yo te kraze tout lakay nou yo.’”<verse eid="JER 9:19"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="JER 9:20"/>Alò tande byen pawòl SENYÈ a, O <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">9:20 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ISA 32:9">És 32:9</ref></char></note>fanm yo.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 9:20">Kite zòrèy nou resevwa pawòl bouch Li.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 9:20">Montre fi nou yo jan pou yo fè dèy.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 9:20">Chak moun montre vwazen li yon chan lamante a.<verse eid="JER 9:20"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="JER 9:21"/>Paske <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">9:21 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="2CH 36:17">II Kwo 36:17</ref></char></note>lanmò fin antre nan fenèt nou nèt.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 9:21">Li te antre nan palè nou yo</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 9:21">pou fèmen timoun yo andedan</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 9:21">ak jenn gason yo nan lari.<verse eid="JER 9:21"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="JER 9:22"/>Pale, “Konsa di SENYÈ a,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 9:22">“‘Kadav moun yo va tonbe tankou <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">9:22 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="PSA 83:10">Sòm 83:10</ref></char></note>fimye bèt nan chan,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 9:22">tankou men plen sereyal lè moun fin rekòlt la.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 9:22">Pèsòn p ap ranmase yo.’”<verse eid="JER 9:22"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="JER 9:23"/>Konsa pale SENYÈ a:</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 9:23">
    <note caller="+" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">9:23 </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="ECC 9:11">Ekl 9:11</ref>
      </char>
    </note>“Pa kite yon nonm saj vin ògeye nan sajès li.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 9:23">Pa kite yon nonm pwisan vin ògeye nan fòs li,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 9:23">ni yon nonm rich vin ògeye nan richès li.<verse eid="JER 9:23"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="JER 9:24"/>Men kite sila ki <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">9:24 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="PSA 20:7">Sòm 20:7</ref></char></note>vin ògeye a, vin ògeye nan sa;</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 9:24">ke li gen konprann, e li rekonèt Mwen,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 9:24">ke se Mwen se SENYÈ a,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 9:24">ki aji nan lanmou dous, jistis,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 9:24">ak ladwati sou latè a;</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 9:24">paske Mwen pran gwo plezi nan bagay sa yo,” deklare SENYÈ a.<verse eid="JER 9:24"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="JER 9:25"/>Gade byen, gen jou k ap vini, “deklare SENYÈ a, ke Mwen va pini tout sila ki te sikonsi, men vrèman yo <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">9:25 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="JER 4:4">Jr 4:4</ref></char></note>pa sikonsi— <verse eid="JER 9:25"/><verse number="26" style="v" sid="JER 9:26"/>Égypte ak Juda, Édom ak fis a Ammon yo e Moab ak tout sila k ap viv nan dezè yo, k ap taye cheve sou de bò tanp yo; paske tout nasyon yo ensikonsi e tout lakay Israël se <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">9:26 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="LEV 26">Lev 26</ref></char></note>ensikonsi nan kè.”<verse eid="JER 9:26"/></para>
  <chapter eid="JER 9"/>
  <chapter number="10" style="c" sid="JER 10"/>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="JER 10:1"/>Tande pawòl la ke SENYÈ a ap pale ak ou, O lakay Israël. <verse eid="JER 10:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="JER 10:2"/>Konsa pale SENYÈ a:</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 10:2">
    <note caller="+" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">10:2 </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="LEV 18:3">Lev 18:3</ref>
      </char>
    </note>“Pa aprann abitid a nasyon yo,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 10:2">ni pa vin krent sign nan syèl yo,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 10:2">malgre nasyon yo krent yo anpil.<verse eid="JER 10:2"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="JER 10:3"/>Paske abitid a pèp yo se afè twonpe moun;</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 10:3">konsi se <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">10:3 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ISA 44:9-20">És 44:9-20</ref></char></note>bwa ki koupe nan forè,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 10:3">zèv men atizan ki koupe ak zouti.<verse eid="JER 10:3"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="JER 10:4"/>Yo dekore l ak ajan ak lò;</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 10:4">yo <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">10:4 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ISA 40:20">És 40:20</ref></char></note>tache li ak klou ak mato, pou l pa deplase.<verse eid="JER 10:4"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="JER 10:5"/>Yo tankou yon bwa palmis</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 10:5">ki fòme pa men moun,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 10:5">men yo <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">10:5 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="PSA 115:5">Sòm 115:5</ref></char></note>pa ka pale.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 10:5">Fòk yo pote yo,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 10:5">paske yo pa ka mache!</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 10:5">Pa krent yo;</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 10:5">paske yo p ap ka fè okenn mal,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 10:5">ni yo p ap ka fè anyen ki bon.”<verse eid="JER 10:5"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="JER 10:6"/>
    <note caller="+" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">10:6 </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="EXO 15:11">Egz 15:11</ref>
      </char>
    </note>Nanpwen moun ki tankou Ou, O SENYÈ.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 10:6">Ou gran!</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 10:6">Gran se non Ou an pwisans!<verse eid="JER 10:6"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="JER 10:7"/>Se <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">10:7 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="REV 15:4">Rev 15:4</ref></char></note>kilès ki pa ta krent Ou,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 10:7">O Wa a nasyon yo?</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 10:7">Anverite, se sa Ou merite!</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 10:7">Paske pami tout moun saj nan nasyon yo,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 10:7">ak nan tout wayòm yo,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 10:7">nanpwen okenn tankou Ou.<verse eid="JER 10:7"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="JER 10:8"/>Men yo tout ansanm se <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">10:8 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="JER 4:22">Jr 4:22</ref></char></note>ensanse e plen ak foli;</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 10:8">instwi pa zidòl yo——se bwa yo ye!<verse eid="JER 10:8"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="JER 10:9"/>Ajan byen bat pote soti Tarsis ak lò ki sòti Uphaz,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 10:9">travay a yon atizan e men a yon òfèv.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 10:9">Vètman yo an vyolèt e mov;</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 10:9">tout se <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">10:9 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="PSA 115:4">Sòm 115:4</ref></char></note>zèv a ouvriye byen fò.<verse eid="JER 10:9"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="JER 10:10"/>Men SENYÈ a se <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">10:10 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ISA 65:16">És 65:16</ref></char></note>vrè Bondye a;</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 10:10">Li se Bondye vivan an e Wa etènèl la.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 10:10">Devan kòlè Li, tout latè tranble</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 10:10">e nasyon yo p ap ka sipòte gwo kòlè Li a.<verse eid="JER 10:10"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="JER 10:11"/>Konsa ou va di yo: <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">10:11 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="PSA 96:5">Sòm 96:5</ref></char></note>“dye ki pa t fè syèl la ak tè yo va peri soti sou latè ak anba syèl yo.”<verse eid="JER 10:11"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="JER 10:12"/>Bondye te fè tè a pa pouvwa Li.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 10:12">Li te <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">10:12 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="PSA 78:69">Sòm 78:69</ref></char></note>etabli lemonn ak sajès Li;</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 10:12">ak konprann Li, Li te etann syèl yo.<verse eid="JER 10:12"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="JER 10:13"/>Lè Li fè vwa L sone,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 10:13">dlo yo mele nan syèl yo.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 10:13">Li fè <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">10:13 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="JOB 36:27-29">Job 36:27-29</ref></char></note>nwaj yo monte soti nan dènye pwent tè a.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 10:13">Li fè loray pou lapli,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 10:13">e Li fè van sòti nan depo Li yo.<verse eid="JER 10:13"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="JER 10:14"/>Tout moun se <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">10:14 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="JER 10:8">Jr 10:8</ref></char></note>ensanse, san konesans.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 10:14">Tout òfèv yo vin wont akoz zidòl li;</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 10:14">paske imaj fonn li se desepsyon.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 10:14">Nanpwen souf nan yo.<verse eid="JER 10:14"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="JER 10:15"/>Yo <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">10:15 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ISA 41:24">És 41:24</ref></char></note>san valè, yon zèv k ap twonpe.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 10:15">Nan lè règleman pa yo, yo va peri.<verse eid="JER 10:15"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="JER 10:16"/>Pòsyon ki pou Jacob la pa konsa;</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 10:16">paske <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">10:16 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ISA 45:7">És 45:7</ref></char></note>Kreyatè a tout bagay se Li menm;</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 10:16">e Israël se tribi eritaj Li.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 10:16">SENYÈ dèzame yo se non Li.<verse eid="JER 10:16"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="JER 10:17"/>
    <note caller="+" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">10:17 </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="EZK 12:3-12">Éz 12:3-12</ref>
      </char>
    </note>Leve pakèt ou atè a, nou menm ki anba syèj!<verse eid="JER 10:17"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="JER 10:18"/>Paske konsa pale SENYÈ a:</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 10:18">“Gade byen, M ap <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">10:18 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="1SA 25:29">I Sam 25:29</ref></char></note>voye pèp peye sa a deyò nan moman sa a.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 10:18">Mwen va fè yo pase anpil doulè, jis yo byen santi li.”<verse eid="JER 10:18"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="JER 10:19"/>Malè a mwen, akoz <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">10:19 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="JER 14:17">Jr 14:17</ref></char></note>blesi m nan!</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 10:19">Blesi m nan byen grav.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 10:19">Men mwen te di:</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 10:19">“Anverite, sa se gwo doulè m;</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 10:19">fòk mwen pote l.”<verse eid="JER 10:19"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="JER 10:20"/>
    <note caller="+" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">10:20 </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="JER 4:20">Jr 4:20</ref>
      </char>
    </note>Tant mwen an fin detwi.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 10:20">Tout kòd mwen yo fin chire.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 10:20">Fis mwen yo te kite mwen.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 10:20">Yo pa la ankò.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 10:20">Nanpwen moun ki pou laji tant mwen an ankò,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 10:20">ni pou monte rido mwen yo.<verse eid="JER 10:20"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="JER 10:21"/>Paske bèje yo vin tankou bèt ensanse;</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 10:21">yo <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">10:21 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="JER 2:8">Jr 2:8</ref></char></note>pa t chache SENYÈ a.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 10:21">Akoz sa, yo pa reyisi;</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 10:21">tout bann mouton yo fin gaye.<verse eid="JER 10:21"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="JER 10:22"/>Bri rapò a rive!</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 10:22">Gade byen, l ap vini— yon gwo zen k ap <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">10:22 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="JER 1:14">Jr 1:14</ref></char></note>sòti nan peyi nò a!</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 10:22">K ap fè vil a Juda yo vin yon dezolasyon,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 10:22">yon andwa pou chen mawon.<verse eid="JER 10:22"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="JER 10:23"/>Mwen konnen, O SENYÈ, ke <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">10:23 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="PRO 16:1">Pwov 16:1</ref></char></note>chemen a yon nonm pa nan li menm,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 10:23">ni se pa posib pou moun ki mache a dirije pwòp pa pye li.<verse eid="JER 10:23"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="JER 10:24"/>
    <note caller="+" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">10:24 </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="PSA 6:1">Sòm 6:1</ref>
      </char>
    </note>Korije mwen, O SENYÈ, men avèk jistis;</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 10:24">pa nan kòlè Ou,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 10:24">sinon Ou va fè m vin pa anyen menm.<verse eid="JER 10:24"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="JER 10:25"/>
    <note caller="+" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">10:25 </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="PSA 79:6-7">Sòm 79:6-7</ref>
      </char>
    </note>Vide gwo kòlè Ou a sou nasyon ki pa konnen Ou yo</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 10:25">ak sou fanmi ki pa rekonèt non Ou yo;</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 10:25">paske yo te devore Jacob.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 10:25">Yo te devore li, manje l nèt e te devaste tout abitasyon li an.<verse eid="JER 10:25"/></para>
  <chapter eid="JER 10"/>
  <chapter number="11" style="c" sid="JER 11"/>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="JER 11:1"/>Pawòl ki te vini a Jérémie soti nan SENYÈ a, t ap di: <verse eid="JER 11:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="JER 11:2"/>“Koute pawòl <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">11:2 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="EXO 19:5">Egz 19:5</ref></char></note>akò sila a e pale avèk mesye Juda yo ak sila ki rete Jérusalem yo. <verse eid="JER 11:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="JER 11:3"/>Di yo: ‘Konsa pale SENYÈ a, Bondye Israël la, <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">11:3 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="DEU 27:26">Det 27:26</ref></char></note>“Modi se nonm ki pa okipe pawòl akò sila a, <verse eid="JER 11:3"/><verse number="4" style="v" sid="JER 11:4"/>ke Mwen te kòmande papa zansèt nou yo pou fè nan jou ke M te mennen yo sòti nan peyi Égypte la, soti nan <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">11:4 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="DEU 4:20">Det 4:20</ref></char></note>founo fè a, lè M te di yo: ‘Koute vwa Mwen e fè selon tout sa ke Mwen kòmande nou. Konsa, nou va pèp Mwen e Mwen va Bondye nou,’ <verse eid="JER 11:4"/><verse number="5" style="v" sid="JER 11:5"/>pou m ka etabli <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">11:5 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="EXO 13:5">Egz 13:5</ref></char></note>sèman ke M te fè ak papa zansèt nou yo, pou bay yo yon peyi k ap koule ak lèt, ak siwo myèl, jan li ye nan jou sa a.”’”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="JER 11:5">Mwen te reponn: “Amen O SENYÈ”. <verse eid="JER 11:5"/><verse number="6" style="v" sid="JER 11:6"/>Konsa, SENYÈ a te di mwen: “Pwoklame tout pawòl sa yo nan vil Juda yo ak nan lari Jérusalem yo, pou di: ‘<note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">11:6 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="JHN 13:17">Jn 13:17</ref></char></note>Tande pawòl akò sa a pou fè yo. <verse eid="JER 11:6"/><verse number="7" style="v" sid="JER 11:7"/>‘Paske Mwen te <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">11:7 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="1SA 8:9">I Sam 8:9</ref></char></note>avèti papa zansèt pa w yo solanèlman nan jou ke M te mennen yo sòti nan peyi Égypte la, menm pou rive nan jou sila a, Mwen t ap avèti tout tan e t ap di: “Tande vwa Mwen”. <verse eid="JER 11:7"/><verse number="8" style="v" sid="JER 11:8"/>Malgre sa, yo pa t obeyi, ni panche zòrèy yo vè Mwen. Men yo te mache chak selon tèt di a kè mechan yo. Akoz sa, Mwen te mennen sou yo tout <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">11:8 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="LEV 26:14-43">Lev 26:14-43</ref></char></note>pawòl akò sila a, ke M te kòmande pou yo fè, men yo pa t fè yo.’”<verse eid="JER 11:8"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="JER 11:9"/>Konsa, SENYÈ a te di m: “Gen yon <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">11:9 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="EZK 22:25">Éz 22:25</ref></char></note>konplo vin k ap fèt pami mesye Juda yo ak moun ki rete Jérusalem yo. <verse eid="JER 11:9"/><verse number="10" style="v" sid="JER 11:10"/>Yo te vire retounen vè inikite a papa zansèt yo, ki te refize tande pawòl Mwen yo. Yo <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">11:10 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="JDG 2:11-13">Jij 2:11-13</ref></char></note>te ale dèyè lòt dye pou sèvi yo. Lakay Israël ak lakay Juda te kraze akò ke M te fè ak papa zansèt yo.” <verse eid="JER 11:10"/><verse number="11" style="v" sid="JER 11:11"/>Pou sa, pale SENYÈ a: “Gade byen” Mwen ap <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">11:11 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="2KI 22:16">II Wa 22:16</ref></char></note>mennen yon gwo dezas sou yo, ke yo p ap ka chape menm. Malgre yo kriye ban Mwen, Mwen p ap koute yo. <verse eid="JER 11:11"/><verse number="12" style="v" sid="JER 11:12"/>Konsa, lavil a Juda ak pèp Jérusalem nan va <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">11:12 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="DEU 32:37">Det 32:37</ref></char></note>ale kriye a lòt dye kote yo brile lansan an; men anverite, yo p ap sove yo nan tan gwo dezas yo. <verse eid="JER 11:12"/><verse number="13" style="v" sid="JER 11:13"/>Paske dye nou yo menm kantite ak vil nou yo, O Juda; epi menm kantite ak lari Jérusalem yo se lotèl kote nou te plase <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">11:13 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="JER 3:24">Jr 3:24</ref></char></note> gwo wont sa yo, menm pou brile lansan bay Baal yo.<verse eid="JER 11:13"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="JER 11:14"/>“Akoz sa, pa priye pou pèp sa a. Ni pa leve gwo kri oswa fè lapriyè pou yo; paske Mwen <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">11:14 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="JER 3:24">Jr 3:24</ref></char></note>p ap koute yo lè yo rele Mwen akoz gwo dezas yo.<verse eid="JER 11:14"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="JER 11:15"/>Ki dwa <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">11:15 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="JER 13:27">Jr 13:27</ref></char></note>byeneme Mwen an genyen lakay Mwen an</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 11:15">konsi li fin fè zak lèd ak anpil gason,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 11:15">epi chè sen an fin kite ou?</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 11:15">Lè ou te fè mal sa a,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 11:15">konsa, ou te rejwi.”<verse eid="JER 11:15"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="JER 11:16"/>SENYÈ a te bay ou non:</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 11:16">“Bwa doliv, byen bèl ak anpil fwi”.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 11:16">Ak <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">11:16 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="PSA 83:2">Sòm 83:2</ref></char></note>gwo bri, li te limen dife sou non sa a,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 11:16">e branch li yo te kase.<verse eid="JER 11:16"/></para>
  <para style="m">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="JER 11:17"/>SENYÈ dèzame ki te plante ou a, te pase lòd malè kont ou akoz mechanste lakay Israël la ak lakay Juda a; akoz yo te pwovoke Mwen ak <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">11:17 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="JER 7:9">Jr 7:9</ref></char></note>ofrann sakrifis ke yo te leve vè Baal yo.<verse eid="JER 11:17"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="JER 11:18"/>Anplis, SENYÈ a te <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">11:18 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="1SA 23:11-12">I Sam 23:11-12</ref></char></note>fè m konprann, e mwen te konnen li. Konsa, Ou te montre m zak yo. <verse eid="JER 11:18"/><verse number="19" style="v" sid="JER 11:19"/>Men mwen te tankou yon <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">11:19 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ISA 53:7">És 53:7</ref></char></note>jenn mouton dou k ap mennen labatwa. Mwen pa t konnen ke yo te fòme yon konplo kont mwen; Ke yo t ap di,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 11:19">“Annou detwi bwa a ak fwi li.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 11:19">Annou koupe l nèt soti nan peyi vivan yo,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 11:19">pou non li pa sonje ankò.”<verse eid="JER 11:19"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="JER 11:20"/>Men O SENYÈ dèzame yo, ki <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">11:20 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="GEN 18:25">Jen 18:25</ref></char></note>fè jijman ki dwat yo,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 11:20">ki sonde santiman ak kè yo,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 11:20">kite mwen wè vanjans Ou sou yo;</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 11:20">paske se Ou menm, mwen te fè konnen koz mwen an.<verse eid="JER 11:20"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="JER 11:21"/>Akoz sa, SENYÈ a pale selon mesye <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">11:21 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="JER 1:1">Jr 1:1</ref></char></note>Anathoth yo, k ap chache lavi ou, k ap di: “Pa pwofetize nan non SENYÈ a, pou ou pa mouri nan men nou”— <verse eid="JER 11:21"/><verse number="22" style="v" sid="JER 11:22"/>Akoz sa, pale SENYÈ dèzame yo: “Gade byen, Mwen prèt pou pini yo! <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">11:22 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="2CH 36:17">II Kwo 36:17</ref></char></note>Jennonm yo va mouri pa nepe, fis ak fi yo va mouri ak gwo grangou. <verse eid="JER 11:22"/><verse number="23" style="v" sid="JER 11:23"/>Menm yon retay <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">11:23 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="JER 6:9">Jr 6:9</ref></char></note>p ap rete pou yo. Paske Mwen ap mennen yon dezas sou mesye Anathoth yo, jis li rive ane règleman pa yo.”<verse eid="JER 11:23"/></para>
  <chapter eid="JER 11"/>
  <chapter number="12" style="c" sid="JER 12"/>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="JER 12:1"/>Byen dwat, se Ou menm, O SENYÈ,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 12:1">lè m plede ka m avèk Ou.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 12:1">Anverite, mwen ta diskite yon ka lajistis avèk Ou.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 12:1">Poukisa <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">12:1 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="JOB 12:6">Job 12:6</ref></char></note>chemen mechan an byen reyisi konsa?</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 12:1">Poukisa tout sa ki aji nan manti yo rete alèz konsa?<verse eid="JER 12:1"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="JER 12:2"/>Ou te plante yo. Wi, konsa yo fin pran rasin.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 12:2">Yo grandi. Wi, yo fè fwi.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 12:2">Ou <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">12:2 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ISA 29:13">És 29:13</ref></char></note>toupre nan lèv yo, men lespri yo lwen W.<verse eid="JER 12:2"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="JER 12:3"/>Men Ou konnen mwen, O SENYÈ.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 12:3">Ou wè mwen.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 12:3">Ou fè egzamen pou wè kè m vè Ou menm.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 12:3">Rale yo akote, tankou mouton k ap prale labatwa;</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 12:3">mete yo apa pou <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">12:3 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="JER 17:8">Jr 17:8</ref></char></note>jou gwo masak la.<verse eid="JER 12:3"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="JER 12:4"/>Depi kilè peyi a va gen dèy konsa,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 12:4">e <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">12:4 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="JOL 1:10-17">Jl 1:10-17</ref></char></note>vèdi chan an vin sèch konsa?</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 12:4">Akoz mechanste a sila ki rete ladann yo,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 12:4">ni bèt ni zwazo detwi nèt;</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 12:4">akoz yo te di: “Li p ap wè dènye fen nou an.”<verse eid="JER 12:4"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="JER 12:5"/>Si ou te kouri ak moun apye yo,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 12:5">e yo fè ou bouke,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 12:5">kijan ou ka fè kous ak cheval?</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 12:5">Malgre, nan yon peyi lapè, ou gen sekirite,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 12:5">men kijan ou va reyisi nan <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">12:5 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="JER 49:19">Jr 49:19</ref></char></note>vye rakbwa Jourdain an?<verse eid="JER 12:5"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="JER 12:6"/>Paske menm <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">12:6 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="GEN 37:4-11">Jen 37:4-11</ref></char></note>frè ou yo ak lakay papa ou a;</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 12:6">menm yo menm, te fè trèt avèk ou!</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 12:6">Menm yo menm, te rele dèyè ou.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 12:6">Pa kwè yo, malgre bèl pawòl dous.<verse eid="JER 12:6"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="JER 12:7"/>“Mwen te abandone lakay Mwen an,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 12:7">Mwen te abandone eritaj Mwen an;</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 12:7">Mwen fin bay <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">12:7 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="JER 11:15">Jr 11:15</ref></char></note>fi byeneme a nanm Mwen an</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 12:7">pou antre nan men lènmi li yo.<verse eid="JER 12:7"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="JER 12:8"/>Eritaj Mwen an te vini pou Mwen, kon yon lyon</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 12:8">k ap gwonde nan forè a.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 12:8">Li te gwonde kont Mwen.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 12:8">Akoz sa, Mwen te vin <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">12:8 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="HOS 9:15">Os 9:15</ref></char></note>rayi li.<verse eid="JER 12:8"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="JER 12:9"/>Èske eritaj Mwen an gen tan vin tankou yon zwazo takte nan lachas?</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 12:9">Èske gen <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">12:9 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="2KI 24:2">II Wa 24:2</ref></char></note>zwazo voras kont li tout kote?</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 12:9">Ale, rasanble tout bèt sovaj nan chan yo.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 12:9">Mennen yo pou yo ka devore!<verse eid="JER 12:9"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="JER 12:10"/>Anpil <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">12:10 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="JER 6:3">Jr 6:3</ref></char></note>bèje fin gate chan rezen Mwen yo.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 12:10">Yo te foule chan Mwen an anba pye;</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 12:10">yo te fè bèl chan Mwen an vin yon savann dezole.<verse eid="JER 12:10"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="JER 12:11"/>Li te vin yon dezè.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 12:11">Abandonen, li plenyen devan M.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 12:11">Tout latè vin dezole,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 12:11">akoz pèsòn <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">12:11 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ISA 42:25">És 42:25</ref></char></note>pa pran sa an kè.<verse eid="JER 12:11"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="JER 12:12"/>Sou tout <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">12:12 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="JER 3:2-21">Jr 3:2-21</ref></char></note>do mòn sèch nan dezè yo, destriktè yo vin parèt,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 12:12">paske yon nepe SENYÈ a ap devore</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 12:12">soti nan yon pwent peyi a jis rive nan lòt la.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 12:12">Nanpwen lapè pou pèsòn.<verse eid="JER 12:12"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="JER 12:13"/>Se <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">12:13 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="LEV 26:16">Lev 26:16</ref></char></note>ble yo te simen e yo rekòlte pikan.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 12:13">Yo te fè gwo efò, san ke yo pa reyisi anyen.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 12:13">Men se pou nou vin wont rekòlt nou an akoz gwo kòlè SENYÈ a.”<verse eid="JER 12:13"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="JER 12:14"/>Konsa pale SENYÈ a de tout <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">12:14 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="JER 49:1-7">Jr 49:1-7</ref></char></note>vwazen mechan k ap atake eritaj ke Mwen te bay a pèp Mwen an, Israël: “Gade byen, Mwen prèt pou dechouke yo depi nan peyi pa yo. Anplis, Mwen va dechouke lakay Juda soti nan mitan yo. <verse eid="JER 12:14"/><verse number="15" style="v" sid="JER 12:15"/>Epi li va vin rive ke apre Mwen dechouke yo, Mwen va ankò gen konpasyon pou yo. Mwen va <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">12:15 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="AMO 9:14">Am 9:14</ref></char></note>mennen yo retounen, yo chak a eritaj pa yo, e yo chak nan pwòp peyi pa yo. <verse eid="JER 12:15"/><verse number="16" style="v" sid="JER 12:16"/>Epi si, anverite, yo va <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">12:16 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ISA 42:6">És 42:6</ref></char></note>aprann chemen a pèp Mwen an, pou sèmante pa non Mwen: ‘Kon SENYÈ a viv la’, menm jan ke yo menm te enstwi pèp Mwen an pou sèmante pa Baal yo, yo va vin etabli nan mitan pèp Mwen an. <verse eid="JER 12:16"/><verse number="17" style="v" sid="JER 12:17"/>Men si yo pa koute, alò, Mwen va <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">12:17 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="PSA 2:8-12">Sòm 2:8-12</ref></char></note>dechouke nasyon sa a, dechouke e detwi li,” deklare SENYÈ a.<verse eid="JER 12:17"/></para>
  <chapter eid="JER 12"/>
  <chapter number="13" style="c" sid="JER 13"/>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="JER 13:1"/>Konsa SENYÈ a te pale mwen: “Ale <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">13:1 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="JER 13:11">Jr 13:11</ref></char></note>achte pou kont ou yon senti an twal len. Mete l nan senti ou, men pa mete li nan dlo.”<verse eid="JER 13:1"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="JER 13:2"/>Konsa mwen te achte senti a selon <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">13:2 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ISA 20:2">És 20:2</ref></char></note>pawòl SENYÈ a, e te mete l nan senti mwen.<verse eid="JER 13:2"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="JER 13:3"/>Epi pawòl SENYÈ a te vin kote mwen yon dezyèm fwa a, epi te di: <verse eid="JER 13:3"/><verse number="4" style="v" sid="JER 13:4"/>“Pran senti ke ou te achte a, ki antoure senti ou a, leve ale nan <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">13:4 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="JER 51:63">Jr 51:63</ref></char></note>Rivyè Euphrate la, e kache li la nan yon twou wòch.”<verse eid="JER 13:4"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="JER 13:5"/>Konsa, mwen te ale kache li akote Rivyè Euphrate la, <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">13:5 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="EXO 39:42-43">Egz 39:42-43</ref></char></note>jan SENYÈ a te kòmande mwen an.<verse eid="JER 13:5"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="JER 13:6"/>Apre anpil jou, SENYÈ a te di m: “Leve ale nan Rivyè Euphrate la e leve pran senti ke M te kòmande ou sere la a.”<verse eid="JER 13:6"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="JER 13:7"/>Epi mwen te ale nan Rivyè Euphrate la, mwen te fouye e mwen te pran senti a sòti nan plas kote mwen te sere li. Konsa, gade byen, senti a te gate. Li te vin san valè.<verse eid="JER 13:7"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="JER 13:8"/>Epi pawòl SENYÈ a te rive kote mwen. Li te di: <verse eid="JER 13:8"/><verse number="9" style="v" sid="JER 13:9"/>“Konsa pale SENYÈ a: ‘Se konsa Mwen va detwi <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">13:9 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="LEV 26:19">Lev 26:19</ref></char></note>ògèy a Juda ak gwo ògèy a Jérusalem nan. <verse eid="JER 13:9"/><verse number="10" style="v" sid="JER 13:10"/>Pèp mechan sila a, ki refize koute pawòl Mwen yo, ki mache nan kou tèt di a kè yo e te ale dèyè lòt dye pou sèvi yo, e pou pwostène devan yo, kite yo vin tankou senti sa a, san okenn valè nèt. <verse eid="JER 13:10"/><verse number="11" style="v" sid="JER 13:11"/>Paske jan senti a kwoke nan senti a yon nonm nan, se konsa Mwen te fè tout lakay Israël <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">13:11 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="EXO 19:5-6">Egz 19:5-6</ref></char></note>kwoke sou Mwen,’ deklare SENYÈ a: ‘pou yo ta kapab pou Mwen, yon pèp, de rekonesans, pou lwanj e pou glwa; men yo pa t koute.’<verse eid="JER 13:11"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="JER 13:12"/>“Pou sa, ou gen pou pale pawòl sa a yo: ‘Konsa pale SENYÈ a, Bondye Israël la, “Fòk tout veso yo plen ak diven.”’ Epi lè yo di ou: ‘Èske nou pa konnen ke tout veso oblije plen ak diven?’ <verse eid="JER 13:12"/><verse number="13" style="v" sid="JER 13:13"/>Alò, pale yo: ‘Konsa pale SENYÈ a: “Gade byen, Mwen prèt pou plen tout sila ki rete nan peyi sa yo—wa k ap chita pou David sou twòn li an, prèt yo, pwofèt yo ak tout moun nan peyi Jérusalem yo—ak koze <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">13:13 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="PSA 60:3">Sòm 60:3</ref></char></note>vin sou nèt la! <verse eid="JER 13:13"/><verse number="14" style="v" sid="JER 13:14"/>Mwen va kraze yo, youn kont lòt, ni papa ni fis ansanm”, deklare SENYÈ a. “Mwen p ap gen <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">13:14 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="DEU 29:20">Det 29:20</ref></char></note>pitye, ni regrè, ni konpasyon pou yo pa detwi.”’”<verse eid="JER 13:14"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="JER 13:15"/>Koute e prete atansyon ak sa.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 13:15">Pa fè <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">13:15 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="PRO 16:5">Pwov 16:5</ref></char></note>ògèy, paske SENYÈ a fin pale.<verse eid="JER 13:15"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="JER 13:16"/>Bay glwa a SENYÈ a, Bondye nou an, avan li pote <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">13:16 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ISA 5:30">És 5:30</ref></char></note>fènwa,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 13:16">avan pye nou vin glise tonbe sou mòn k ap plen tenèb yo;</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 13:16">pou pandan nou ap tann limyè,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 13:16">Li pa fè l antre nan fènwa lanmò a</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 13:16">pou l rive nan tenèb ki san espwa.<verse eid="JER 13:16"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="JER 13:17"/>Men <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">13:17 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="MAL 2:2">Mal 2:2</ref></char></note>si ou pa koute sa a,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 13:17">nanm mwen va kriye an sekrè pou kalite ògèy sa a.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 13:17">Wi, zye m va kriye anmè e koule anpil dlo,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 13:17">akoz bann mouton SENYÈ a fin kaptif nèt.<verse eid="JER 13:17"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="JER 13:18"/>Di a <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">13:18 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="2KI 24:12">II Wa 24:12</ref></char></note>wa a ak manman rèn nan:</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 13:18">“Pran yon chèz ki ba,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 13:18">paske bèl kouwòn ou an,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 13:18">kouwòn de glwa a menm,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 13:18">fin tonbe kite tèt ou.”<verse eid="JER 13:18"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="JER 13:19"/>
    <note caller="+" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">13:19 </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="JER 32:44">Jr 32:44</ref>
      </char>
    </note>Vil negev yo te fèmen ak kle,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 13:19">e nanpwen moun ki pou louvri yo.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 13:19">Tout Juda fin antre an egzil, antre an egzil nèt.<verse eid="JER 13:19"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="JER 13:20"/>Leve zye ou pou wè, <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">13:20 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="JER 1:15">Jr 1:15</ref></char></note>men sila k ap vini soti nan nò yo.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 13:20">Kote bann mouton ki te bay a ou menm nan, bèl mouton ou yo?<verse eid="JER 13:20"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="JER 13:21"/>Kisa ou va di lè Li chwazi yo chèf sou nou—</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 13:21">konsi, se nou menm ki te enstwi yo—</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 13:21">ansyen <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">13:21 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="JER 2:25">Jr 2:25</ref></char></note>zanmi nou yo vin chèf sou nou?</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 13:21">Èske gwo doulè p ap sezi ou tankou yon fanm nan akouchman?<verse eid="JER 13:21"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="JER 13:22"/>“Si ou di nan kè ou, <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">13:22 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="JER 5:19">Jr 5:19</ref></char></note>poukisa bagay sa te rive mwen?”</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 13:22">Akoz grandè a inikite ou, jip ou yo te vin retire</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 13:22">e talon ou yo te vin ekspoze.<verse eid="JER 13:22"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="JER 13:23"/>
    <note caller="+" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">13:23 </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="PRO 27:22">Pwov 27:22</ref>
      </char>
    </note>Èske Etyopyen an ka chanje koulè po li,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 13:23">oswa leyopa a takte li yo?</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 13:23">Sèl Konsa nou menm tou, ak abitid fè mal,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 13:23">ta ka chanje 1 pou vin fè byen.<verse eid="JER 13:23"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="JER 13:24"/>Akoz sa, Mwen va <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">13:24 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="LEV 26:33">Lev 26:33</ref></char></note>gaye yo kon pay nan van, nan van dezè a.<verse eid="JER 13:24"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="JER 13:25"/>“Sa se <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">13:25 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="JOB 20:29">Job 20:29</ref></char></note>tiraj osò pa nou,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 13:25">pòsyon ke nou resevwa sòti nan Mwen an”, deklare SENYÈ a,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 13:25">“akoz nou te bliye Mwen</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 13:25">e te mete konfyans nan sa ki fo.<verse eid="JER 13:25"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="JER 13:26"/>Akoz sa, Mwen menm va <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">13:26 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="LAM 1:8">Lam 1:8</ref></char></note>retire jip ou anwo figi ou,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 13:26">pou wont ou kapab vin vizib.<verse eid="JER 13:26"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="JER 13:27"/>Mwen te wè abominasyon nou yo, ak<note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">13:27 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="JER 5:7-8">Jr 5:7-8</ref></char></note>adiltè ou yo</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 13:27">e ranni ak anvi pou fè pwostitisyon lèd ou yo,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 13:27">sou kolin ak nan chan yo.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 13:27">Malè a ou menm, O Jérusalem!</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 13:27">Pou jiskilè ou va rete pa pwòp?”</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 13:27">Pou konbyen de tan sa va dire?<verse eid="JER 13:27"/></para>
  <chapter eid="JER 13"/>
  <chapter number="14" style="c" sid="JER 14"/>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="JER 14:1"/>Sa se pawòl SENYÈ a a Jérémie konsènan <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">14:1 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="JER 17:8">Jr 17:8</ref></char></note>gwo sechrès la:<verse eid="JER 14:1"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="JER 14:2"/>Juda kriye ak doulè</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 14:2">e pòtay li yo vin abandone.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 14:2">Yo chita atè pou fè dèy e <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">14:2 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="1SA 5:12">I Sam 5:12</ref></char></note>kri Jérusalem vin monte.<verse eid="JER 14:2"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="JER 14:3"/>Prens pa yo te <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">14:3 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="1KI 18:5">I Wa 18:5</ref></char></note>voye sèvitè yo chache dlo.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 14:3">Yo rive nan sitèn yo,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 14:3">men nanpwen dlo.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 14:3">Yo te retounen ak veso yo vid.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 14:3">Yo te vin wont, imilye e yo te kouvri tèt yo.<verse eid="JER 14:3"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="JER 14:4"/>Akoz <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">14:4 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="JOL 1:19">Jl 1:19</ref></char></note>tè sèch la vin fann,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 14:4">akoz pa t gen lapli sou peyi a;</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 14:4">kiltivatè yo te vin wont.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 14:4">Yo te kouvri tèt yo.<verse eid="JER 14:4"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="JER 14:5"/>Wi, menm femèl sèf nan chan an</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 14:5">fè pitit pou kite yo.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 14:5">
    <note caller="+" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">14:5 </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="ISA 15:6">És 15:6</ref>
      </char>
    </note>Nanpwen zèb.<verse eid="JER 14:5"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="JER 14:6"/>
    <note caller="+" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">14:6 </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="JOB 39:5-6">Job 39:5-6</ref>
      </char>
    </note>Bourik mawon yo kanpe sou kolin sèch yo.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 14:6">Y ap rale soufle fò tankou chen mawon.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 14:6">Zye yo vin febli, paske nanpwen anyen ki vèt.<verse eid="JER 14:6"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="JER 14:7"/>Malgre inikite nou yo temwaye kont nou,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 14:7">O SENYÈ, aji pou koz a non Ou!</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 14:7">Rebelyon nou anpil.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 14:7">Nou te peche kontre Ou.<verse eid="JER 14:7"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="JER 14:8"/>O Espwa Israël la,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 14:8">
    <note caller="+" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">14:8 </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="ISA 43:3">És 43:3</ref>
      </char>
    </note>Sovè li nan tan gwo twoub la,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 14:8">poukisa Ou tankou yon etranje nan peyi a?</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 14:8">Oswa yon vwayajè ki te monte tant li lannwit?<verse eid="JER 14:8"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="JER 14:9"/>Poukisa Ou tankou yon nonm twouble,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 14:9">tankou yon nonm pwisan ki pa kapab bay sekou?</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 14:9">Malgre sa, Ou nan mitan nou, O SENYÈ e nou vin rele pa non Ou;</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 14:9">pa abandone nou!<verse eid="JER 14:9"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="JER 14:10"/>Konsa pale SENYÈ a a pèp sa a:</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 14:10">“Malgre yo tèlman renmen egare;</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 14:10">yo pa t kenbe pye yo nan bon kontwòl.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 14:10">Akoz sa, SENYÈ a pa aksepte yo.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 14:10">Koulye a, li sonje inikite yo.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 14:10">Li fè yo rand kont pou peche yo.”<verse eid="JER 14:10"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="JER 14:11"/>Pou sa, SENYÈ a te di m: <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">14:11 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="EXO 32:10">Egz 32:10</ref></char></note>“Pa fè lapriyè nan favè a pèp sa a. <verse eid="JER 14:11"/><verse number="12" style="v" sid="JER 14:12"/>Lè yo fè jèn, Mwen p ap koute kri yo; epi lè yo ofri ofrann brile ak ofrann sereyal, Mwen p ap aksepte yo. Pito Mwen va fè yo disparèt ak nepe, ak gwo grangou, bèt ak maladi k ap ravaje chan yo.”<verse eid="JER 14:12"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="JER 14:13"/>Men “A, Senyè, BONDYE a!” Mwen te di: “Gade, pwofèt yo ap di yo: ‘Ou <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">14:13 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="JER 5:12">Jr 5:12</ref></char></note>p ap wè nepe, ni gwo grangou, men se lapè k ap rete nèt nan plas sa a.’”<verse eid="JER 14:13"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="JER 14:14"/>Konsa, SENYÈ a te di Mwen: <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">14:14 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="JER 5:31">Jr 5:31</ref></char></note> “Pwofèt yo ap pwofetize sa ki fo nan non Mwen. Mwen pa t voye yo, ni kòmande yo, ni pale avèk yo. Y ap pwofetize yon vizyon ki fo, prediksyon, sa ki san enpòtans, ak manti k ap sòti nan pwòp panse pa yo. <verse eid="JER 14:14"/><verse number="15" style="v" sid="JER 14:15"/>Pou sa, pale SENYÈ a, selon pwofèt ki pwofetize nan non Mwen, malgre se pa Mwen ki te voye yo—men yo kontinye ap di: ‘P ap gen nepe ni gwo grangou nan peyi sa a’,<note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">14:15 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="JER 23:15">Jr 23:15</ref></char></note> ak nepe e gwo grangou, pwofèt sa yo ap rankontre fen yo! <verse eid="JER 14:15"/><verse number="16" style="v" sid="JER 14:16"/>Pèp la tou, a sila yo bay pwofesi sa a ap jete deyò nan lari Jérusalem akoz gwo grangou ak nepe. P ap menm gen moun ki pou antere yo—ni yo menm, ni madanm yo, ni fis yo ni fi yo—paske Mwen va <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">14:16 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="PRO 1:31">Pwov 1:31</ref></char></note>vide pwòp mechanste pa yo sou yo.<verse eid="JER 14:16"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="JER 14:17"/>“Ou va di yo pawòl sa a:</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 14:17">‘Kite zye m koule ak dlo lannwit kon lajounen</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 14:17">e pa kite dlo yo sispann;</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 14:17">Paske <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">14:17 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ISA 37:22">És 37:22</ref></char></note>fi vyèj a pèp mwen an</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 14:17">te kraze ak yon gran brèch,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 14:17">ak yon blesi byen grav.<verse eid="JER 14:17"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="JER 14:18"/>Si mwen ale andeyò peyi a,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 14:18">gade byen, tout sila ki mouri ak nepe yo!</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 14:18">Oswa si mwen antre nan vil la,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 14:18">gade byen, maladi ak gwo grangou!</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 14:18">Paske <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">14:18 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="JER 6:13">Jr 6:13</ref></char></note>pwofèt la, ak prèt la tou te fè ale vini</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 14:18">nan yon peyi ke yo pa t menm konnen.’”<verse eid="JER 14:18"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="JER 14:19"/>Èske Ou te rejte Juda nèt?</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 14:19">Oswa èske Ou te rayi Sion?</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 14:19">Poukisa Ou te frape nou jiskaske nou <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">14:19 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="JER 30:13">Jr 30:13</ref></char></note>vin pa ka geri?</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 14:19">Nou t ap tann lapè, men anyen ki bon pa t vini;</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 14:19">pou yon tan pou nou ta ka geri,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 14:19">men gade byen, se gwo laperèz!<verse eid="JER 14:19"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="JER 14:20"/>Nou konnen mechanste nou yo, O SENYÈ,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 14:20">inikite a papa zansèt nou yo,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 14:20">paske <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">14:20 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="JER 8:14">Jr 8:14</ref></char></note>nou te peche kont Ou.<verse eid="JER 14:20"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="JER 14:21"/>Pa meprize nou, <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">14:21 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="PSA 25:11">Sòm 25:11</ref></char></note>pou koz a pwòp non Ou:</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 14:21">pa kite twòn a glwa ou a dezonore.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 14:21">Sonje e pa kase akò Ou avèk nou.<verse eid="JER 14:21"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="JER 14:22"/>Èske genyen pami zidòl a nasyon yo ki konn bay lapli?</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 14:22">Oswa èske syèl yo ka fè lapli pou kont yo?</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 14:22">Èske se pa Ou menm, O SENYÈ, Bondye nou an?</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 14:22">Akoz sa, nou mete <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">14:22 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="LAM 3:26">Lam 3:26</ref></char></note>espwa nan Ou,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 14:22">paske se Ou ki te fè tout bagay sa yo.<verse eid="JER 14:22"/></para>
  <chapter eid="JER 14"/>
  <chapter number="15" style="c" sid="JER 15"/>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="JER 15:1"/>Alò, SENYÈ a te di mwen: “Menm si <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">15:1 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="EXO 32:11-14">Egz 32:11-14</ref></char></note>Moïse ak Samuel te kanpe devan M, kè M pa t ap avèk pèp sa a. Voye yo sòti nan prezans Mwen! Kite yo ale nèt! <verse eid="JER 15:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="JER 15:2"/>Konsa l ap rive ke lè yo mande ou: ‘Ki jan n ap prale?’, alò, ou va di yo: ‘Se konsa SENYÈ a pale:</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 15:2">“Sila ki <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">15:2 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="JER 14:12">Jr 14:12</ref></char></note>pou mouri yo, a lanmò;</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 15:2">ak sila ki pou nepe yo, a nepe;</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 15:2">sila ki pou gwo grangou yo, a gwo grangou a;</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 15:2">e sila ki pou kaptif yo, a kaptivite.”’<verse eid="JER 15:2"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="JER 15:3"/>“Mwen va <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">15:3 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="LEV 26:16-25">Lev 26:16-25</ref></char></note>chwazi sou yo kat kalite jan,” pale SENYÈ a: “nepe ki pou touye, chen ki pou chire yo, e bèt syèl yo, ak bèt latè pou devore e detwi yo. <verse eid="JER 15:3"/><verse number="4" style="v" sid="JER 15:4"/>Mwen va <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">15:4 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="LEV 26:33">Lev 26:33</ref></char></note>fè yo yon objè sezisman pami tout wayòm latè yo, akoz Manassé, fis a Ézéchias la, wa Juda a, pou sa li te fè Jérusalem nan.”<verse eid="JER 15:4"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="JER 15:5"/>“Anverite, se kilès k ap gen pitye pou ou, O Jérusalem?</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 15:5">Oswa kilès k ap <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">15:5 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="NAM 3:7">Na 3:7</ref></char></note>fè gwo kri pou ou?</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 15:5">Oswa k ap vire sou kote pou mande si ou byen?<verse eid="JER 15:5"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="JER 15:6"/>Ou menm ki abandonen Mwen an,” deklare SENYÈ a,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 15:6">“Ou kontinye ap fè bak.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 15:6">Pou sa, Mwen te <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">15:6 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ISA 1:4">És 1:4</ref></char></note>lonje men M kont ou</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 15:6">e Mwen te pou detwi ou.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 15:6">Mwen bouke demontre ou konpasyon!<verse eid="JER 15:6"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="JER 15:7"/>Mwen te vannen yo ak yon fouchèt vannen nan pòtay peyi a.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 15:7">Mwen te <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">15:7 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="JER 18:21">Jr 18:21</ref></char></note>prive yo de pitit yo.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 15:7">Mwen te detwi pèp Mwen an.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 15:7">Yo pa t vire kite chemen yo.<verse eid="JER 15:7"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="JER 15:8"/>
    <note caller="+" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">15:8 </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="ISA 3:25-26">És 3:25-26</ref>
      </char>
    </note>Vèv pa yo vin plis ke grenn sab lanmè devan Mwen.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 15:8">Mwen te fè parèt kont yo;</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 15:8">kont manman a yon jennonm,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 15:8">yon destriktè a midi.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 15:8">Mwen te sibitman fè desann sou li gwo doulè ak sezisman.<verse eid="JER 15:8"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="JER 15:9"/>Sila ki te <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">15:9 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="1SA 2:5">I Sam 2:5</ref></char></note>fè sèt pitit gason te vin chagren;</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 15:9">li te rale denyè souf.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 15:9">Solèy pa li te vin desann nan mitan lajounen;</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 15:9">li te soufri wont e li te menm imilye.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 15:9">Konsa, Mwen va remèt sila ki chape de nepe yo</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 15:9">devan lènmi yo,” deklare SENYÈ a.<verse eid="JER 15:9"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="JER 15:10"/>Malè se mwen, manman m, ki te fè mwen,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 15:10">yon <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">15:10 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="JER 1:18-19">Jr 1:18-19</ref></char></note>nonm ki fè twoub leve,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 15:10">yon nonm ki fè kontansyon nan tout latè a!</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 15:10">Mwen pa t prete lajan a lòt moun, ni pèsòn pa t prete mwen;</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 15:10">malgre sa, yo tout ban m madichon.<verse eid="JER 15:10"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="JER 15:11"/>SENYÈ a te di: “Anverite, Mwen va <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">15:11 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="PSA 138:3">Sòm 138:3</ref></char></note>bay ou fòs pou sa ki bon.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 15:11">Anverite, Mwen va fè lènmi an fè siplikasyon pou ou</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 15:11">nan yon tan gwo dezas, ak yon tan gwo doulè.<verse eid="JER 15:11"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="JER 15:12"/>Èske yon moun ka kraze fè;</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 15:12">
    <note caller="+" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">15:12 </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="JER 28:14">Jr 28:14</ref>
      </char>
    </note>fè ki sòti nan nò, oswa bwonz?<verse eid="JER 15:12"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="JER 15:13"/>Mwen va bay gwo richès ou ak trezò ou yo,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 15:13">kon piyaj ki <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">15:13 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="PSA 44:12">Sòm 44:12</ref></char></note>san frè;</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 15:13">sa a, konsa, pou tout peche ou yo,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 15:13">menm anndan tout lizyè ou yo.<verse eid="JER 15:13"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="JER 15:14"/>Mwen va fè lènmi ou yo mennen yo nan yon</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 15:14">
    <note caller="+" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">15:14 </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="PSA 44:12">Sòm 44:12</ref>
      </char>
    </note>peyi ke ou pa konnen;</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 15:14">paske yon dife te vin limen nan kòlè Mwen</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 15:14">ki va brile sou ou.”<verse eid="JER 15:14"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="JER 15:15"/>
    <note caller="+" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">15:15 </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="JER 12:3">Jr 12:3</ref>
      </char>
    </note>Ou menm ki konnen, O SENYÈ,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 15:15">sonje mwen e pran vanjans sou pèsekitè mwen yo.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 15:15">Nan pasyans Ou, O SENYÈ, pa retire m nèt;</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 15:15">rekonèt ke pou non Ou, mwen te sipòte repwòch.<verse eid="JER 15:15"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="JER 15:16"/>Pawòl Ou yo te vin twouve;</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 15:16">mwen te <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">15:16 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="EZK 3:3">Éz 3:3</ref></char></note>manje yo.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 15:16">Pawòl Ou yo te vin pou mwen yon gwo jwa</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 15:16">ki fè kè m rejwi;</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 15:16">paske mwen te rele pa non Ou, O SENYÈ Bondye Dèzame yo.<verse eid="JER 15:16"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="JER 15:17"/>Mwen <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">15:17 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="PSA 1:1">Sòm 1:1</ref></char></note>pa t chita nan sèk moun k ap fè banbòch,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 15:17">ni mwen pa t vante tèt mwen wo.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 15:17">Akoz men Ou sou mwen, mwen te chita apa pou kont mwen,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 15:17">paske Ou te ranpli mwen ak endiyasyon.<verse eid="JER 15:17"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="JER 15:18"/>Poukisa, doulè mwen an rete tout tan,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 15:18">e<note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">15:18 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="JOB 34:6">Job 34:6</ref></char></note>blese mwen an reste san gerizon?</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 15:18">Èske Ou menm, anverite,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 15:18">va devni pou mwen kon yon sous twonpe,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 15:18">ak dlo sou sila yo pa ka depann?<verse eid="JER 15:18"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="JER 15:19"/>Konsa, pale SENYÈ a:</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 15:19">
    <note caller="+" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">15:19 </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="JOB 34:6">Job 34:6</ref>
      </char>
    </note>“Si ou retounen, alò, Mwen va mennen ou ankò</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 15:19">pou ou kanpe devan M.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 15:19">Si ou separe sa ki presye soti de sa ki san valè,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 15:19">ou va vin tankou bouch Mwen.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 15:19">Yo va retounen kote ou;</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 15:19">men ou menm, ou pa p retounen kote yo menm.<verse eid="JER 15:19"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="JER 15:20"/>Mwen va fè ou devan pèp sa a, yon miray fòtifye ak bwonz.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 15:20">Malgre yo goumen kont ou, yo p ap genyen sou ou;</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 15:20">paske <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">15:20 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="PSA 46:7">Sòm 46:7</ref></char></note>Mwen avèk ou pou ba ou sekou</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 15:20">e pou delivre ou,” deklare SENYÈ a.<verse eid="JER 15:20"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="JER 15:21"/>“Konsa, Mwen va delivre ou nan men a mechan yo</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 15:21">e Mwen va <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">15:21 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="GEN 48:16">Jen 48:16</ref></char></note>rachte ou soti nan men a vyolan yo.”<verse eid="JER 15:21"/></para>
  <chapter eid="JER 15"/>
  <chapter number="16" style="c" sid="JER 16"/>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="JER 16:1"/>Anplis, pawòl SENYÈ a te vin kote mwen. Li te di: <verse eid="JER 16:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="JER 16:2"/>“Ou p ap pran yon madanm pou ou menm, ni fè fis ak fi nan kote sa a.” <verse eid="JER 16:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="JER 16:3"/>Paske konsa pale SENYÈ a konsènan fis ak fi ki fèt nan plas sila a, e konsènan <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">16:3 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="JER 15:8">Jr 15:8</ref></char></note>manman yo ki te fè yo ak papa yo ki te fè yo nan peyi sa a: <verse eid="JER 16:3"/><verse number="4" style="v" sid="JER 16:4"/>“Yo va <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">16:4 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="JER 15:2">Jr 15:2</ref></char></note>mouri mo yo ki byen move. Yo p ap fè dèy pou yo, ni antere yo. Yo va rete tankou fimye bèt sou sifas latè. Yo va manje nèt ak nepe ak gwo grangou. Kadav yo va devni manje pou zwazo syèl ak pou bèt sovaj latè yo.”<verse eid="JER 16:4"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="JER 16:5"/>Paske konsa pale SENYÈ a: “Pa antre nan <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">16:5 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="EZK 24:16-23">Éz 24:16-23</ref></char></note>kay doulè a, ni pa ale kriye pou yo! Pa regret yo! Paske Mwen te retire lapè M de pèp sa a,” deklare SENYÈ a: “lanmou Mwen ak konpasyon Mwen.” <verse eid="JER 16:5"/><verse number="6" style="v" sid="JER 16:6"/>Ni gran, ni piti va mouri nan peyi sa a. Yo p ap antere, yo p ap fè dèy pou yo, ni p ap gen moun ki <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">16:6 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="DEU 14:1">Det 14:1</ref></char></note>blese kò l oswa pase razwa nan tèt li pou yo. <verse eid="JER 16:6"/><verse number="7" style="v" sid="JER 16:7"/>Pèsòn p ap <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">16:7 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="DEU 14:1">Det 14:1</ref></char></note>kase pen doulè a pou yo, pou konsole okenn moun pou lanmò, ni bay yo yon tas konsolasyon pou bwè pou papa yo, oswa manman yo.<verse eid="JER 16:7"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="JER 16:8"/>“Anplis, ou <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">16:8 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ECC 7:2-4">Ekl 7:2-4</ref></char></note>pa prale nan yon kay ki gen fèt pou chita ak yo pou manje ak bwè.” <verse eid="JER 16:8"/><verse number="9" style="v" sid="JER 16:9"/>Paske konsa pale SENYÈ dèzame yo, Bondye Israël la: “Gade byen, Mwen va <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">16:9 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="JER 7:34">Jr 7:34</ref></char></note>elimine nèt nan plas sa, vwa rejwisans ak vwa kè kontan, vwa a jèn gason fenk marye ak vwa a jèn fi marye, devan zye nou e nan pwòp tan pa nou. <verse eid="JER 16:9"/><verse number="10" style="v" sid="JER 16:10"/>Alò, lè ou di pèp sa a tout pawòl sa yo, yo va di ou: <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">16:10 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="DEU 29:24">Det 29:24</ref></char></note> ‘Pou ki rezon SENYÈ a te deklare tout gwo malè sa a kont nou? Epi ki inikite oswa ki peche ke nou te fè kont SENYÈ a, Bondye nou an?’ <verse eid="JER 16:10"/><verse number="11" style="v" sid="JER 16:11"/>Nan lè sa a, ou gen pou di yo: <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">16:11 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="DEU 29:25">Det 29:25</ref></char></note> ‘Akoz papa zansèt nou yo te abandone Mwen,’ deklare SENYÈ a: ‘pou te swiv lòt dye yo, pou te sèvi yo e te pwostène devan yo. Konsa yo te abandone Mwen e yo pa t kenbe lalwa Mwen an. <verse eid="JER 16:11"/><verse number="12" style="v" sid="JER 16:12"/>Nou tou, te fè mal <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">16:12 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="JER 7:26">Jr 7:26</ref></char></note>plis menm ke papa zansèt nou yo. Paske gade byen, nou chak ap mache selon tèt di a pwòp kè mechan pa nou, san koute Mwen. <verse eid="JER 16:12"/><verse number="13" style="v" sid="JER 16:13"/>Akoz sa, Mwen va <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">16:13 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="DEU 4:26-27">Det 4:26-27</ref></char></note>jete nou deyò peyi sa a, antre nan yon peyi ke nou pa t janm konnen, ni nou menm, ni papa zansèt nou yo. La menm, nou va sèvi lòt dye yo lajounen kon lannwit, paske Mwen p ap bannou okenn favè.’<verse eid="JER 16:13"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="JER 16:14"/>“Akoz sa, gade byen, gen jou k ap vini,” deklare SENYÈ a: “lè fraz sila a p ap menm repete ankò: ‘Jan SENYÈ vivan an, ki te mennen, fè fis Israël yo soti nan <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">16:14 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="EXO 20:2">Egz 20:2</ref></char></note>peyi Égypte la’, <verse eid="JER 16:14"/><verse number="15" style="v" sid="JER 16:15"/>Men: ‘Jan SENYÈ vivan an, ki te mennen fè monte fis Israël yo <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">16:15 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="PSA 106:47">Sòm 106:47</ref></char></note>soti nan peyi nò a e soti nan tout peyi kote Li te ekzile yo.’ Paske Mwen va restore yo a pwòp peyi yo, ke Mwen te bay a papa zansèt yo.<verse eid="JER 16:15"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="JER 16:16"/>“Gade byen, Mwen ap voye anpil <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">16:16 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="AMO 4:2">Am 4:2</ref></char></note>moun lapèch,” deklare SENYÈ a: “Epi yo va fè lapèch pou yo. Apre sa a, Mwen va voye anpil moun lachas e yo va fè lachas pou yo nan tout kolin ak nan tout kwen nan gwo wòch yo. <verse eid="JER 16:16"/><verse number="17" style="v" sid="JER 16:17"/>Paske zye M sou tout chemen pa yo. Yo pa kache devan figi Mwen, <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">16:17 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="JER 2:22">Jr 2:22</ref></char></note>ni inikite yo pa kache devan zye M. <verse eid="JER 16:17"/><verse number="18" style="v" sid="JER 16:18"/>Premyèman, Mwen va rekonpanse doub tout inikite ak peche yo, akoz yo te <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">16:18 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="NUM 35:33-34">Nonb 35:33-34</ref></char></note>fè peyi a pouri nèt. Akoz yo te ranpli eritaj Mwen an ak kadav a zidòl abominab yo, e eritaj Mwen an ak abominasyon pa yo.”<verse eid="JER 16:18"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="JER 16:19"/>O SENYÈ, fòs mwen an, sitadèl mwen an</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 16:19">e <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">16:19 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="NAM 1:7">Na 1:7</ref></char></note>sekou mwen an nan jou gwo malè a,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 16:19">vè Ou menm, nasyon yo va vini soti nan dènye pwent latè.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 16:19">Yo va di:</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 16:19">“Papa zansèt nou yo pa t gen okenn eritaj sof ke manti</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 16:19">sa ki pouriyen, san enpòtans e san benefis.”<verse eid="JER 16:19"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="JER 16:20"/>Èske lòm dwe fè dye pou kont li,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 16:20">malgre <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">16:20 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="PSA 115:4-8">Sòm 115:4-8</ref></char></note>se pa dye yo ye?<verse eid="JER 16:20"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="JER 16:21"/>“Akoz sa, gade byen, Mwen va fè yo konnen,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 16:21">fwa sa a, Mwen va <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">16:21 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="PSA 9:16">Sòm 9:16</ref></char></note>fè yo konnen pouvwa M, ak pwisans Mwen.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 16:21">Konsa, yo va konnen ke non Mwen se SENYÈ a.”<verse eid="JER 16:21"/></para>
  <chapter eid="JER 16"/>
  <chapter number="17" style="c" sid="JER 17"/>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="JER 17:1"/>Peche a Juda ekri ak yon plim fèt an fè,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 17:1">ak yon pwent dyaman.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 17:1">Li <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">17:1 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="PRO 3:3">Pwov 3:3</ref></char></note>grave sou tablo kè yo,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 17:1">ak sou kòn lotèl pa yo.<verse eid="JER 17:1"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="JER 17:2"/>Menm jan yo sonje <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">17:2 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="JER 7:18">Jr 7:18</ref></char></note>pitit pa yo,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 17:2">se konsa yo sonje lotèl pa yo,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 17:2">ak Asherim sou kote bwa vèt, sou wo kolin yo.<verse eid="JER 17:2"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="JER 17:3"/>O <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">17:3 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="JER 26:18">Jr 26:18</ref></char></note>mòn nan vil andeyò Mwen an,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 17:3">Mwen va bay yo tout richès ou yo</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 17:3">ak tout trezò ou yo kon piyaj,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 17:3">wo plas ou yo pou peche, nan tout lizyè ou yo.<verse eid="JER 17:3"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="JER 17:4"/>Epi ou va menm pou kont ou, <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">17:4 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="JER 12:7">Jr 12:7</ref></char></note>kite eritaj ke M te ba ou la.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 17:4">Konsa, Mwen va fè ou sèvi lènmi ou yo</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 17:4">nan peyi ke ou pa konnen an;</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 17:4">paske ou te limen nan kòlè Mwen yon dife</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 17:4">ki va brile jis pou tout tan.<verse eid="JER 17:4"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="JER 17:5"/>Konsa pale SENYÈ a:</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 17:5">
    <note caller="+" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">17:5 </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="PSA 146:3">Sòm 146:3</ref>
      </char>
    </note>“Modi se moun ki mete konfyans nan lòm,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 17:5">ki fè lachè vin fòs li,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 17:5">ak kè a sila ki tounen lwen SENYÈ a.<verse eid="JER 17:5"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="JER 17:6"/>Paske li va tankou <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">17:6 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="JER 48:6">Jr 48:6</ref></char></note>bwa raje nan dezè;</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 17:6">li p ap janm wè lè bonè rive,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 17:6">men li va viv pami wòch savann nan dezè a,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 17:6">nan yon peyi sale, san moun ki rete ladann.<verse eid="JER 17:6"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="JER 17:7"/>“Beni se nonm ki konfye nan SENYÈ a,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 17:7">ak sila ki <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">17:7 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="PSA 40:4">Sòm 40:4</ref></char></note>mete konfyans li nan SENYÈ a.<verse eid="JER 17:7"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="JER 17:8"/>Paske li va tankou yon ab ki plante kote dlo,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 17:8">ki lonje rasin li akote yon sous dlo.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 17:8">Li p ap pè lè chalè a rive, men fèy li yo va vèt.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 17:8">Li p ap twouble nan ane <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">17:8 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="PSA 1:1">Sòm 1:1</ref></char></note>sechrès la,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 17:8">ni sispann bay fwi.<verse eid="JER 17:8"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="JER 17:9"/>Kè lòm plen <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">17:9 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ROM 7:11">Wo 7:11</ref></char></note> manti plis ke tout lòt yo.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 17:9">Nanpwen lasante ladann nan.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 17:9">Se kilès ki ka konprann li?<verse eid="JER 17:9"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="JER 17:10"/>“Mwen, SENYÈ a, Mwen sonde kè;</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 17:10">Mwen pase panse a leprèv,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 17:10">
    <note caller="+" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">17:10 </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="PSA 62:12">Sòm 62:12</ref>
      </char>
    </note>pou M ka menm bay a chak moun selon chemen pa li,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 17:10">selon fwi a zèv li yo.”<verse eid="JER 17:10"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="JER 17:11"/>Kon yon pentad ki kale ze ki pa t pou li,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 17:11">se konsa sila ki ranmase richès san dwa.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 17:11">Nan mitan jou li yo, yo va kite li,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 17:11">e lè vi l fini, li va yon <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">17:11 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="LUK 12:20">Luc 12:20</ref></char></note>moun bèt.<verse eid="JER 17:11"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="JER 17:12"/>
    <note caller="+" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">17:12 </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="JER 3:17">Jr 3:17</ref>
      </char>
    </note>Yon twòn plen ak laglwa plase an wo,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 17:12">depi kòmansman an, se li ki azil nou.<verse eid="JER 17:12"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="JER 17:13"/>O SENYÈ, espwa Israël la,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 17:13">tout moun ki abandone Ou yo, va vin wont.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 17:13">Sila yo ki kite Mwen sou latè yo,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 17:13">sou latè non yo va vin <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">17:13 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="LUK 10:20">Luc 10:20</ref></char></note>enskri,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 17:13">akoz yo te abandone SENYÈ a,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 17:13">sous dlo vivan an.<verse eid="JER 17:13"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="JER 17:14"/>
    <note caller="+" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">17:14 </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="JER 30:17">Jr 30:17</ref>
      </char>
    </note>Geri mwen, O SENYÈ e mwen va geri nèt!</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 17:14">Sove mwen e mwen va sove!</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 17:14">Paske se Ou menm ki lwanj mwen an.<verse eid="JER 17:14"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="JER 17:15"/>Gade, y ap <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">17:15 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ISA 5:19">És 5:19</ref></char></note>di mwen tout tan:</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 17:15">“Kote pawòl SENYÈ a?</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 17:15">Kite l ranpli koulye a”.<verse eid="JER 17:15"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="JER 17:16"/>Men pou mwen menm, mwen pa t kouri</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 17:16">pou m ta sispann fè bèje pou Ou,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 17:16">ni mwen pa t anvi wè jou malè sa a.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 17:16">
    <note caller="+" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">17:16 </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="JER 12:3">Jr 12:3</ref>
      </char>
    </note> Ou konnen!</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 17:16">Tout pawòl lèv mwen yo te nan prezans Ou.<verse eid="JER 17:16"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="JER 17:17"/>Pa <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">17:17 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="PSA 88:15">Sòm 88:15</ref></char></note> fè m gwo laperèz.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 17:17">Ou se azil mwen nan jou gwo twoub la.<verse eid="JER 17:17"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="JER 17:18"/>Ke sila ki pèsekite mwen yo vin wont,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 17:18">men pou mwen menm, pa kite mwen vin wont;</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 17:18">kite yo twouble nèt, men pa kite m vin twouble.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 17:18">
    <note caller="+" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">17:18 </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="PSA 35:8">Sòm 35:8</ref>
      </char>
    </note>Mennen sou yo yon jou gwo twoub.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 17:18">Detwi yo ak yon destriksyon ki doub!<verse eid="JER 17:18"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="JER 17:19"/>Konsa SENYÈ a te pale mwen: “Ale kanpe nan pòtay piblik la, kote wa Juda yo fè antre sòti a, nan tout pòtay Jérusalem yo. <verse eid="JER 17:19"/><verse number="20" style="v" sid="JER 17:20"/>Pale yo konsa: <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">17:20 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="EZR 2:7">Esd 2:7</ref></char></note> ‘Koute pawòl SENYÈ a, wa Juda yo, e tout Juda ak tout sila k ap viv Jérusalem yo, k ap fè antre sòti nan pòtay yo: <verse eid="JER 17:20"/><verse number="21" style="v" sid="JER 17:21"/>Konsa pale SENYÈ a: “Veye afè nou e <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">17:21 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="NUM 15:32-36">Nonb 15:32-36</ref></char></note>pa pote okenn chaj nan jou Saba a, ni pa mennen anyen antre nan pòtay Jérusalem nan. <verse eid="JER 17:21"/><verse number="22" style="v" sid="JER 17:22"/>Nou p ap fè okenn chaj sòti lakay nou nan jou Saba a. Ni pa <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">17:22 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="EXO 16:23-29">Egz 16:23-29</ref></char></note>fè okenn travay, men kenbe jou Saba a sen, jan Mwen te kòmande papa zansèt nou yo. <verse eid="JER 17:22"/><verse number="23" style="v" sid="JER 17:23"/>Men yo pa t koute, ni panche zòrèy yo, men yo te fè tèt di pou yo pa ta koute, ni vin korije. <verse eid="JER 17:23"/><verse number="24" style="v" sid="JER 17:24"/>Men li va vin rive ke si ou <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">17:24 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="EXO 15:26">Egz 15:26</ref></char></note>koute M byen pre,” deklare SENYÈ a, “pou pa fè chaj antre nan pòtay lavil sa a nan jou Saba a, men ou kenbe Saba a sen e pa fè travay sou li, <verse eid="JER 17:24"/><verse number="25" style="v" sid="JER 17:25"/><note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">17:25 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="JER 22:4">Jr 22:4</ref></char></note>alò, va genyen moun ki antre nan pòtay lavil sa a, wa ak prens ki chita sou twòn a David yo, monte sou cha yo ak sou cheval yo, yo menm ak prens pa yo, moun Juda ak sila ki rete Jérusalem yo e vil sa a va abite jis pou tout tan. <verse eid="JER 17:25"/><verse number="26" style="v" sid="JER 17:26"/>Yo va antre ladann soti nan <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">17:26 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="JER 32:44">Jr 32:44</ref></char></note>vil a Juda yo ak tout andwa ki antoure Jérusalem yo; soti nan peyi Benjamin, soti nan ba plèn nan, nan peyi kolin yo ak nan dezè a, k ap pote ofrann brile, sakrifis, ofrann sereyal, ak lansan e yo va mennen sakrifis a remèsiman lakay SENYÈ a. <verse eid="JER 17:26"/><verse number="27" style="v" sid="JER 17:27"/>Men <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">17:27 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ISA 1:20">És 1:20</ref></char></note>si nou pa koute Mwen e pa kenbe jou Saba a sen ak sispann pote chaj e antre nan pòtay Jérusalem nan jou Saba a; alò, Mwen va limen yon dife nan pòtay li yo. Konsa, li va devore palè Jérusalem yo, e li p ap etenn menm.”’”<verse eid="JER 17:27"/></para>
  <chapter eid="JER 17"/>
  <chapter number="18" style="c" sid="JER 18"/>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="JER 18:1"/>Pawòl ki te vini a Jérémie soti nan SENYÈ a ki te di: <verse eid="JER 18:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="JER 18:2"/>“Leve <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">18:2 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="JER 19:1-2">Jr 19:1-2</ref></char></note>desann lakay mèt krich la, e la Mwen va anonse pawòl Mwen yo a ou menm.”<verse eid="JER 18:2"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="JER 18:3"/>Konsa, mwen te desann lakay mèt krich la. E gade byen, li t ap fè yon bagay sou wou a. <verse eid="JER 18:3"/><verse number="4" style="v" sid="JER 18:4"/>Men veso ke li t ap fè ak ajil la te gate nan men mèt krich la. Pou sa, li te refòme l fè yon lòt veso jan sa te fè l plezi fè a.<verse eid="JER 18:4"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="JER 18:5"/>Pawòl SENYÈ a te vin kote mwen. Li te di: <verse eid="JER 18:5"/><verse number="6" style="v" sid="JER 18:6"/>Èske Mwen pa kabab, O lakay Israël, aji avèk ou menm jan mèt krich la konn fè a? deklare SENYÈ a. Gade byen, tankou <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">18:6 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ISA 45:9">És 45:9</ref></char></note>ajil la nan men mèt krich la a, se konsa ou ye nan men Mwen, O lakay Israël. <verse eid="JER 18:6"/><verse number="7" style="v" sid="JER 18:7"/>Nan yon moman, Mwen ka pale konsa konsènan yon nasyon, oswa konsènan yon wayòm pou <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">18:7 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="JER 1:10">Jr 1:10</ref></char></note>dechouke li, pou jete li atè, oswa pou detwi li. <verse eid="JER 18:7"/><verse number="8" style="v" sid="JER 18:8"/>Men si nasyon sa a ke Mwen te pale a, vin kite mechanste li a, Mwen va vin <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">18:8 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="PSA 106:45">Sòm 106:45</ref></char></note>repanti konsènan gwo twoub ke m te gen entansyon fè rive l la. <verse eid="JER 18:8"/><verse number="9" style="v" sid="JER 18:9"/>Oswa, nan yon lòt moman, Mwen ka pale konsènan yon nasyon, oswa konsènan yon wayòm pou <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">18:9 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="JER 1:10">Jr 1:10</ref></char></note>bati li, oswa pou etabli li. <verse eid="JER 18:9"/><verse number="10" style="v" sid="JER 18:10"/>Men si li fè mal nan zye M e pa obeyi vwa M, alò, Mwen va <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">18:10 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="1SA 2:30">I Sam 2:30</ref></char></note>repanti de byen nan ke M te fè pwomès fè yo.<verse eid="JER 18:10"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="JER 18:11"/>“Alò, pou sa, pale ak mesye Juda yo, ak moun ki rete Jérusalem yo. Di yo: ‘Konsa pale SENYÈ a: “Gade byen, Mwen ap prepare gwo malè kont nou, e Mwen ap fòme yon plan kont nou. <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">18:11 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="2KI 17:3">II Wa 17:3</ref></char></note>Vire fè bak, nou chak, soti nan wout mechan li, e korije de zak nou yo.”’ <verse eid="JER 18:11"/><verse number="12" style="v" sid="JER 18:12"/>Men yo va di: ‘Sa pa ka fèt! Paske nou ap swiv pwòp plan pa nou, e nou chak va aji selon pwòp panse a <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">18:12 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="DEU 29:19">Det 29:19</ref></char></note>kè di nou.’<verse eid="JER 18:12"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="JER 18:13"/>Akoz sa a, pale SENYÈ a:</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 18:13">“Mande, koulye a, pami nasyon yo;</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 18:13">se kilès ki konn tande yon koze konsa?</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 18:13">
    <note caller="+" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">18:13 </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="JER 14:7">Jr 14:7</ref>
      </char>
    </note>Vyèj Israël la te fè yon bagay pi lèd pase tout bagay.<verse eid="JER 18:13"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="JER 18:14"/>Èske lanèj Liban konn fè fayit</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 18:14">pou l pa kite wòch chan an a?</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 18:14">Oswa èske dlo frèt ki koule soti depi lwen</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 18:14">va vin sèch?<verse eid="JER 18:14"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="JER 18:15"/>Paske pèp Mwen an fin bliye Mwen.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 18:15">
    <note caller="+" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">18:15 </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="ISA 65:7">És 65:7</ref>
      </char>
    </note>Yo brile lansan bay dye ki san valè yo.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 18:15">Yo chape tonbe kite chemen yo,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 18:15">soti nan chemen ansyen yo, pou mache nan vye ti wout,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 18:15">men pa sou gran chemen an.<verse eid="JER 18:15"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="JER 18:16"/>Y ap fè peyi nou vin yon <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">18:16 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="JER 25:9">Jr 25:9</ref></char></note>dega,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 18:16">yon objè moun ap sifle.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 18:16">Tout sila ki pase ladann va etone pou sa</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 18:16">e va souke tèt yo.<verse eid="JER 18:16"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="JER 18:17"/>Tankou van lès, Mwen va <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">18:17 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="JOB 27:21">Job 27:21</ref></char></note>gaye yo nèt devan lènmi an,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 18:17">Nan jou kalamite yo, Mwen va ba yo do m.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 18:17">Yo p ap wè figi M.<verse eid="JER 18:17"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="JER 18:18"/>Konsa yo te di: “Vini! Annou <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">18:18 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="JER 11:19">Jr 11:19</ref></char></note>fè konplo kont Jérémie! Anverite, lalwa a p ap pral pèdi de prèt la, ni konsèy a saj yo, ni pawòl sen a pwofèt la! Vini, annou frape li ak kout lang, e pa okipe okenn nan pawòl li yo.”<verse eid="JER 18:18"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="JER 18:19"/>Koute mwen, SENYÈ e,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 18:19">koute sa ke lènmi m yo ap di!<verse eid="JER 18:19"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="JER 18:20"/>
    <note caller="+" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">18:20 </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="PSA 109:4">Sòm 109:4</ref>
      </char>
    </note>Èske se ak mal ke yon moun dwe rekonpanse pou sa ki bon?</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 18:20">Paske se yon fòs yo fin fouye pou mwen.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 18:20">Sonje kijan mwen te kanpe devan Ou,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 18:20">pou pale sa ki bon pou yo menm,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 18:20">pou m ta ka fè kòlè Ou vire kite yo.<verse eid="JER 18:20"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="JER 18:21"/>Pou sa, <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">18:21 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="PSA 109:9">Sòm 109:9</ref></char></note>livre pitit yo a gwo grangou</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 18:21">e livre yo anba pouvwa nepe a.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 18:21">Kite madanm pa yo rete san pitit e vèv.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 18:21">Kite mesye yo tou vin frape a lanmò;</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 18:21">e jennonm yo vin frape ak nepe nan batay la.<verse eid="JER 18:21"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="JER 18:22"/>Pou yon gwo kri ka tande soti lakay yo</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 18:22">
    <note caller="+" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">18:22 </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="JER 18:20">Jr 18:20</ref>
      </char>
    </note>lè sibitman, Ou mennen rive yon bann piyajè sou yo;</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 18:22">paske yo te fouye yon fòs pou pran mwen,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 18:22">e te kache pèlen pou pye m.<verse eid="JER 18:22"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="JER 18:23"/>Malgre sa, Ou menm, O SENYÈ, Ou konnen tout</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 18:23">manèv mòtèl yo kont mwen yo.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 18:23">
    <note caller="+" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">18:23 </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="NEH 4:5">Né 4:5</ref>
      </char>
    </note>Pa padone inikite pa yo, ni efase peche yo devan zye Ou.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 18:23">Men kite yo boulvèse nèt jis yo jete nèt devan Ou.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 18:23">Aji avèk yo nan lè kòlè Ou a!<verse eid="JER 18:23"/></para>
  <chapter eid="JER 18"/>
  <chapter number="19" style="c" sid="JER 19"/>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="JER 19:1"/>Konsa pale SENYÈ a: “Ale achte yon po kanari nan men mèt krich la. Pran kèk nan <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">19:1 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="NUM 11:16">Nonb 11:16</ref></char></note>ansyen a pèp yo, ak kèk nan prèt prensipal yo. <verse eid="JER 19:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="JER 19:2"/>Konsa, ale deyò nan <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">19:2 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="JOS 15:8">Jos 15:8</ref></char></note>vale Ben-Hinnom nan, ki akote antre pòtay kanari kraze a, e la pwoklame pawòl ke M pale ou yo. <verse eid="JER 19:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="JER 19:3"/>Di: ‘Tande pawòl SENYÈ a, O wa Juda yo ak moun ki rete Jérusalem yo: konsa pale SENYÈ dèzame yo, Bondye Israël la: “Gade byen, Mwen prèt pou mennen gwo malè sou plas sa a, k ap fè <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">19:3 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="1SA 3:11">I Sam 3:11</ref></char></note>zòrèy a tout moun ki tande yo vin toudi. <verse eid="JER 19:3"/><verse number="4" style="v" sid="JER 19:4"/>Akoz yo te abandone Mwen, yo te <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">19:4 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="EZK 7:22">Éz 7:22</ref></char></note>fè plas sa a vin pa pwòp, e yo te brile sakrifis nan li bay lòt dye, ke ni yo menm, ni papa zansèt yo, ni wa a Juda yo pa t janm konnen—epi akoz yo te plen plas sa a ak san a inosan yo, <verse eid="JER 19:4"/><verse number="5" style="v" sid="JER 19:5"/>akoz yo te bati <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">19:5 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="NUM 22:41">Nonb 22:41</ref></char></note>wo plas a Baal yo pou brile pwòp fis pa yo nan dife kon ofrann brile a Baal yo, yon bagay ke Mwen pa t janm kòmande, ni pale, ni li pa t janm antre nan tèt Mwen.’ <verse eid="JER 19:5"/><verse number="6" style="v" sid="JER 19:6"/>Akoz tout sa a, gade byen, jou yo ap vini,” deklare SENYÈ a: “pou plas sa a pa rele <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">19:6 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ISA 30:33">És 30:33</ref></char></note>‘Topheth’ ankò, oswa ‘Vale Ben-Hinnom’ nan; men pito, ‘Vale a Gwo Masak’ la.<verse eid="JER 19:6"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="JER 19:7"/>“‘“Mwen va <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">19:7 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="PSA 33:10-11">Sòm 33:10-11</ref></char></note>fè nil tout konsèy Juda ak Jérusalem nan plas sa a. Mwen va fè yo tonbe pa nepe devan lènmi yo, e pa men a sila k ap chache lavi yo. Konsa, Mwen va bay kadav yo pou manje a zwazo syèl yo, ak bèt sovaj latè yo. <verse eid="JER 19:7"/><verse number="8" style="v" sid="JER 19:8"/>Anplis, Mwen va fè vil sa a yon dega, yon objè degoutan k ap fè moun soufle anlè kon koulèv. <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">19:8 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="1KI 9:8">I Wa 9:8</ref></char></note>Tout moun ki pase akote li va vin etone, e sifle anlè akoz tout dezas li yo. <verse eid="JER 19:8"/><verse number="9" style="v" sid="JER 19:9"/>Mwen va fè yo <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">19:9 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="LEV 26:29">Lev 26:29</ref></char></note>manje chè pwòp fis pa yo ak fi pa yo. Yo va manje chè youn lòt nan syèj la, ak nan gwo twoub avèk sila lènmi pa yo, ak sila k ap chache lavi yo va twouble yo.”’<verse eid="JER 19:9"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="JER 19:10"/>“Nan moman sa a, ou gen pou kraze <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">19:10 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="JER 19:1">Jr 19:1</ref></char></note>kanari a devan zye a tout moun ki akonpanye ou. <verse eid="JER 19:10"/><verse number="11" style="v" sid="JER 19:11"/>Epi di yo: ‘Konsa pale SENYÈ dèzame yo: “Se konsa Mwen va <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">19:11 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="PSA 2:9">Sòm 2:9</ref></char></note>kraze pèp sa a ak vil sa a, jis jan ke yon moun kraze yon po kanari, pou l pa ka repare ankò. Yo va antere Topheth, jis lè pa gen plas pou antere ankò. <verse eid="JER 19:11"/><verse number="12" style="v" sid="JER 19:12"/>Se konsa, mwen va trete plas sa a ak moun ki rete ladann yo,” deklare SENYÈ a, “pou fè vil sa a tankou Topheth. <verse eid="JER 19:12"/><verse number="13" style="v" sid="JER 19:13"/>Lakay Juda ak lakay a wa Juda yo va vin souye kon <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">19:13 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="2KI 23:10">II Wa 23:10</ref></char></note>Topheth, akoz anwo twati a tout kay yo te brile sakrifis a tout lame syèl yo, e te vide bwason kon ofrann a lòt dye yo.”’”<verse eid="JER 19:13"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="JER 19:14"/>Konsa, Jérémie te sòti Topheth, kote SENYÈ a te voye l pwofetize a. Li te kanpe nan <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">19:14 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="2CH 20:5">II Kwo 20:5</ref></char></note>lakou lakay SENYÈ a e te di a tout pèp la: <verse eid="JER 19:14"/><verse number="15" style="v" sid="JER 19:15"/>“Konsa pale SENYÈ dèzame yo, Bondye Israël la: ‘Gade byen, Mwen prèt pou mennen sou vil sila a ak tout bouk li yo tout gwo twoub ke M te deklare kont li yo, akoz yo te fè tèt yo di <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">19:15 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="PSA 58:4">Sòm 58:4</ref></char></note>pou pa koute pawòl Mwen yo.’”<verse eid="JER 19:15"/></para>
  <chapter eid="JER 19"/>
  <chapter number="20" style="c" sid="JER 20"/>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="JER 20:1"/>Lè Paschhur, prèt la, fis a Immer a, ki te <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">20:1 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="2KI 25:18">II Wa 25:18</ref></char></note>chèf ofisye lakay SENYÈ a, te tande Jérémie fè pwofesi sila yo, <verse eid="JER 20:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="JER 20:2"/>Paschhur te fè yo <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">20:2 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="1KI 22:27">I Wa 22:27</ref></char></note>bat Jérémie, pwofèt la. Li te mete li nan sèp yo ki te kote Pòtay Anwo Benjamin an, ki te nan lakay SENYÈ a. <verse eid="JER 20:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="JER 20:3"/>Nan pwochen jou a, lè Paschhur te lage Jérémie sòti nan sèp yo, Jérémie te di li: “Paschhur se pa non ke SENYÈ a te <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">20:3 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ISA 8:3">És 8:3</ref></char></note>bay ou, men pito Magor-Missabib. <verse eid="JER 20:3"/><verse number="4" style="v" sid="JER 20:4"/>Paske konsa pale SENYÈ a: ‘Gade byen, Mwen va fè ou vin yon gwo laperèz pou pwòp tèt ou, ak tout zanmi ou yo. Pandan zye ou toujou ap gade, yo va tonbe pa nepe lènmi pa yo. Se konsa, mwen va <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">20:4 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="JER 21:4-10">Jr 21:4-10</ref></char></note>livre tout Juda, pou tonbe nan men a wa Babylone nan. Li va pote yo ale tankou egzile Babylone e li va touye yo ak nepe. <verse eid="JER 20:4"/><verse number="5" style="v" sid="JER 20:5"/>Anplis, Mwen va livre tout richès vil sa a, tout pwodwi li yo ak tout bagay koute chè li yo, menm tout trezò a wa a Juda yo, e mwen va livre yo nan <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">20:5 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="2KI 20:17-18">II Wa 20:17-18</ref></char></note>men a lènmi yo. Yo va piyaje yo, pote yo ale, e pote yo Babylone. <verse eid="JER 20:5"/><verse number="6" style="v" sid="JER 20:6"/>Konsa, ou menm, Paschhur, ou menm ak tout sila ki rete lakay ou yo, va ale an kaptivite. Ou va antre nan Babylone. Ou va mouri la, e la, ou va antere; ou menm avèk tout <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">20:6 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="JER 20:4">Jr 20:4</ref></char></note>zanmi ou yo ki te bay fo pwofesi yo.’”<verse eid="JER 20:6"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="JER 20:7"/>O SENYÈ, Ou te mennen m e mwen te mennen;</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 20:7">Ou pi fò pase m, e Ou te genyen m.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 20:7">Mwen te vin yon <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">20:7 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="JOB 12:4">Job 12:4</ref></char></note>gwo blag tout lajounen;</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 20:7">se tout moun k ap moke mwen.<verse eid="JER 20:7"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="JER 20:8"/>Paske chak fwa ke m pale, mwen kriye fò;</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 20:8">mwen pwoklame vyolans ak destriksyon!</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 20:8">Konsa, <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">20:8 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="2CH 36:16">II Kwo 36:16</ref></char></note>pawòl SENYÈ a te fè m resevwa repwòch.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 20:8">Mwen pase nan rizib tout lajounen.<verse eid="JER 20:8"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="JER 20:9"/>Si mwen di: “Mwen p ap sonje Li ankò,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 20:9">ni pale ankò nan non Li”,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 20:9">alò, anndan kè mwen vin <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">20:9 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="EZK 3:14">Éz 3:14</ref></char></note>kon yon</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 20:9">dife k ap brile ki fèmen nan zo m.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 20:9">Mwen bouke kenbe l anndan m,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 20:9">mwen pa kapab.<verse eid="JER 20:9"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="JER 20:10"/>Paske mwen tande detripe nan zòrèy anpil moun:</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 20:10">“Danje, danje toupatou! Denonse! Wi, annou denonse li!”</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 20:10">Tout zanmi m ke m kon fè konfyans yo,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 20:10">k ap tann pou yo wè lè mwen tonbe, ap di:</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 20:10">“Petèt nou ka mennen l,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 20:10">pou nou ka vin enpoze nou sou li</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 20:10">e konsa, nou va pran vanjans sou li.”<verse eid="JER 20:10"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="JER 20:11"/>Men <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">20:11 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="JER 1:8">Jr 1:8</ref></char></note>SENYÈ a avè m kon yon ewo fewòs.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 20:11">Akoz sa, pèsekitè mwen yo va tonbe vin fè bak.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 20:11">Yo p ap reyisi.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 20:11">Yo va wont nèt akoz yo fè fayit,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 20:11">ak yon wont ki p ap janm pase, ki p ap janm bliye.<verse eid="JER 20:11"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="JER 20:12"/>Sepandan, O SENYÈ dèzame yo,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 20:12">Ou menm ki <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">20:12 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="PSA 7:9">Sòm 7:9</ref></char></note>sonde moun dwat yo,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 20:12">ki wè panse ak kè a;</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 20:12">kite mwen wè vanjans Ou sou yo;</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 20:12">paske a Ou menm, mwen te konfye ka m nan.<verse eid="JER 20:12"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="JER 20:13"/>Chante a SENYÈ a, louwe SENYÈ a!</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 20:13">Paske Li te <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">20:13 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="PSA 34:6">Sòm 34:6</ref></char></note>delivre nanm a malere a</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 20:13">soti nan men a malfektè yo.<verse eid="JER 20:13"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="JER 20:14"/>Kite <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">20:14 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="JOB 3:3-6">Job 3:3-6</ref></char></note>jou ke mwen te fèt la modi;</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 20:14">kite jou ke manman m te akouche m nan vin pa beni!<verse eid="JER 20:14"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="JER 20:15"/>Kite nonm ki te mennen nouvèl kote papa m nan,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 20:15">ki te di: “Yon <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">20:15 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="GEN 21:6-7">Jen 21:6-7</ref></char></note>tigason te fèt a ou menm,”</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 20:15">e ki te fè l byen kontan an, vin modi.<verse eid="JER 20:15"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="JER 20:16"/>Men kite nonm sa a vin kon gwo vil ke</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 20:16">SENYÈ a te <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">20:16 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="GEN 19:25">Jen 19:25</ref></char></note>kraze nèt san pitye.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 20:16">Kite li tande gwo kri nan granmmaten</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 20:16">ak kri “Anmwey” a midi,<verse eid="JER 20:16"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="JER 20:17"/>akoz li pa t <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">20:17 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="JOB 3:10-16">Job 3:10-16</ref></char></note>touye m avan mwen te fèt,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 20:17">pou manman m ta ka sèvi kon tonbo a</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 20:17">pou vant li rete ansent pou tout tan.<verse eid="JER 20:17"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="JER 20:18"/>Poukisa mwen te janm sòti nan vant,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 20:18">pou m ta <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">20:18 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="JOB 3:20">Job 3:20</ref></char></note>gade twoub ak tristès,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 20:18">pou jou m yo ta pase nan wont?<verse eid="JER 20:18"/></para>
  <chapter eid="JER 20"/>
  <chapter number="21" style="c" sid="JER 21"/>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="JER 21:1"/>Pawòl ki te vini kote Jérémie soti nan SENYÈ a, lè <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">21:1 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="2KI 24:17-18">II Wa 24:17-18</ref></char></note>Wa Sédécias te voye Paschhur, fis a Malkija a, ak Sophonie, fis a Maaséja a, prèt la, pou di l: <verse eid="JER 21:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="JER 21:2"/>Souple, mande a SENYÈ a pou nou menm, paske <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">21:2 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="2KI 25:1">II Wa 25:1</ref></char></note>Nebucadnetsar, wa Babylone nan ap fè lagè kont nou. Petèt SENYÈ a va aji avèk nou selon zèv mèvèy Li yo, pou lènmi an rete kò l sou nou.<verse eid="JER 21:2"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="JER 21:3"/>Alò, Jérémie te di yo: “Nou va di Sédécias konsa: <verse eid="JER 21:3"/><verse number="4" style="v" sid="JER 21:4"/>‘Konsa pale SENYÈ Bondye Israël la: “Gade byen, Mwen prèt pou <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">21:4 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="JER 32:5">Jr 32:5</ref></char></note>vire zam lagè ki nan men nou yo, zam ak sila n ap batay kont wa Babylone nan, ak Kaldeyen k ap fè syèj nou deyò miray la. Konsa, Mwen va rasanble yo nan mitan vil sa a. <verse eid="JER 21:4"/><verse number="5" style="v" sid="JER 21:5"/>Mwen menm, <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">21:5 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ISA 63:10">És 63:10</ref></char></note>Mwen va fè lagè kont nou ak yon men lonje, ak yon bra pwisan, menm ak kòlè, gwo kòlè, ak gwo endiyasyon. <verse eid="JER 21:5"/><verse number="6" style="v" sid="JER 21:6"/>Anplis, Mwen va frape tout sa ki rete nan vil sa a, ni lòm, ni bèt. Yo va mouri akoz yon gwo <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">21:6 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="JER 14:12">Jr 14:12</ref></char></note>epidemi. <verse eid="JER 21:6"/><verse number="7" style="v" sid="JER 21:7"/>Lè l fini”, deklare SENYÈ a: <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">21:7 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="2KI 25:5-21">II Wa 25:5-21</ref></char></note>“Mwen va livre Sédécias, wa Juda a ak sèvitè li yo ak pèp la, sila yo ki chape nan vil sa a de epidemi, nepe, ak gwo grangou, pou fè yo antre nan men a wa Nebucadnetsar, wa Babylone nan, nan men a lènmi pa yo ak nan men a sila k ap chache lavi yo. Epi li va frape yo ak kout nepe. Li p ap lese yo, ni gen okenn pitye, ni konpasyon pou yo.”’<verse eid="JER 21:7"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="JER 21:8"/>“Anplis, Ou va di a pèp sa a: ‘Konsa pale SENYÈ a: “Gade byen, Mwen <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">21:8 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="DEU 30:15-19">Det 30:15-19</ref></char></note>mete devan nou chemen lavi ak chemen lanmò. <verse eid="JER 21:8"/><verse number="9" style="v" sid="JER 21:9"/>Sila ki <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">21:9 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="JER 38:2-23">Jr 38:2-23</ref></char></note>rete nan vil sa a va mouri pa nepe ak gwo grangou, ak epidemi, men sila ki soti e desann kote Kaldeyen k ap fè syèj kont nou yo, va sove lavi li. Li va chape ak lavi li. <verse eid="JER 21:9"/><verse number="10" style="v" sid="JER 21:10"/>Paske Mwen te <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">21:10 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="LEV 17:10">Lev 17:10</ref></char></note>ranje figi M kont vil sa a pou mal, e pa pou byen,” deklare SENYÈ a. “Li va livre nan men a wa Babylone nan e li va brile li ak dife.”’<verse eid="JER 21:10"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="JER 21:11"/>“Konsa, di a lakay <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">21:11 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="JER 17:20">Jr 17:20</ref></char></note>wa Juda a: ‘Tande pawòl SENYÈ a. <verse eid="JER 21:11"/><verse number="12" style="v" sid="JER 21:12"/>O lakay David, konsa pale SENYÈ a:</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 21:12">‘Aji ak jistis chak maten.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 21:12">Delivre moun ki te vòlè devan pouvwa a sila ki te oprime l la,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 21:12">pou gwo kòlè Mwen pa sòti deyò kon dife</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 21:12">e brile yon jan pou okenn pa ka etenn,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 21:12">akoz mechanste a zak yo.<verse eid="JER 21:12"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="JER 21:13"/>Gade byen, Mwen kontra ou,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 21:13">O <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">21:13 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="PSA 125:2">Sòm 125:2</ref></char></note>sila ki rete nan ba plèn nan,’ deklare SENYÈ a.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 21:13">‘Nou menm k ap di: “Se kilès k ap desann kont nou?”</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 21:13">Oswa, “Se kilès k ap antre nan abitasyon nou yo?”<verse eid="JER 21:13"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="JER 21:14"/>Mwen va pini nou <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">21:14 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ISA 3:10-11">És 3:10-11</ref></char></note>selon rezilta zak nou yo, deklare SENYÈ a:</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 21:14">“Epi Mwen va limen yon dife nan forè li</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 21:14">ki va devore tout ozanviwon li.’”<verse eid="JER 21:14"/></para>
  <chapter eid="JER 21"/>
  <chapter number="22" style="c" sid="JER 22"/>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="JER 22:1"/>Konsa pale SENYÈ a: “Ale desann kote kay wa Juda a, e pale pawòl sa a: <verse eid="JER 22:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="JER 22:2"/>Di l konsa: ‘Koute pawòl SENYÈ a, O wa Juda, ki <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">22:2 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ISA 9:7">És 9:7</ref></char></note>chita sou twòn David la, ou menm, sèvitè ou yo ak pèp ou a ki antre nan pòtay sila yo. <verse eid="JER 22:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="JER 22:3"/>Konsa pale SENYÈ a: <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">22:3 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ISA 58:6-7">És 58:6-7</ref></char></note>“Fè jistis ak ladwati e delivre sila ki te vòlè devan pouvwa sila ki te oprime l la. Anplis pa maltrete ni fè vyolans a yon etranje, òfelen an ak vèv la. Ni pa vèse san inosan nan plas sa a. <verse eid="JER 22:3"/><verse number="4" style="v" sid="JER 22:4"/>Paske si nou menm mesye yo va, anverite, fè bagay sa a, alò, <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">22:4 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="JER 17:25">Jr 17:25</ref></char></note>wa yo va antre nan pòtay kay sa a, e va chita nan plas David sou twòn li an. Yo va monte sou cha yo ak sou cheval yo—yo menm, sèvitè yo ak pèp li a. <verse eid="JER 22:4"/><verse number="5" style="v" sid="JER 22:5"/>Men si nou pa obeyi pawòl sa yo, Mwen <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">22:5 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="GEN 22:16">Jen 22:16</ref></char></note>sèmante pa Mwen menm,” deklare SENYÈ a: “ke kay sila a va vin dezole.”’”<verse eid="JER 22:5"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="JER 22:6"/>Paske konsa pale SENYÈ a konsènan kay wa a Juda a:</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 22:6">“Ou tankou Galaad pou Mwen,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 22:6">tankou tèt mòn Liban an.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 22:6">Malgre, anverite Mwen va fè nou kon yon <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">22:6 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="PSA 107:34">Sòm 107:34</ref></char></note>dezè,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 22:6">kon vil ki abandone.<verse eid="JER 22:6"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="JER 22:7"/>Paske Mwen va mete <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">22:7 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ISA 10:3-6">És 10:3-6</ref></char></note>destriktè apa pou ou,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 22:7">yo chak ak zam yo.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 22:7">Epi yo va koupe mete atè bwa sèd</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 22:7">pi chwazi ou yo e jete yo nan dife.<verse eid="JER 22:7"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="JER 22:8"/>“Anpil nasyon va pase kote vil sa a. Konsa, yo va <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">22:8 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="DEU 29:24-26">Det 29:24-26</ref></char></note>di youn lòt: ‘Poukisa SENYÈ a te fè bagay sa a gwo vil sa a?’ <verse eid="JER 22:8"/><verse number="9" style="v" sid="JER 22:9"/>Epi yo va reponn: ‘Akoz yo te <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">22:9 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="2KI 22:17">II Wa 22:17</ref></char></note>abandone akò SENYÈ a, Bondye yo a, e te pwostène yo a lòt dye yo e te sèvi yo.’”<verse eid="JER 22:9"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="JER 22:10"/>
    <note caller="+" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">22:10 </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="ECC 4:2">Ekl 4:2</ref>
      </char>
    </note>Pa kriye pou mò yo.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 22:10">Pa fè dèy pou li,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 22:10">men kriye san rete pou sila ki sòti a;</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 22:10">paske li p ap janm retounen,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 22:10">ni li p ap wè peyi l ankò.<verse eid="JER 22:10"/></para>
  <para style="m">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="JER 22:11"/>Paske se konsa SENYÈ a pale a <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">22:11 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="2KI 23:30-34">II Wa 23:30-34</ref></char></note>Schallum, fis a Josias, wa Juda a, ki te vin wa nan plas Josias, papa li, ki te ale kite plas sa a: “Li p ap janm retounen la, <verse eid="JER 22:11"/><verse number="12" style="v" sid="JER 22:12"/>men nan plas kote li te mennen an kaptivite a, se la li va <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">22:12 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="2KI 23:34">II Wa 23:34</ref></char></note>mouri e li p ap wè peyi sila ankò.”<verse eid="JER 22:12"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="JER 22:13"/>“Malè a sila ki bati kay li <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">22:13 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="JER 17:11">Jr 17:11</ref></char></note>san ladwati,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 22:13">chanm anlè yo san jistis,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 22:13">ki itilize sèvis vwazen li san peye</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 22:13">e ki pa bay li salè li,<verse eid="JER 22:13"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="JER 22:14"/>Ki di: “Mwen va <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">22:14 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ISA 5:8">És 5:8</ref></char></note>bati pou mwen menm</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 22:14">yon kay ak anpil espas,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 22:14">ak gwo chanm anlè.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 22:14">Mwen va koupe fenèt li yo,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 22:14">ba li panno bwa sèd</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 22:14">e pentire l an koulè wouj.’<verse eid="JER 22:14"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="JER 22:15"/>“Èske ou dwe wa akoz ou pi fò nan afè bwa sèd?</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 22:15">Èske papa ou pa t manje, bwè</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 22:15">e <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">22:15 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="2KI 23:25">II Wa 23:25</ref></char></note>fè jistis ak sa ki dwat?</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 22:15">Epi sa te ale byen pou li.<verse eid="JER 22:15"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="JER 22:16"/>Li te plede koz a malere ak aflije yo,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 22:16">epi sa te ale byen.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 22:16">
    <note caller="+" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">22:16 </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="1CH 28:9">I Kwo 28:9</ref>
      </char>
    </note>Èske se pa sa ki vle di ou rekonèt Mwen an?” deklare SENYÈ a.<verse eid="JER 22:16"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="JER 22:17"/>“Men zye ou ak kè ou rete sèlman</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 22:17">sou richès ki ranmase nan zak malonèt,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 22:17">nan vèse san inosan,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 22:17">nan opresyon ak vyolans.”<verse eid="JER 22:17"/></para>
  <para style="m">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="JER 22:18"/>Pou sa, konsa SENYÈ a pale konsènan Jojakim, fis a Josias, wa Juda a: “Yo p ap fè dèy pou li.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 22:18">Ni rele ‘Anmwey, frè m!’ ni ‘Anmwey sè m!’</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 22:18">“Yo p ap fè gwo kri pou li.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 22:18">Ni ‘Anmwey, mèt mwen!’</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 22:18">Ni ‘Anmwey, pou grand pwisans li!’<verse eid="JER 22:18"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="JER 22:19"/>Li va <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">22:19 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="1KI 21:23">I Wa 21:23</ref></char></note>antere ak antèman bourik,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 22:19">trennen e jete deyò pòtay Jérusalem yo.”<verse eid="JER 22:19"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="JER 22:20"/>“Ale monte kote Liban.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 22:20">Kriye fò e leve vwa ou nan Basan.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 22:20">Kriye anplis depi <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">22:20 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="NUM 27:12">Nonb 27:12</ref></char></note>Abarim,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 22:20">paske tout moun ki renmen ou yo vin kraze nèt.<verse eid="JER 22:20"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="JER 22:21"/>Mwen te pale ak ou nan pwosperite,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 22:21">men <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">22:21 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="JER 13:10">Jr 13:10</ref></char></note>ou te di: ‘Mwen p ap koute’!</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 22:21">Konsa abitid ou depi nan jenès ou,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 22:21">ke ou te refize obeyi lavwa M.<verse eid="JER 22:21"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="JER 22:22"/>Van an va bale fè disparèt tout bèje ou yo,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 22:22">ak moun ki renmen ou yo,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 22:22">y ap wale an kaptivite.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 22:22">Konsa, ou va anverite <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">22:22 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ISA 65:13">És 65:13</ref></char></note>wont e imilye</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 22:22">akoz tout mechanste ou yo.<verse eid="JER 22:22"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="JER 22:23"/>Nou menm k ap viv Liban,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 22:23">ki fè nich ak bwa sèd yo,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 22:23">nou va plenyen nan gòj lè gran doulè a rive sou ou;</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 22:23">
    <note caller="+" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">22:23 </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="JER 4:31">Jr 4:31</ref>
      </char>
    </note>doulè tankou yon fanm k ap akouche a!<verse eid="JER 22:23"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="JER 22:24"/>“Kon Mwen viv la”, deklare SENYÈ a: “Menmsi <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">22:24 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="2KI 24:6">II Wa 24:6</ref></char></note>Jeconia, fis a Jojakim nan, te yon bag so nan men dwat Mwen; malgre sa, Mwen ta rale retire ou. <verse eid="JER 22:24"/><verse number="25" style="v" sid="JER 22:25"/>Epi mwen ta <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">22:25 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="2KI 24:15-16">II Wa 24:15-16</ref></char></note>lese ou tonbe nan men a sila k ap chache lavi ou yo; wi, nan men a sila ke ou krent anpil yo, menm nan men Nebucadnetsar, wa a Babylone nan, e nan men a Kaldeyen yo. <verse eid="JER 22:25"/><verse number="26" style="v" sid="JER 22:26"/>Mwen va jete ou ak <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">22:26 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="2KI 24:8">II Wa 24:8</ref></char></note>manman ou ki te fè ou a jis nan yon lòt peyi kote ou pa t fèt, e la ou va mouri. <verse eid="JER 22:26"/><verse number="27" style="v" sid="JER 22:27"/>Men pou peyi kote yo ta vle retounen an, yo p ap retounen la.”<verse eid="JER 22:27"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="JER 22:28"/>Èske nonm sa a, Jenocia se yon po meprize, kraze nèt?</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 22:28">Oswa èske li se yon veso lèd, san valè?</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 22:28">Poukisa li menm ak desandan li yo te <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">22:28 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="JER 15:1">Jr 15:1</ref></char></note>jete deyò konsa</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 22:28">e depoze nan yon peyi ke yo pa t konnen?<verse eid="JER 22:28"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="JER 22:29"/>O latè, latè, latè,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 22:29">
    <note caller="+" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">22:29 </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="DEU 4:26">Det 4:26</ref>
      </char>
    </note>tande pawòl SENYÈ a!<verse eid="JER 22:29"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="30" style="v" sid="JER 22:30"/>Konsa pale SENYÈ a:</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 22:30">“Mete nonm sa a nan lis kon <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">22:30 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="1CH 3:17">I Kwo 3:17</ref></char></note>‘san pitit’,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 22:30">yon nonm ki p ap reyisi nan jou li yo.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 22:30">Paske nanpwen moun nan desandan li yo ki va reyisi,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 22:30">ni k ap chita sou twòn David la,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 22:30">ni gouvène ankò nan Juda.”<verse eid="JER 22:30"/></para>
  <chapter eid="JER 22"/>
  <chapter number="23" style="c" sid="JER 23"/>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="JER 23:1"/>“Malè a bèje k ap <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">23:1 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ISA 56:9-12">És 56:9-12</ref></char></note>detwi e gaye mouton patiraj Mwen yo!” deklare SENYÈ a. <verse eid="JER 23:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="JER 23:2"/>Akoz sa, pale SENYÈ Bondye Israël la konsènan bèje k ap fè gadyen pèp Mwen yo: “Nou fin gaye bann mouton Mwen, chase yo ale, e nou pa t okipe yo. Gade byen, Mwen prèt pou <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">23:2 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="EXO 32:34">Egz 32:34</ref></char></note>regle nou pou mechanste a zak nou yo,” deklare SENYÈ a. <verse eid="JER 23:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="JER 23:3"/>“Epi konsa, Mwen va <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">23:3 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ISA 11:11-16">És 11:11-16</ref></char></note>rasanble retay bann mouton Mwen an soti nan tout peyi ke m te pouse yo ale yo, e mennen yo retounen nan pa yo. Yo va vin bay fwi e peple anpil. <verse eid="JER 23:3"/><verse number="4" style="v" sid="JER 23:4"/>Anplis, Mwen va leve bèje sou yo e yo va okipe yo. Konsa, yo <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">23:4 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="JER 30:10">Jr 30:10</ref></char></note>p ap pè ankò, ni plen ak laperèz ni okenn moun p ap manke,” deklare SENYÈ a.<verse eid="JER 23:4"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="JER 23:5"/>“Gade byen, jou yo ap vini”, deklare SENYÈ a:</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 23:5">“lè Mwen va fè leve pou lakay David,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 23:5">yon <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">23:5 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ISA 4:2">És 4:2</ref></char></note>branch plen ladwati.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 23:5">Li va renye kon wa, aji ak sajès e fè jistis ak ladwati nan peyi a.<verse eid="JER 23:5"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="JER 23:6"/>Nan jou Li yo, Juda va sove,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 23:6">e Israël va rete ansekirite.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 23:6">Men <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">23:6 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ISA 7:14">És 7:14</ref></char></note>non pa sila yo va rele Li a:</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 23:6">‘SENYÈ a, Ladwati Nou an.’”<verse eid="JER 23:6"/></para>
  <para style="m">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="JER 23:7"/>
    <note caller="+" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">23:7 </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="ISA 43:18-19">És 43:18-19</ref>
      </char>
    </note>“Akoz sa, gade byen, jou yo ap vini”, deklare SENYÈ a: “lè yo p ap di ankò: ‘Kon SENYÈ a viv ki te mennen fè monte fis Israël yo soti nan peyi Égypte;’ <verse eid="JER 23:7"/><verse number="8" style="v" sid="JER 23:8"/>men: ‘Kon SENYÈ a viv, ki te <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">23:8 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ISA 43:5-6">És 43:5-6</ref></char></note>mennen e fè retounen desandan lakay Israël yo soti nan peyi nò a e soti nan tout peyi kote mwen te chase yo ale yo.’ Konsa, yo va viv sou pwòp tèren pa yo.”<verse eid="JER 23:8"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="JER 23:9"/>Epi pou pwofèt yo:</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 23:9">
    <note caller="+" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">23:9 </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="JER 8:18">Jr 8:18</ref>
      </char>
    </note>kè m fin kase anndan m.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 23:9">Tout zo m yo tranble;</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 23:9">Mwen vin kon yon moun sou,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 23:9">menm yon moun ki soumèt anba gwòg,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 23:9">akoz SENYÈ a,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 23:9">e akoz pawòl sen Li yo.<verse eid="JER 23:9"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="JER 23:10"/>“Paske peyi a plen ak <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">23:10 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="PSA 107:34">Sòm 107:34</ref></char></note>adiltè;</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 23:10">paske akoz madichon, peyi a ap kriye.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 23:10">Patiraj nan savann yo fin seche.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 23:10">Y ap kouri nan move chemen</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 23:10">e pwisans yo pa pou sa ki dwat.<verse eid="JER 23:10"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="JER 23:11"/>
    <note caller="+" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">23:11 </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="JER 6:13">Jr 6:13</ref>
      </char>
    </note>Ni pwofèt ni prèt yo vin pouri nèt.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 23:11">Menm anndan lakay Mwen an,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 23:11">Mwen jwenn mechanste yo”,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 23:11">deklare SENYÈ a.<verse eid="JER 23:11"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="JER 23:12"/>Akoz sa, chemen pa yo va yon wout ki glise nan tenèb la;</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 23:12">yo va vin chase jis rive nan fènwa</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 23:12">e vin glise tonbe ladann;</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 23:12">paske Mwen va mennen gwo kalamite sou yo</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 23:12">nan ane règleman yo,” deklare SENYÈ a.<verse eid="JER 23:12"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="JER 23:13"/>“Anplis, pami pwofèt Samarie yo,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 23:13">Mwen te wè yon betiz.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 23:13">Yo te <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">23:13 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="1KI 18:18-21">I Wa 18:18-21</ref></char></note>pwofetize pa Baal</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 23:13">e yo te egare pèp Mwen an, Israël.<verse eid="JER 23:13"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="JER 23:14"/>Osi, pami pwofèt Jérusalem yo, Mwen te wè yon move bagay:</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 23:14">Zak <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">23:14 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="JER 29:23">Jr 29:23</ref></char></note>adiltè, e yo mache nan sa ki fo.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 23:14">Yo ranfòse men a malfektè yo,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 23:14">pou okenn moun pa vire kite mechanste li.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 23:14">Yo tout vin pou Mwen tankou Sodome</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 23:14">e abitan li yo kon Gomorrhe.<verse eid="JER 23:14"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="JER 23:15"/>Akoz sa, pale SENYÈ dèzame yo konsènan pwofèt yo:</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 23:15">“Gade byen, Mwen ap bay yo <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">23:15 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="DEU 29:18">Det 29:18</ref></char></note>manje bwa lanmè</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 23:15">e fè yo bwè dlo anpwazone;</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 23:15">paske soti nan pwofèt Jérusalem yo,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 23:15">tout kalite pouriti gaye nan tout peyi a.”<verse eid="JER 23:15"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="JER 23:16"/>Konsa pale SENYÈ dèzame yo:</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 23:16">“Pa koute pawòl a pwofèt k ap fè pwofesi devan nou yo.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 23:16">Y ap <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">23:16 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="JER 27:9-10">Jr 27:9-10</ref></char></note>mennen nou nan bagay ki pou ryen.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 23:16">Yo pale yon vizyon ki sòti nan pwòp imajinasyon pa yo,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 23:16">men pa nan bouch SENYÈ a.<verse eid="JER 23:16"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="JER 23:17"/>Yo kontinye di a sila k ap meprize Mwen yo,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 23:17">‘SENYÈ a te di: <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">23:17 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="JER 8:11">Jr 8:11</ref></char></note>“Nou va gen lapè”’”</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 23:17">e pou tout sila k ap mache nan pwòp tèt di yo, yo di:</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 23:17">“Malè p ap rive nou.”<verse eid="JER 23:17"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="JER 23:18"/>Men se kilès ki te kanpe nan konsèy a SENYÈ a,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 23:18">pou l ta wè e tande pawòl li?</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 23:18">Kilès ki te <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">23:18 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="JOB 33:31">Job 33:31</ref></char></note>prete atansyon a pawòl Mwen, e te koute l?<verse eid="JER 23:18"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="JER 23:19"/>Gade byen, <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">23:19 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="JER 25:32">Jr 25:32</ref></char></note>tanpèt SENYÈ a deja sòti ak gwo kòlè li.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 23:19">Tankou yon toubiyon k ap vire touwon,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 23:19">li va vire desann sou tèt a mechan an.<verse eid="JER 23:19"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="JER 23:20"/>
    <note caller="+" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">23:20 </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="2KI 23:26">II Wa 23:26</ref>
      </char>
    </note>Kòlè SENYÈ a p ap vire fè bak</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 23:20">jiskaske Li fin fèt</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 23:20">pou l acheve tout volonte a kè li yo.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 23:20">Nan dènye jou yo, nou va konprann sa byen klè.<verse eid="JER 23:20"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="JER 23:21"/>Mwen pa t voye <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">23:21 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="JER 14:14">Jr 14:14</ref></char></note>pwofèt sila yo, men yo te kouri.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 23:21">Mwen pa t pale ak yo, men yo te fè pwofesi.<verse eid="JER 23:21"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="JER 23:22"/>Men si yo te konn <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">23:22 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="JER 9:12">Jr 9:12</ref></char></note>kanpe nan konsèy Mwen an;</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 23:22">alò, yo t ap anonse pawòl Mwen yo a pèp Mwen an</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 23:22">pou fè yo vire fè bak kite wout mechan yo,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 23:22">ak mechanste a zak pa yo.<verse eid="JER 23:22"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="JER 23:23"/>“Èske Mwen se pa yon Bondye ki <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">23:23 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="PSA 139:1-10">Sòm 139:1-10</ref></char></note>toupre?” deklare SENYÈ a:</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 23:23">“E ki pa yon Bondye ki lwen?<verse eid="JER 23:23"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="JER 23:24"/>Èske yon nonm ka kache kò l yon kote kachèt</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 23:24">pou M pa wè l?” deklare SENYÈ a?</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 23:24">
    <note caller="+" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">23:24 </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="1KI 8:27">I Wa 8:27</ref>
      </char>
    </note>“Èske Mwen pa ranpli syèl yo ak tè a?” deklare SENYÈ a?”<verse eid="JER 23:24"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="JER 23:25"/>“Mwen te tande sa pwofèt ki fè <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">23:25 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="JER 14:14">Jr 14:14</ref></char></note>fo pwofesi nan non Mwen yo te di. Y ap di: ‘Mwen te fè yon rèv, mwen te fè yon rèv!’ <verse eid="JER 23:25"/><verse number="26" style="v" sid="JER 23:26"/>Pou konbyen de tan? Èske gen yon bagay nan kè pwofèt ki fè fo pwofesi yo, menm pwofèt sila ki <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">23:26 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="1TI 4:1-2">I Tim 4:1-2</ref></char></note>twonpe pwòp kè yo? <verse eid="JER 23:26"/><verse number="27" style="v" sid="JER 23:27"/>Yo gen entansyon <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">23:27 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="DEU 13:1-3">Det 13:1-3</ref></char></note>fè pèp Mwen an bliye non Mwen ak rèv ke yo repete youn ak lòt yo, menm jan ke papa zansèt yo te bliye non M akoz Baal? <verse eid="JER 23:27"/><verse number="28" style="v" sid="JER 23:28"/>Pwofèt ki fè rèv la, kite li repete rèv li a. Epi sila ki gen pawòl pa M, kite l pale pawòl pa M nan ak verite. <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">23:28 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="1CO 3:12-13">I Kor 3:12-13</ref></char></note>Kisa gen nan pay ki sanble ak sereyal? <verse eid="JER 23:28"/><verse number="29" style="v" sid="JER 23:29"/>Èske pawòl Mwen pa tankou yon dife?” deklare SENYÈ a: “Èske li pa tankou yon <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">23:29 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="2CO 10:4-5">II Kor 10:4-5</ref></char></note>mato ki kraze fann wòch?”<verse eid="JER 23:29"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" sid="JER 23:30"/>Pou sa, gade byen, <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">23:30 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="DEU 18:20">Det 18:20</ref></char></note>“Mwen kont pwofèt yo,” deklare SENYÈ a: “Ki vòlè pawòl Mwen yo soti nan youn lòt.” <verse eid="JER 23:30"/><verse number="31" style="v" sid="JER 23:31"/>“Gade byen, Mwen kont pwofèt yo”, deklare SENYÈ a: “Ki sèvi lang yo pou deklare, ‘SENYÈ a deklare’. <verse eid="JER 23:31"/><verse number="32" style="v" sid="JER 23:32"/>Gade byen, Mwen kont sila ki te fè pwofesi fo <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">23:32 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="DEU 13:1-2">Det 13:1-2</ref></char></note>rèv” deklare SENYÈ a: “E ki te repete yo pou egare pèp Mwen yo ak manti yo, ak ògèy san kontwòl yo, malgre se pa Mwen ki te voye yo, ni kòmande yo. Ni yo pa founi okenn benefis pou pèp sa a,” deklare SENYÈ a.<verse eid="JER 23:32"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="33" style="v" sid="JER 23:33"/>“Alò, lè pèp sa a, pwofèt la oswa prèt la mande ou pou di: ‘Se kilès ki <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">23:33 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ISA 13:1">És 13:1</ref></char></note>pòt pawòl SENYÈ a?’ Alò, ou va reponn yo: ‘Ki pòt pawòl sa a?’ “Mwen va retire jete nou” deklare SENYÈ a’. <verse eid="JER 23:33"/><verse number="34" style="v" sid="JER 23:34"/>Epi pou pwofèt la, prèt la oswa pèp la ki di: <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">23:34 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="LAM 2:14">Lam 2:14</ref></char></note> ‘Pòt pawòl SENYÈ a’, Mwen va mennen pinisyon sou moun sila a ak lakay li. <verse eid="JER 23:34"/><verse number="35" style="v" sid="JER 23:35"/>Konsa nou chak va di a vwazen li, ak frè li: <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">23:35 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="JER 33:3">Jr 33:3</ref></char></note> ‘Se ki repons SENYÈ a te bay’, oswa ‘se ak kilès SENYÈ a te pale?’ <verse eid="JER 23:35"/><verse number="36" style="v" sid="JER 23:36"/>Paske nou p ap sonje pwofesi SENYÈ a ankò, akoz pawòl a chak moun va devni pwop mesaj li. Konsa nou fin <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">23:36 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="GAL 1:7-8">Gal 1:7-8</ref></char></note>tòde pawòl a SENYÈ dèzame yo, Bondye nou an. <verse eid="JER 23:36"/><verse number="37" style="v" sid="JER 23:37"/>Pou sa a, nou va di a pwofèt sa a: ‘Ki repons SENYÈ a te bannou?’ epi ‘Kisa SENYÈ a te di’? <verse eid="JER 23:37"/><verse number="38" style="v" sid="JER 23:38"/>Akoz nou di: ‘Pwofesi SENYÈ a,’ anverite, konsa pale SENYÈ a: ‘Akoz nou sèvi pawòl sila a, “pwofesi SENYÈ a,” Mwen ap voye kote nou pou di: “Nou pa pou di ‘Pwofesi SENYÈ a!”’ <verse eid="JER 23:38"/><verse number="39" style="v" sid="JER 23:39"/>Akoz sa, gade byen, <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">23:39 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="JER 7:14-15">Jr 7:14-15</ref></char></note>Mwen va, anverite, bliye nou e jete nou lwen prezans Mwen, ansanm ak vil ke M te bannou ak papa zansèt nou yo. <verse eid="JER 23:39"/><verse number="40" style="v" sid="JER 23:40"/>Mwen va fè poze yon <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">23:40 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="JER 20:11">Jr 20:11</ref></char></note>repwòch ki p ap janm sòti sou nou, ak yon imilyasyon ki p ap janm bliye.”<verse eid="JER 23:40"/></para>
  <chapter eid="JER 23"/>
  <chapter number="24" style="c" sid="JER 24"/>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="JER 24:1"/>Pawòl SENYÈ a te demontre m, epi, gade byen, de panyen fig etranje ki te plase devan tanp SENYÈ a, lè <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">24:1 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="2KI 24:10-16">II Wa 24:10-16</ref></char></note>Nebucadnetsar, wa Babylone nan, te fin retire Jeconia, fis a Jojakim nan, wa Juda a, dirijan a Juda yo ak gwo atizan ak bòs fòjewon Jérusalem yo pou te mennen yo Babylone. <verse eid="JER 24:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="JER 24:2"/>Yon panyen te gen bon fig etranje yo, tankou nan <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">24:2 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="MIC 7:1">Mi 7:1</ref></char></note>premye rekòlt yo, e lòt panyen an te gen move fig ki pa t ka manje akoz yo te pouri.<verse eid="JER 24:2"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="JER 24:3"/>Konsa, SENYÈ a te di m: <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">24:3 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="JER 1:11-13">Jr 1:11-13</ref></char></note>“Kisa ou wè, Jérémie?”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="JER 24:3">Mwen te reponn: “Fig etranje yo, bon fig etranje yo, byen bon, ak move fig etranje yo, byen move, ki pa ka manje akoz yo pouri.”<verse eid="JER 24:3"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="JER 24:4"/>Epi pawòl SENYÈ a te vin kote mwen. Li te di: <verse eid="JER 24:4"/><verse number="5" style="v" sid="JER 24:5"/>“Konsa pale SENYÈ Israël a ‘Tankou bon fig etranje yo, konsa Mwen va konsidere <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">24:5 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="NAM 1:7">Na 1:7</ref></char></note>kon bon, kaptif a Juda yo, ke m te voye sòti nan plas sa a pou antre nan peyi Kaldeyen yo. <verse eid="JER 24:5"/><verse number="6" style="v" sid="JER 24:6"/>Paske Mwen va fikse zye M sou yo pou byen e Mwen va <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">24:6 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="JER 12:15">Jr 12:15</ref></char></note>mennen yo ankò nan peyi sa a. Mwen va bati yo, e Mwen p ap rale fè yo desann. Mwen va plante yo e Mwen p ap rache yo. <verse eid="JER 24:6"/><verse number="7" style="v" sid="JER 24:7"/>Mwen va bay yo yon <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">24:7 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="JER 12:15">Jr 12:15</ref></char></note>kè pou rekonèt Mwen, ke se Mwen ki SENYÈ a. Konsa, yo va pèp Mwen e Mwen va Bondye yo, paske yo va retounen kote Mwen ak tout kè yo.’”<verse eid="JER 24:7"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="JER 24:8"/>“Men tankou move fig etranje ki pa ka manje akoz yo pouri yo—anverite, konsa”, pale SENYÈ a—“Konsa Mwen va abandone Sédécias, wa Juda a, dirijan li yo, <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">24:8 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="JER 39:9">Jr 39:9</ref></char></note>retay Jérusalem ki rete nan peyi sa a, ak sila ki rete nan peyi Égypte yo. <verse eid="JER 24:8"/><verse number="9" style="v" sid="JER 24:9"/>Mwen va fè yo vin yon gwo laperèz ak yon mal pou tout wayòm latè yo, kon repwòch, yon vye mo, yon rizib, e yon <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">24:9 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ISA 65:15">És 65:15</ref></char></note>madichon tout kote ke M gaye yo. <verse eid="JER 24:9"/><verse number="10" style="v" sid="JER 24:10"/>Mwen va voye <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">24:10 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ISA 51:19">És 51:19</ref></char></note>nepe ak gwo grangou, maladi ak bèt pou ravaje chan yo jiskaske yo fin detwi soti nan peyi ke M te bay a yo menm nan ak papa zansèt yo.”<verse eid="JER 24:10"/></para>
  <chapter eid="JER 24"/>
  <chapter number="25" style="c" sid="JER 25"/>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="JER 25:1"/>Pawòl ki te rive kote Jérémie konsènan tout pèp a Juda a, nan katriyèm ane a <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">25:1 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="2KI 24:1-2">II Wa 24:1-2</ref></char></note>Jojakim, fis a Josias, wa Juda a, (ki te nan premye ane Nebucadnetsar, wa Babylone nan), <verse eid="JER 25:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="JER 25:2"/>ke Jérémie, pwofèt la, te pale a tout <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">25:2 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="JER 18:11">Jr 18:11</ref></char></note>pèp Juda a e a tout moun ki te rete Jérusalem yo. Li te di: <verse eid="JER 25:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="JER 25:3"/>Depi nan trèzyèm ane Josias, fis a Amon an, wa Juda a, menm rive nan jou sa a, pandan venn-twazan sila yo, pawòl SENYÈ a te vin kote mwen. Konsa, mwen te pale avèk nou; mwen te leve bonè pou pale ak nou, men nou pa t koute, ni nou pa t panche zòrèy nou pou tande.<verse eid="JER 25:3"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="JER 25:4"/>SENYÈ a te voye bannou tout <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">25:4 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="2CH 36:15">II Kwo 36:15</ref></char></note>sèvitè Li yo ak pwofèt yo. Li te leve bonè pou voye yo, men nou pa t koute, ni panche zòrèy nou pou koute, <verse eid="JER 25:4"/><verse number="5" style="v" sid="JER 25:5"/>Li te di: <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">25:5 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="2KI 17:13">II Wa 17:13</ref></char></note> “Vire koulye a nou tout e kite wout mechan nou, mechanste a zak nou yo pou vin rete nan peyi ke SENYÈ a te bannou ak papa zansèt nou yo pou tout tan, jis rive pou tout tan. <verse eid="JER 25:5"/><verse number="6" style="v" sid="JER 25:6"/><note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">25:6 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="DEU 6:14">Det 6:14</ref></char></note>Pa mache dèyè lòt dye pou sèvi e adore yo, ni pa pwovoke M a lakòlè ak zèv men nou yo. Konsa, Mwen p ap fè nou okenn mal.”<verse eid="JER 25:6"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="JER 25:7"/>“Sepandan, nou pa t janm koute Mwen,” deklare SENYÈ a: “pou nou ka pwovoke m a lakòlè ak zèv men nou yo, jis rive nan pwòp donmaj nou.”<verse eid="JER 25:7"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="JER 25:8"/>Pou sa, konsa pale SENYÈ dèzame yo: “Akoz nou pa t obeyi pawòl Mwen yo, <verse eid="JER 25:8"/><verse number="9" style="v" sid="JER 25:9"/>gade byen, Mwen va voye pran tout fanmi nò yo,” deklare SENYÈ a: “Epi Mwen va voye kote Nebucadnetsar, wa Babylone nan, <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">25:9 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ISA 13:3">És 13:3</ref></char></note>sèvitè Mwen an. Mwen va fè yo vini kont peyi sa a, kont tout moun ki rete ladann yo, e kont tout nasyon ki antoure li yo. Konsa, Mwen va detwi yo nèt, fè yo vin yon gwo laperèz, yon objè moun sifle kon koulèv ak yon dezolasyon k ap la pou tout tan. <verse eid="JER 25:9"/><verse number="10" style="v" sid="JER 25:10"/>Anplis, Mwen va <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">25:10 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ISA 24:8-11">És 24:8-11</ref></char></note>retire sou yo vwa ki plen ak lajwa a, e vwa a kè kontan an, vwa a jennonm ki fenk marye, vwa a jenn fi marye a, son a wòch moulen yo ak limyè a lanp lan. <verse eid="JER 25:10"/><verse number="11" style="v" sid="JER 25:11"/>Tout peyi sa a va vin yon dezolasyon ak yon gwo laperèz, e nasyon sa yo va sèvi wa Babylone nan pandan <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">25:11 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="2CH 36:21">II Kwo 36:21</ref></char></note>swasann-dis ane.”<verse eid="JER 25:11"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="JER 25:12"/>“Konsa, li va vin rive ke <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">25:12 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="EZR 1:1">Esd 1:1</ref></char></note>lè swasann-dis ane vin fini, Mwen va pini wa Babylone nan ak nasyon sa a,” deklare SENYÈ a: “pou inikite pa yo. Pou peyi Kaldeyen yo, Mwen va fè li vin yon dezolasyon nèt jis pou tout tan. <verse eid="JER 25:12"/><verse number="13" style="v" sid="JER 25:13"/>Mwen va fè rive sou peyi sa a tout pawòl Mwen ke Mwen te pwononse kont li, tout sa ki ekri nan <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">25:13 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="JER 36:4-32">Jr 36:4-32</ref></char></note>liv sa a, ke Jérémie te fè kon pwofesi kont tout nasyon sa yo. <verse eid="JER 25:13"/><verse number="14" style="v" sid="JER 25:14"/>(Paske, <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">25:14 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="JER 27:7">Jr 27:7</ref></char></note>anpil nasyon ak gwo wa va fè yo vin esklav, menm yo menm. Konsa, Mwen va rekonpanse yo selon zèv yo.)”<verse eid="JER 25:14"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="JER 25:15"/>Paske SENYÈ a, Bondye Israël la di mwen: “Pran <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">25:15 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="JOB 21:20">Job 21:20</ref></char></note>tas diven kòlè sa a soti nan men Mwen, e fè tout nasyon kote Mwen voye ou yo bwè l. <verse eid="JER 25:15"/><verse number="16" style="v" sid="JER 25:16"/>Yo va <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">25:16 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="NAM 3:11">Na 3:11</ref></char></note>bwè, kilbite e vin fou akoz nepe ke Mwen va voye pami yo.”<verse eid="JER 25:16"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="JER 25:17"/>Konsa, mwen te pran tas la nan men SENYÈ a, e mwen te <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">25:17 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="JER 1:10">Jr 1:10</ref></char></note>fè tout nasyon sou sila SENYÈ a te voye mwen yo, bwè l: <verse eid="JER 25:17"/><verse number="18" style="v" sid="JER 25:18"/><note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">25:18 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="PSA 60:3">Sòm 60:3</ref></char></note>Jérusalem ak vil Juda yo, wa pa li yo ak prens li yo, pou fè yo vin detwi nèt, yon gwo laperèz, yon objè k ap fè moun sifle anlè kon koulèv, yon madichon, jis jan sa ye jodi a; <verse eid="JER 25:18"/><verse number="19" style="v" sid="JER 25:19"/><note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">25:19 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="JER 46:2-28">Jr 46:2-28</ref></char></note>Farawon, wa Égypte la, sèvitè li yo, prens li yo ak tout pèp li a; <verse eid="JER 25:19"/><verse number="20" style="v" sid="JER 25:20"/>epi tout etranje yo, tout wa <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">25:20 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="JOB 1:1">Job 1:1</ref></char></note>peyi Uts yo, tout wa peyi Filisten yo, menm Askalon, Gaza, Ékron, ak sila ki rete Asdod yo; <verse eid="JER 25:20"/><verse number="21" style="v" sid="JER 25:21"/>Édom, <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">25:21 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="JER 48:1-47">Jr 48:1-47</ref></char></note>Moab ak fis Ammon yo; <verse eid="JER 25:21"/><verse number="22" style="v" sid="JER 25:22"/>epi tout wa Tyr yo, tout wa Sidon yo ak wa <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">25:22 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="JER 31:10">Jr 31:10</ref></char></note>peyi kot ki lòtbò lanmè yo; <verse eid="JER 25:22"/><verse number="23" style="v" sid="JER 25:23"/>Dedan ak Théma, ak <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">25:23 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="GEN 22:21">Jen 22:21</ref></char></note>Buz e tout sila ki koupe kwen cheve yo; <verse eid="JER 25:23"/><verse number="24" style="v" sid="JER 25:24"/>epi tout wa Arabie yo ak tout wa a pèp etranje ki rete nan dezè yo; <verse eid="JER 25:24"/><verse number="25" style="v" sid="JER 25:25"/>epi tout wa Zimri yo, tout wa a <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">25:25 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="GEN 10:22">Jen 10:22</ref></char></note>Élam yo ak tout wa a Médie yo; <verse eid="JER 25:25"/><verse number="26" style="v" sid="JER 25:26"/>epi tout wa nò yo, ni pre, ni lwen, youn avèk lòt; epi <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">25:26 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="JER 25:9">Jr 25:9</ref></char></note>tout wayòm latè ki sou sifas tè a. Wa Schéschac la va bwè apre yo.<verse eid="JER 25:26"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="JER 25:27"/>“Ou va di yo: ‘Konsa pale SENYÈ dèzame yo, Bondye Israël la, “Bwè, vin sou, vomi, tonbe e pa leve ankò akoz <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">25:27 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="EZK 21:4-5">Éz 21:4-5</ref></char></note>nepe ke Mwen va voye pami nou an.”’<verse eid="JER 25:27"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="JER 25:28"/>Epi li va vin rive ke si yo <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">25:28 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="JOB 34:33">Job 34:33</ref></char></note>refize pran tas la nan men ou pou bwè, alò ou va di yo: ‘Konsa pale SENYÈ dèzame yo: “Anverite, nou va bwè! <verse eid="JER 25:28"/><verse number="29" style="v" sid="JER 25:29"/>Paske gade byen, Mwen ap kòmanse fè yon zèv k ap yon kalamite nan vil sa a, ki <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">25:29 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="1KI 8:43">I Wa 8:43</ref></char></note>rele pa non Mwen an. Èske nou dwe konplètman chape anba pinisyon? Nou p ap chape anba pinisyon, paske Mwen ap fè apèl nepe a kont tout sila ki rete sou latè yo”, deklare SENYÈ dèzame yo.”’<verse eid="JER 25:29"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" sid="JER 25:30"/>“Akoz sa, ou va pwofetize kont yo ak tout pawòl sa yo. Ou va di yo:</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 25:30">‘SENYÈ a va <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">25:30 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="JOL 2:11">Jl 2:11</ref></char></note> gwonde fò depi anwo;</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 25:30">vwa l va eksprime depi nan abitasyon sen li an.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 25:30">Li va gwonde ak pwisans kont bann mouton pa li an.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 25:30">Li va rele fò tankou sila k ap foule rezen yo,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 25:30">kont tout sila ki rete sou latè yo.<verse eid="JER 25:30"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="31" style="v" sid="JER 25:31"/>Yon zen va rive soti nan dènye ekstremite latè,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 25:31">akoz SENYÈ a <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">25:31 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="HOS 4:1">Os 4:1</ref></char></note>gen yon kont pou regle ak tout nasyon yo.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 25:31">Li va antre nan jijman ak tout chè yo.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 25:31">Pou mechan yo, li va livre yo a nepe,’” deklare SENYÈ a.<verse eid="JER 25:31"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" sid="JER 25:32"/>Konsa pale SENYÈ dèzame yo:</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 25:32">“Gade byen, mal la va sòti vin parèt de nasyon a nasyon,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 25:32">e yon <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">25:32 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ISA 30:30">És 30:30</ref></char></note>gwo tanpèt va tòde jis rive nan pwent pi lwen de mond lan.<verse eid="JER 25:32"/></para>
  <para style="m">
    <verse number="33" style="v" sid="JER 25:33"/>Sila ki <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">25:33 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ISA 34:2-3">És 34:2-3</ref></char></note>touye pa SENYÈ yo nan jou sa a va soti nan yon pwent latè jis rive nan lòt la. Yo p ap kriye pou yo, vin ranmase yo, ni antere. Yo va tankou fimye bèt sou sifas latè.<verse eid="JER 25:33"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="34" style="v" sid="JER 25:34"/>Kriye fò, nou menm k ap fè bèje yo;</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 25:34">rele anmwey!</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 25:34">Woule kò nou nan sann,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 25:34">nou menm ki mèt a bann mouton yo;</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 25:34">paske jou a <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">25:34 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ISA 34:6-7">És 34:6-7</ref></char></note>masak nou yo ak egzil la fin rive,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 25:34">e nou va tonbe kon veso pi chwazi a.<verse eid="JER 25:34"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="35" style="v" sid="JER 25:35"/>
    <note caller="+" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">25:35 </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="JOB 11:20">Job 11:20</ref>
      </char>
    </note>Sove ale pa p posib pou bèje yo.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 25:35">Mèt bann mouton yo p ap chape.<verse eid="JER 25:35"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="36" style="v" sid="JER 25:36"/>Tande kri a bèje yo,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 25:36">ak plent a mèt bann mouton yo.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 25:36">Konsa, SENYÈ a ap detwi patiraj yo,<verse eid="JER 25:36"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="37" style="v" sid="JER 25:37"/>Epi <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">25:37 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ISA 27:10">És 27:10</ref></char></note>pak mouton lapè yo tonbe an silans,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 25:37">akoz gwo kòlè SENYÈ a.”<verse eid="JER 25:37"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="38" style="v" sid="JER 25:38"/>Li soti nan kote kachèt Li yo <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">25:38 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="JER 4:7">Jr 4:7</ref></char></note>kon lyon an,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 25:38">paske peyi yo te devni yon gwo laperèz</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 25:38">akoz gwo vyolans nepe k ap oprime,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 25:38">e akoz gwo raj a kòlè Li.<verse eid="JER 25:38"/></para>
  <chapter eid="JER 25"/>
  <chapter number="26" style="c" sid="JER 26"/>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="JER 26:1"/>Nan kòmansman règn a <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">26:1 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="2KI 23:36">II Wa 23:36</ref></char></note>wa Jojakim nan, fis a Josias la, wa a Juda a, pawòl sa a te sòti nan SENYÈ a: <verse eid="JER 26:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="JER 26:2"/>“Konsa pale SENYÈ a: ‘Kanpe nan lakou lakay SENYÈ a pou pale ak tout vil Juda a ki te vin adore lakay SENYÈ a'. Bay yo tout pawòl ke M te kòmande ou pou pale avèk yo. <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">26:2 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="DEU 4:2">Det 4:2</ref></char></note>Pa manke menm yon mo! <verse eid="JER 26:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="JER 26:3"/>Petèt yo va koute e tout moun va vire kite pwòp wout mechan pa yo, pou M <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">26:3 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="JER 18:8">Jr 18:8</ref></char></note>ta kapab repanti de malè ke M planifye pou fè rive yo, akoz mechanste a zak yo.’” <verse eid="JER 26:3"/><verse number="4" style="v" sid="JER 26:4"/>Men sa ou va di yo: “Konsa pale SENYÈ a: <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">26:4 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="LEV 26:14">Lev 26:14</ref></char></note>‘Si nou refize koute Mwen, pou mache nan lalwa ke M te mete devan nou an, <verse eid="JER 26:4"/><verse number="5" style="v" sid="JER 26:5"/>pou koute pawòl a <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">26:5 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="2KI 9:7">II Wa 9:7</ref></char></note>sèvitè Mwen yo, pwofèt ke M te voye a nou menm tout tan, tout tan yo,—men nou pa t koute— <verse eid="JER 26:5"/><verse number="6" style="v" sid="JER 26:6"/>konsa, Mwen va fè kay sila kon Silo e vil sa a, Mwen va fè li vin yon <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">26:6 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="2KI 22:19">II Wa 22:19</ref> </char></note>madichon pou tout nasyon sou latè yo.’”<verse eid="JER 26:6"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="JER 26:7"/>
    <note caller="+" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">26:7 </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="JER 5:31">Jr 5:31</ref>
      </char>
    </note>Prèt yo, pwofèt yo ak tout pèp la te tande Jérémie pale pawòl sa yo lakay SENYÈ a. <verse eid="JER 26:7"/><verse number="8" style="v" sid="JER 26:8"/>Lè Jérémie te fin pale tout sa ke SENYÈ a te kòmande pale a tout pèp la, prèt yo ak pwofèt yo ak tout pèp la te sezi li. Yo te di: <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">26:8 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="JER 11:19">Jr 11:19</ref></char></note>“Fòk ou mouri! <verse eid="JER 26:8"/><verse number="9" style="v" sid="JER 26:9"/>Poukisa ou te pwofetize nan non SENYÈ a e te di: ‘Kay sa a va tankou Silo e vil sa a va vin dezète, san moun?’” Konsa, <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">26:9 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ACT 3:11">Trav 3:11</ref></char></note>tout pèp la te rasanble antoure Jérémie lakay SENYÈ a.<verse eid="JER 26:9"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="JER 26:10"/>Lè ofisye a Juda yo te tande bagay sa yo, yo te vin monte soti lakay a wa a pou rive lakay SENYÈ a, e yo te chita nan antre Pòtay Nèf lakay SENYÈ a. <verse eid="JER 26:10"/><verse number="11" style="v" sid="JER 26:11"/>Epi prèt yo ak pwofèt yo te pale ak ofisye yo ak tout pèp la e te di: “Nonm sa a merite mouri! Li te pwofetize kont vil sila a, jan nou te koute ak pwòp tande nou an.”<verse eid="JER 26:11"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="JER 26:12"/>Konsa, Jérémie te pale ak tout ofisye yo ak tout pèp la. Li te di: <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">26:12 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="JER 1:17-18">Jr 1:17-18</ref></char></note>“SENYÈ a te voye mwen pou pwofetize kont tout kay sila a, tout pawòl ke nou te tande yo. <verse eid="JER 26:12"/><verse number="13" style="v" sid="JER 26:13"/>Alò, pou sa, <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">26:13 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="JER 7:3-5">Jr 7:3-5</ref></char></note>korije chemen nou yo ak zèv nou yo, e obeyi a vwa SENYÈ a, Bondye nou an; epi SENYÈ a va chanje lide sou malè ke Li te pwononse kont nou an. <verse eid="JER 26:13"/><verse number="14" style="v" sid="JER 26:14"/>Men pou mwen menm, <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">26:14 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="JER 38:5">Jr 38:5</ref></char></note>se nan men nou mwen ye. Fè sa nou pito avè m jan nou wè li bon nan zye nou an. <verse eid="JER 26:14"/><verse number="15" style="v" sid="JER 26:15"/>Sèlman, konnen byen ke si nou mete m a lanmò, nou va mennen <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">26:15 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="NUM 35:33">Nonb 35:33</ref></char></note>san inosan vin tonbe sou nou menm, sou vil sa a, ak tout moun ki rete ladan; paske anverite, SENYÈ a te voye mwen kote nou pou pale tout pawòl sa yo nan zòrèy nou.”<verse eid="JER 26:15"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="JER 26:16"/>Epi ofisye yo ak tout pèp la te di a prèt yo e a pwofèt yo: <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">26:16 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ACT 5:34-39">Trav 5:34-39</ref></char></note>“Nou p ap pase lòd lanmò pou nonm sa a, paske li te pale nou nan non SENYÈ a, Bondye nou an.”<verse eid="JER 26:16"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="JER 26:17"/>Epi <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">26:17 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ACT 5:34">Trav 5:34</ref></char></note>kèk nan ansyen peyi a te leve e te pale a tout asanble a pèp la. Yo te di: <verse eid="JER 26:17"/><verse number="18" style="v" sid="JER 26:18"/><note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">26:18 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="MIC 1:1">Mi 1:1</ref></char></note>“Michée, moun Moréscheth la, te pwofetize nan tan Ézéchias, wa Juda a. Li te pale a tout pèp Juda a e te di: ‘Konsa SENYÈ dèzame yo te pale:</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 26:18">“Sion va raboure kon yon chan,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 26:18">Jérusalem va vin yon pil mazi</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 26:18">e mòn kay la kon pwent ki piwo nan yon forè.”<verse eid="JER 26:18"/></para>
  <para style="m">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="JER 26:19"/>“‘Èske Ézéchias, wa Juda a, ak tout Juda te mete l a lanmò? Èske li pa t gen lakrent SENYÈ a, chache favè SENYÈ a, e SENYÈ a te chanje lide Li sou malè ke li te pwononse kont yo a? Men nou ap komèt yon gwo mal kont pwòp tèt pa nou.’”<verse eid="JER 26:19"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="JER 26:20"/>Anverite, te gen yon nonm ki te pwofetize nan non SENYÈ a, Urie, fis a Schemaeja a, a <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">26:20 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="JOS 9:17">Jos 9:17</ref></char></note>Kirjath-Jearim. Li te pwofetize kont vil sa a e kont peyi sa a, pawòl parèy a tout sa a Jérémie yo. <verse eid="JER 26:20"/><verse number="21" style="v" sid="JER 26:21"/>Lè wa Jojakim ak tout mesye pwisan pa li yo ak tout ofisye yo te tande pawòl li yo, alò, wa a te eseye mete l a lanmò. Men Urie te tande. Li te krent e li te <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">26:21 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="JER 36:12">Jr 36:12</ref></char></note>sove ale rive an Égypte. <verse eid="JER 26:21"/><verse number="22" style="v" sid="JER 26:22"/>Konsa, wa Jojakim te voye mesye li yo an Égypte: Elnathan, fis a Acbor a e kèk lòt mesye avèk li te ale antre an Égypte. <verse eid="JER 26:22"/><verse number="23" style="v" sid="JER 26:23"/>Epi yo te mennen Urie soti an Égypte, te fè l rive kote wa Jojakim ki te <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">26:23 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="JER 2:30">Jr 2:30</ref></char></note>touye l ak yon nepe e te jete kadav li nan simityè endijan yo.<verse eid="JER 26:23"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="JER 26:24"/>Men, men Achikam la, fis a Schaphan nan, te avèk Jérémie, ki te fè l <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">26:24 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="1KI 18:4">I Wa 18:4</ref></char></note>pa rive nan men a pèp la pou mete l a lanmò.<verse eid="JER 26:24"/></para>
  <chapter eid="JER 26"/>
  <chapter number="27" style="c" sid="JER 27"/>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="JER 27:1"/>Nan kòmansman règn wa <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">27:1 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="2KI 24:18-20">II Wa 24:18-20</ref></char></note>Sédécias, fis a Josias la, wa Juda a, pawòl sa a te rive kote Jérémie soti nan SENYÈ a, epi te di, <verse eid="JER 27:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="JER 27:2"/>Konsa SENYÈ a pale ak mwen: “Fè pou kont ou <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">27:2 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="JER 30:8">Jr 30:8</ref></char></note>lyen ak jouk e mete yo sou kou ou. <verse eid="JER 27:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="JER 27:3"/>Epi voye pawòl kote wa <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">27:3 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="JER 25:21-22">Jr 25:21-22</ref></char></note>Edom an, wa Moab la, wa a fis Ammon yo, wa Tyre la e wa a Sidon an pa mesaje ki vini Jérusalem kote Sédécias, wa Juda a. <verse eid="JER 27:3"/><verse number="4" style="v" sid="JER 27:4"/>Kòmande yo ale kote mèt pa yo e di yo: ‘Konsa pale SENYÈ dèzame yo, Bondye Israël la, konsa nou va di a mèt nou yo, <verse eid="JER 27:4"/><verse number="5" style="v" sid="JER 27:5"/>“Mwen te fè latè, lèzòm ak bèt ki sou sifas latè yo <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">27:5 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="DEU 9:29">Det 9:29</ref></char></note>pa gran pouvwa Mwen ak men M lonje, e Mwen va bay li a sila ki fè M plezi nan zye mwen. <verse eid="JER 27:5"/><verse number="6" style="v" sid="JER 27:6"/>Koulye a, Mwen <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">27:6 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="JER 21:7">Jr 21:7</ref></char></note>te bay tout peyi sila yo nan men a Nebucadnetsar, wa Babylone, sèvitè Mwen an e Mwen te bay li, anplis, bèt sovaj chan yo pou sèvi li. <verse eid="JER 27:6"/><verse number="7" style="v" sid="JER 27:7"/>Tout nasyon yo va sèvi li e fis li ak gran fis li jis rive nan lè pwòp peyi li vini. Nan moman sa a, anpil nasyon ak anpil wa va fè li vin sèvitè yo.”’”<verse eid="JER 27:7"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="JER 27:8"/>“Li va rive ke nasyon oswa wayòm ki refize sèvi Nebucadnetsar, wa Babylone nan, e ki pa mete kou li anba jouk a wa Babylone nan, Mwen va pini nasyon sa a ak <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">27:8 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="JER 24:10">Jr 24:10</ref></char></note>nepe a, ak gwo grangou e ak envazyon ensèk k ap ravaje tout chan yo,” deklare SENYÈ a: “jiskaske Mwen fin detwi nasyon sa a pa men li.<verse eid="JER 27:8"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="JER 27:9"/>“Men pou nou menm, <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">27:9 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="EXO 22:18">Egz 22:18</ref></char></note>pa koute pwofèt nou yo, divinò nou yo, moun ki fè rèv yo, moun k ap devine yo, ni sila ki fè wanga yo, k ap di: ‘Nou p ap sèvi wa Babylone nan’. <verse eid="JER 27:9"/><verse number="10" style="v" sid="JER 27:10"/>Paske pwofesi pa yo se <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">27:10 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="JER 23:25">Jr 23:25</ref></char></note>manti y ap bannou pou yo deplase nou ale lwen peyi nou, pou fè M ta pouse bourade nou deyò e nou va peri. <verse eid="JER 27:10"/><verse number="11" style="v" sid="JER 27:11"/>Men nasyon a ki <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">27:11 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="JER 27:2-12">Jr 27:2-12</ref></char></note>bese kou li anba jouk wa Babylone nan e ki sèvi li, Mwen va kite nan peyi li,” deklare SENYÈ a. “Konsa, yo va travay tè a pou viv ladann.”<verse eid="JER 27:11"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="JER 27:12"/>Mwen te pale pawòl tankou sila yo a <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">27:12 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="JER 27:3">Jr 27:3</ref></char></note>Sédécias, wa Juda a. Mwen te di l: “Mennen kou nou anba jouk a wa Babylone nan pou sèvi li ak pèp li a, e viv! <verse eid="JER 27:12"/><verse number="13" style="v" sid="JER 27:13"/>Poukisa nou va <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">27:13 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="PRO 8:36">Pwov 8:36</ref></char></note>mouri, nou menm avèk pèp nou an, pa nepe, gwo grangou, ak ravaj bèt ki manje tout chan yo, kon SENYÈ a te pale a nasyon sa a ki refize sèvi wa Babylone nan? <verse eid="JER 27:13"/><verse number="14" style="v" sid="JER 27:14"/>Konsa, <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">27:14 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="JER 27:9">Jr 27:9</ref></char></note>pa koute pawòl a pwofèt k ap pale ak nou, k ap di: ‘Nou p ap oblije sèvi wa Babylone nan,’ paske y ap fè pwofesi manti a nou menm. <verse eid="JER 27:14"/><verse number="15" style="v" sid="JER 27:15"/>Paske <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">27:15 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="JER 23:21">Jr 23:21</ref></char></note>Mwen pa t voye yo,” deklare SENYÈ a: “Yo fè fo pwofesi nan non Mwen, pou m ka pouse bourade nou deyò pou nou ka peri, nou menm ak pwofèt ki fè pwofesi sa yo bannou yo.”<verse eid="JER 27:15"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="JER 27:16"/>Apre, mwen te pale ak prèt yo e a tout pèp sa a. Mwen te di: “Konsa pale SENYÈ a: Pa koute pawòl a pwofèt nou yo ki fè pwofesi bannou ki di: ‘Gade byen, <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">27:16 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="2KI 24:13">II Wa 24:13</ref></char></note>veso lakay SENYÈ yo va retounen rapid soti Babylone;’ paske yo fè pwofesi manti bannou. <verse eid="JER 27:16"/><verse number="17" style="v" sid="JER 27:17"/>Pa koute yo. Sèvi wa Babylone nan e viv! Poukisa vil sa a ta dwe <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">27:17 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="JER 7:34">Jr 7:34</ref></char></note>detwi nèt? <verse eid="JER 27:17"/><verse number="18" style="v" sid="JER 27:18"/>Men <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">27:18 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="1KI 18:24">I Wa 18:24</ref></char></note>si se pwofèt yo ye, e si pawòl SENYÈ a avèk yo, kite yo koulye a fè demann a SENYÈ dèzame yo, pou veso ki rete lakay SENYÈ yo, lakay wa Juda a ak Jérusalem yo pa ale Babylone. <verse eid="JER 27:18"/><verse number="19" style="v" sid="JER 27:19"/>Paske se konsa pale SENYÈ dèzame yo konsènan <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">27:19 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="1KI 7:15">I Wa 7:15</ref></char></note>pilye yo, konsènan lanmè a, konsènan baz yo e konsènan tout lòt veso ki rete nan vil sa a, <verse eid="JER 27:19"/><verse number="20" style="v" sid="JER 27:20"/>ke Nebucadnetsar, wa Babylone nan, pa t pran lè l te pote Jeconia, fis a Jojakim nan, wa Juda a, te fè <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">27:20 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="2KI 24:12-16">II Wa 24:12-16</ref></char></note>sòti Jérusalem pou rive Babylone, ak tout gwo moun Juda ak Jérusalem yo. <verse eid="JER 27:20"/><verse number="21" style="v" sid="JER 27:21"/>Wi, se konsa SENYÈ dèzame yo, Bondye Israël la, te pale konsènan veso ki rete lakay SENYÈ yo, lakay wa Juda a ak Jérusalem yo, <verse eid="JER 27:21"/><verse number="22" style="v" sid="JER 27:22"/>‘Yo va pote rive Babylone e yo va la jis rive jou ke m vizite yo a,’ deklare SENYÈ a. ‘Apre, Mwen va <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">27:22 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="EZR 1:7-11">Esd 1:7-11</ref></char></note>mennen yo retounen e restore yo nan plas sa a.’”<verse eid="JER 27:22"/></para>
  <chapter eid="JER 27"/>
  <chapter number="28" style="c" sid="JER 28"/>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="JER 28:1"/>Alò, nan menm ane a, nan kòmansman règn a <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">28:1 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="2KI 24:18-20">II Wa 24:18-20</ref></char></note>Sédécias, wa Juda a, nan katriyèm ane, nan senkyèm mwa Hanania, fis a Azzur a, pwofèt ki te sòti nan Gabaon an, te pale ak mwen lakay SENYÈ a, nan prezans a prèt yo e a tout pèp yo. Li te di: <verse eid="JER 28:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="JER 28:2"/><note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">28:2 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="JER 27:12">Jr 27:12</ref></char></note>“Konsa pale SENYÈ dèzame yo, Bondye Israël la, ‘Mwen te kase jouk wa Babylone nan. <verse eid="JER 28:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="JER 28:3"/>Pandan dezan Mwen va fè rive nan plas sa a, <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">28:3 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="2KI 24:13">II Wa 24:13</ref></char></note>tout veso lakay SENYÈ yo, ke Nebucadnetsar, wa Babylone nan, te pran fè sòti nan plas sa a pou te pote Babylone yo. <verse eid="JER 28:3"/><verse number="4" style="v" sid="JER 28:4"/>Anplis, Mwen va mennen fè retounen nan plas sa a, Jeconia, fis a Jojakim nan, wa a Juda a ak tout egzile Juda ki te ale Babylone yo,’ deklare SENYÈ a, ‘paske Mwen va kase fado a wa a Babylone nan.’”<verse eid="JER 28:4"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="JER 28:5"/>Answit pwofèt Jérémie te pale ak pwofèt Hanania nan prezans a prèt yo, e nan prezans lan a tout moun ki te kanpe <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">28:5 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="JER 28:1">Jr 28:1</ref></char></note>lakay SENYÈ yo, <verse eid="JER 28:5"/><verse number="6" style="v" sid="JER 28:6"/>epi pwofèt Jérémie te di: <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">28:6 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="1KI 1:36">I Wa 1:36</ref></char></note>“Amen! Ke SENYÈ a fè l konsa. Ke SENYÈ a kapab konfime pawòl ke ou te pale yo, pou fè mennen retounen veso lakay SENYÈ yo, e tout moun ki ekzile yo, sòti Babylone pou antre nan plas sa a. <verse eid="JER 28:6"/><verse number="7" style="v" sid="JER 28:7"/>Malgre sa, <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">28:7 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="1KI 22:28">I Wa 22:28</ref></char></note>tande pawòl sa a ke m prèt pou pale nan tande pa w ak tande a tout pèp la! <verse eid="JER 28:7"/><verse number="8" style="v" sid="JER 28:8"/>Pwofèt ki te avan mwen yo, e avan ou depi nan tan ansyen an, te <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">28:8 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="LEV 26:14-39">Lev 26:14-39</ref></char></note>pwofetize kont anpil peyi e kont gwo wayòm, pou lagè, pou kalamite ak envazyon ensèk ki ta ravaje peyi yo. <verse eid="JER 28:8"/><verse number="9" style="v" sid="JER 28:9"/>Pwofèt ki te pwofetize lapè a, <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">28:9 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="DEU 18:22">Det 18:22</ref></char></note>lè pwofesi sa a vin rive; alò, pwofèt sa a va vin rekonèt kon yon pwofèt ke SENYÈ te vrèman voye.”<verse eid="JER 28:9"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="JER 28:10"/>Alò Hanania, pwofèt la, te retire <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">28:10 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="JER 27:2">Jr 27:2</ref></char></note>jouk la sou kou Jérémie e te kraze li. <verse eid="JER 28:10"/><verse number="11" style="v" sid="JER 28:11"/>Hanania te pale nan prezans a tout pèp la e te di: <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">28:11 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="JER 14:14">Jr 14:14</ref></char></note>“Konsa pale SENYÈ a, ‘Menm konsa, avan dezan, Mwen va kase jouk Nebucadnetsar, wa Babylone nan, fè l sòti sou kou a tout nasyon yo.’” Alò, pwofèt Jérémie te al fè wout li.<verse eid="JER 28:11"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="JER 28:12"/>
    <note caller="+" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">28:12 </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="JER 1:2">Jr 1:2</ref>
      </char>
    </note>Pawòl SENYÈ a te rive kote Jérémie lè Hanania te fin kase jouk a sou kou pwofèt Jérémie an. Li te di: <verse eid="JER 28:12"/><verse number="13" style="v" sid="JER 28:13"/>“Ale pale ak Hanania e di: ‘Konsa pale SENYÈ a, “Ou te kase jouk ki fèt an bwa yo, men ou fè rive olye de yo, jouk yo ki fèt an fè.” <verse eid="JER 28:13"/><verse number="14" style="v" sid="JER 28:14"/>Paske konsa pale SENYÈ dèzame yo, Bondye Israël la: “Mwen te mete yon <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">28:14 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="DEU 28:48">Det 28:48</ref></char></note>jouk fèt an fè sou kou a tout nasyon sila yo, pou yo ka sèvi Nebucadnetsar, wa Babylone nan; epi yo va sèvi li. Anplis, Mwen te bay li bèt chan yo.”’”<verse eid="JER 28:14"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="JER 28:15"/>Epi Jérémie, pwofèt la, te di a Hanania, pwofèt la: “Koute koulye a, Hanania, SENYÈ a pa t voye ou e <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">28:15 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="JER 20:6">Jr 20:6</ref></char></note>ou te fè pèp sa a kwè nan yon manti. <verse eid="JER 28:15"/><verse number="16" style="v" sid="JER 28:16"/>Pou sa, se konsa SENYÈ a pale: ‘Gade byen, Mwen prèt pou retire ou sou sifas tè a. Ane sa a, ou va mouri, akoz ou te <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">28:16 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="DEU 13:5">Det 13:5</ref></char></note>konseye rebelyon kont SENYÈ a.’” <verse eid="JER 28:16"/><verse number="17" style="v" sid="JER 28:17"/>Se konsa Hanania, pwofèt la, te mouri nan menm ane sa a nan setyèm mwa a.<verse eid="JER 28:17"/></para>
  <chapter eid="JER 28"/>
  <chapter number="29" style="c" sid="JER 29"/>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="JER 29:1"/>Alò, sila yo se pawòl a <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">29:1 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="2CH 30:1-6">II Kwo 30:1-6</ref></char></note>lèt ke Jérémie, pwofèt la, te voye soti Jérusalem bay lòt ansyen an egzil yo, ansanm ak prèt yo, pwofèt yo ak tout moun ke Nebucadnetsar te pran pou fè antre an egzil soti Jérusalem pou rive Babylone yo, <verse eid="JER 29:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="JER 29:2"/>( lè Wa <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">29:2 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="2KI 24:12-16">II Wa 24:12-16</ref></char></note>Jeconia ak manman rèn nan, ofisye tribinal yo, prens a Juda yo, gwo bòs atizan yo, ak sila ki travay nan metal yo te fin pati Jérusalem.) <verse eid="JER 29:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="JER 29:3"/>Lèt la te voye pa men Éleasa, fis a Schaphan ak Guemaria a, fis a <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">29:3 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="1CH 6:13">I Kwo 6:13</ref></char></note>Hilkija a, ke Sédécias, fis wa Juda a, te voye Babylone kote wa Nebucadnetsar. Li te di:<verse eid="JER 29:3"/></para>
  <para style="pi1">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="JER 29:4"/>Konsa pale SENYÈ dèzame yo, Bondye Israël la, a tout egzile ke m te <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">29:4 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="JER 24:5">Jr 24:5</ref></char></note>voye an egzil soti Jérusalem pou rive Babylone yo: <verse eid="JER 29:4"/><verse number="5" style="v" sid="JER 29:5"/><note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">29:5 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="JER 29:28">Jr 29:28</ref></char></note> “Bati kay e viv nan yo. Plante jaden e manje pwodwi yo. <verse eid="JER 29:5"/><verse number="6" style="v" sid="JER 29:6"/>Pran <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">29:6 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="JER 16:2-4">Jr 16:2-4</ref></char></note>madanm e vin papa a fis ak fi. Pran madanm pou fis nou yo e bay a fi nou yo mari yo, epi vin miltipliye la e pa diminye. <verse eid="JER 29:6"/><verse number="7" style="v" sid="JER 29:7"/>Chache bonè a peyi sa a kote Mwen te voye nou an egzil la, e priye a SENYÈ a pou li; paske nan bonè pa li, ou va jwenn bonè.” <verse eid="JER 29:7"/><verse number="8" style="v" sid="JER 29:8"/>Paske konsa pale SENYÈ dèzame yo, Bondye Israël la: “Pa kite <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">29:8 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="JER 27:9">Jr 27:9</ref></char></note>pwofèt ki rete nan mitan nou yo ak divinò nou yo twonpe nou, ni pa koute rèv ke yo fè. <verse eid="JER 29:8"/><verse number="9" style="v" sid="JER 29:9"/>Paske yo <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">29:9 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="JER 27:15">Jr 27:15</ref></char></note>fè fo pwofesi bannou nan non Mwen. Mwen pa t voye yo,” deklare SENYÈ a. <verse eid="JER 29:9"/><verse number="10" style="v" sid="JER 29:10"/>Paske konsa pale SENYÈ a: “Lè <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">29:10 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="2CH 36:21-23">II Kwo 36:21-23</ref></char></note>swasann-dizan yo fin ekoule pou Babylone, Mwen va vizite nou, e ranpli nou ak bon pawòl Mwen a nou menm, pou mennen nou retounen nan plas sa a. <verse eid="JER 29:10"/><verse number="11" style="v" sid="JER 29:11"/>Paske Mwen konnen <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">29:11 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="PSA 40:5">Sòm 40:5</ref></char></note>plan ke M genyen pou nou yo,” deklare SENYÈ a, “plan pou bonè e pa pou malè, pou bay nou yon bon avni ak espwa. <verse eid="JER 29:11"/><verse number="12" style="v" sid="JER 29:12"/>Epi nou va <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">29:12 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="PSA 50:15">Sòm 50:15</ref></char></note>rele Mwen, vin kote Mwen pou priye, e Mwen va koute nou. <verse eid="JER 29:12"/><verse number="13" style="v" sid="JER 29:13"/>Nou va <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">29:13 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="DEU 4:29">Det 4:29</ref></char></note>chache Mwen e nou va jwenn Mwen lè nou chache M ak tout kè nou. <verse eid="JER 29:13"/><verse number="14" style="v" sid="JER 29:14"/>Mwen va vin <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">29:14 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="DEU 30:1-10">Det 30:1-10</ref></char></note>twouve pa nou menm” deklare SENYÈ a: “Epi Mwen va restore bonte nou e ranmase nou soti nan tout nasyon yo ak plas kote Mwen te chase fè nou rive yo,” deklare SENYÈ a. “Epi Mwen va mennen nou fè nou retounen rive nan plas ke Mwen te fè nou pòte ale kon kaptif yo.”<verse eid="JER 29:14"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="JER 29:15"/>Akoz nou te di: “SENYÈ a te fè leve pwofèt yo pou nou Babylone”— <verse eid="JER 29:15"/><verse number="16" style="v" sid="JER 29:16"/>Pou sa, pale SENYÈ a konsènan wa ki chita sou twòn David la, e konsènan tout moun ki rete nan vil sa yo, frè nou yo ki <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">29:16 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="JER 38:2-23">Jr 38:2-23</ref></char></note>pa t antre ak nou an egzil yo— <verse eid="JER 29:16"/><verse number="17" style="v" sid="JER 29:17"/>Konsa pale SENYÈ dèzame yo: “Gade byen, Mwen ap voye sou yo <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">29:17 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="JER 27:8">Jr 27:8</ref></char></note>nepe ak gwo grangou, ensèk ak maladi pou ravaje chan yo, Mwen va fè yo tankou fig etranje ki louvri pete fann, e ki pa ka manje akoz yo pouri nèt. <verse eid="JER 29:17"/><verse number="18" style="v" sid="JER 29:18"/>Mwen va kouri dèyè yo ak nepe, ak gwo grangou, ak ensèk ak maladi pou ravaje chan yo. Mwen va fè yo jete ale retou pami tout wayòm latè yo, pou yo kapab vin yon gwo laperèz pou tout wayòm sou latè yo, pou yo kapab vin yon <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">29:18 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ISA 65:15">És 65:15</ref></char></note>madichon, yon bagay lèd e degoutan, yon objè k ap fè moun sifle anlè kon koulèv, yon repwòch pami tout nasyon kote Mwen te chase fè yo ale yo, <verse eid="JER 29:18"/><verse number="19" style="v" sid="JER 29:19"/>akoz yo <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">29:19 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="JER 6:19">Jr 6:19</ref></char></note>pa t koute pawòl Mwen yo,” deklare SENYÈ a: “ke Mwen te voye bay yo ankò e ankò pa sèvitè Mwen yo, pwofèt yo. Men nou pa t koute”, deklare SENYÈ a.<verse eid="JER 29:19"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="JER 29:20"/>Pou sa, nou menm, koute pawòl SENYÈ a, nou menm ki ekzile yo, ke M te <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">29:20 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="JER 24:5">Jr 24:5</ref></char></note>voye ale kite Jérusalem pou rive Babylone yo. <verse eid="JER 29:20"/><verse number="21" style="v" sid="JER 29:21"/>“Konsa pale SENYÈ dèzame yo, Bondye Israël la, konsènan Achab, fis a Kolaja a, e konsènan Sédécias, fis a Maaséja a, k ap <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">29:21 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="JER 14:14-15">Jr 14:14-15</ref></char></note>fè fo pwofesi bannou nan non Mwen, ‘Gade Byen, Mwen va livre yo nan men Nebucadnetsar, wa Babylone nan e li va touye yo devan zye nou. <verse eid="JER 29:21"/><verse number="22" style="v" sid="JER 29:22"/>Akoz yo menm, yon <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">29:22 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ISA 65:15">És 65:15</ref></char></note>madichon va vin itilize pa tout egzile Juda ki Babylone yo, ki va di: “Ke SENYÈ a fè ou tankou Sédécias ak tankou Achab, ke wa Babylone nan te boukannen nan dife a, <verse eid="JER 29:22"/><verse number="23" style="v" sid="JER 29:23"/>akoz yo te aji ak foli an Israël. Yo te <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">29:23 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="JER 5:8">Jr 5:8</ref></char></note>komèt adiltè ak madanm a vwazen yo, e yo te pale manti nan non Mwen, ke M pa t janm kòmande yo fè. Mwen se Sila ki konnen, e Mwen se temwen,” deklare SENYÈ a.’”<verse eid="JER 29:23"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="JER 29:24"/>A <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">29:24 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="JER 29:31-32">Jr 29:31-32</ref></char></note>Schemaeja, Nechelamit lan, ou va di: <verse eid="JER 29:24"/><verse number="25" style="v" sid="JER 29:25"/>“Konsa pale SENYÈ dèzame yo, Bondye Israël la: ‘Akoz ou te voye <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">29:25 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="JER 29:1">Jr 29:1</ref></char></note>lèt nan pwòp non pa w a tout pèp Jérusalem nan, a Sophonie, fis a Maaséja a, prèt la, epi a tout prèt yo, epi di: <verse eid="JER 29:25"/><verse number="26" style="v" sid="JER 29:26"/>“SENYÈ a te fè nou prèt olye Johojada, prèt la, pou vin chèf lakay SENYÈ a sou chak moun fou ki pwofetize, pou <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">29:26 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ACT 16:24">Trav 16:24</ref></char></note>mete li nan sèp ak nan kolye an fè. <verse eid="JER 29:26"/><verse number="27" style="v" sid="JER 29:27"/>Alò, konsa, poukisa ou pa t repwoche Jérémie a <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">29:27 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="JER 1:1">Jr 1:1</ref></char></note>Anathoth ki fè pwop tèt li pwofet ou menm nan? <verse eid="JER 29:27"/><verse number="28" style="v" sid="JER 29:28"/>Paske, li te <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">29:28 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="JER 29:1">Jr 29:1</ref></char></note>voye nou Babylone e li te di: Egzil la va byen long. Bati kay pou viv. Plante jaden pou manje pwodwi yo.”’”<verse eid="JER 29:28"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="JER 29:29"/>
    <note caller="+" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">29:29 </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="JER 29:25">Jr 29:25</ref>
      </char>
    </note>Sophonie, prèt la, te li lèt sa a bay Jérémie, pwofèt la. <verse eid="JER 29:29"/><verse number="30" style="v" sid="JER 29:30"/>Epi pawòl a SENYÈ a te vini a Jérémie ki te di: <verse eid="JER 29:30"/><verse number="31" style="v" sid="JER 29:31"/>“Voye kote tout egzile yo e di: ‘Konsa pale SENYÈ a konsènan Schemaeja, Nechelamit lan: “Akoz Schemaeja te <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">29:31 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="JER 14:14-15">Jr 14:14-15</ref></char></note>pwofetize a nou menm, malgre Mwen pa t voye l e li te fè nou kwè nan yon manti,” <verse eid="JER 29:31"/><verse number="32" style="v" sid="JER 29:32"/>Akoz sa, pale SENYÈ a: “Gade byen, Mwen prèt pou pini Schemaeja, Nechelamit lan, ak desandan li yo. <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">29:32 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="1SA 2:30-34">I Sam 2:30-34</ref></char></note>Li p ap gen pèsòn k ap viv pami pèp sa a, ni li p ap wè bonte ke Mwen prèt pou fè pou pèp Mwen an,” deklare SENYÈ a: “akoz li te preche rebelyon kont SENYÈ a.”’”<verse eid="JER 29:32"/></para>
  <chapter eid="JER 29"/>
  <chapter number="30" style="c" sid="JER 30"/>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="JER 30:1"/>Pawòl ki te vini a Jérémie soti nan SENYÈ a, ki te di: <verse eid="JER 30:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="JER 30:2"/>“Konsa pale SENYÈ a, Bondye Israël la: <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">30:2 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ISA 30:8">És 30:8</ref></char></note> ‘Ekri tout pawòl ke M te bay ou yo nan yon liv. <verse eid="JER 30:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="JER 30:3"/>Paske gade byen, jou yo ap vini,’ deklare SENYÈ a: ‘lè Mwen va restore fòtin pèp Mwen an, <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">30:3 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="JER 3:18">Jr 3:18</ref></char></note>Israël ak Juda,’ Senyè a di. ‘Anplis, Mwen va mennen yo retounen nan peyi ke m te bay a papa zansèt yo, e yo va posede li.’”<verse eid="JER 30:3"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="JER 30:4"/>Alò, sila yo se pawòl ke SENYÈ a te pale konsènan Israël e konsènan Juda: <verse eid="JER 30:4"/><verse number="5" style="v" sid="JER 30:5"/>Paske konsa pale SENYÈ a:</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 30:5">“Mwen te tande son a yon <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">30:5 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ISA 5:30">És 5:30</ref></char></note>gwo laperèz,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 30:5">a yon gwo krent;</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 30:5">pa gen lapè.<verse eid="JER 30:5"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="JER 30:6"/>Mande koulye a pou wè si yon gason kapab fè pitit.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 30:6">Poukisa Mwen wè tout gason ak men li sou ti vant yo,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 30:6">
    <note caller="+" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">30:6 </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="JER 4:31">Jr 4:31</ref>
      </char>
    </note>konsi se fanm k ap fè pitit?</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 30:6">Epi poukisa tout figi yo vin pal konsa?<verse eid="JER 30:6"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="JER 30:7"/>Elas, paske jou sa a gran, pa gen ki parèy a li.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 30:7">Li se lè a <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">30:7 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="JER 2:27-28">Jr 2:27-28</ref></char></note>gwo doulè Jacob la;</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 30:7">men li va sove de li.<verse eid="JER 30:7"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="JER 30:8"/>“Li va vin rive nan jou sa a, deklare SENYÈ dèzame yo:</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 30:8">ke Mwen va <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">30:8 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ISA 9:4">És 9:4</ref></char></note>kase jouk li a soti sou kou nou.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 30:8">Mwen va chire kòd yo,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 30:8">e etranje yo p ap fè yo esklav ankò.<verse eid="JER 30:8"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="JER 30:9"/>Men yo va sèvi SENYÈ a, Bondye pa yo a</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 30:9">e <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">30:9 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ISA 55:3-5">És 55:3-5</ref></char></note>David, wa yo a, ke Mwen va fè leve wo pou yo.<verse eid="JER 30:9"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="JER 30:10"/>Pa pè anyen, O Jacob, sèvitè Mwen an,” deklare SENYÈ a:</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 30:10">“Epi pa pèdi kouraj, O Israël;</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 30:10">paske gade byen, Mwen va sove ou soti lwen</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 30:10">e posterite ou soti nan peyi kaptivite yo.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 30:10">Jacob va retounen,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 30:10">Li va kalm, alèz,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 30:10">e <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">30:10 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="MIC 4:4">Mi 4:4</ref></char></note>nanpwen moun k ap fè l fè pè.<verse eid="JER 30:10"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="JER 30:11"/>Paske Mwen avèk ou, deklare SENYÈ a, pou sove ou;</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 30:11">paske Mwen va detwi nèt tout nasyon kote Mwen te gaye ou yo,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 30:11">sèlman ou menm ke M p ap detwi nèt.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 30:11">Men m ap fè ou korije fil a mezi;</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 30:11">Mwen p ap kite ou san pinisyon.”<verse eid="JER 30:11"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="JER 30:12"/>Paske konsa pale SENYÈ a:</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 30:12">“Blesi ou yo pa kab geri,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 30:12">e <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">30:12 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="2CH 36:16">II Kwo 36:16</ref></char></note>kondisyon ou byen grav.<verse eid="JER 30:12"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="JER 30:13"/>Nanpwen moun ki pou plede koz ou;</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 30:13">pa gen gerizon pou maleng nan, <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">30:13 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="JER 14:19">Jr 14:19</ref></char></note>ni ou p ap ka refè.<verse eid="JER 30:13"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="JER 30:14"/>Tout moun ki renmen ou yo fin bliye ou,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 30:14">yo pa chache ou;</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 30:14">paske Mwen te blese ou ak blesi a yon lènmi,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 30:14">ak pinisyon a yon moun ki mechan,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 30:14">akoz inikite ou gran e peche ou anpil.<verse eid="JER 30:14"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="JER 30:15"/>Poukisa w ap kriye akoz blesi ou yo?</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 30:15">Doulè ou a pa gen gerizon.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 30:15">Akoz inikite ou yo gran e peche ou yo anpil,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 30:15">Mwen te fè ou sa a.<verse eid="JER 30:15"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="JER 30:16"/>Akoz sa, tout sila ki <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">30:16 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="JER 2:3">Jr 2:3</ref> </char></note>devore ou yo va vin devore;</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 30:16">epi tout advèsè ou yo, yo chak, yo va antre an kaptivite.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 30:16">Sila ki piyaje ou yo va tounen piyaj yo menm,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 30:16">e tout sila yo ki fè nou vin viktim yo,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 30:16">va vin viktim yo menm.<verse eid="JER 30:16"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="JER 30:17"/>Paske M ap fè ou <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">30:17 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="EXO 15:26">Egz 15:26</ref></char></note>reprann lasante,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 30:17">e Mwen va geri ou de tout blesi ou yo,” deklare SENYÈ a:</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 30:17">“Akoz yo te rele ou yon rejte e yo te di:</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 30:17">‘Se Sion; nanpwen moun ki bezwen anyen ladan.’”<verse eid="JER 30:17"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="JER 30:18"/>Konsa pale SENYÈ a:</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 30:18">“Gade byen, Mwen va restore fòtin a tant a Jacob yo,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 30:18">e gen konpasyon pou lakay li yo;</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 30:18">vil la va rebati sou ranblè li yo</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 30:18">e <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">30:18 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="1CH 29:1-19">I Kwo 29:1-19</ref></char></note>palè a va kanpe nan pwòp plas li.<verse eid="JER 30:18"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="JER 30:19"/>Nan yo menm, va sòti remèsiman ak vwa a sila k ap fè fèt yo.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 30:19">Mwen va miltipliye yo e yo p ap diminye;</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 30:19">anplis, Mwen va bay yo <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">30:19 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ISA 55:5">És 55:5</ref></char></note>glwa, e yo p ap meprize;<verse eid="JER 30:19"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="JER 30:20"/>Pitit pa yo tou va tankou oparavan,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 30:20">e kongregasyon yo va <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">30:20 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ISA 54:14">És 54:14</ref></char></note>etabli devan M.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 30:20">Mwen va pini tout sila k ap oprime yo.<verse eid="JER 30:20"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="JER 30:21"/>Chèf pa yo va youn nan yo,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 30:21">e sila ki gouvène yo va sòti nan mitan yo.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 30:21">Mwen va <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">30:21 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="NUM 16:5">Nonb 16:5</ref></char></note>mennen li toupre,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 30:21">e li va vin toupre Mwen;</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 30:21">paske se kilès ki ta gen kouraj pou pwoche M?” deklare SENYÈ a.<verse eid="JER 30:21"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="JER 30:22"/>“Nou va vin pèp Mwen e Mwen va vin Bondye pa nou.”<verse eid="JER 30:22"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="JER 30:23"/>Gade byen, <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">30:23 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="JER 23:19">Jr 23:19</ref></char></note>tanpèt SENYÈ a, kòlè Li fin depanse nèt,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 30:23">yon tanpèt k ap ravaje;</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 30:23">li va eklate sou tèt a mechan yo.<verse eid="JER 30:23"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="JER 30:24"/>
    <note caller="+" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">30:24 </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="JER 4:8">Jr 4:8</ref>
      </char>
    </note>Kòlè fewòs SENYÈ a p ap detounen jiskaske li fin fè,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 30:24">jiskaske li fin acheve entansyon a kè Li.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 30:24">Nan dènye jou yo, ou va konprann sa.”<verse eid="JER 30:24"/></para>
  <chapter eid="JER 30"/>
  <chapter number="31" style="c" sid="JER 31"/>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="JER 31:1"/>“Nan lè sa a”, deklare SENYÈ a: “Mwen va vin <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">31:1 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="JER 30:22">Jr 30:22</ref></char></note>Bondye a tout fanmi Israël yo, e yo va vin pèp Mwen.”<verse eid="JER 31:1"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="JER 31:2"/>Konsa pale SENYÈ a: “Pèp ki te chape de nepe a, <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">31:2 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="NUM 14:20">Nonb 14:20</ref></char></note>te jwenn gras nan dezè a— Israël la menm, lè M te bay li repo li.”<verse eid="JER 31:2"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="JER 31:3"/>SENYÈ a te parèt a li menm soti lwen epi te di:</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 31:3">“Wi, Mwen te renmen ou ak yon lanmou ki p ap janm fini.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 31:3">Konsa, Mwen te atire ou ak lanmou dous.<verse eid="JER 31:3"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="JER 31:4"/>
    <note caller="+" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">31:4 </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="JER 24:6">Jr 24:6</ref>
      </char>
    </note>Yon lòt fwa ankò, Mwen va bati ou,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 31:4">e ou va vin rebati, O vyèj Israël la!</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 31:4">Yon lòt fwa, ou va reprann tanbouren ou yo.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 31:4">Ou va vin parèt nan dans a sila k ap fete yo.<verse eid="JER 31:4"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="JER 31:5"/>Yon lòt fwa, ou va <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">31:5 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="PSA 107:37">Sòm 107:37</ref></char></note>plante chan rezen yo sou kolin Samarie yo.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 31:5">Plantè yo va plante e yo va kontan ak fwi li.<verse eid="JER 31:5"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="JER 31:6"/>Paske jou a va rive lè gadyen</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 31:6">sou kolin Éphraïm yo va kriye fò:</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 31:6">‘Annou leve! Annou <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">31:6 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ISA 2:3">És 2:3</ref></char></note>monte Sion, kote SENYÈ a, Bondye nou an.’”<verse eid="JER 31:6"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="JER 31:7"/>Paske konsa pale SENYÈ a:</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 31:7">“Chante anlè ak kè kontan pou Jacob,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 31:7">e kriye fò pami chèf nasyon yo.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 31:7">Pwoklame, bay lwanj epi di:</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 31:7">‘O SENYÈ <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">31:7 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="PSA 28:9">Sòm 28:9</ref></char></note>sove pèp Ou a, retay Israël la!’<verse eid="JER 31:7"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="JER 31:8"/>Gade byen, Mwen ap mennen yo sòti nan peyi nò a,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 31:8">e Mwen va ranmase yo soti nan pati pi lwen latè a.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 31:8">Pami yo, avèg ak <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">31:8 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="EZK 34:16">Éz 34:16</ref></char></note>bwate yo,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 31:8">fanm lan ak pitit li,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 31:8">ak sila ki gen doulè tranche ansanm.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 31:8">Yon gran konpanyen, yo va retounen isit la.<verse eid="JER 31:8"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="JER 31:9"/>Ak dlo nan zye, yo va vini.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 31:9">Ak siplikasyon, Mwen va mennen yo;</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 31:9">Mwen va fè yo mache akote sous dlo yo,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 31:9">sou yon chemen dwat kote yo p ap <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">31:9 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ISA 63:13">És 63:13</ref></char></note>tonbe a;</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 31:9">paske Mwen se yon Papa pou Israël.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 31:9">Éphraïm se premye ne Mwen.”<verse eid="JER 31:9"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="JER 31:10"/>“Tande pawòl SENYÈ a, O nasyon yo!</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 31:10">E deklare nan peyi kot byen lwen yo,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 31:10">epi di: ‘Sila ki te gaye Israël la, va ranmase li,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 31:10">e kenbe li kon yon <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">31:10 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ISA 40:11">És 40:11</ref></char></note>bèje k ap gade bann mouton li.’<verse eid="JER 31:10"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="JER 31:11"/>Paske SENYÈ a te <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">31:11 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ISA 44:23">És 44:23</ref></char></note>rachte Jacob.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 31:11">Li te rachte l soti nan men a sila ki te pi fò pase l.<verse eid="JER 31:11"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="JER 31:12"/>Yo va vin kriye fò ak lajwa sou <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">31:12 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="EZK 17:23">Éz 17:23</ref></char></note>wotè a Sion yo,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 31:12">e yo va gen kè kontan nèt sou bonte SENYÈ a,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 31:12">sou sereyal ak diven tounèf, ak lwil</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 31:12">e sou jenn a bann mouton an ak twoupo a.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 31:12">Nanm yo va tankou yon jaden wouze.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 31:12">Yo p ap janm soufri tristès ankò.<verse eid="JER 31:12"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="JER 31:13"/>Epi vyèj la va rejwi nan dans lan,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 31:13">ansanm ak jennonm yo ak ansyen yo;</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 31:13">paske Mwen va <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">31:13 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ISA 61:3">És 61:3</ref></char></note>fè tristès yo vin tounen lajwa.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 31:13">Mwen va rekonfòte yo,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 31:13">e bay yo kè kontan pou ranplase tristès yo.<verse eid="JER 31:13"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="JER 31:14"/>Mwen va ranpli nanm a prèt yo ak abondans,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 31:14">e pèp Mwen an va <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">31:14 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="JER 50:19">Jr 50:19</ref></char></note>satisfè ak bonte Mwen,” deklare SENYÈ a.<verse eid="JER 31:14"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="JER 31:15"/>Konsa pale SENYÈ a,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 31:15">
    <note caller="+" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">31:15 </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="MAT 2:18">Mat 2:18</ref>
      </char>
    </note>“Yon vwa vin tande nan Rama, lamantasyon yo</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 31:15">ak gwo kriye dlo k ap sòti nan zye yo.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 31:15">Rachel ap kriye pou pitit li yo.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 31:15">Li refize rekonfòte pou pitit li yo,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 31:15">akoz yo pa la ankò.”<verse eid="JER 31:15"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="JER 31:16"/>Konsa pale SENYÈ a:</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 31:16">“Anpeche vwa ou k ap kriye,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 31:16">ak zye ou ap fè dlo;</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 31:16">paske <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">31:16 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="RUT 2:12">Rt 2:12</ref></char></note>travay ou va vin rekonpanse,” deklare SENYÈ a:</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 31:16">“Yo va retounen sòti nan peyi ènmi an.<verse eid="JER 31:16"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="JER 31:17"/>Gen <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">31:17 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="JER 29:11">Jr 29:11</ref></char></note>espwa davni pou ou,” deklare SENYÈ a:</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 31:17">“Pitit ou yo va retounen nan peyi pa yo.<verse eid="JER 31:17"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="JER 31:18"/>“Anverite, Mwen te tande Éphraïm ap kriye ak doulè:</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 31:18">‘Ou te fè m <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">31:18 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="JOB 5:17">Job 5:17</ref></char></note> sibi chatiman.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 31:18">Mwen te sibi chatiman</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 31:18">tankou yon jenn bèf ki poko fin donte.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 31:18">Mennen m pou m ka restore,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 31:18">paske se Ou menm ki SENYÈ a, Bondye mwen an.<verse eid="JER 31:18"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="JER 31:19"/>Paske lè m te retounen, mwen te <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">31:19 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="EZK 36:31">Éz 36:31</ref></char></note>repanti.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 31:19">Epi apre mwen te enstwi.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 31:19">Mwen te frape pwòp kwis mwen.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 31:19">Mwen te vin wont e twouble menm;</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 31:19">paske mwen te pote repwòch jenès mwen.’<verse eid="JER 31:19"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="JER 31:20"/>Èske <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">31:20 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="HOS 11:8">Os 11:8</ref></char></note>Éphraïm se fis Mwen?</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 31:20">Èske li se yon pitit ki fè M anpil plezi?</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 31:20">Anverite, Mwen te pale kont li souvan, men M sonje l toujou;</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 31:20">konsa kè M gen gwo dezi pou li.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 31:20">Anverite, Mwen va fè gras pou li”, deklare SENYÈ a.<verse eid="JER 31:20"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="JER 31:21"/>“Plase pou ou menm ransèyman chemen yo;</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 31:21">mete pou kont ou poto k ap dirije.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 31:21">Konsantre tout panse ou sou direksyon gran chemen an,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 31:21">wout sou sila ou te ale a.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 31:21">
    <note caller="+" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">31:21 </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="ISA 48:20">És 48:20</ref>
      </char>
    </note>Retounen, O vyèj Israël;</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 31:21">retounen kote vil sila yo, vil pa w yo.<verse eid="JER 31:21"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="JER 31:22"/>Pou konbyen de tan ou va fè ale retou,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 31:22">O <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">31:22 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="JER 3:6">Jr 3:6</ref></char></note>fi ki enfidèl?</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 31:22">Paske SENYÈ a te fè yon bagay nèf sou latè:</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 31:22">yon fanm va antoure yon nonm.”<verse eid="JER 31:22"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="JER 31:23"/>Konsa pale SENYÈ dèzame yo, Bondye Israël la: “Yon fwa ankò, yo va pale pawòl sa a nan peyi Juda ak nan vil li yo lè M fin restore bonè li: ‘Ke SENYÈ a beni ou, O <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">31:23 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ISA 1:26">És 1:26</ref></char></note>kay ladwati a, O mòn sen an!’ <verse eid="JER 31:23"/><verse number="24" style="v" sid="JER 31:24"/>Juda ak tout vil li yo va demere ansanm ladann, kiltivatè a ak sila k ap deplase ak bann mouton li yo. <verse eid="JER 31:24"/><verse number="25" style="v" sid="JER 31:25"/><note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">31:25 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="PSA 107:9">Sòm 107:9</ref></char></note>Paske Mwen rafrechi chak nanm ki fatige ak tout moun ki pèdi fòs yo.”<verse eid="JER 31:25"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="JER 31:26"/>Nan moman sa a, mwen te <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">31:26 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ZEC 4:1">Za 4:1</ref></char></note>reveye nan dòmi, e mwen te gade; dòmi an te tèlman dous pou mwen.<verse eid="JER 31:26"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="JER 31:27"/>“Gade byen, jou yo ap vini”, deklare SENYÈ a: “Lè M va <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">31:27 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="EZK 39:11">Éz 39:11</ref></char></note>plante lakay Israël ak lakay Juda avèk semans a lòm e avèk semans a bèt. <verse eid="JER 31:27"/><verse number="28" style="v" sid="JER 31:28"/>Konsi Mwen te veye sou yo pou rache yo, pou kraze yo, pou boulvèse yo, pou detwi yo, e pou mennen gwo dezas; se konsa mwen va veye sou yo pou <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">31:28 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="JER 24:6">Jr 24:6</ref></char></note>bati e pou plante,” deklare SENYÈ a. <verse eid="JER 31:28"/><verse number="29" style="v" sid="JER 31:29"/>“Nan jou sa yo, yo p ap di ankò:</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 31:29">
    <note caller="+" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">31:29 </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="LAM 5:7">Lam 5:7</ref>
      </char>
    </note> ‘Papa yo te manje rezen si,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 31:29">e dan timoun yo vin kanpe apik.’<verse eid="JER 31:29"/></para>
  <para style="m">
    <verse number="30" style="v" sid="JER 31:30"/>Men <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">31:30 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="DEU 24:16">Det 24:16</ref></char></note>chak moun va mouri akoz pwòp inikite pa li. Chak moun ki manje rezen si yo, se pwòp dan pa l k ap vin kanpe apik.<verse eid="JER 31:30"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" sid="JER 31:31"/>“Gade byen, jou yo ap vini”, deklare SENYÈ a: “lè Mwen va fè yon <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">31:31 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="JER 32:40">Jr 32:40</ref></char></note>akò tounèf avèk lakay Israël, e avèk lakay Juda, <verse eid="JER 31:31"/><verse number="32" style="v" sid="JER 31:32"/>pa tankou <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">31:32 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="EXO 19:5">Egz 19:5</ref></char></note>akò ke M te fè ak papa yo a nan jou ke M te pran yo pa lamen pou mennen yo sòti nan peyi Égypte la; akò Mwen ke yo te kraze a, malgre Mwen te yon mari pou yo a,” deklare SENYÈ a. <verse eid="JER 31:32"/><verse number="33" style="v" sid="JER 31:33"/>“Men sa se akò ke M va fè ak lakay Israël apre jou sa yo”, deklare SENYÈ a:</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 31:33">
    <note caller="+" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">31:33 </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="PSA 40:8">Sòm 40:8</ref>
      </char>
    </note>“Mwen va mete lalwa M anndan yo</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 31:33">e sou kè yo Mwen va ekri l;</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 31:33">epi Mwen va Bondye yo,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 31:33">e yo va pèp Mwen.<verse eid="JER 31:33"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="34" style="v" sid="JER 31:34"/>“Yo p ap ankò enstwi, chak moun vwazen pa li,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 31:34">e chak moun frè pa li pou di: ‘Konnen SENYÈ a,’</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 31:34">paske yo tout va konnen Mwen,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 31:34">soti nan pi piti nan yo jis rive nan pi gran nan yo a,”</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 31:34">deklare SENYÈ a,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 31:34">“paske Mwen va padone inikite yo,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 31:34">e <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">31:34 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ISA 43:25">És 43:25</ref></char></note>peche yo, Mwen p ap sonje yo ankò.”<verse eid="JER 31:34"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="35" style="v" sid="JER 31:35"/>SENYÈ a ki <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">31:35 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="GEN 1:14-18">Jen 1:14-18</ref></char></note>bay solèy kon limyè nan lajounen</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 31:35">e ki etabli lòd pou lalin ak zetwal yo pou bay limyè nan aswè,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 31:35">ki boulvèse lanmè a jis lanm li gwonde—</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 31:35">SENYÈ dèzame yo se non Li, k ap di:<verse eid="JER 31:35"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="36" style="v" sid="JER 31:36"/>
    <note caller="+" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">31:36 </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="AMO 9:8-9">Am 9:8-9</ref>
      </char>
    </note>“Si lòd sa a vin deregle devan M, deklare SENYÈ a:</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 31:36">“Alò desandan Israël yo osi va sispann</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 31:36">kon yon nasyon devan M, jis pou tout tan.”<verse eid="JER 31:36"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="37" style="v" sid="JER 31:37"/>Konsa pale SENYÈ a: “<note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">31:37 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ISA 40:12">És 40:12</ref></char></note>Si syèl anwo yo ka mezire,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 31:37">e fondasyon tè yo ka kontwole pa anba;</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 31:37">alò, Mwen va osi jete tout desandan Israël yo nèt</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 31:37">pou tout sa yo te fè yo,” deklare SENYÈ a.<verse eid="JER 31:37"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="38" style="v" sid="JER 31:38"/>“Gade byen, jou yo ap vini,” deklare SENYÈ a: “Lè <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">31:38 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="JER 30:18">Jr 30:18</ref></char></note>vil la va rebati pou SENYÈ a, soti nan fò Hananeel la jis rive nan Pòtay Kwen an. <verse eid="JER 31:38"/><verse number="39" style="v" sid="JER 31:39"/>Konsa <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">31:39 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ZEC 2:1">Za 2:1</ref></char></note>lign mezi a va kontinye ale tou dwat jis rive nan kolin Gareb, epi li va vire Goath. <verse eid="JER 31:39"/><verse number="40" style="v" sid="JER 31:40"/>“Konsa tout vale kadav yo ak sann yo, e tout chan yo jis rive nan flèv <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">31:40 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="2SA 15:23">II Sam 15:23</ref></char></note>Cédron nan, pou rive nan kwen Pòtay Cheval la, vè lès, va sen a SENYÈ a. Konsa, li p ap rache retire, ni jete ba ankò, jis pou tout tan.”<verse eid="JER 31:40"/></para>
  <chapter eid="JER 31"/>
  <chapter number="32" style="c" sid="JER 32"/>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="JER 32:1"/>Pawòl ki te vini a Jérémie soti nan SENYÈ a, nan <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">32:1 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="2KI 25:1-2">II Wa 25:1-2</ref></char></note>dizyèm ane Sédécias, wa Juda a, ki te nan dizuityèm ane a Nebucadnetsar. <verse eid="JER 32:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="JER 32:2"/>Alò, nan lè sa a, lame a wa Babylone nan t ap fè syèj sou Jérusalem, e Jérémie, pwofèt la, te fèmen nan <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">32:2 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="NEH 3:25">Né 3:25</ref></char></note>lakou gad ki te lakay wa a Juda a.<verse eid="JER 32:2"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="JER 32:3"/>Akoz Sédécias, wa Juda a te <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">32:3 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="2KI 6:32">II Wa 6:32</ref></char></note>mete li nan prizon e te di: “Poukisa ou pwofetize konsa pou di: ‘Konsa pale SENYÈ a: “Gade byen, Mwen prèt pou bay vil sa a nan men a Wa Babylone nan e li va pran l; <verse eid="JER 32:3"/><verse number="4" style="v" sid="JER 32:4"/>epi Sédécias, wa Juda a p ap chape nan men a Kaldeyen yo, men anverite, li va livre bay nan lamen wa Babylone nan. Li va <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">32:4 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="JER 39:5">Jr 39:5</ref></char></note>pale ak li fasafas e va wè li zye nan zye. <verse eid="JER 32:4"/><verse number="5" style="v" sid="JER 32:5"/>Epi konsa, li va pran Sédécias fè l rive Babylone e li va la jiskaske Mwen vizite li,” deklare SENYÈ a. “Malgre nou goumen kont Kaldeyen yo, nou <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">32:5 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="EZK 17:9-15">Éz 17:9-15</ref></char></note>p ap reyisi.”’”<verse eid="JER 32:5"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="JER 32:6"/>Jérémie te reponn: “Pawòl SENYÈ a te rive kote mwen e te di: <verse eid="JER 32:6"/><verse number="7" style="v" sid="JER 32:7"/>Gade byen, Hanameel, fis a Schallum nan, tonton ou, ap vin kote ou, e li va di: ‘Achte pou ou menm chan mwen ki nan Anathoth, paske se ou menm ki gen <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">32:7 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="LEV 25:25">Lev 25:25</ref></char></note>dwa redanmsyon pou achte l.’”<verse eid="JER 32:7"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="JER 32:8"/>“Konsa, Hanameel, fis a tonton m nan, te vin kote mwen nan <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">32:8 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="JER 32:2">Jr 32:2</ref></char></note>lakou gad la selon pawòl SENYÈ a. Li te di mwen: ‘Achte chan mwen an, souple, ki Anathoth, nan peyi Benjamin an; paske ou gen dwa posede l e redanmsyon an se pou ou. Achte l pou ou menm.’</para>
  <para style="p" vid="JER 32:8">“Epi mwen te konnen ke sa se te pawòl SENYÈ a. <verse eid="JER 32:8"/><verse number="9" style="v" sid="JER 32:9"/>Mwen te achte chan ki te Anathoth la nan men Hanameel, fis a tonton m nan e mwen te <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">32:9 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="GEN 23:16">Jen 23:16</ref></char></note>peze ajan bay pou li, disèt sik ajan. <verse eid="JER 32:9"/><verse number="10" style="v" sid="JER 32:10"/>Mwen te <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">32:10 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ISA 44:5">És 44:5</ref></char></note>siyen e mete so sou papye tè a, te rele temwen, e te peze ajan sou balans pou bay. <verse eid="JER 32:10"/><verse number="11" style="v" sid="JER 32:11"/>Alò, mwen te pran papye vant lan, ansanm ak kopi ki te fèmen anba so a, tout <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">32:11 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="LUK 2:27">Luc 2:27</ref></char></note>tèm ak kondisyon vant yo, ak kopi a ouvri. <verse eid="JER 32:11"/><verse number="12" style="v" sid="JER 32:12"/>Epi mwen te bay papye vant lan bay <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">32:12 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="JER 32:16">Jr 32:16</ref></char></note>Baruc, fis a Nérija a, fis a Macheséja a, devan zye a Hanameel, fis a tonton m nan, e devan zye a temwen ki te siyen papye vant lan, devan tout Jwif ki te chita nan lakou gad yo.<verse eid="JER 32:12"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="JER 32:13"/>“Epi mwen te kòmande Baruc nan prezans yo, e mwen te di: <verse eid="JER 32:13"/><verse number="14" style="v" sid="JER 32:14"/>Konsa pale SENYÈ dèzame yo, Bondye Israël a: ‘Pran papye tè sila yo, zak vant sa a ki fèmen ak so, ansanm ak zak vant sa a ki ouvri, e mete yo nan yon veso fèt ak ajil, pou yo ka dire pou anpil tan.’ <verse eid="JER 32:14"/><verse number="15" style="v" sid="JER 32:15"/>Paske konsa pale SENYÈ dèzame yo, Bondye Israël la: <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">32:15 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="JER 30:18">Jr 30:18</ref></char></note>‘Kay yo, jaden yo ak chan rezen yo ap vin achte ankò nan peyi sa a.’<verse eid="JER 32:15"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="JER 32:16"/>“Lè mwen te fin bay papye tè a a Baruc, fis a Nérija a; alò, mwen te <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">32:16 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="GEN 32:9-12">Jen 32:9-12</ref></char></note>priye a SENYÈ a, e te di:<verse eid="JER 32:16"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="mi">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="JER 32:17"/>‘A, SENYÈ Bondye! Gade byen, Ou te <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">32:17 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="2KI 19:15">II Wa 19:15</ref></char></note>fè syèl yo ak tè a ak gran pouvwa Ou, e ak men Ou lonje! Nanpwen anyen ki twò difisil pou Ou, <verse eid="JER 32:17"/><verse number="18" style="v" sid="JER 32:18"/>Ou menm ki montre lanmou dous a dè milye, men rekonpanse inikite a papa yo nan sen a jenerasyon k ap swiv yo. Gran e pwisan Bondye, SENYÈ dèzame yo se non Li. <verse eid="JER 32:18"/><verse number="19" style="v" sid="JER 32:19"/><note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">32:19 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ISA 9:6">És 9:6</ref></char></note>Gran an konsèy e pwisan an zèv, ki gen zye ki ouvri nan tout chemen a fis a lòm yo, ki rekonpanse tout moun selon chemen li, e selon fwi lan a zèv li; <verse eid="JER 32:19"/><verse number="20" style="v" sid="JER 32:20"/>ki te <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">32:20 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="PSA 78:43">Sòm 78:43</ref></char></note>opere sign ak mèvèy nan peyi Égypte la, jis rive nan jou sa a, an Israël e pami tout imanite; epi Ou te fè yon non pou Ou menm, jan sa ye jodi a. <verse eid="JER 32:20"/><verse number="21" style="v" sid="JER 32:21"/>Ou te <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">32:21 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="EXO 6:6">Egz 6:6</ref></char></note>mennen pèp Ou a, Israël sòti nan peyi Égypte ak sign ak mèvèy, avèk yon men pwisan, yon bra lonje e avèk gwo laperèz. <verse eid="JER 32:21"/><verse number="22" style="v" sid="JER 32:22"/>Epi Ou te bay yo peyi sa a, ke Ou te <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">32:22 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="EXO 3:8-17">Egz 3:8-17</ref></char></note>sèmante a papa zansèt yo pou bay yo, yon peyi k ap koule ak lèt ak siwo myèl. <verse eid="JER 32:22"/><verse number="23" style="v" sid="JER 32:23"/>Yo te antre e te pran posesyon li, men yo pa t obeyi a vwa Ou, ni <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">32:23 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="EZR 9:7">Esd 9:7</ref></char></note>mache nan lalwa Ou. Yo pa t fè anyen nan tout sa Ou te kòmande yo fè yo. Pou sa, Ou fè tout malè sa a rive sou yo.<verse eid="JER 32:23"/></para>
  <para style="pi1">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="JER 32:24"/>“Gade byen, men balkon tè syèj yo fin rive kote vil la pou pran l. Epi vil la fin bay nan men a Kaldeyen ki goumen kont li yo, akoz nepe, ak gwo grangou, avèk ensèk ak maladi ki devaste. Konsa, sa Ou te pale a fin rive. Gade byen, Ou wè l. <verse eid="JER 32:24"/><verse number="25" style="v" sid="JER 32:25"/>Ou te di mwen, O Senyè BONDYE, ‘Achte pou ou menm chan an ak lajan; rele temwen yo’ —malgre vil la fin bay nan men a Kaldeyen yo.”<verse eid="JER 32:25"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="JER 32:26"/>Konsa, pawòl SENYÈ a te rive a Jérémie. Li te di: <verse eid="JER 32:26"/><verse number="27" style="v" sid="JER 32:27"/>“Gade byen, Mwen se SENYÈ a, <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">32:27 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="NUM 16:22">Nonb 16:22</ref></char></note>Bondye a tout chè yo. Èske gen bagay twò difisil pou Mwen? <verse eid="JER 32:27"/><verse number="28" style="v" sid="JER 32:28"/>Pou sa, pale SENYÈ a: ‘Gade byen, Mwen prèt pou <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">32:28 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="2KI 25:11">II Wa 25:11</ref></char></note>bay vil sa a nan men a Kaldeyen yo, e nan men a Nebucadnetsar, wa Babylone nan, e li va pran l. <verse eid="JER 32:28"/><verse number="29" style="v" sid="JER 32:29"/>Kaldeyen k ap goumen kont vil sa yo va antre <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">32:29 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="2CH 36:19">II Kwo 36:19</ref></char></note>mete dife nan tout vil sa a, e brile li, ak kay kote te gen ofrann lansan a Baal sou twati yo, e yo te vide ofrann bwason yo a lòt dye pou fè M fache.’”<verse eid="JER 32:29"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" sid="JER 32:30"/>“Anverite, fis Israël yo ak fis Juda yo t ap fè sèlman sa ki <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">32:30 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="DEU 9:7-12">Det 9:7-12</ref></char></note>mal devan zye M soti nan jenès yo; paske fis a Israël yo te pwovoke M sèlman a lakòlè ak zèv men yo”, deklare SENYÈ a. <verse eid="JER 32:30"/><verse number="31" style="v" sid="JER 32:31"/>“Anverite, vil sa a te atire kòlè M ak raj Mwen an soti nan jou ke yo te bati li a, menm rive nan jou sa a, pou sa ta dwe <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">32:31 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="2KI 23:27">II Wa 23:27</ref></char></note>retire devan figi Mwen, <verse eid="JER 32:31"/><verse number="32" style="v" sid="JER 32:32"/>akoz tout mechanste ke fis Israël yo ak fis Juda yo te fè, pou yo ta pwovoke Mwen a lakòlè—yo menm, <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">32:32 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="EZR 9:7">Esd 9:7</ref></char></note>wa yo, chèf yo, prèt yo, pwofèt yo, mesye a Juda yo, ak tout moun ki rete Jérusalem yo. <verse eid="JER 32:32"/><verse number="33" style="v" sid="JER 32:33"/>Yo te vire do ban Mwen olye figi yo. Malgre <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">32:33 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="2CH 36:15-16">II Kwo 36:15-16</ref></char></note>enstriksyon ke Mwen te bay yo ankò e ankò, men yo pa t ap koute M pou resevwa lenstriksyon an. <verse eid="JER 32:33"/><verse number="34" style="v" sid="JER 32:34"/>Men yo te <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">32:34 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="2KI 21:1-7">II Wa 21:1-7</ref></char></note>mete bagay abominab pa yo nan kay ki rele pa non pa M nan, pou souye l. <verse eid="JER 32:34"/><verse number="35" style="v" sid="JER 32:35"/>Yo te bati <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">32:35 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="2CH 28:2">II Kwo 28:2</ref></char></note>wo plas a Baal ki nan vale Ben-Hinnom nan, pou fè fis yo pase nan dife a Moloc, bagay ke M pa t kòmande yo, ni sa pa t antre nan panse M ke yo ta dwe fè bagay abominab sa a, pou fè Juda peche.”<verse eid="JER 32:35"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="36" style="v" sid="JER 32:36"/>Alò, pou sa, konsa pale SENYÈ a, Bondye Israël la, konsènan vil sa a ke ou te di: “Li te <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">32:36 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="JER 32:24">Jr 32:24</ref></char></note>livre nan men a wa a Babylone nan pa nepe, pa gwo grangou, e pa gwo epidemi.” <verse eid="JER 32:36"/><verse number="37" style="v" sid="JER 32:37"/>“Gade byen, Mwen va ranmase yo soti nan tout peyi kote Mwen te pouse bourade yo, ale nan kòlè ak raj Mwen an, ak gran endiyasyon Mwen an; epi Mwen va mennen yo retounen nan plas sa a. Epi la, Mwen va <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">32:37 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="JER 23:6">Jr 23:6</ref></char></note>fè yo rete anpè. <verse eid="JER 32:37"/><verse number="38" style="v" sid="JER 32:38"/>Yo va <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">32:38 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="JER 24:7">Jr 24:7</ref></char></note>pèp Mwen e Mwen va Bondye yo; <verse eid="JER 32:38"/><verse number="39" style="v" sid="JER 32:39"/>Epi Mwen va <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">32:39 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="2CH 30:12">II Kwo 30:12</ref></char></note>bay yo yon sèl kè ak yon sèl chemen pou yo ka toujou gen lakrent Mwen pou pwòp byen pa yo e pou byen a pitit apre yo. <verse eid="JER 32:39"/><verse number="40" style="v" sid="JER 32:40"/>Mwen va fè yon akò k ap pou tout tan nèt avèk yo, ke Mwen <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">32:40 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="DEU 31:6">Det 31:6</ref></char></note>p ap vire kite yo, pou fè yo byen. Konsa Mwen va mete lakrent Mwen anndan kè yo pou yo pa vire kite Mwen. <verse eid="JER 32:40"/><verse number="41" style="v" sid="JER 32:41"/>Mwen va rejwi de yo pou fè byen pou yo. E Mwen va, ak fidelite, <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">32:41 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="HOS 2:19-20">Os 2:19-20</ref></char></note>plante yo nan peyi sa a, ak tout kè Mwen e ak tout nanm Mwen.”<verse eid="JER 32:41"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="42" style="v" sid="JER 32:42"/>Paske SENYÈ a di, <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">32:42 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="JER 31:28">Jr 31:28</ref></char></note>“Menm jan ke M te mennen tout gwo dezas sa a sou pèp sa a, konsa Mwen va mennen sou yo tout bonte ke Mwen ap pwomèt yo. <verse eid="JER 32:42"/><verse number="43" style="v" sid="JER 32:43"/><note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">32:43 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="JER 32:15-25">Jr 32:15-25</ref></char></note>Chan yo va vin achte nan peyi sa a kote ou te di: ‘Sa se yon dezolasyon, san moun ni bèt. Li livre nan men a Kaldeyen yo.’ <verse eid="JER 32:43"/><verse number="44" style="v" sid="JER 32:44"/>Mesye yo va achte chan yo pou lajan, <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">32:44 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="JER 32:10">Jr 32:10</ref></char></note>siyen, mete so sou papye tè yo, e rele temwen nan peyi Benjamin an, nan andwa a Jérusalem yo, nan vil a Juda yo, nan vil a peyi kolin yo, nan vil nan ba plèn yo, ak nan vil dezè yo; paske Mwen va ranvèse kaptivite yo,” deklare SENYÈ a.<verse eid="JER 32:44"/></para>
  <chapter eid="JER 32"/>
  <chapter number="33" style="c" sid="JER 33"/>
  <para style="nb">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="JER 33:1"/>Epi pawòl SENYÈ a te vin kote Jérémie yon dezyèm fwa, pandan li te toujou <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">33:1 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="JER 32:2-8">Jr 32:2-8</ref></char></note>nan prizon nan lakou gad la. Li te di: <verse eid="JER 33:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="JER 33:2"/>“Konsa pale <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">33:2 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="JER 51:19">Jr 51:19</ref></char></note>SENYÈ a ki te fè tè a, SENYÈ a ki te fòme li pou etabli li a—SENYÈ a se non Li. <verse eid="JER 33:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="JER 33:3"/><note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">33:3 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="PSA 50:15">Sòm 50:15</ref></char></note>‘Rele Mwen, Mwen va reponn ou e Mwen va di ou gwo bagay pwisan ke ou pa t janm konnen.’ <verse eid="JER 33:3"/><verse number="4" style="v" sid="JER 33:4"/>Paske konsa pale SENYÈ Israël la konsènan kay nan vil sa yo, e konsènan kay a wa a Juda k ap vin kraze pou fè yon ranpa kont <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">33:4 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="JER 32:24">Jr 32:24</ref></char></note>balkon tè syèj yo e kont nepe a, <verse eid="JER 33:4"/><verse number="5" style="v" sid="JER 33:5"/>‘pandan y ap vini pou goumen kont Kaldeyen yo e pou plen yo ak kadav moun ke M te masakre nan kòlè Mwen ak gwo kòlè Mwen yo, epi Mwen te <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">33:5 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ISA 8:17">És 8:17</ref></char></note>kache figi M kont vil sa a, akoz tout mechanste yo, <verse eid="JER 33:5"/><verse number="6" style="v" sid="JER 33:6"/>‘gade byen, Mwen va mennen kote li lasante ak gerizon, e Mwen va geri yo. Epi Mwen va montre yo <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">33:6 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ISA 66:12">És 66:12</ref></char></note>lapè ak verite an abondans. <verse eid="JER 33:6"/><verse number="7" style="v" sid="JER 33:7"/>Mwen va restore bonè a Juda ak bonè a Israël, e Mwen va <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">33:7 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ISA 1:26">És 1:26</ref></char></note>rebati yo jan yo te ye o kòmansman an. <verse eid="JER 33:7"/><verse number="8" style="v" sid="JER 33:8"/>Mwen va <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">33:8 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="PSA 51:2">Sòm 51:2</ref></char></note>netwaye yo de tout inikite avèk sila yo te peche kont Mwen yo. Mwen va padone tout inikite pa sila yo te peche kont Mwen yo e pa sila yo te fè transgresyon kont Mwen yo. <verse eid="JER 33:8"/><verse number="9" style="v" sid="JER 33:9"/>Vil sa va pou Mwen yon non lajwa, lwanj ak laglwa devan <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">33:9 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="JER 3:17-19">Jr 3:17-19</ref></char></note>tout nasyon latè yo, ki va tande afè tout byen ke M fè pou yo. Yo va gen lakrent e tranble akoz tout byen ak tout lapè ke M fè pou li.’”<verse eid="JER 33:9"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="JER 33:10"/>Konsa pale SENYÈ a: “Yon fwa ankò yo va tande nan plas sa a, sou sa ou w ap di a: ‘Sa se yon <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">33:10 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="JER 32:43">Jr 32:43</ref></char></note>dezè, san moun e san bèt, sa vle di nan vil a Juda yo ak ri Jérusalem yo, ki dezole, san moun e san pèsòn ni bèt pou rete ladann,’ <verse eid="JER 33:10"/><verse number="11" style="v" sid="JER 33:11"/>vwa lajwa a ak vwa kè kontan, vwa a yon jennonm ki fenk marye e vwa a jenn fi maryaj la, vwa a sila k ap di yo: ‘Bay remèsiman a SENYÈ dèzame yo, paske SENYÈ a bon, paske lanmou dous Li dire jis pou tout tan’; k ap pote yon ofrann remèsiman antre lakay SENYÈ a. Paske Mwen va restore bonè a peyi a jan li te ye oparavan an,” pale SENYÈ a.<verse eid="JER 33:11"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="JER 33:12"/>Konsa pale SENYÈ dèzame yo: “Va ankò gen nan plas sa a ki dezè, ki <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">33:12 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="JER 32:43">Jr 32:43</ref></char></note>san moun, ni bèt e nan tout vil li yo, yon kote pou bèje k ap okipe bann mouton yo rete. <verse eid="JER 33:12"/><verse number="13" style="v" sid="JER 33:13"/>Nan vil a peyi kolin yo, nan vil a ba plèn yo, nan vil a dezè yo, nan peyi Benjamin an, nan andwa a Jérusalem yo e nan vil a Juda yo, bann mouton yo va ankò <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">33:13 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="LEV 27:32">Lev 27:32</ref></char></note>pase anba men a sila k ap konte yo a,” pale SENYÈ a.<verse eid="JER 33:13"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="JER 33:14"/>“Gade byen, jou yo ap vini”, deklare SENYÈ a: “Lè Mwen va <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">33:14 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ISA 32:1-2">És 32:1-2</ref></char></note>akonpli bon pawòl la Mwen te pale konsènan lakay Israël la ak lakay Juda a.<verse eid="JER 33:14"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="JER 33:15"/>“Nan jou sa yo e nan lè sa a,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 33:15">Mwen va fè yon <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">33:15 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ISA 4:2">És 4:2</ref></char></note>Branch ladwati a David pete vin parèt.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 33:15">Li va egzekite <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">33:15 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ISA 4:2">És 4:2</ref></char></note>lajistis ak ladwati sou tout latè.<verse eid="JER 33:15"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="JER 33:16"/>Nan jou sa yo, Juda va vin sove</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 33:16">e Jérusalem va ansekirite.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 33:16">Men non pa sila li va rele a:</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 33:16">
    <note caller="+" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">33:16 </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="ISA 45:24-25">És 45:24-25</ref>
      </char>
    </note>SENYÈ a se ladwati nou.”<verse eid="JER 33:16"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="JER 33:17"/>“Paske, se konsa SENYÈ a pale: ‘David <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">33:17 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="2SA 7:16">II Sam 7:16</ref></char></note>p ap janm manke yon nonm pou chita sou twòn lakay Israël la. <verse eid="JER 33:17"/><verse number="18" style="v" sid="JER 33:18"/>Konsa, <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">33:18 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="NUM 3:5-10">Nonb 3:5-10</ref></char></note>prèt Levit yo p ap janm manke yon nonm devan Mwen, pou ofri ofrann brile, pou brile ofrann sereyal e pou prepare sakrifis yo tout tan san rete.’”<verse eid="JER 33:18"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="JER 33:19"/>Pawòl SENYÈ a te vin kote Jérémie e te di: <verse eid="JER 33:19"/><verse number="20" style="v" sid="JER 33:20"/>“Konsa pale SENYÈ a: ‘Si ou ka <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">33:20 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="PSA 89:37">Sòm 89:37</ref></char></note>kraze akò Mwen an pou jounen an, e akò Mwen an pou nwit lan, pou jou sa a ak nwit sa a pa rive nan lè deziye yo, <verse eid="JER 33:20"/><verse number="21" style="v" sid="JER 33:21"/>alò, konsa sèlman,<note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">33:21 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="2SA 23:5">II Sam 23:5</ref></char></note>akò Mwen an kab kraze avèk David, Sèvitè Mwen an, pou li pa gen yon fis pou renye sou twòn li an e avèk prèt Levit yo, pou ministè pa m yo. <verse eid="JER 33:21"/><verse number="22" style="v" sid="JER 33:22"/>Tankou lame syèl la pa ka konte e sab lanmè a pa ka mezire, konsa Mwen va miltipliye desandan a David yo, sèvitè Mwen an ak Levit ki sèvi Mwen yo.’”<verse eid="JER 33:22"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="JER 33:23"/>Epi pawòl SENYÈ a te vini a Jérémie. Li te di: <verse eid="JER 33:23"/><verse number="24" style="v" sid="JER 33:24"/>“Pa okipe bagay pèp sa a te pale, lè yo di: <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">33:24 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ISA 7:17">És 7:17</ref></char></note> ‘De fanmi ke SENYÈ a te chwazi yo, Li te fin rejte yo’? Konsa, yo meprize pèp Mwen an; yo pa menm ankò tankou yon nasyon nan zye yo. <verse eid="JER 33:24"/><verse number="25" style="v" sid="JER 33:25"/>Konsa pale SENYÈ a: ‘Si <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">33:25 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="GEN 8:22">Jen 8:22</ref></char></note> akò Mwen an pou lajounen ak lannwit pa kanpe, epi aranjman ki òdone nan syèl yo pa t fèt pa Mwen menm, <verse eid="JER 33:25"/><verse number="26" style="v" sid="JER 33:26"/>alò, sèl konsa, Mwen ta rejte desandan a Jacob yo ak David, sèvitè Mwen an e pa chwazi pami desandan li yo <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">33:26 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="GEN 49:10">Jen 49:10</ref></char></note>chèf sou desandan a Abraham, Issac ak Jacob yo. Men Mwen va restore bonè pa yo, e Mwen va genyen mizerikòd pou yo.’”<verse eid="JER 33:26"/></para>
  <chapter eid="JER 33"/>
  <chapter number="34" style="c" sid="JER 34"/>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="JER 34:1"/>Pawòl ki te vini a Jérémie soti nan SENYÈ a, lè Nebucadnetsar, wa Babylone nan, ak tout lame li a, ak <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">34:1 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="JER 1:15">Jr 1:15</ref></char></note>tout wayòm latè ki te anba pouvwa l yo ak tout pèp yo, t ap goumen kont Jérusalem e kont tout vil li yo, ki te di: <verse eid="JER 34:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="JER 34:2"/>Konsa pale SENYÈ Bondye Israël la: “Ale pale a Sédécias, wa Juda a, epi di li: ‘Konsa pale SENYÈ a: “Gade byen, <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">34:2 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="JER 21:10">Jr 21:10</ref></char></note>Mwen ap bay vil sa a pou antre nan men a wa Babylone nan, e li va brile li ak dife. <verse eid="JER 34:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="JER 34:3"/><note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">34:3 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="2KI 25:4-5">II Wa 25:4-5</ref></char></note>Ou p ap chape nan men l, paske anverite, ou va kapte e va livre nan men l. Konsa, zye ou va wè wa Babylone nan. Li va pale avèk ou fasafas. Se nan Babylone ou prale.”’”<verse eid="JER 34:3"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="JER 34:4"/>“Sepandan, tande pawòl SENYÈ a, O Sédécias, wa Juda a. Konsa pale SENYÈ a konsènan ou menm, ‘Ou p ap mouri pa nepe. <verse eid="JER 34:4"/><verse number="5" style="v" sid="JER 34:5"/>Ou va mouri anpè. Tankou epis yo te brile pou antèman papa zansèt ou yo, ansyen wa ki te avan ou yo, se konsa yo va brile epis pou ou. <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">34:5 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="JER 22:18">Jr 22:18</ref></char></note>Yo va fè kri dèy pou ou: “Anmwey mèt nou an”, paske se Mwen ki bay mo sa a’ deklare SENYÈ a.”<verse eid="JER 34:5"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="JER 34:6"/>Epi Jérémie te pale <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">34:6 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="1SA 3:18">I Sam 3:18</ref></char></note>tout pawòl sila yo a Sédécias, wa Juda nan Jérusalem <verse eid="JER 34:6"/><verse number="7" style="v" sid="JER 34:7"/>lè lame a wa Babylone nan te goumen kont Jérusalem e kont tout rès vil Juda yo; konsi, Lakis ak Azéka, paske se sèl yo ki te rete kon <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">34:7 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="1SA 3:18">I Sam 3:18</ref></char></note>vil fòtifye pami vil a Juda yo.<verse eid="JER 34:7"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="JER 34:8"/>Pawòl ki te vini a Jérémie soti nan SENYÈ a apre Wa Sédécias te fin <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">34:8 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="2KI 11:17">II Wa 11:17</ref></char></note>fè yon antant ak tout moun ki te Jérusalem yo pou libere yo: <verse eid="JER 34:8"/><verse number="9" style="v" sid="JER 34:9"/>pou chak moun ta bay libète a sèvitè li e chak moun a sèvant li, yon gason Ebre oswa yon fanm Ebre; <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">34:9 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="LEV 25:39">Lev 25:39</ref></char></note>pou pèsòn pa ta kenbe yo, yon Jwif frè parèy yo, nan esklavaj. <verse eid="JER 34:9"/><verse number="10" style="v" sid="JER 34:10"/>Epi tout <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">34:10 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="JER 26:10-16">Jr 26:10-16</ref></char></note>ofisye yo ak tout pèp la te obeyi a sila ki te antre nan akò a, ke chan moun ta libere sèvitè ak sèvant li yo, pou okenn moun pa ta kenbe yo an esklavaj. Yo te obeyi e te bay yo libète. <verse eid="JER 34:10"/><verse number="11" style="v" sid="JER 34:11"/>Men apre yo te fin vire, yo te reprann sèvitè ak sèvant ke yo te bay libète yo, e te fè yo soumèt ankò nan wòl sèvitè ak sèvant yo.<verse eid="JER 34:11"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="JER 34:12"/>Alò, pawòl SENYÈ a te vini a Jérémie soti nan SENYÈ a. Li te di: <verse eid="JER 34:12"/><verse number="13" style="v" sid="JER 34:13"/>Konsa pale SENYÈ Bondye Israël la: Mwen te <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">34:13 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="EXO 24:3-8">Egz 24:3-8</ref></char></note>fè yon akò ak papa zansèt nou yo nan jou ke M te mennen yo sòti nan peyi Égypte la, soti nan kay esklavaj la. Mwen te di: <verse eid="JER 34:13"/><verse number="14" style="v" sid="JER 34:14"/><note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">34:14 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="EXO 21:2">Egz 21:2</ref></char></note>Nan fen sèt ane yo, nou chak va libere frè Ebre ki te vann a li menm nan, e ki te sèvi nou pandan sis ane yo. Yo va voye li lib de nou menm. Men papa zansèt nou yo pa t obeyi Mwen, ni pa t panche zòrèy yo kote Mwen. <verse eid="JER 34:14"/><verse number="15" style="v" sid="JER 34:15"/>Malgre sa, nan tan sa a, nou te vire fè sa ki dwat nan zye M, chak moun te pwoklame libète a vwazen li e nou te fè yon akò avèk Mwen nan kay ki rele pa non Mwen an. <verse eid="JER 34:15"/><verse number="16" style="v" sid="JER 34:16"/>Men koulye a, nou te vire <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">34:16 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="EXO 20:7">Egz 20:7</ref></char></note>derespekte non Mwen, chak moun te reprann sèvitè ak sèvant ke nou te libere selon dezi yo, e nou te fè yo vin soumèt pou devni ankò sèvitè ak sèvant nou.<verse eid="JER 34:16"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="JER 34:17"/>Akoz sa, pale SENYÈ a: “Nou pa t obeyi Mwen nan pwoklame libète chak mesye a frè li, e chak mesye a vwazen li, gade byen, Mwen ap pwoklame libète pou nou,” deklare SENYÈ a: “pou nepe a, pou envazyon ensèk ak maladi, pou gwo grangou. Konsa, Mwen va fè nou vin yon <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">34:17 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="DEU 28:25">Det 28:25</ref></char></note>objè lèd e degoutan pou tout wayòm yo sou latè yo. <verse eid="JER 34:17"/><verse number="18" style="v" sid="JER 34:18"/>Mwen va bay mesye ki te transgrese akò Mwen yo, ki pa t akonpli pawòl a akò ke yo te fè devan M, lè yo te <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">34:18 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="GEN 15:10">Jen 15:10</ref></char></note>koupe jenn bèf lan an de mòso pou te pase nan mitan de pati li yo— <verse eid="JER 34:18"/><verse number="19" style="v" sid="JER 34:19"/>Ofisyèl a Juda yo, ak ofisyèl a Jérusalem yo, ofisye tribinal la e prèt ak tout pèp peyi ki te pase antre de pati jenn bèf la— <verse eid="JER 34:19"/><verse number="20" style="v" sid="JER 34:20"/>Mwen va livre yo nan men a lènmi yo, e nan men a sila k ap chache pran lavi yo. Epi kadav yo va sèvi kon manje pou zwazo syèl yo, ak bèt sovaj latè yo.<verse eid="JER 34:20"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="JER 34:21"/>“Sédécias, wa Juda a, ak ofisye pa l yo, Mwen va livre yo nan men lènmi pa yo, nan men a sila k ap chache lavi yo ak nan men a lame Babylone <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">34:21 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="JER 37:5-11">Jr 37:5-11</ref></char></note>ki te ale kite nou an. <verse eid="JER 34:21"/><verse number="22" style="v" sid="JER 34:22"/>Gade byen, Mwen va pase lòd”, deklare SENYÈ a: “Epi Mwen va mennen yo retounen nan vil sa a. Konsa, yo va goumen kont li, pran li e brile li ak dife, epi Mwen va fè lavil Juda yo vin yon <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">34:22 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="JER 4:7">Jr 4:7</ref></char></note>kote dezète san moun ki rete ladan yo.”<verse eid="JER 34:22"/></para>
  <chapter eid="JER 34"/>
  <chapter number="35" style="c" sid="JER 35"/>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="JER 35:1"/>Pawòl ki te rive a Jérémie soti nan SENYÈ a nan jou a <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">35:1 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="2KI 23:34-36">II Wa 23:34-36</ref></char></note>Jojakim yo, fis a Josias la, wa Juda a, te di: <verse eid="JER 35:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="JER 35:2"/>“Ale lakay <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">35:2 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="2KI 10:15">II Wa 10:15</ref></char></note>Rekabit yo. Pale avèk yo e mennen yo antre lakay SENYÈ a, nan youn nan chanm yo, e bay yo diven pou yo bwè.”<verse eid="JER 35:2"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="JER 35:3"/>Konsa, mwen te pran Jaazania, fis a Jérémie an, fis a Habazinia a, frè li yo, tout fis li yo ak tout kay Rekabit yo, <verse eid="JER 35:3"/><verse number="4" style="v" sid="JER 35:4"/>epi mwen te mennen yo lakay SENYÈ la, nan chanm a fis a Hanan yo, fis a Jigdalia a, nonm Bondye ki te toupre chanm ofisye yo, ki te anwo chanm Maaséja a, fis a Schallum nan, <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">35:4 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="1CH 9:18">I Kwo 9:18</ref></char></note>gadyen pòt la. <verse eid="JER 35:4"/><verse number="5" style="v" sid="JER 35:5"/>Epi mwen te plase devan mesye lakay Rekabit yo, krich plen ak diven ak tas, epi mwen te di yo: <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">35:5 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="AMO 2:12">Am 2:12</ref></char></note>“Bwè diven!”<verse eid="JER 35:5"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="JER 35:6"/>Men yo te di: “Nou p ap bwè diven, paske Jonadab, fis a Récab la, papa nou, te bannou lòd e te di: <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">35:6 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="LEV 10:9">Lev 10:9</ref></char></note> ‘Nou p ap bwè diven, ni nou menm, ni fis nou yo jis pou tout tan. <verse eid="JER 35:6"/><verse number="7" style="v" sid="JER 35:7"/>Nou pa pou bati kay e nou pa pou simen semans, ni plante chan rezen, ni achte youn; men se nan tant nou dwe viv pandan tout jou nou yo, pou nou kapab viv <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">35:7 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="EXO 20:12">Egz 20:12</ref></char></note>anpil jou nan peyi kote nou demere a.’ <verse eid="JER 35:7"/><verse number="8" style="v" sid="JER 35:8"/>Nou te <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">35:8 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="PRO 1:8-9">Pwov 1:8-9</ref></char></note>obeyi a vwa Jonadab, fis a Récab la, papa nou, nan tout sa li te kòmande nou, pou pa bwè diven pandan tout jou nou yo, nou menm, madanm nou, fis nou yo ak fi nou yo, <verse eid="JER 35:8"/><verse number="9" style="v" sid="JER 35:9"/>ni bati pou nou menm kay pou nou ta viv ladann. Nou <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">35:9 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="PSA 37:16">Sòm 37:16</ref></char></note>pa genyen chan rezen yo, ni chan kiltive, ni semans, <verse eid="JER 35:9"/><verse number="10" style="v" sid="JER 35:10"/>“Men se sèlman <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">35:10 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="JER 35:7">Jr 35:7</ref></char></note>nan tant nou te rete yo. Nou te obeyi e te fè selon tout sa ke Jonadab, papa nou, te kòmande nou yo. <verse eid="JER 35:10"/><verse number="11" style="v" sid="JER 35:11"/>Men lè Nebucadnetsar, wa Babylone nan, te monte kont peyi a, nou te di: ‘Vini! Annou ale Jérusalem akoz lakrent lame Kaldeyen yo ak lakrent lame Siryen yo. Konsa, nou va rete Jérusalem.’”<verse eid="JER 35:11"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="JER 35:12"/>Epi pawòl SENYÈ a te vini a Jérémie. Li te di: <verse eid="JER 35:12"/><verse number="13" style="v" sid="JER 35:13"/>“Konsa pale SENYÈ a, Bondye Israël la: ‘Ale di a mesye Juda yo, e a sila k ap viv Jérusalem yo: <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">35:13 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ISA 28:9-12">És 28:9-12</ref></char></note>“Èske nou p ap resevwa lenstriksyon pou koute pawòl Mwen yo?” deklare SENYÈ a. <verse eid="JER 35:13"/><verse number="14" style="v" sid="JER 35:14"/><note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">35:14 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="JER 35:6-10">Jr 35:6-10</ref></char></note>“Pawòl a Jonadab, fis a Récab la, ke li te kòmande fis li yo pou pa bwè diven yo, byen obsève. Pou sa, yo pa bwè diven jis rive jou sa a, paske yo te obeyi lòd papa yo. Men Mwen te pale ak nou ankò e ankò, e nou pa t koute Mwen. <verse eid="JER 35:14"/><verse number="15" style="v" sid="JER 35:15"/>Anplis, Mwen te voye a nou menm tout sèvitè Mwen yo, pwofèt yo. Mwen te voye yo ankò e ankò e yo te di: ‘Vire koulye a chak moun kite move chemen li, korije zèv mechan nou yo, e <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">35:15 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="DEU 2:14">Det 2:14</ref></char></note>pa kouri dèyè lòt dye yo pou adore yo. Konsa, nou va demere nan peyi ke M te ba a nou menm e a papa zansèt nou yo;’ men nou pa t enkline zòrèy nou, ni nou pa t koute Mwen. <verse eid="JER 35:15"/><verse number="16" style="v" sid="JER 35:16"/>Anverite, fis a Jonadab yo, fis a Récab la te <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">35:16 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="JER 35:14">Jr 35:14</ref></char></note>swiv lòd a papa yo ak sila li te kòmande yo, men pèp sa a pa t koute Mwen.”’<verse eid="JER 35:16"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="JER 35:17"/>“Akoz sa, pale SENYÈ a, Bondye dèzame yo, Bondye Israël la: ‘Gade byen, <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">35:17 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="JOS 23:15">Jos 23:15</ref></char></note>Mwen ap mennen sou Juda ak sou tout sila ki rete Jérusalem yo, tout dezas ke M te pwononse kont yo, akoz Mwen te pale ak yo, men yo pa t koute, e Mwen te rele yo, men yo pa t reponn.’”<verse eid="JER 35:17"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="JER 35:18"/>Epi Jérémie te di a lakay Rekabit yo: “Konsa pale SENYÈ dèzame yo, Bondye Israël la: ‘Akoz nou te <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">35:18 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="EXO 20:12">Egz 20:12</ref></char></note>obeyi lòd a Jonadab, papa nou an, nou te swiv tout lòd li yo, e te fè tout sa ke li te kòmande nou;’ <verse eid="JER 35:18"/><verse number="19" style="v" sid="JER 35:19"/>Pou sa, konsa pale SENYÈ dèzame yo, Bondye Israël la: ‘Jonadab, fis a Récab la, <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">35:19 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="1CH 2:55">I Kwo 2:55</ref></char></note>p ap manke yon nonm ki pou toujou kanpe devan M.’”<verse eid="JER 35:19"/></para>
  <chapter eid="JER 35"/>
  <chapter number="36" style="c" sid="JER 36"/>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="JER 36:1"/>Nan <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">36:1 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="2KI 24:1">II Wa 24:1</ref></char></note>katriyèm ane Jojakim, fis a Josias la, wa Juda a, pawòl sa a te rive a Jérémie soti nan SENYÈ a. Li te di: <verse eid="JER 36:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="JER 36:2"/>“Pran yon woulo e ekri sou li tout pawòl ke M te pale ou konsènan <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">36:2 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="JER 3:3-10">Jr 3:3-10</ref></char></note>Israël, konsènan Juda, e konsènan tout nasyon yo, depi nan jou ke M te premyèman pale ak ou a, depi nan jou a Josias yo, jis pou rive nan jou sa a. <verse eid="JER 36:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="JER 36:3"/>Petèt, lakay Juda va tande afè tout malè ke M gen lentansyon fè rive yo, jiskaske tout moun va detounen kite chemen mechan pa yo; epi konsa, Mwen kapab <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">36:3 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="JON 3:10">Jon 3:10</ref></char></note>padone inikite ak peche yo.”<verse eid="JER 36:3"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="JER 36:4"/>Konsa, Jérémie te rele Baruc, fis a Nérija a, e Baruc te ekri sou yon <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">36:4 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="JER 36:14">Jr 36:14</ref></char></note>woulo, selon dikte Jérémie, tout pawòl ke SENYÈ a te pale a li yo. <verse eid="JER 36:4"/><verse number="5" style="v" sid="JER 36:5"/>Jérémie te kòmande Baruc. Li te di: “Mwen <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">36:5 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="JER 32:2">Jr 32:2</ref></char></note>limite. Mwen p ap ka antre lakay SENYÈ a. <verse eid="JER 36:5"/><verse number="6" style="v" sid="JER 36:6"/>Akoz sa, ou va ale li depi nan woulo ke ou te ekri selon dikte mwen an, pawòl a SENYÈ a. Li l a pèp lakay SENYÈ a nan yon <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">36:6 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="JER 36:9">Jr 36:9</ref></char></note>jou jèn. Epi anplis, ou va li yo a tout pèp Juda a lè yo antre sòti nan vil yo. <verse eid="JER 36:6"/><verse number="7" style="v" sid="JER 36:7"/><note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">36:7 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="1KI 8:33">I Wa 8:33</ref></char></note>Petèt siplikasyon yo va vini devan SENYÈ a, e tout moun va detounen kite chemen mechan yo. Paske kòlè ak gwo mekontantman SENYÈ a pwononse kont pèp sa a, byen gran.”<verse eid="JER 36:7"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="JER 36:8"/>Baruc, fis a Nérija a, te fè selon tout sa ke Jérémie, pwofèt la, te kòmande li yo. Li te <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">36:8 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="JER 1:17">Jr 1:17</ref></char></note>li nan woulo pawòl a SENYÈ a, lakay SENYÈ a. <verse eid="JER 36:8"/><verse number="9" style="v" sid="JER 36:9"/>Alò, nan senkyèm ane Jojakim lan, fis a Josias, wa a Juda a, nan nevyèm mwa a, tout pèp Jérusalem nan ak tout moun ki te antre soti nan vil Jérusalem yo, te pwoklame yon <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">36:9 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="JDG 20:26">Jij 20:26</ref></char></note>jèn devan SENYÈ a. <verse eid="JER 36:9"/><verse number="10" style="v" sid="JER 36:10"/>Epi Baruc te li nan woulo pawòl a Jérémie yo lakay SENYÈ a nan <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">36:10 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="JER 35:4">Jr 35:4</ref></char></note>chanm a Guemaria, fis Schaphan an, grefye nan tribinal anwo a, nan antre Pòtay Nèf la lakay SENYÈ a, devan tout pèp la.<verse eid="JER 36:10"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="JER 36:11"/>Alò, lè <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">36:11 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="JER 36:13">Jr 36:13</ref></char></note>Michée, fis a Guemaria, fis a Schaphan an, te tande tout pawòl a SENYÈ a soti nan liv la, <verse eid="JER 36:11"/><verse number="12" style="v" sid="JER 36:12"/>Li te desann lakay wa a, nan chanm grefye a. Epi gade byen, tout ofisye yo te chita la—-<note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">36:12 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="JER 36:20">Jr 36:20</ref></char></note>Élischama, grefye a, Delaja, fis a Schemaeja a, Elnathan, fis a Acbor a, Guemaria, fis a Schaphan an e Sédécias, fis a Hanania a, ak tout lòt chèf yo. <verse eid="JER 36:12"/><verse number="13" style="v" sid="JER 36:13"/>Michée te <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">36:13 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="2KI 22:10">II Wa 22:10</ref></char></note>deklare a yo menm tout pawòl ke li te tande lè Baruc te li soti nan liv a pèp la. <verse eid="JER 36:13"/><verse number="14" style="v" sid="JER 36:14"/>Epi tout ofisye yo te voye Jehudi, fis a Nethania, fis a Schélémia, fis a Cuschi a, kote Baruc e te di: “Pran nan men ou woulo ke ou te li a pèp la e vini.”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="JER 36:14">Konsa Baruc, fis a Nethania, <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">36:14 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="JER 36:2">Jr 36:2</ref></char></note>te pran woulo a nan men l e te ale kote yo. <verse eid="JER 36:14"/><verse number="15" style="v" sid="JER 36:15"/>Yo te di li: “Chita la, souple e li li bannou.”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="JER 36:15">Konsa, Baruc te <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">36:15 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="JER 36:21">Jr 36:21</ref></char></note>li li bay yo.<verse eid="JER 36:15"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="JER 36:16"/>Lè yo te tande tout pawòl yo; ak gwo perèz, yo <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">36:16 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="JER 36:24">Jr 36:24</ref></char></note>te vire youn vè lòt e yo te di a Baruc: “Anverite, nou va bay rapò tout pawòl sa yo bay wa a.” <verse eid="JER 36:16"/><verse number="17" style="v" sid="JER 36:17"/>Epi yo te mande Baruc e te di: “Di nou, souple, <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">36:17 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="JHN 9:10-26">Jn 9:10-26</ref></char></note>kijan ou te ekri tout pawòl sa yo? Èske se te selon dikte pa li?”<verse eid="JER 36:17"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="JER 36:18"/>Epi Baruc te di yo: “Li te <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">36:18 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="JER 36:4">Jr 36:4</ref></char></note>dikte tout pawòl sa yo e mwen te ekri yo ak lank nan liv la.” <verse eid="JER 36:18"/><verse number="19" style="v" sid="JER 36:19"/>Alò, ofisye yo te di a Baruc: “Ale, <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">36:19 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="1KI 17:3">I Wa 17:3</ref> </char></note>kache tèt ou, ou menm ak Jérémie e pa kite pèsòn konnen kote nou ye.”<verse eid="JER 36:19"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="JER 36:20"/>Pou sa, yo te ale kote <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">36:20 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="JER 36:12">Jr 36:12</ref></char></note>wa a nan lakou a, men yo te depoze woulo a nan chanm Élischama, grefye a, e yo te fè rapò tout pawòl sa yo a wa a. <verse eid="JER 36:20"/><verse number="21" style="v" sid="JER 36:21"/>Epi wa a te voye Jehudi chache woulo a, e li te retire li nan chanm Élischama, grefye a. Epi Jehudi <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">36:21 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="2KI 22:10">II Wa 22:10</ref></char></note>te li li bay wa a ansanm ak tout ofisye ki te kanpe akote wa a. <verse eid="JER 36:21"/><verse number="22" style="v" sid="JER 36:22"/>Alò, wa a te chita nan <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">36:22 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="JDG 3:20">Jij 3:20</ref></char></note>kay sezon livè a, nan nevyèm mwa a, ak dife ki t ap brile nan recho la devan l. <verse eid="JER 36:22"/><verse number="23" style="v" sid="JER 36:23"/>Lè Jehudi te fin li twa oswa kat pòsyon, wa a te koupe li ak yon kouto e te <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">36:23 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="1KI 22:8-27">I Wa 22:8-27</ref></char></note>jete li nan dife ki te nan recho a, jiskaske woulo a te fin manje nèt nan dife ki te nan recho a. <verse eid="JER 36:23"/><verse number="24" style="v" sid="JER 36:24"/>Malgre sa, wa a ak tout sèvitè ki te tande pawòl sila yo <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">36:24 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="PSA 36:1">Sòm 36:1</ref></char></note>pa t pè, ni yo pa t chire rad yo. <verse eid="JER 36:24"/><verse number="25" style="v" sid="JER 36:25"/>Menmsi Elnathan, Delaja ak Guemaria te <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">36:25 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="GEN 37:22-27">Jen 37:22-27</ref></char></note>sipliye wa a pou l pa brile woulo a, li te refize koute yo. <verse eid="JER 36:25"/><verse number="26" style="v" sid="JER 36:26"/>Epi wa a te kòmande Jerachmeel, fis a wa a, Seraja, fis Azriel e Schélémia, fis a Abdeel, pou <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">36:26 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="1KI 19:1-14">I Wa 19:1-14</ref></char></note>sezi Baruc, grefye a ak Jérémie, pwofèt la, men SENYÈ a te kache yo.<verse eid="JER 36:26"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="JER 36:27"/>Epi pawòl SENYÈ a te rive kote Jérémie lè wa a te fin <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">36:27 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="JER 36:23">Jr 36:23</ref></char></note>brile woulo pawòl ke Baruc te ekri selon dikte Jérémie a e te di: <verse eid="JER 36:27"/><verse number="28" style="v" sid="JER 36:28"/><note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">36:28 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="JER 36:4-23">Jr 36:4-23</ref></char></note>“Pran ankò yon lòt woulo e ekri sou li tout menm pawòl ki te ekri sou premye woulo ke Jojakim, wa Juda a, te brile a. <verse eid="JER 36:28"/><verse number="29" style="v" sid="JER 36:29"/>Epi konsènan Jojakim, wa Juda a, ou va di: ‘Konsa pale SENYÈ a: “Ou te brile woulo sa a e ou te di: <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">36:29 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ISA 29:21">És 29:21</ref></char></note> ‘Poukisa ou te ekri sou li ke wa Babylone nan va, anverite, vin detwi peyi sa a e va fè ni lòm ni bèt vin disparèt ladann?’”’ <verse eid="JER 36:29"/><verse number="30" style="v" sid="JER 36:30"/>‘Akoz sa’, pale SENYÈ a konsènan Jojakim wa Juda a: “Li <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">36:30 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="2KI 24:12-15">II Wa 24:12-15</ref></char></note>p ap gen okenn moun ki pou chita sou twòn David la, e kadav li va jete deyò nan chalè lajounen ak gwo fredi lannwit. <verse eid="JER 36:30"/><verse number="31" style="v" sid="JER 36:31"/>Anplis, Mwen va <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">36:31 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="JER 23:34">Jr 23:34</ref></char></note>pini li ak desandan li yo ak sèvitè pou inikite yo, e Mwen va mennen sou yo ak sila k ap viv Jérusalem yo, ak mesye Juda yo, tout malè ke M te deklare a yo menm yo—men yo pa t koute.”’”<verse eid="JER 36:31"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" sid="JER 36:32"/>Epi Jérémie te pran yon lòt woulo. Li te bay li a Baruc, fis a Nérija a, grefye a, epi li te <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">36:32 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="EXO 4:15-16">Egz 4:15-16</ref></char></note>ekri sou li selon dikte a Jérémie, tout pawòl a liv ke Jojakim, wa Juda a te brile nan dife a; epi anpil pawòl parèy a yo te ajoute nan yo.<verse eid="JER 36:32"/></para>
  <chapter eid="JER 36"/>
  <chapter number="37" style="c" sid="JER 37"/>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="JER 37:1"/>Alò, <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">37:1 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="2KI 24:17">II Wa 24:17</ref></char></note>Sédécias, fis a Josias ke Nebucadnetsar, wa Babylone nan, te fè wa nan peyi Juda a, te renye kon wa nan plas a Jeconia, fis a Jojakim nan. <verse eid="JER 37:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="JER 37:2"/>Men <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">37:2 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="2KI 24:19-20">II Wa 24:19-20</ref></char></note>ni li menm, ni sèvitè li yo, ni pèp peyi a te koute pawòl SENYÈ a, ke li te pale pa Jérémie, pwofèt la.<verse eid="JER 37:2"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="JER 37:3"/>Men wa Sédécias te voye Jucal, fis a Schélémia a, ak Sophonie, fis a Maaséja a, kote Jérémie, pwofèt la. Li te di: <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">37:3 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="1KI 13:6">I Wa 13:6</ref></char></note>“Souple, priye a SENYÈ a, Bondye nou an, pou nou menm.”<verse eid="JER 37:3"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="JER 37:4"/>Alò, Jérémie te toujou ap sikile pami pèp la, paske yo potko <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">37:4 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="1KI 13:6">I Wa 13:6</ref></char></note>mete l nan prizon. <verse eid="JER 37:4"/><verse number="5" style="v" sid="JER 37:5"/>Antretan, <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">37:5 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="1KI 13:6">I Wa 13:6</ref></char></note>lame Farawon an te gen tan sòti an Égypte; epi lè Kaldeyen ki t ap fè syèj Jérusalem yo te tande rapò de yo a, yo te leve syèj la sou Jérusalem.<verse eid="JER 37:5"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="JER 37:6"/>Alò, pawòl SENYÈ a te vin kote Jérémie, pwofèt la e te di: <verse eid="JER 37:6"/><verse number="7" style="v" sid="JER 37:7"/>“Konsa pale SENYÈ a, Bondye Israël la: ‘Konsa nou va di a wa Juda a, ki te voye nou kote m pou mande konsèy la: “Gade byen, lame <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">37:7 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ISA 30:1-3">És 30:1-3</ref></char></note>Farawon ki te vin parèt pou bannou asistans lan va retounen nan pwòp peyi li an Égypte. <verse eid="JER 37:7"/><verse number="8" style="v" sid="JER 37:8"/>Kaldeyen yo va <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">37:8 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="JER 34:22">Jr 34:22</ref></char></note>retounen pou goumen kont vil sa a, e yo va pran l pou brile l ak dife.”’”<verse eid="JER 37:8"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="JER 37:9"/>“Konsa pale SENYÈ a: ‘Pa <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">37:9 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="JER 29:8">Jr 29:8</ref></char></note>twonpe tèt nou pou nou di: “Kaldeyen yo vrèman va kite nou”, paske vrèman, yo pa prale. <verse eid="JER 37:9"/><verse number="10" style="v" sid="JER 37:10"/>Paske <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">37:10 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="LEV 26:36-38">Lev 26:36-38</ref></char></note>menm si nou te bat tout lame Kaldeyen ki t ap goumen kont nou yo e te gen sèlman moun blese ki rete pami yo, yo chak nan tant pa yo, yo ta soulve e brile vil sa a ak dife.’”<verse eid="JER 37:10"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="JER 37:11"/>Alò, li te vin rive ke lè lame Kaldeyen an te leve syèj Jérusalem nan akoz lame Farawon an, <verse eid="JER 37:11"/><verse number="12" style="v" sid="JER 37:12"/>ke Jérémie te sòti deyò Jérusalem pou ale nan peyi Benjamin pou l ta ka <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">37:12 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="JER 32:8">Jr 32:8</ref></char></note>pran posesyon a yon teren pami pèp la. <verse eid="JER 37:12"/><verse number="13" style="v" sid="JER 37:13"/>Pandan li te kote Pòtay Benjamin an, yon kapitèn nan gad la ki te rele Jireija, fis a Schélémia, fis a Hanania a, te la. Li te <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">37:13 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="JER 18:18">Jr 18:18</ref></char></note>arete Jérémie, pwofèt la e te di: “W ap vin apiye Kaldeyen yo!”<verse eid="JER 37:13"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="JER 37:14"/>Men Jérémie te di: <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">37:14 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="PSA 27:12">Sòm 27:12</ref></char></note>“Manti! Mwen p ap apiye Kaldeyen yo”. Men li te refize koute li. Konsa, Jireija te arete Jérémie e te mennen li kote ofisye yo. <verse eid="JER 37:14"/><verse number="15" style="v" sid="JER 37:15"/>Ofisye yo te fache ak Jérémie. Yo te bat li e yo te <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">37:15 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="GEN 39:20">Jen 39:20</ref></char></note>anprizone li lakay Jonathan, grefye a, ke yo te sèvi pou prizon.<verse eid="JER 37:15"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="JER 37:16"/>Lè Jérémie te fin rive nan <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">37:16 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="JER 38:6">Jr 38:6</ref></char></note>donjon an, sa vle di, yon chanm prizon, li te rete la pandan anpil jou. <verse eid="JER 37:16"/><verse number="17" style="v" sid="JER 37:17"/>Konsa, Wa Sédécias te voye retire li. Nan palè li, wa a an sekrè te kesyone l. Li te mande: “Èske gen yon pawòl ki sòti nan SENYÈ a?”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="JER 37:17">Jérémie te reponn: “Wi, genyen!” Epi li te di: “Ou va <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">37:17 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="JER 21:7">Jr 21:7</ref></char></note>livre nan men wa a Babylone nan.”<verse eid="JER 37:17"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="JER 37:18"/>Anplis, Jérémie te di a Wa Sédécias: “Nan ki fason mwen te peche kont ou an, oswa kont sèvitè ou yo, oswa kont pèp sa a, pou ou te mete m nan prizon an? <verse eid="JER 37:18"/><verse number="19" style="v" sid="JER 37:19"/>Alò, ki kote pwofèt ki te pwofetize devan ou ye, ki t ap di: <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">37:19 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="JER 27:14">Jr 27:14</ref></char></note> ‘Wa Babylone nan p ap parèt kont nou, ni kont peyi sa a’? <verse eid="JER 37:19"/><verse number="20" style="v" sid="JER 37:20"/>Men koulye a, souple, koute mwen, O mèt mwen, e wa mwen: souple, kite <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">37:20 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="JER 36:7">Jr 36:7</ref></char></note>demann mwen an rive devan ou, e pa fè m retounen lakay Jonathan, grefye a, pou mwen pa mouri la.”<verse eid="JER 37:20"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="JER 37:21"/>Epi Wa Sédécias te pase lòd e yo te pase lòd selon Jérémie pou l rete nan <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">37:21 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="JER 32:2">Jr 32:2</ref></char></note>lakou kay gad la. Yo te bay li yon pen ki sòti nan lari boulanje a, jiskaske tout pen nan vil la te fini nèt. Konsa, Jérémie te rete nan lakou kay gad la.<verse eid="JER 37:21"/></para>
  <chapter eid="JER 37"/>
  <chapter number="38" style="c" sid="JER 38"/>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="JER 38:1"/>Alò, Schephathia, fis a Mattan e Guedalia, fis a <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">38:1 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="JER 21:1">Jr 21:1</ref></char></note>Paschhur, fis a Malkija, te tande pawòl ke Jérémie t ap pale a tout pèp la e t ap di: <verse eid="JER 38:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="JER 38:2"/>“Konsa pale SENYÈ a: <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">38:2 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="JER 21:9">Jr 21:9</ref></char></note> ‘Sila ki rete nan vil sa a va mouri ak nepe, ak gwo grangou e ak gwo ravaj ak maladi, men sila ki sòti pou rive anvè Kaldeyen yo va viv. Li va gen pwòp lavi l kon pwòp benefis pa l e li va viv.’ <verse eid="JER 38:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="JER 38:3"/>Konsa pale SENYÈ a: ‘Vil sa a va anverite <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">38:3 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="JER 21:10">Jr 21:10</ref></char></note>livre nan men a wa Babylone nan, e li va kaptire l.’”<verse eid="JER 38:3"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="JER 38:4"/>Epi ofisye yo te di a wa a: “Koulye a, kite nonm sa a vin mete a lanmò, konsi l ap <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">38:4 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="EXO 5:4">Egz 5:4</ref></char></note>dekouraje mesye lagè ki rete nan vil sa a, ak tout pèp la lè l pale pawòl konsa avèk yo; paske nonm sa a p ap chache byen a pèp sa a, men malè yo.”<verse eid="JER 38:4"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="JER 38:5"/>Konsa, Wa Sédécias te di: “Gade byen, li nan men nou; paske wa a <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">38:5 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="2SA 3:39">II Sam 3:39</ref></char></note>p ap ka fè anyen kont nou menm.”<verse eid="JER 38:5"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="JER 38:6"/>Epi yo te pran Jérémie e te jete li nan <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">38:6 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="JER 37:16-21">Jr 37:16-21</ref></char></note>sitèn Malkija, fis a wa a, ki te nan lakou kay gad la. Yo te fè Jérémie desann ladann ak kòd yo. Alò, nan sitèn nan, pa t gen dlo, men sèlman labou, e Jérémie te fonse antre nan labou a.<verse eid="JER 38:6"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="JER 38:7"/>Men <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">38:7 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="JER 39:16">Jr 39:16</ref></char></note>Ébed Mélec, Etyopyen an, yon enik, pandan li te lakay wa a, te tande ke yo te mete Jérémie nan sitèn nan. Alò, wa a te chita nan antre Pòtay Benjamin an. <verse eid="JER 38:7"/><verse number="8" style="v" sid="JER 38:8"/>Epi Ébed-Mélec te sòti nan palè a wa a pou pale ak wa a. Li te di: <verse eid="JER 38:8"/><verse number="9" style="v" sid="JER 38:9"/>“Mèt mwen, wa a, mesye sila yo te aji ak mechanste nan tout sa yo te fè Jérémie yo, pwofèt ki te jete nan sitèn nan. Li va mouri kote li ye akoz gwo grangou, paske <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">38:9 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="JER 37:21">Jr 37:21</ref></char></note>nanpwen pen ankò nan vil la.”<verse eid="JER 38:9"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="JER 38:10"/>Epi wa a te kòmande Ébed-Mélec, Etyopyen an, e te di l: “Pran trant mesye soti isit la anba otorite ou e mennen fè monte Jérémie soti nan sitèn nan avan l mouri.” <verse eid="JER 38:10"/><verse number="11" style="v" sid="JER 38:11"/>Konsa, Ébed-Mélec te pran mesye yo anba otorite li, e te antre nan palè a wa a, yon kote pi ba depo a. Li te pran la vye rad epwize ak vye twal epwize e te fè yo desann sou kòd, antre nan pwi a, rive kote Jérémie. <verse eid="JER 38:11"/><verse number="12" style="v" sid="JER 38:12"/>Konsa, Ébed-Mélec, Etyopyen an te di a Jérémie: “Alò, mete rad epwize sa yo ak twal yo anba bra ou, anba kòd yo.”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="JER 38:12">Jérémie te fè l. <verse eid="JER 38:12"/><verse number="13" style="v" sid="JER 38:13"/>Konsa, yo te rale Jérémie fè l monte leve sòti nan sitèn nan, e Jérémie te rete nan <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">38:13 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="NEH 3:25">Né 3:25</ref></char></note>lakou kay gad la.<verse eid="JER 38:13"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="JER 38:14"/>Epi Wa Sédécias te voye fè yo mennen Jérémie, pwofèt la, kote li nan twazyèm antre ki nan kay SENYÈ a; epi wa a te di a Jérémie: “Mwen ap <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">38:14 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="1SA 3:17-18">I Sam 3:17-18</ref></char></note>mande ou yon bagay. Pa kache anyen devan m.”<verse eid="JER 38:14"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="JER 38:15"/>Epi Jérémie te reponn a Sédécias: <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">38:15 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="LUK 22:67-68">Luc 22:67-68</ref></char></note>“Si mwen pale ou, anverite, ou p ap mete m a lanmò? Anplis, menm si m bay ou konsèy, ou p ap koute mwen.”<verse eid="JER 38:15"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="JER 38:16"/>Men wa Sédécias te sèmante a Jérémie an sekrè. Li te di: “Kon SENYÈ a viv la, ki te fè <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">38:16 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="NUM 16:22">Nonb 16:22</ref></char></note>nanm nou, anverite, mwen p ap mete ou a lanmò, ni mwen p ap livre ou nan men a mesye sila k ap chache pran lavi ou yo.”<verse eid="JER 38:16"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="JER 38:17"/>Epi Jérémie te di a Sédécias: “Konsa pale SENYÈ a, Bondye dèzame yo, Bondye Israël la; ‘Si, anverite, ou va <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">38:17 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="2KI 24:12">II Wa 24:12</ref></char></note>sòti deyò pou vin soumèt a wa Babylone nan; alò, ou va viv, vil sa a p ap brile ak dife e ou menm ak lakay ou va viv. <verse eid="JER 38:17"/><verse number="18" style="v" sid="JER 38:18"/>Men si ou pa ale deyò kote ofisye a wa Babylone yo, alò, vil sa va livre nan men a Kaldeyen yo. Epi yo va brile li ak dife e ou menm, ou p ap chape nan men yo.’”<verse eid="JER 38:18"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="JER 38:19"/>Epi Wa Sédécias te reponn a Jérémie: “Mwen <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">38:19 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ISA 51:12">És 51:12</ref></char></note>krent Jwif ki te janbe kote Kaldeyen yo, paske yo kapab petèt livre mwen nan men yo, e yo va abize m.”<verse eid="JER 38:19"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="JER 38:20"/>Men Jérémie te di: “Yo p ap livre ou nan men yo. Souple, <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">38:20 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="2CH 20:20">II Kwo 20:20</ref></char></note>obeyi SENYÈ a nan sa ke m ap di ou a, pou l ka ale byen pou ou, e pou ou kapab viv. <verse eid="JER 38:20"/><verse number="21" style="v" sid="JER 38:21"/>Men si ou kontinye refize ale deyò, men pawòl ke SENYÈ a te montre m nan: <verse eid="JER 38:21"/><verse number="22" style="v" sid="JER 38:22"/>Alò, gade byen, tout fanm ki te rete nan palè wa Juda a, va mennen deyò kote prens a wa Babylone yo; epi fanm sa yo va di:</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 38:22">“Pwòch zanmi ou yo te egare ou</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 38:22">e te vin domine sou ou;</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 38:22">pandan pye ou te kole nan labou a,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 38:22">yo te vire kite ou.”<verse eid="JER 38:22"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="JER 38:23"/>Anplis, yo va mennen deyò tout madanm ou yo ak fis ou yo devan Kaldeyen yo, e ou <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">38:23 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="JER 38:18">Jr 38:18</ref></char></note>menm, ou p ap ka chape nan men yo, men ou va sezi pa men wa Babylone nan e vil sa a va brile ak dife.’”<verse eid="JER 38:23"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="JER 38:24"/>Epi Sédécias te di a Jérémie: “Pa kite pèsòn konnen pawòl sa yo, e ou p ap mouri. <verse eid="JER 38:24"/><verse number="25" style="v" sid="JER 38:25"/>Men si ofisye yo tande ke mwen te pale avèk ou, te vin rekonèt ou e di ou: ‘Pale a nou sa ke ou te di wa a, sa ke wa a te di ou a; pa kache sa devan nou e nou p ap mete ou a lanmò,’ <verse eid="JER 38:25"/><verse number="26" style="v" sid="JER 38:26"/>alò, ou gen pou di yo: ‘Mwen t ap <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">38:26 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="JER 37:20">Jr 37:20</ref></char></note>prezante siplikasyon mwen yo devan wa a, pou l pa fè m retounen lakay Jonathan pou m pa ta mouri la.’”<verse eid="JER 38:26"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="JER 38:27"/>Epi tout ofisye yo te vin kote Jérémie pou te kesyone li. Pou sa, li te reponn yo selon pawòl ke wa a te kòmande yo. Epi yo te sispann pale ak li, konsi konvèsasyon an pa t koute pa okenn moun.<verse eid="JER 38:27"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="JER 38:28"/>Konsa, Jérémie te <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">38:28 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="PSA 23:4">Sòm 23:4</ref></char></note>rete nan lakou kay gad yo jis rive jou ke Jérusalem te vin kaptire a.<verse eid="JER 38:28"/></para>
  <chapter eid="JER 38"/>
  <chapter number="39" style="c" sid="JER 39"/>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="JER 39:1"/>Alò, lè Jérusalem te vin kaptire <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">39:1 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="2KI 25:1-2">II Wa 25:1-2</ref></char></note>nan nevyèm ane pouvwa Sédécias la, wa Juda a, nan dizyèm mwa, Nebucadnetsar, wa Babylone nan, ak tout lame li te rive kote Jérusalem pou te fè syèj sou li. <verse eid="JER 39:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="JER 39:2"/>Nan onzyèm ane pouvwa Sédécias la, nan katriyèm mwa a, nan nevyèm jou nan mwa a, yon <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">39:2 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="2KI 25:4">II Wa 25:4</ref></char></note>brèch te fèt nan miray vil la. <verse eid="JER 39:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="JER 39:3"/>Epi tout <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">39:3 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="JER 38:17">Jr 38:17</ref></char></note>ofisye a wa Babylone yo te antre ladann. Yo te chita bò kote Pòtay Mitan a; Nergal-Scharetser, Samgar-Nebu, Sarsekim, chèf a enik yo, Nergal-Sar-Ezer, chèf a majisyen yo, ak tout rès chèf a wa Babylon yo. <verse eid="JER 39:3"/><verse number="4" style="v" sid="JER 39:4"/>Lè Sédécias, wa Juda a, ak tout mesye lagè yo te wè yo, yo te sove ale e te ale deyò lavil la nan nwit lan pa chemen jaden a wa a, atravè <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">39:4 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="2CH 32:5">II Kwo 32:5</ref></char></note>pòtay antre de miray yo. Konsa li te sove ale vè dezè a.<verse eid="JER 39:4"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="JER 39:5"/>Men lame Kaldeyen yo te kouri dèyè yo e te kaptire Sédécias nan plèn Jéricho. Yo te sezi li e te mennen li monte kote Nebucadnetsar, wa Babylone nan, nan <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">39:5 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="2KI 23:33">II Wa 23:33</ref></char></note>Ribla, nan peyi a Hamath la. Epi li te pwononse jijman sou li. <verse eid="JER 39:5"/><verse number="6" style="v" sid="JER 39:6"/>Epi wa Babylone nan te touye fis a Sédécias yo, devan zye l nan Ribla. Anplis, wa Babylone nan te touye tout mesye enpòtan Juda yo. <verse eid="JER 39:6"/><verse number="7" style="v" sid="JER 39:7"/>Epi li te <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">39:7 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="2KI 25:7">II Wa 25:7</ref></char></note>avegle zye Sédécias, e te mare li ak braslè an bwonz pou mennen l Babylone.<verse eid="JER 39:7"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="JER 39:8"/>Anplis, Kaldeyen yo te <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">39:8 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="2KI 25:9">II Wa 25:9</ref></char></note>brile palè wa a ak dife avèk kay a pèp la, e yo te kraze miray Jérusalem yo. <verse eid="JER 39:8"/><verse number="9" style="v" sid="JER 39:9"/>Tout rès pèp la ki te rete lavil la, ak <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">39:9 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="JER 38:19">Jr 38:19</ref></char></note>sila ki te abandone vil la, ki te janbe kote li, e retay ki te rete nan vil la, Nebuzaradan, chèf gad yo, te pote yo an egzil Babylone. <verse eid="JER 39:9"/><verse number="10" style="v" sid="JER 39:10"/>Men kèk nan sila ki te <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">39:10 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="2KI 25:12">II Wa 25:12</ref></char></note>malere nèt yo, ki pa t gen anyen yo, Nebuzaradan, chèf gad yo, te kite yo dèyè nan peyi Juda, e te bay yo chan rezen ak chan pou yo kiltive nan menm lè sa a.<verse eid="JER 39:10"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="JER 39:11"/>Alò, Nebucadnetsar, wa Babylone nan, te pase lòd de <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">39:11 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="JOB 5:15-16">Job 5:15-16</ref></char></note>Jérémie pa Nebuzaradan, chèf gad la. Li te di: <verse eid="JER 39:11"/><verse number="12" style="v" sid="JER 39:12"/>“Pran l e okipe l, <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">39:12 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="PSA 105:14-15">Sòm 105:14-15</ref></char></note>pa fè l anyen ki mal, men pito aji avèk li jan li mande ou a.”<verse eid="JER 39:12"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="JER 39:13"/>Konsa Nebuzaradan, chèf gad yo, te voye pawòl pa Nebuschazban, chèf a enik yo, Nergal-Scharetser, chèf a majisyen yo, ak tout chèf a wa Babylone yo, <verse eid="JER 39:13"/><verse number="14" style="v" sid="JER 39:14"/>te voye <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">39:14 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="JER 38:28">Jr 38:28</ref></char></note>retire Jérémie sòti nan lakou kay gad la e te fè Guedalia, fis Achikam, fis a Schaphan nan, responsab pou mennen li lakay li. Konsa, li te rete pami pèp li a.<verse eid="JER 39:14"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="JER 39:15"/>Alò, pawòl SENYÈ a te rive kote Jérémie pandan li te <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">39:15 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="JER 38:28">Jr 38:28</ref></char></note>anprizone nan lakou kay gad la. Li te di: <verse eid="JER 39:15"/><verse number="16" style="v" sid="JER 39:16"/>“Ale pale ak Ébed-Mélec, Etyopyen an pou di l: ‘Konsa pale SENYÈ dèzame yo, Bondye Israël la: “Gade byen, Mwen prèt pou mennen pawòl Mwen yo sou vil sa a pou dezas e pa pou pwosperite. Konsa <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">39:16 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="PSA 91:8">Sòm 91:8</ref></char></note>yo va fèt devan ou nan jou sa a. <verse eid="JER 39:16"/><verse number="17" style="v" sid="JER 39:17"/>Men mwen va <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">39:17 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="PSA 41:1-2">Sòm 41:1-2</ref></char></note>delivre ou nan jou sa a,” deklare SENYÈ a: “Ou p ap livre nan men a moun sa yo ke ou pè yo. <verse eid="JER 39:17"/><verse number="18" style="v" sid="JER 39:18"/>Paske anverite, Mwen va sove ou e ou p ap tonbe anba nepe, men ou va gen lavi ou kon benefis, akoz ou te <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">39:18 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="PSA 34:22">Sòm 34:22</ref></char></note>mete konfyans nan Mwen,” deklare SENYÈ a.’”<verse eid="JER 39:18"/></para>
  <chapter eid="JER 39"/>
  <chapter number="40" style="c" sid="JER 40"/>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="JER 40:1"/>Pawòl ki te rive kote Jérémie soti nan SENYÈ a lè Nebuzaradan, chèf a gad yo te lage li nan Rama, lè l te pran li mare ak <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">40:1 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ACT 12:6-7">Trav 12:6-7</ref></char></note>chenn pami tout egzil a Jérusalem ak Juda ki t ap egzile Babylone yo. <verse eid="JER 40:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="JER 40:2"/>Alò, chèf a gad yo te pran Jérémie. Yo te di l: <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">40:2 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="LEV 26:14-38">Lev 26:14-38</ref></char></note>“SENYÈ a, Bondye ou a, te pwomèt gwo malè sa a kont plas sa a; <verse eid="JER 40:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="JER 40:3"/>epi SENYÈ a te fè l vin parèt. Li te fè l jan sa te pwomèt la. Akoz nou te <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">40:3 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="JER 50:7">Jr 50:7</ref></char></note>peche kont SENYÈ a e pa t koute vwa li, pou sa, bagay sa a te vin rive nou. <verse eid="JER 40:3"/><verse number="4" style="v" sid="JER 40:4"/>Men koulye a, gade byen, mwen ap <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">40:4 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="JER 39:11-12">Jr 39:11-12</ref></char></note>libere ou jodi a de chenn ki nan men ou yo. Si ou ta prefere vini ak mwen Babylone, vini e mwen va okipe ou. Men si ou prefere pa ale, ou pa oblije. Gade, tout peyi a devan ou. Ale kote li sanble bon e an règ pou ou ta ale.” <verse eid="JER 40:4"/><verse number="5" style="v" sid="JER 40:5"/>Kòm Jérémie poko t ap tounen, li te di: “Ale konsa, alò, retounen a Guedalia, fis a Achikam, fis a Schaphan an, ke wa Babylone nan te <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">40:5 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="2KI 25:23">II Wa 25:23</ref></char></note>apwente sou vil a Juda yo, e rete la pami pèp la; oswa, ale kote li sanble pi bon pou ou ta ale.”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="JER 40:5">Konsa chèf gad la te bay li yon pòsyon manje ak yon kado e te kite li ale. <verse eid="JER 40:5"/><verse number="6" style="v" sid="JER 40:6"/>Konsa, Jérémie te ale <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">40:6 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="JDG 20:1">Jij 20:1</ref></char></note>Mitspa, kote Guedalia, fis a Achikam e te rete avè l pami moun ki te rete nan peyi a.<verse eid="JER 40:6"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="JER 40:7"/>Alò, tout chèf lame ki te nan chan an ak mesye pa yo te tande ke wa Babylone nan te chwazi Guedalia, fis a Achikam nan, sou peyi a, e ke li te mete li an chaj de tout mesye yo, fanm ak timoun yo, sila ki te <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">40:7 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="JER 39:10">Jr 39:10</ref></char></note>pi malere pase tout moun nan peyi a, ki pa t oblije fè egzil Babylone yo. <verse eid="JER 40:7"/><verse number="8" style="v" sid="JER 40:8"/>Pou sa, yo te vin kote Guedalia Mitspa, ansanm ak Ismaël, fis a Nethania a ak Jochanan e Jonathan, fis a Karéach, Seraja, fis a Thanhumeth, fis a Éphaï, <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">40:8 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="2SA 23:28-29">II Sam 23:28-29</ref></char></note>Nethopha ak Jezania, fis a Maacatite, yo menm ak mesye pa yo. <verse eid="JER 40:8"/><verse number="9" style="v" sid="JER 40:9"/>Epi Guedalia, fis a Achikam, fis a Schaphan an, te <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">40:9 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="1SA 20:16-17">I Sam 20:16-17</ref></char></note>sèmante a yo menm e a mesye pa yo. Li te di: “Pa pe sèvi Kaldeyen yo. Rete nan peyi a pou sèvi wa Babylone nan, pou sa ale byen pou nou. <verse eid="JER 40:9"/><verse number="10" style="v" sid="JER 40:10"/>Alò, pou mwen menm, gade byen, mwen ap rete Mitspa, pou m ka <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">40:10 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="DEU 1:38">Det 1:38</ref></char></note>kanpe pou nou devan Kaldeyen ki va vini kote nou yo. Men pou nou, ranmase divin nan, fwi sezon ete a ak lwil epi mete yo nan veso pou konsève yo e rete nan vil nou ke nou fin okipe yo.”<verse eid="JER 40:10"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="JER 40:11"/>Menm jan an osi, tout Jwif ki te <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">40:11 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="NUM 22:1">Nonb 22:1</ref></char></note>Moab yo, pami fis a Ammon nan Edom yo e ki te nan tout lòt peyi yo, te tande ke wa Babylone nan te kite yon retay pou Juda, e ke li te deziyen sou yo, Guedalia, fis a Achakim, fis a Schaphan an. <verse eid="JER 40:11"/><verse number="12" style="v" sid="JER 40:12"/>Epi tout Jwif yo te <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">40:12 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="JER 43:5">Jr 43:5</ref></char></note> retounen soti tout kote ke yo te chase ale yo pou te vini nan peyi Juda, kote Guedalia nan Mitspa e te ranmase diven nan gran sezon an an gran kantite.<verse eid="JER 40:12"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="JER 40:13"/>Alò, Jochanan, fis a Karéach ak tout chèf lame ki te nan chan an te vini a Guedalia nan Mitspa. <verse eid="JER 40:13"/><verse number="14" style="v" sid="JER 40:14"/>Yo te di a li menm: “Èske ou konnen ke Baalis, wa a fis <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">40:14 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="1SA 11:1-3">I Sam 11:1-3</ref></char></note>Ammon yo te voye Ismaël, fis a Nethania a, pou pran lavi ou?”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="JER 40:14">Men Guedalia, fis a Achakim nan, pa t kwè yo.<verse eid="JER 40:14"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="JER 40:15"/>Epi Jochanan, fis a Karéach la, te pale an sekrè ak Guedalia nan Mitspa. Li te di: <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">40:15 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="1SA 26:8">I Sam 26:8</ref></char></note>“Kite mwen ale touye Ismaël, fis a Nethania a e pèsòn p ap konnen! Poukisa li ta dwe pran lavi ou pou tout Jwif ki rasanble a ou menm yo ta gaye, e pou retay Juda a ta peri?”<verse eid="JER 40:15"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="JER 40:16"/>Men Guedalia, fis a Achikam nan, te di a Jochanan, fis a Karéach la: <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">40:16 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="MAT 10:16">Mat 10:16</ref></char></note>“Pa fè bagay sa a, paske ou ap di yon manti sou Ismaël.”<verse eid="JER 40:16"/></para>
  <chapter eid="JER 40"/>
  <chapter number="41" style="c" sid="JER 41"/>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="JER 41:1"/>Nan setyèm mwa Ismaël, fis a Nethania a, fis a Élischama, manm fanmi wayal la, e youn nan chèf prensipal a wa yo, ansanm ak dis mesye te rive Mitspa, kote Guedalia, fis a Achikam nan. Pandan yo <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">41:1 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="PSA 41:9">Sòm 41:9</ref></char></note>t ap manje pen ansanm nan Mitspa, <verse eid="JER 41:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="JER 41:2"/>Ismaël, fis a Nethania a ak dis mesye ki t ap manje avèk li yo te leve e te <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">41:2 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="2SA 3:27">II Sam 3:27</ref></char></note>touye Guedalia, fis a Achikam, fis a Schaphan an, ak nepe, e te mete a lanmò sila ke wa Babylone nan te apwente sou peyi a. <verse eid="JER 41:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="JER 41:3"/>Ismaël, anplis, te frape touye tout Jwif ki te avè l yo, sa vle di ak Guedalia nan Mitspa, menm ak Kaldeyen ki te la yo, mesye lagè yo.<verse eid="JER 41:3"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="JER 41:4"/>Alò, li te rive nan pwochen jou apre lanmò a Guedalia a, lè pèsòn pa t konnen anyen sou sa, <verse eid="JER 41:4"/><verse number="5" style="v" sid="JER 41:5"/>ke katre-ven gason te sòti Sichem, Silo ak Samarie avèk <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">41:5 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="LEV 19:27">Lev 19:27</ref></char></note>bab yo retire nèt ak razwa, ak rad yo chire e kò yo blese, ofrann ak lansan nan men yo pou pote lakay SENYÈ a. <verse eid="JER 41:5"/><verse number="6" style="v" sid="JER 41:6"/>Epi Ismaël, fis a Nethania a, te sòti Mitspa pou rankontre yo e li t ap <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">41:6 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="2SA 3:16">II Sam 3:16</ref></char></note>kriye nan wout la; epi pandan li te rankontre yo, li te di yo: “Vin kote Guedalia, fis a Akchikam nan!” <verse eid="JER 41:6"/><verse number="7" style="v" sid="JER 41:7"/>Malgre sa, li te rive ke lè yo te antre anndan vil la, Ismaël, fis a Nethania a ak mesye ki te avè l yo te <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">41:7 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="PSA 55:23">Sòm 55:23</ref></char></note>touye yo e jete yo nan sitèn nan. <verse eid="JER 41:7"/><verse number="8" style="v" sid="JER 41:8"/>Men dis nan mesye ki te pami yo te di a Ismaël: “pa mete nou a lanmò, paske nou gen depo ble, lòj, lwil ansanm ak siwo myèl ki kache nan chan an.”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="JER 41:8">Akoz sa, li te ralanti e pa t mete yo ansanm ak zanmi parèy yo a lanmò. <verse eid="JER 41:8"/><verse number="9" style="v" sid="JER 41:9"/>Alò, konsènan sitèn kote Ismaël te jete tout kadav a mesye ke li te touye akoz Guedalia yo, se te sila ki te bati pa wa Asa a pou Baescha, wa Israël la; Ismaël, fis a Nethania a, te plen li ak moun mouri yo.<verse eid="JER 41:9"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="JER 41:10"/>Epi Ismaël te pran an kaptif tout <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">41:10 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="JER 40:11-12">Jr 40:11-12</ref></char></note>retay ki te Mitspa yo, fi a wa yo ak tout moun ki te rete Mitspa yo, ke Nebuzaradan, chèf gad la, te mete sou chaj Guedalia, fis a Achikam nan. Konsa Ismaël, fis a Nethania a, te pran yo an kaptif e te pati pou janbe kote fis a Ammon yo.<verse eid="JER 41:10"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="JER 41:11"/>Men Jochanan, fis a Karéach la ak tout <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">41:11 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="JER 40:11-12">Jr 40:11-12</ref></char></note>chèf a fòs lame ki te avèk li yo te tande afè mechanste ke Ismaël, fis a Nethania a, te fè a. <verse eid="JER 41:11"/><verse number="12" style="v" sid="JER 41:12"/>Pou sa, yo te pran tout mesye yo pou te ale goumen ak Ismaël, fis a Nethania. Yo te rankontre li akote <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">41:12 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="2SA 2:13">II Sam 2:13</ref></char></note>gwo basen ki Gabaon an. <verse eid="JER 41:12"/><verse number="13" style="v" sid="JER 41:13"/>Alò, la menm tout moun ki te avèk Ismaël yo te wè Jochanan, fis a Karéach la ak chèf lame an ki te avèk li yo. Konsa, yo te kontan. <verse eid="JER 41:13"/><verse number="14" style="v" sid="JER 41:14"/>Tout moun ke Ismaël te pran kaptif soti Mitspa yo te vire retounen pou te ale kote Jochanan, fis a Karéach la. <verse eid="JER 41:14"/><verse number="15" style="v" sid="JER 41:15"/>Men Ismaël, fis a Nethania a, te <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">41:15 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="1SA 30:17">I Sam 30:17</ref></char></note>chape nan men Jochanan ak uit mesye pou te rive kote fis a Ammon yo.<verse eid="JER 41:15"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="JER 41:16"/>Epi Jochanan, fis a Karéach la ak tout chèf fòs lame ki te avèk li yo te pran soti Mitspa <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">41:16 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="JER 42:8">Jr 42:8</ref></char></note>tout sila nan retay moun ke li te reprann soti nan men Ismaël, fis a Nethania a, lè l te fin touye Guedalia, fis a Achikam nan— ki vle di mesye ki te sòlda yo, fanm yo, timoun yo, ak enik ke li te mennen retounen soti Gabaon an. <verse eid="JER 41:16"/><verse number="17" style="v" sid="JER 41:17"/>Yo te ale rete Gerut-Kimham, toupre Bethléem, pou yo te ka ale an Égypte, <verse eid="JER 41:17"/><verse number="18" style="v" sid="JER 41:18"/>akoz Kaldeyen yo. Yo te krent yo, akoz Ismaël, fis a Nethania a, te touye Guedalia, fis a Achikam nan, ke <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">41:18 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="JER 40:5">Jr 40:5</ref></char></note>wa Babylone nan te apwente sou peyi a.<verse eid="JER 41:18"/></para>
  <chapter eid="JER 41"/>
  <chapter number="42" style="c" sid="JER 42"/>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="JER 42:1"/>Epi tout gran chèf lame yo, <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">42:1 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="JER 40:8-13">Jr 40:8-13</ref></char></note>Jochanan, fis a Karéach la, Jezania, fis Hosée a, ak tout pèp la, ni piti, ni gran, te pwoche. <verse eid="JER 42:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="JER 42:2"/>Yo te di a Jérémie, pwofèt la: “Souple, kite demand nou an vin parèt devan ou, e priye SENYÈ a, Bondye ou a, pou nou; pou tout retay sa a, akoz nou se sèlman <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">42:2 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="LEV 26:22">Lev 26:22</ref></char></note>kèk grenn ki rete pami anpil nan nou, jan zye ou konn wè nou an, <verse eid="JER 42:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="JER 42:3"/>pou SENYÈ a, Bondye ou a, kapab pale nou de <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">42:3 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="PSA 86:11">Sòm 86:11</ref></char></note>chemen ke nou ta dwe pran an, ak bagay ke nou ta dwe fè a.”<verse eid="JER 42:3"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="JER 42:4"/>Jérémie, pwofèt la, te di yo: “Mwen te tande. Gade byen, mwen va priye a SENYÈ a, Bondye nou an, an akò ak tout pawòl nou yo, epi mwen va di nou tout mesaj avèk sila SENYÈ a va reponn nou yo. Mwen p ap kenbe dèyè menm yon mo pou nou.”<verse eid="JER 42:4"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="JER 42:5"/>Epi yo te di a Jérémie: “Ke <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">42:5 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="GEN 31:50">Jen 31:50</ref></char></note>SENYÈ a kapab yon vrè fidèl temwen kont nou si nou pa aji selon tout mesaj ke SENYÈ a, Bondye ou a, va voye pou nou. <verse eid="JER 42:5"/><verse number="6" style="v" sid="JER 42:6"/>Kit li dous, kit li pa dous, nou va <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">42:6 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="EXO 24:7">Egz 24:7</ref></char></note>koute vwa SENYÈ a sou sila nou ap voye ou a, pou sa kapab ale byen pou nou lè nou koute vwa SENYÈ a, Bondye nou an.”<verse eid="JER 42:6"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="JER 42:7"/>Alò, lè <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">42:7 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="PSA 27:14">Sòm 27:14</ref></char></note>sèt jou fin ekoule, pawòl SENYÈ a te rive kote Jérémie. <verse eid="JER 42:7"/><verse number="8" style="v" sid="JER 42:8"/>Konsa, li te rele Jochanan, fis a Karéach la, ak tout chèf lame ki te avè l yo ak tout pèp la, ni piti, ni gran. <verse eid="JER 42:8"/><verse number="9" style="v" sid="JER 42:9"/>Epi li te di yo: “Konsa <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">42:9 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="2KI 19:4">II Wa 19:4</ref></char></note>pale SENYÈ a, Bondye Israël la, a Sila nou te voye mwen pou prezante sa nou t ap mande devan L lan: <verse eid="JER 42:9"/><verse number="10" style="v" sid="JER 42:10"/>‘Si, anverite, nou va rete nan peyi sa a; alò, Mwen va <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">42:10 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="JER 24:6">Jr 24:6</ref></char></note>ankouraje nou, Mwen p ap detwi nou, Mwen va plante nou e Mwen p ap dechouke nou, men Mwen va ralanti sou malè avèk sila Mwen te aflije nou an. <verse eid="JER 42:10"/><verse number="11" style="v" sid="JER 42:11"/>Pa pè wa Babylone nan, k ap bannou perèz nan moman sa a. Pa pè l, paske <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">42:11 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="NUM 14:9">Nonb 14:9</ref></char></note>Mwen avèk nou pou sove nou e pou delivre nou de men l. <verse eid="JER 42:11"/><verse number="12" style="v" sid="JER 42:12"/>Anplis, Mwen va montre nou konpasyon, <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">42:12 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="NEH 1:11">Né 1:11</ref></char></note>pou l ta genyen konpasyon anvè nou e restore nou sou pwòp tè pa nou.<verse eid="JER 42:12"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="JER 42:13"/>“‘Men si nou ap di: <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">42:13 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="EXO 5:2">Egz 5:2</ref></char></note>“Nou p ap rete nan peyi sa a,” pou nou pa ta koute vwa a SENYÈ a, Bondye nou an, <verse eid="JER 42:13"/><verse number="14" style="v" sid="JER 42:14"/>epi di: “Non, men nou va ale <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">42:14 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ISA 31:1">És 31:1</ref></char></note>nan peyi Égypte, kote nou p ap tande afè lagè, ni son a twonpèt, ni grangou pou pen, e se la nou va rete;”’ <verse eid="JER 42:14"/><verse number="15" style="v" sid="JER 42:15"/>alò, nan ka sa a, koute pawòl SENYÈ a, O retay a Juda yo. Konsa pale SENYÈ dèzame yo, Bondye Israël la: ‘Si nou, anverite, fikse vizaj nou pou antre an <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">42:15 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="DEU 17:16">Det 17:16</ref></char></note>Égypte e pou antre nan rezidans lan, <verse eid="JER 42:15"/><verse number="16" style="v" sid="JER 42:16"/>alò, <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">42:16 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="JER 44:13-27">Jr 44:13-27</ref></char></note>nepe ke nou vrèman krent lan va rive pran nou nan peyi Égypte la, epi grangou ke nou krent anpil la, va swiv nou de prè an Égypte, e la nou va mouri. <verse eid="JER 42:16"/><verse number="17" style="v" sid="JER 42:17"/>Konsa, tout mesye ki fikse panse yo pou rive la an Égypte, pou fè rezidans yo la, va mouri pa nepe, pa grangou, ak gwo epidemi. Yo <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">42:17 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="JER 44:14-28">Jr 44:14-28</ref></char></note>p ap gen retay, ni ki chape sou gwo malè ke Mwen va fè vini sou yo a.’ <verse eid="JER 42:17"/><verse number="18" style="v" sid="JER 42:18"/>Paske konsa pale SENYÈ dèzame yo, Bondye Israël la: ‘Tankou gwo kòlè ak mekontantman Mwen te vide sou sila ki rete Jérusalem yo, se konsa gwo kòlè Mwen va vide sou nou lè nou antre an Égypte. Konsa, nou va devni yon <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">42:18 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="DEU 29:21">Det 29:21</ref></char></note>madichon, yon objè degoutan, yon anatèm e yon repwòch. Ni nou p ap janm wè kote sila a ankò.’<verse eid="JER 42:18"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="JER 42:19"/>“SENYÈ a te pale ak nou, O retay Juda a: ‘Pa <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">42:19 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="DEU 17:16">Det 17:16</ref></char></note>ale antre an Égypte!’ Nou ta dwe konprann byen klè ke jodi a, mwen te avèti nou sa. <verse eid="JER 42:19"/><verse number="20" style="v" sid="JER 42:20"/>Paske nou <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">42:20 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="JER 43:2">Jr 43:2</ref></char></note>twonpe pwòp tèt nou. Se nou menm ki te voye mwen kote SENYÈ a, Bondye nou an. Nou te di: “Priye pou nou a SENYÈ a, Bondye nou an, epi nenpòt sa SENYÈ a, Bondye nou an di, fè nou konnen e nou va fè l.” <verse eid="JER 42:20"/><verse number="21" style="v" sid="JER 42:21"/>Konsa, jodi a, mwen te di nou, men nou <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">42:21 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="JER 43:4">Jr 43:4</ref></char></note>pa t obeyi SENYÈ a, Bondye nou an, menm nan tout sa Li te voye mwen pale nou yo. <verse eid="JER 42:21"/><verse number="22" style="v" sid="JER 42:22"/>Akoz sa, nou ta koulye a dwe konprann ke nou va <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">42:22 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="HOS 9:6">Os 9:6</ref></char></note>mouri pa nepe, pa grangou e pa gwo epidemi, nan plas kote nou vle ale rezide a.<verse eid="JER 42:22"/></para>
  <chapter eid="JER 42"/>
  <chapter number="43" style="c" sid="JER 43"/>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="JER 43:1"/>Men la menm Jérémie, ke SENYÈ a, Bondye pa yo a, te voye a, te <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">43:1 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="JER 26:8">Jr 26:8</ref></char></note>fin pale tout pèp la tout pawòl a SENYÈ a, Bondye pa yo a—— sa vle di, tout pawòl sila yo—— <verse eid="JER 43:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="JER 43:2"/>Azaria, <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">43:2 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="JER 42:1">Jr 42:1</ref></char></note>fis a Hosée, Jochanan, fis a Karéach e tout mesye ògeye yo te di a Jérémie: “W ap bay manti! SENYÈ a, Bondye nou an, pa t voye ou di: ‘Nou p ap antre Égypte pou rete la’. <verse eid="JER 43:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="JER 43:3"/>Men se <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">43:3 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="JER 36:4-32">Jr 36:4-32</ref></char></note>Baruc, fis a Nérija a, k ap chofe ou kont nou pou livre nou nan men a Kaldeyen yo, pou yo menm mete nou a lanmò, oswa ekzile nou Babylone.”<verse eid="JER 43:3"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="JER 43:4"/>Pou sa, Jochanan, fis a Karéach la ak tout chèf lame yo, ak tout pèp la, pa t obeyi vwa SENYÈ a pou rete nan peyi Juda a. <verse eid="JER 43:4"/><verse number="5" style="v" sid="JER 43:5"/>Men Jochanan, fis a Karéach la, ak tout chèf lame yo te pran <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">43:5 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="JER 40:11">Jr 40:11</ref></char></note>tout retay a Juda yo, ki te retounen soti nan tout nasyon kote yo te konn chase yo rive, pou yo ta ka rete nan peyi Juda a— <verse eid="JER 43:5"/><verse number="6" style="v" sid="JER 43:6"/>mesye yo, fanm yo, timoun yo, <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">43:6 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="JER 41:10">Jr 41:10</ref></char></note>fi a wa yo, e chak moun ke Nebuzaradan, chèf a kò gad la te kite avèk Guedalia, fis a Achikam nan ak granpapa a Schaphan, ansanm ak Jérémie, pwofèt la e Baruc, fis a Nérija a. <verse eid="JER 43:6"/><verse number="7" style="v" sid="JER 43:7"/>Epi yo te antre nan peyi Égypte la paske yo pa t obeyi a vwa SENYÈ <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">43:7 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="JER 2:16">Jr 2:16</ref></char></note>e yo te rive jis Tachpnaès.<verse eid="JER 43:7"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="JER 43:8"/>Epi pawòl SENYÈ a te vin kote Jérémie nan <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">43:8 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="JER 46:14">Jr 46:14</ref></char></note>Tachpanès. Li te di: <verse eid="JER 43:8"/><verse number="9" style="v" sid="JER 43:9"/>“Pran kèk nan gwo wòch nan men ou, e sere yo nan mòtye nan pave brik ki nan antre palè Farawon ki nan Tachpanès la, devan zye a kèk nan Jwif yo. <verse eid="JER 43:9"/><verse number="10" style="v" sid="JER 43:10"/>Epi di yo: ‘Konsa pale SENYÈ dèzame yo, Bondye Israël la: “Gade byen, Mwen va voye chache Nebucadnetsar, wa Babylone nan <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">43:10 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ISA 44:28">És 44:28</ref></char></note>sèvitè Mwen an, e Mwen va plase twòn li byen dirèk anwo wòch sila ke m te kache yo; epi li va ouvri gwo abri wayàl pa l anwo yo. <verse eid="JER 43:10"/><verse number="11" style="v" sid="JER 43:11"/>Anplis, li va vin frape peyi Égypte la. Sila ki te fèt pou mouri va mouri; sila pou prizon yo, va vin anprizone, e sila ki pou nepe yo, va jwenn nepe. <verse eid="JER 43:11"/><verse number="12" style="v" sid="JER 43:12"/>Epi Mwen va mete dife sou tanp dye Égypte yo, li va brile yo e soti avèk yo kon prizonye. Li va vlope li menm ak peyi Égypte kon yon bèje vlope kò l ak vètman li, e li va sòti la, ansekirite. <verse eid="JER 43:12"/><verse number="13" style="v" sid="JER 43:13"/>Anplis, li va kraze nèt imaj an wòch Beth-Schémech yo, ki nan peyi Égypte la, epi tanp dye a Égypte yo, li va brile yo ak dife.”’”<verse eid="JER 43:13"/></para>
  <chapter eid="JER 43"/>
  <chapter number="44" style="c" sid="JER 44"/>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="JER 44:1"/>Pawòl ki te rive kote Jérémie pou tout Jwif ki te rete nan peyi Égypte yo, sila ki te rete nan <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">44:1 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="EXO 14:2">Egz 14:2</ref></char></note>Migdol yo, Tachpanès Noph ak nan peyi a Pathros yo. Li te di: <verse eid="JER 44:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="JER 44:2"/>“Konsa pale SENYÈ dèzame yo, Bondye Israël la: ‘Nou menm, nou te wè tout malè ke M te mennen sou Jérusalem ak tout vil Juda yo. Gade byen, nan jou sa a, <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">44:2 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ISA 6:11">És 6:11</ref></char></note>yo fin kraze nèt e pèsòn pa rete nan yo, <verse eid="JER 44:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="JER 44:3"/>akoz mechanste ke yo te fè pou <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">44:3 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ISA 3:8">És 3:8</ref></char></note>pwovoke M a lakòlè, akoz yo te kontinye brile sakrifis pou sèvi lòt dye ke yo pa t konnen, ni yo, ni nou menm, ni zansèt nou yo. <verse eid="JER 44:3"/><verse number="4" style="v" sid="JER 44:4"/>Malgre sa, Mwen te <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">44:4 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="JER 7:13-25">Jr 7:13-25</ref></char></note>voye bannou tout sèvitè mwen yo, pwofèt yo, ankò e ankò e Mwen te di: “Ah, pa fè bagay abominab sila ke m menm rayi a.” <verse eid="JER 44:4"/><verse number="5" style="v" sid="JER 44:5"/>Men <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">44:5 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="JER 11:8-10">Jr 11:8-10</ref></char></note>yo pa t koute, ni panche zòrèy yo pou kite mechanste yo, pou yo pa brile sakrifis a lòt dye yo. <verse eid="JER 44:5"/><verse number="6" style="v" sid="JER 44:6"/>Akoz sa, kòlè Mwen ak mekontantman Mwen te vide e te brile nan <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">44:6 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="JER 7:17-34">Jr 7:17-34</ref></char></note>vil Juda yo ak nan ri a Jérusalem yo, jiskaske yo vin detwi nèt e vin yon dezolasyon jis rive jodi a.’<verse eid="JER 44:6"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="JER 44:7"/>“Alò, konsa pale SENYÈ a, Bondye Israël la: ‘Poukisa n ap fè gwo mal sa a nou menm, pou nou ta <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">44:7 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="JER 3:24">Jr 3:24</ref></char></note>koupe retire nèt de nou menm, gason, fanm, pitit, ak tibebe, pou kite tèt nou san retay. <verse eid="JER 44:7"/><verse number="8" style="v" sid="JER 44:8"/>Epi pwovoke M a lakòlè avèk zèv men nou, <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">44:8 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="JER 7:9">Jr 7:9</ref></char></note>brile sakrifis a lòt dye nan peyi Égypte yo, kote nou ap antre pou rezide, pou nou kab vin koupe retire nèt e devni yon madichon ak yon repwòch pami tout nasyon sou latè yo? <verse eid="JER 44:8"/><verse number="9" style="v" sid="JER 44:9"/>Èske nou fin bliye <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">44:9 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="JER 7:9-18">Jr 7:9-18</ref></char></note>mechanste a papa zansèt nou yo, mechanste a wa a Juda yo, mechanste a madanm yo, pwòp mechanste pa nou, mechanste a madanm pa nou yo, ke yo te komèt nan peyi Juda a ak nan ri Jérusalem yo. <verse eid="JER 44:9"/><verse number="10" style="v" sid="JER 44:10"/>Men yo pa t repanti, menm jis rive jodi a, ni yo pa t gen lakrent, ni <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">44:10 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="JER 26:4">Jr 26:4</ref></char></note>mache nan lalwa Mwen, ni règleman ke M te mete devan nou yo ak devan papa zansèt nou yo.’<verse eid="JER 44:10"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="JER 44:11"/>“Pou sa, konsa pale SENYÈ dèzame yo, Bondye Israël la: ‘Gade byen, Mwen ap <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">44:11 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="LEV 17:10">Lev 17:10</ref></char></note>fikse fas Mwen kont nou pou malè, menm pou koupe retire tout Juda. <verse eid="JER 44:11"/><verse number="12" style="v" sid="JER 44:12"/>Epi Mwen va <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">44:12 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="JER 42:15-22">Jr 42:15-22</ref></char></note>retire retay Juda ki te fikse panse yo sou antre nan peyi Égypte pou abite la, e yo va tout twouve move desten pa yo. La, nan peyi Égypte, yo va tonbe pa nepe e rankontre desten yo nan gwo grangou. Yo va devni yon madichon, yon objè degoutan, yon anatèm ak yon repwòch. <verse eid="JER 44:12"/><verse number="13" style="v" sid="JER 44:13"/>Epi Mwen va pini sila ki rete an peyi Égypte, kon mwen te pini Jérusalem, ak nepe a, ak grangou, ak bèt ki ravaje chan e ak epidemi. <verse eid="JER 44:13"/><verse number="14" style="v" sid="JER 44:14"/>Konsa, <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">44:14 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="JER 22:10">Jr 22:10</ref></char></note>p ap gen moun ki chape, ni ki retounen nan retay Juda ki te antre nan peyi Égypte pou rezide la ak entansyon pou retounen nan peyi Juda, kote yo gen anvi retounen viv la. Paske okenn moun p ap retounen sof ke kèk grenn ki chape.’”<verse eid="JER 44:14"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="JER 44:15"/>Epi <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">44:15 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="PRO 11:21">Pwov 11:21</ref></char></note>tout sila ki te konnen ke madanm yo t ap brile sakrifis a lòt dye yo, ansanm ak tout fanm ki te kanpe la yo, yon gwo asanble, menm ak tout moun ki te rete Pathros nan peyi Égypte la, te reponn a Jérémie. Yo te di: <verse eid="JER 44:15"/><verse number="16" style="v" sid="JER 44:16"/>“Pou <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">44:16 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="PRO 1:24-27">Pwov 1:24-27</ref></char></note>mesaj ke ou te pale nou nan non SENYÈ a, nou p ap koute ou! <verse eid="JER 44:16"/><verse number="17" style="v" sid="JER 44:17"/>Men pito, nou va akonpli tout pawòl ki te sòti nan bouch pa nou, lè n ap brile sakrifis a <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">44:17 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="2KI 17:16">II Wa 17:16</ref></char></note>rèn syèl la, e vide bwason devan l, menm jan ke nou menm, ak papa zansèt nou yo, wa nou yo, ak prèt nou yo te konn fè nan vil Juda yo ak nan ri a Jérusalem yo. Paske nan lè sa a, nou te gen kont manje, nou te byen alèz e nou pa t konn soufri malè. <verse eid="JER 44:17"/><verse number="18" style="v" sid="JER 44:18"/>Men depi lè nou te sispann brile sakrifis a rèn syèl la ak vide bwason devan l, nou te vin <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">44:18 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="NUM 11:5-6">Nonb 11:5-6</ref></char></note>manke tout bagay, e nou te vin anile pa nepe ak gwo grangou.” <verse eid="JER 44:18"/><verse number="19" style="v" sid="JER 44:19"/>Fanm yo te pale: “Lè nou t ap <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">44:19 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="JER 7:18">Jr 7:18</ref></char></note>brile sakrifis a rèn syèl la, e nou t ap vide ofrann bwason a li menm, èske se te san mari nou ke nou te fè pou li gato sakrifis nan imaj li e te vide ofrann bwason a li menm?”<verse eid="JER 44:19"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="JER 44:20"/>Epi Jérémie te di a tout pèp la, a mesye yo ak fanm yo—menm a tout pèp ki t ap reponn li konsa yo—e li te di: <verse eid="JER 44:20"/><verse number="21" style="v" sid="JER 44:21"/>Pou <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">44:21 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="EZK 8:10-11">Éz 8:10-11</ref></char></note>sakrifis lafimen ke nou te brile nan vil a Juda yo ak ri a Jérusalem yo, nou menm ak papa zansèt nou yo, wa nou yo, ak prens nou yo e pèp peyi a, èske SENYÈ a pa t sonje yo, e èske tout sa pa t antre nan panse Li? <verse eid="JER 44:21"/><verse number="22" style="v" sid="JER 44:22"/>Konsa, SENYÈ a pa t ka sipòte sa akoz mechanste a zak nou yo, akoz zak abominab ke nou te komèt yo. Se pou sa, peyi nou an fin detwi nèt, yon objè degoutan ak yon madichon, san pèsòn pou rete ladann, jan li ye jodi a. <verse eid="JER 44:22"/><verse number="23" style="v" sid="JER 44:23"/>Akoz nou te brile sakrifis yo, nou te peche kont SENYÈ a e pa t obeyi vwa SENYÈ a, ni mache nan lalwa Li, règleman Li yo, ak temwayaj Li yo; akoz sa, gran malè sa a vin tonbe sou nou, jan li ye jodi a.<verse eid="JER 44:23"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="JER 44:24"/>Konsa, Jérémie te di a tout pèp la, ansanm ak tout fanm yo: “Tande pawòl SENYÈ a, tout Juda ki rete <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">44:24 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="JER 43:7">Jr 43:7</ref></char></note>nan peyi Égypte la, <verse eid="JER 44:24"/><verse number="25" style="v" sid="JER 44:25"/>Konsa pale SENYÈ dèzame yo, Bondye Israël la, konsa: ‘Pou nou menm ak madanm nou, nou te pale ak bouch nou, nou te akonpli sa ak men nou, e nou te di: “Anverite, nou va akonpli ve ke nou te fè yo, pou nou brile sakrifis a rèn syèl la, e vide bwason nou yo a li menm.”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="JER 44:25">
    <note caller="+" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">44:25 </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="EZK 20:39">Éz 20:39</ref>
      </char>
    </note>“‘Ale fè l, pou akonpli ve nou yo; e byen si, akonpli ve nou yo!’<verse eid="JER 44:25"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="JER 44:26"/>“Sepandan, tande pawòl SENYÈ a, tout moun Juda ki rete nan peyi Égypte la: ‘Gade byen, Mwen te sèmante pa gran non Mwen,’ SENYÈ a di: <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">44:26 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="PSA 50:16">Sòm 50:16</ref></char></note> ‘Pinga non Mwen janm nome ankò nan bouch a okenn moun Juda nan tout peyi Égypte la, pou ta di: “Jan Senyè BONDYE a viv la.” <verse eid="JER 44:26"/><verse number="27" style="v" sid="JER 44:27"/>Gade byen, M ap veye sou yo pou malè yo, e pa pou byen yo. <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">44:27 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="2KI 21:14">II Wa 21:14</ref></char></note>Tout mesye Juda ki nan peyi Égypte yo, va rankontre lafen pa yo ak nepe e ak gwo grangou jiskaske yo fin disparèt nèt. <verse eid="JER 44:27"/><verse number="28" style="v" sid="JER 44:28"/>Sila ki chape anba nepe yo va retounen sòti nan peyi Égypte pou rive Juda <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">44:28 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ISA 10:19">És 10:19</ref></char></note> p ap gen anpil menm. Nan lè sa a, retay Juda ki te ale nan peyi Égypte pou rezide yo, va konnen pawòl a kilès k ap kanpe, si se pa M nan, oswa pa yo a’.<verse eid="JER 44:28"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="JER 44:29"/>“‘Sa va sèvi kon sign pou nou’, SENYÈ a di: ‘ke Mwen va pini nou nan plas sa a, pou nou ka konnen ke <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">44:29 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="PRO 19:21">Pwov 19:21</ref></char></note>pawòl Mwen va, anverite, kanpe kont nou pou malè nou.’ <verse eid="JER 44:29"/><verse number="30" style="v" sid="JER 44:30"/>Konsa pale SENYÈ a: ‘Gade byen, Mwen va livre <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">44:30 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="2KI 25:4-7">II Wa 25:4-7</ref></char></note> Farawon Hophra, wa Égypte la, nan men lènmi li yo; nan men a sila k ap chache lavi li, menm jan ke m te livre Sédécias, wa Juda a, nan men Nebucadnetsar, wa Babylone nan, ki te ènmi li e ki t ap chache lavi li.’”<verse eid="JER 44:30"/></para>
  <chapter eid="JER 44"/>
  <chapter number="45" style="c" sid="JER 45"/>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="JER 45:1"/>Mesaj ke Jérémie, pwofèt la, te pale a Baruc, fis a Nérija, lè l te fin ekri pawòl sila yo nan yon liv selon dikte Jérémie, nan <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">45:1 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="2KI 24:1">II Wa 24:1</ref></char></note>katriyèm ane Jojakim, fis a Josias, wa Juda a, lè l te di: <verse eid="JER 45:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="JER 45:2"/>Konsa pale SENYÈ a, Bondye Israël la a ou menm, O Baruc: <verse eid="JER 45:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="JER 45:3"/>‘Ou te di: “Ah! Malè a mwen menm! Paske SENYÈ a te mete tristès nan doulè m; mwen fatige ak plent mwen yo e mwen pa jwenn repo.’”<verse eid="JER 45:3"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="JER 45:4"/>“Se konsa ou dwe pale li, ‘Konsa pale SENYÈ a: “Gade byen, <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">45:4 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ISA 5:5">És 5:5</ref></char></note>sa ke M te bati a, Mwen prèt pou demoli li, e sa ke M te plante a, Mwen prèt pou rache li; sa vle di, tout peyi a.” <verse eid="JER 45:4"/><verse number="5" style="v" sid="JER 45:5"/>Men ou menm, èske w ap chache gwo bagay pou ou menm? Pa chache, paske gade byen, Mwen va mennen dezas sou tout chè,’ deklare SENYÈ a: “Men Mwen va kite ou chape ak lavi ou a, nenpòt kote ou ale.”<verse eid="JER 45:5"/></para>
  <chapter eid="JER 45"/>
  <chapter number="46" style="c" sid="JER 46"/>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="JER 46:1"/>Sa ki te rive selon pawòl SENYÈ a a Jérémie, pwofèt la, <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">46:1 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="JER 1:10">Jr 1:10</ref></char></note>konsènan nasyon yo.<verse eid="JER 46:1"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="JER 46:2"/>Pou Égypte: konsènan lame <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">46:2 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="2KI 18:21">II Wa 18:21</ref></char></note>Farawon Neco, wa Égypte la, ki te akote rivyè Euphrate nan Carkemisch, ke Nebucadnetsar, wa Babylone nan, te bat nèt nan katriyèm ane Jojakim, fis a Josias, wa Juda a.<verse eid="JER 46:2"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="JER 46:3"/>
    <note caller="+" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">46:3 </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="ISA 21:5">És 21:5</ref>
      </char>
    </note>“Alinye pwotèj ak boukliye</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 46:3">e pwoche pre pou batay la.<verse eid="JER 46:3"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="JER 46:4"/>Sele cheval, e monte sou do yo;</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 46:4">pran pozisyon nou ak kas nan tèt!</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 46:4">Netwaye tout lans yo,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 46:4">e mete abiman an bwonz!<verse eid="JER 46:4"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="JER 46:5"/>Poukisa mwen te wè sa?</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 46:5">Yo pè nèt, y ap <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">46:5 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ISA 42:17">És 42:17</ref></char></note>rale fè bak,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 46:5">mesye pwisan yo fin bat nèt,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 46:5">e sèl abri yo sove ale san gade dèyè.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 46:5">Se gwo laperèz tout kote!”</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 46:5">deklare SENYÈ a.<verse eid="JER 46:5"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="JER 46:6"/>Pa kite <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">46:6 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ISA 30:16">És 30:16</ref></char></note>sila ki pi rapid la sove ale,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 46:6">ni moun pwisan an chape poul li.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 46:6">Nan nò, akote rivyè Euphrate la,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 46:6">yo te glise, chape tonbe.<verse eid="JER 46:6"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="JER 46:7"/>Se kilès sa ki <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">46:7 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="JER 47:2">Jr 47:2</ref></char></note>leve tankou rivyè Nil la,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 46:7">tankou rivyè ki gen dlo k ap jayi toupatou yo?<verse eid="JER 46:7"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="JER 46:8"/>Égypte leve tankou rivyè Nil la,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 46:8">menm tankou rivyè ki gen dlo k ap jayi toupatou yo.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 46:8">Li te di: “Mwen va <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">46:8 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ISA 37:24">És 37:24</ref></char></note>leve kouvri peyi sa a;</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 46:8">anverite, Mwen va detwi vil la ak moun ki rete ladann yo.”<verse eid="JER 46:8"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="JER 46:9"/>An avan, cheval yo!</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 46:9">Kouri tankou moun fou, cha lagè yo!</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 46:9">Kite moun pwisan yo mache devan:</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 46:9">Éthiopie ak Puth ki manevre boukliye a,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 46:9">
    <note caller="+" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">46:9 </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="JER 47:3">Jr 47:3</ref>
      </char>
    </note>Lidyen ki manevre e koube banza a.<verse eid="JER 46:9"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="JER 46:10"/>Paske jou sa a se pou Senyè BONDYE dèzame yo,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 46:10">yon jou vanjans,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 46:10">pou L kapab fè vanjans Li sou lènmi Li yo.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 46:10">Nepe a va devore vin satisfè,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 46:10">Li va bwè kont li nan san yo;</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 46:10">paske va genyen yon <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">46:10 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ISA 34:6">És 34:6</ref></char></note> sakrifis pou Senyè BONDYE dèzame yo,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 46:10">nan peyi nò a, akote Larivyè Euphrate la.<verse eid="JER 46:10"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="JER 46:11"/>
    <note caller="+" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">46:11 </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="JER 8:22">Jr 8:22</ref>
      </char>
    </note>Monte Galaad pou jwenn pomad gerizon an,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 46:11">O fi vyèj Égypte la!</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 46:11">Anven nou te miltipliye remèd yo;</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 46:11">nanpwen gerizon pou nou.<verse eid="JER 46:11"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="JER 46:12"/>Nasyon yo te tande de bagay <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">46:12 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="JER 2:36">Jr 2:36</ref></char></note>wont ou an,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 46:12">e tè a plen ak kri detrès ou;</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 46:12">paske yon gran gèrye tonbe sou gran gèye,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 46:12">e toulède tonbe atè ansanm.<verse eid="JER 46:12"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="JER 46:13"/>Sa se mesaj ke SENYÈ a te pale a Jérémie, pwofèt la, konsènan avni a wa Nebucadnetsar, wa Babylone nan, pou <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">46:13 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ISA 19:1">És 19:1</ref></char></note>frape peyi Égypte la:<verse eid="JER 46:13"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="JER 46:14"/>“Se pou nou deklare an Égypte</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 46:14">e pwoklame nan Migdol;</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 46:14">pwoklame tou nan Noph e nan <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">46:14 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="JER 43:8">Jr 43:8</ref></char></note>Tachpanès;</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 46:14">Di: ‘Pran pozisyon nou e kanpe,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 46:14">paske nepe fin devore sila ki antoure nou yo.’<verse eid="JER 46:14"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="JER 46:15"/>Poukisa mesye pwisan nou yo vin pwostène?</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 46:15">Yo pa kanpe akoz SENYÈ a te <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">46:15 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="PSA 18:14-39">Sòm 18:14-39</ref></char></note>pouse yo desann.<verse eid="JER 46:15"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="JER 46:16"/>Li fè anpil <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">46:16 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="LEV 26:36-37">Lev 26:36-37</ref></char></note>tonbe;</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 46:16">anverite, yo tonbe youn kont lòt.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 46:16">Yo te di: ‘Kanpe! Annou retounen kote</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 46:16">pwòp pèp pa nou, nan peyi natal nou,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 46:16">lwen nepe a sila k ap oprime a.’<verse eid="JER 46:16"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="JER 46:17"/>Yo te kriye la: ‘Farawon, wa Égypte la,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 46:17">pa plis ke yon <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">46:17 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="EXO 15:9-10">Egz 15:9-10</ref></char></note>gwo bri;</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 46:17">li te kite tan deziye a fin pase!’<verse eid="JER 46:17"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="JER 46:18"/>“Jan Mwen viv la,” deklare <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">46:18 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="JER 48:15">Jr 48:15</ref></char></note>Wa a</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 46:18">ki gen kon non Li, SENYÈ dèzame yo,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 46:18">“Anverite, youn ki parèt gran tankou Mòn Thabor pami mòn yo,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 46:18">oswa tankou Carmel akote lanmè a;</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 46:18">se konsa lap vini.<verse eid="JER 46:18"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="JER 46:19"/>Prepare valiz ou pou <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">46:19 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ISA 20:4">És 20:4</ref></char></note>egzil,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 46:19">O fi k ap demere an Égypte,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 46:19">paske Noph va devni yon dezolasyon;</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 46:19">li va brile menm,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 46:19">pou l rete vid san moun ladann.<verse eid="JER 46:19"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="JER 46:20"/>“Égypte se yon gazèl byen bèl,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 46:20">men yon gwo mouch ap vini <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">46:20 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="JER 1:14">Jr 1:14</ref></char></note>soti nan nò.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 46:20">Li fin rive.<verse eid="JER 46:20"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="JER 46:21"/>Anplis, sòlda mèsenè etranje nan mitan li yo</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 46:21">tankou jenn bèf yo byen angrese,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 46:21">paske yo menm tou te fin vire nèt;</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 46:21">yo te sove ale ansanm.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 46:21">Yo pa t kanpe,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 46:21">paske jou malè pa yo fin rive sou yo;</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 46:21">lè <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">46:21 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="JER 48:44">Jr 48:44</ref></char></note>pinisyon pa yo.<verse eid="JER 46:21"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="JER 46:22"/>Son li va soti kon yon sèpan;</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 46:22">paske tankou yon lame, yo vini,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 46:22">yo rive kote li ak moun k ap pote rach.<verse eid="JER 46:22"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="JER 46:23"/>“Yo va koupe forè li”, deklare SENYÈ a;</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 46:23">anverite, li p ap twouve ankò;</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 46:23">paske yo plis pase gwo lame krikèt volan.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 46:23">Fòs kantite yo depase kontwòl.<verse eid="JER 46:23"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="JER 46:24"/>Fi Égypte la ap fè gwo wont;</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 46:24">lap livre nan pouvwa moun nan nò yo.”<verse eid="JER 46:24"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="JER 46:25"/>SENYÈ dèzame yo, Bondye Israël la di: “Gade byen, Mwen ap pini Amon ki rete <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">46:25 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="EXO 30:14-16">Egz 30:14-16</ref></char></note>Thebes la, Farawon e Égypte ansanm ak dye li yo ak wa li yo, menm Farawon ak sila ki mete konfyans nan li yo. <verse eid="JER 46:25"/><verse number="26" style="v" sid="JER 46:26"/>Mwen va livre yo a sila k ap <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">46:26 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="JER 44:30">Jr 44:30</ref></char></note>chache touye yo, menm nan men Nebucadnetsar, wa Babylone nan ak nan men chèf li yo. Malgre sa, apre, li va vin gen moun ki rete ladann jan li te ye nan tan pase a.” deklare SENYÈ a.<verse eid="JER 46:26"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="JER 46:27"/>Men pou ou menm, O! Jacob, sèvitè Mwen an,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 46:27">pa gen lakrent, ni pa twouble, O Israël!</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 46:27">Paske ou wè, Mwen va <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">46:27 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ISA 11:11">És 11:11</ref></char></note>sove nou soti lwen,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 46:27">e desandan nou yo soti nan peyi kaptivite yo.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 46:27">Jacob va retounen pou rete san twoub,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 46:27">ansekirite, san pèsòn ki pou fè l tranble.<verse eid="JER 46:27"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="JER 46:28"/>O Jacob, sèvitè Mwen an, pa gen lakrent!” deklare SENYÈ a:</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 46:28">“paske, Mwen avèk ou.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 46:28">Paske Mwen va fè fen a tout nasyon</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 46:28">kote Mwen te chase ou ale yo.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 46:28">Sepandan, Mwen <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">46:28 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="JER 4:27">Jr 4:27</ref></char></note>p ap fè fen a ou menm;</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 46:28">men Mwen va korije ou jan sa dwe fèt</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 46:28">e Mwen p ap kite ou san pinisyon.”<verse eid="JER 46:28"/></para>
  <chapter eid="JER 46"/>
  <chapter number="47" style="c" sid="JER 47"/>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="JER 47:1"/>Sa ki te vini kon pawòl SENYÈ a de Jérémie, pwofèt la, konsènan <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">47:1 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="JER 25:20">Jr 25:20</ref></char></note>Filisten yo, avan Farawon te fin bat peyi Gaza.<verse eid="JER 47:1"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="JER 47:2"/>Konsa pale SENYÈ a:</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 47:2">“Gade byen, dlo yo ap leve soti nan <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">47:2 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ISA 14:31">És 14:31</ref></char></note>nò</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 47:2">e l ap vin fè yon gwo fòs inondasyon dlo k ap debòde</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 47:2">jis li vin kouvri latè ak tout kapasite l,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 47:2">menm vil a sila ki rete ladann.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 47:2">Mesye yo va kriye fò,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 47:2">e tout moun ladann va rele anmwey.<verse eid="JER 47:2"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="JER 47:3"/>Akoz bri zago cheval li k ap kouri rèd,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 47:3">zen a cha li yo, ak gwonde a wou yo,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 47:3">papa yo pa p retounen pran pitit yo,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 47:3">men men yo va lage nèt ak sezisman.<verse eid="JER 47:3"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="JER 47:4"/>Akoz jou k ap vini pou detwi tout Filisten yo,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 47:4">pou koupe retire nèt de Tyr ak Sidon tout soutyen ki rete yo;</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 47:4">paske SENYÈ a ap detwi Filisten yo,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 47:4">retay a kot Caphtor a.<verse eid="JER 47:4"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="JER 47:5"/>Gaza vin chòv;</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 47:5">
    <note caller="+" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">47:5 </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="JDG 1:18">Jij 1:18</ref>
      </char>
    </note>Askalon te fin detwi nèt.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 47:5">O retay vale yo!</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 47:5">Pandan konbyen de tan</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 47:5">nou va blese pwòp chè nou?<verse eid="JER 47:5"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="JER 47:6"/>“‘Ah <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">47:6 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="JDG 7:20">Jij 7:20</ref></char></note>nepe SENYÈ a!</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 47:6">Pandan konbyen de tan</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 47:6">ou va refize vin kalm?</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 47:6">Ralanti, rantre nan fouwo a;</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 47:6">repoze e rete trankil.’<verse eid="JER 47:6"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="JER 47:7"/>“Kòman li ka kalm, lè SENYÈ a bay li lòd?</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 47:7">Kont Ashkalon, kont kot lanmè a;</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 47:7">Se la, Li te <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">47:7 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="MIC 6:9">Mi 6:9</ref></char></note>ranje pou l te fèt.”<verse eid="JER 47:7"/></para>
  <chapter eid="JER 47"/>
  <chapter number="48" style="c" sid="JER 48"/>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="JER 48:1"/>Konsènan <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">48:1 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ISA 15:1">És 15:1</ref></char></note>Moab. Konsa pale SENYÈ dèzame yo, Bondye Israël la:</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 48:1">“Malè a Nebo!</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 48:1">Paske li fin detwi.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 48:1">Kirjathaïm te rive wont nèt.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 48:1">Li vin kaptire.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 48:1">Sitadèl la ki te leve byen wo a te fè wont.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 48:1">Li te vin kraze nèt.<verse eid="JER 48:1"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="JER 48:2"/>Pa genyen lwanj pou Moab ankò.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 48:2">Nan <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">48:2 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="NUM 21:25">Nonb 21:25</ref></char></note>Hesbon, yo te fè plan pou malè li:</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 48:2">‘Vini, annou koupe retire l nèt</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 48:2">pou l pa menm yon nasyon ankò!’</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 48:2">Nou menm tou, Madmen, va vin an silans.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 48:2">Nepe a va swiv nou.<verse eid="JER 48:2"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="JER 48:3"/>Bri a gwo kri k ap sòti <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">48:3 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ISA 15:5">És 15:5</ref></char></note>Choronaïm;</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 48:3">ravaj ak gwo destriksyon!<verse eid="JER 48:3"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="JER 48:4"/>Moab fin kraze.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 48:4">Pitit li yo te fè yon kri detrès.<verse eid="JER 48:4"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="JER 48:5"/>Paske akote pant ki monte vè <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">48:5 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ISA 15:5">És 15:5</ref></char></note>Luchith la,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 48:5">yo va monte avèk kri san rete.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 48:5">Paske nan pant ki desann kote Choronaïm nan,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 48:5">yo te tande gwo kri ak doulè</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 48:5">akoz destriksyon an.<verse eid="JER 48:5"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="JER 48:6"/>
    <note caller="+" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">48:6 </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="JER 51:6">Jr 51:6</ref>
      </char>
    </note>Chape poul nou, sove lavi nou,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 48:6">pou nou ka tankou yon bayawonn nan dezè a.<verse eid="JER 48:6"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="JER 48:7"/>Paske akoz konfyans nou mete nan pwòp zèv nou</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 48:7">ak trezò pa nou;</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 48:7">menm nou menm va vin kaptire.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 48:7">
    <note caller="+" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">48:7 </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="NUM 21:29">Nonb 21:29</ref>
      </char>
    </note>Kemosch va antre an egzil</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 48:7">ansanm ak prèt li yo ak prens li yo.<verse eid="JER 48:7"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="JER 48:8"/>Yon destriktè va vini nan chak vil,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 48:8">pou pa gen vil ki chape;</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 48:8">vale a, anplis, ap detwi,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 48:8">e <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">48:8 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="JOS 13:9">Jos 13:9</ref></char></note>wo plèn nan va detwi,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 48:8">jan SENYÈ a te pale a.<verse eid="JER 48:8"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="JER 48:9"/>Bay zèl a Moab, paske li va sove ale;</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 48:9">epi vil pa li yo va vin yon <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">48:9 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="JER 44:22">Jr 44:22</ref></char></note>dezè,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 48:9">san moun ki pou rete ladan yo.<verse eid="JER 48:9"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="JER 48:10"/>“Malè a sila ki fè travay SENYÈ a ak <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">48:10 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="1KI 20:39-42">I Wa 20:39-42</ref></char></note>neglijans,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 48:10">e malè a sila ki anpeche nepe l vèse san.<verse eid="JER 48:10"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="JER 48:11"/>“Moab te <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">48:11 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="JER 22:21">Jr 22:21</ref></char></note>alèz depi nan jenès li;</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 48:11">anplis, li pa t janm deranje.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 48:11">Tankou diven ki rete nan boutèy orijinal,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 48:11">ki pa t vide de veso a veso,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 48:11">nonplis li pa t janm ale an egzil.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 48:11">Akoz sa, li kenbe bon gou li,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 48:11">ni odè li pa chanje.<verse eid="JER 48:11"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="JER 48:12"/>Akoz sa, gade byen, jou yo ap vini”, deklare SENYÈ a:</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 48:12">“lè Mwen va voye kote li sila ki chavire bato yo</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 48:12">e yo va chavire li, yo va vide veso li yo</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 48:12">e kraze tout bokal li yo.<verse eid="JER 48:12"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="JER 48:13"/>Epi Moab va wont pou Kemosch, menm jan</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 48:13">lakay Israël te wont pou <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">48:13 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="1KI 12:29">I Wa 12:29</ref></char></note>Béthel, konfyans pa yo.<verse eid="JER 48:13"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="JER 48:14"/>“Kòman nou ka di: ‘Nou se <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">48:14 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="PSA 33:16">Sòm 33:16</ref></char></note>vanyan gèrye</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 48:14">e moun plen kouraj pou batay’?<verse eid="JER 48:14"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="JER 48:15"/>Moab fin detwi nèt,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 48:15">e moun fin monte kote vil li yo;</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 48:15">anplis, <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">48:15 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ISA 40:30-31">És 40:30-31</ref></char></note>jenn mesye pi chwazi li yo fin tonbe nan gwo masak,”</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 48:15">deklare Wa a, ki pote non a SENYÈ dèzame yo.<verse eid="JER 48:15"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="JER 48:16"/>“Gwo dega Moab la <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">48:16 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ISA 13:22">És 13:22</ref></char></note>prèt pou rive</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 48:16">e malè li va chofe rive vit.<verse eid="JER 48:16"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="JER 48:17"/>Fè dèy pou li, nou menm tout ki antoure li,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 48:17">menm nou menm tout ki te konnen non li, di:</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 48:17">‘Gade kijan gwo fòs <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">48:17 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ISA 13:22">És 13:22</ref></char></note>baton wayal la fin kase,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 48:17">yon baton ki te tèlman bèl!’<verse eid="JER 48:17"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="JER 48:18"/>O fi ki rete Dibon an,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 48:18">“Desann kite glwa ou pou vin chita sou tè sèk;</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 48:18">paske destriktè Moab la te vin kont ou.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 48:18">Li te detwi sitadèl ou yo.<verse eid="JER 48:18"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="JER 48:19"/>Kanpe akote wout la pou veye,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 48:19">O moun ki rete Aroër.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 48:19">Mande gason ‘ki moun ki sove ale a’?</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 48:19">E fi a ‘ki moun ki chape poul li a’?</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 48:19">Mande: ‘Kisa ki te pase?’<verse eid="JER 48:19"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="JER 48:20"/>Moab fin fè wont nèt, paske li fin kraze nèt.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 48:20">Fè gwo kri, rele anmwey!</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 48:20">Deklare akote Rivyè Arnon an ke Moab te fin detwi.<verse eid="JER 48:20"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="JER 48:21"/>Jijman fin rive sou plèn nan tou,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 48:21">sou Holon, sou Jahats e kont Méphaath,<verse eid="JER 48:21"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="JER 48:22"/>Sou Dibon, sou Nebo, sou Beth-Diblathaïm,<verse eid="JER 48:22"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="JER 48:23"/>Sou Kirjathaïm sou Beth-Gamul, sou Beth-Meon,<verse eid="JER 48:23"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="JER 48:24"/>Sou <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">48:24 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="JER 48:41">Jr 48:41</ref></char></note>Kerijoth, sou Botsra, sou tout vil nan</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 48:24">peyi Moab yo, ni lwen, ni pre.<verse eid="JER 48:24"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="JER 48:25"/>
    <note caller="+" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">48:25 </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="PSA 75:10">Sòm 75:10</ref>
      </char>
    </note>Kòn Moab te fin koupe nèt e bra li te fin kase,”</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 48:25">deklare SENYÈ a.<verse eid="JER 48:25"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="JER 48:26"/>
    <note caller="+" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">48:26 </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="JER 25:15">Jr 25:15</ref>
      </char>
    </note>“Fè l vin sou,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 48:26">paske li te plen ògèy anvè SENYÈ a.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 48:26">Pou sa, Moab va vire tounen nan vomisman li,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 48:26">e anplis, li va vin yon rizib pou tout moun ka ri.<verse eid="JER 48:26"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="JER 48:27"/>Alò, èske nou pa t konsidere Israël kon yon rizib?</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 48:27">Oswa, èske se pami volè li te tonbe?</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 48:27">Paske chak fwa nou pale sou li,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 48:27">nou souke tèt nou konsi n ap giyonnen li.<verse eid="JER 48:27"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="JER 48:28"/>Kite vil yo pou rete nan <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">48:28 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="JDG 6:2">Jij 6:2</ref></char></note>kav wo yo, O moun Moab yo!</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 48:28">Fè tankou toutrèl ki fè nich li dèyè bouch gwo kav yo.<verse eid="JER 48:28"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="JER 48:29"/>
    <note caller="+" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">48:29 </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="ISA 16:6">És 16:6</ref>
      </char>
    </note>“Nou konn tande afè ògèy Moab la.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 48:29">Li vrèman ògeye nan ensolans li,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 48:29">ògèy li, awogans kè li,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 48:29">ak leve pwòp tèt li byen wo.<verse eid="JER 48:29"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="30" style="v" sid="JER 48:30"/>Mwen konnen <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">48:30 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ISA 37:28">És 37:28</ref></char></note>gwo kòlè li,” deklare SENYÈ a:</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 48:30">“Men sa initil;</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 48:30">gwo ògèy li a pa reyisi anyen.<verse eid="JER 48:30"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="31" style="v" sid="JER 48:31"/>Pou sa, mwen va <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">48:31 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ISA 15:5">És 15:5</ref></char></note>rele anmwey pou Moab,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 48:31">menm pou tout Moab mwen va rele fò.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 48:31">Mwen va plenyen ak tristès pou mesye a Kir-Hérès yo.<verse eid="JER 48:31"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="32" style="v" sid="JER 48:32"/>Plis ke <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">48:32 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ISA 16:8-9">És 16:8-9</ref></char></note>kriye pou Jaezer, mwen va kriye</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 48:32">pou ou, O chan rezen Sibma a.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 48:32">Chan rezen nou yo te lonje rive lòtbò lanmè a.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 48:32">Yo te rive nan lanmè Jaezer a.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 48:32">Sou fwi gran sezon ak rekòlt rezen nou,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 48:32">destriktè a vin tonbe.<verse eid="JER 48:32"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="33" style="v" sid="JER 48:33"/>Konsa, <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">48:33 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ISA 16:10">És 16:10</ref></char></note>lajwa ak kè kontan vin retire</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 48:33">nan chan plen ak fwi a,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 48:33">menm nan Moab.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 48:33">Epi Mwen te fè diven vin sispann nan pèz diven yo.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 48:33">Pèsòn p ap foule yo ak gwo kri.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 48:33">Kri ki genyen, se ke pa gen kriye menm.<verse eid="JER 48:33"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="34" style="v" sid="JER 48:34"/>Soti nan gwo kri Hesbon an, menm rive Élealé,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 48:34">menm nan Jahats, yo te leve vwa yo, soti Tsoar,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 48:34">jis rive Choronaïm, jiska Églath-Schelischija;</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 48:34">paske dlo a Nimrim yo va anplis vin dezole.<verse eid="JER 48:34"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="35" style="v" sid="JER 48:35"/>M ap fè Moab fini nèt”, deklare SENYÈ a:</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 48:35">“Sila ki ofri sakrifis sou wo plas yo e sila ki</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 48:35">
    <note caller="+" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">48:35 </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="JER 7:9">Jr 7:9</ref>
      </char>
    </note>brile lansan a dye li yo.<verse eid="JER 48:35"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="36" style="v" sid="JER 48:36"/>Akoz sa, <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">48:36 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ISA 5:15">És 5:15</ref></char></note>kè M kriye pou Moab tankou flit;</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 48:36">kè M kriye tou pou mesye Kir-Hérès yo.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 48:36">Akoz yo te pèdi tout abondans li te konn pwodwi.<verse eid="JER 48:36"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="37" style="v" sid="JER 48:37"/>Paske <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">48:37 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ISA 15:2">És 15:2</ref></char></note>tout tèt vin chòv e tout bab vin koupe kout;</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 48:37">genyen blesi sou tout men yo ak twal sak sou kwis.<verse eid="JER 48:37"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="38" style="v" sid="JER 48:38"/>Sou tout <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">48:38 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ISA 22:1">És 22:1</ref></char></note>twati a Moab yo ak nan lari yo,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 48:38">se lamantasyon tout kote;</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 48:38">paske mwen te kraze Moab kon yon veso san valè,”</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 48:38">deklare SENYÈ a.<verse eid="JER 48:38"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="39" style="v" sid="JER 48:39"/>“A la kraze li kraze! Yo te rele anmwey.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 48:39">Gade kijan Moab te vire do li—li vin wont nèt!</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 48:39">Konsa, Moab va vin yon rizib ak yon <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">48:39 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="EZK 26:16">Éz 26:16</ref></char></note>objè degoutan</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 48:39">a tout moun ki antoure li yo.”<verse eid="JER 48:39"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="40" style="v" sid="JER 48:40"/>Paske konsa pale SENYÈ a: “Gade byen, li va vole</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 48:40">rapid tankou èg e <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">48:40 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ISA 8:8">És 8:8</ref></char></note>lonje zèl li ouvri kont Moab.<verse eid="JER 48:40"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="41" style="v" sid="JER 48:41"/>Kerijoth te fin kaptire e sitadèl yo te vin pran.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 48:41">
    <note caller="+" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">48:41 </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="JER 49:22">Jr 49:22</ref>
      </char>
    </note>Kè a mesye pwisan Moab yo nan jou sa a,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 48:41">va tankou kè a yon fanm k ap pouse pitit.<verse eid="JER 48:41"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="42" style="v" sid="JER 48:42"/>Moab va <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">48:42 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="PSA 83:4">Sòm 83:4</ref></char></note>detwi jiskaske li vin pa yon pèp ankò,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 48:42">akoz li te vin awogan anvè SENYÈ a.<verse eid="JER 48:42"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="43" style="v" sid="JER 48:43"/>
    <note caller="+" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">48:43 </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="ISA 24:17-18">És 24:17-18</ref>
      </char>
    </note>Gwo laperèz devan twou fòs, ak pèlen ap vini sou nou,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 48:43">O moun Moab yo,” deklare SENYÈ a.<verse eid="JER 48:43"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="44" style="v" sid="JER 48:44"/>“Sila ki sove ale devan gwo laperèz la, va tonbe nan fòs la</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 48:44">e sila ki monte sòti nan fòs la,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 48:44">va kenbe nan pèlen an;</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 48:44">paske Mwen va mennen sou li, menm sou Moab,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 48:44">ane a <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">48:44 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="JER 46:21">Jr 46:21</ref></char></note>pinisyon yo”, deklare SENYÈ a.<verse eid="JER 48:44"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="45" style="v" sid="JER 48:45"/>“Nan lonbraj Hesbon, mesye ki chape yo rete san fòs;</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 48:45">paske dife a parèt sòti nan Hesbon,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 48:45">yon <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">48:45 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="NUM 21:28-29">Nonb 21:28-29</ref></char></note>flanm soti nan mitan Sihon</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 48:45">e li te devore fwontèn tèt a Moab</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 48:45">ak zo bwa tèt mò a banbochè yo.<verse eid="JER 48:45"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="46" style="v" sid="JER 48:46"/>Malè pou ou, Moab! Pèp <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">48:46 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="JDG 11:24">Jij 11:24</ref></char></note>Kemosch la fin peri;</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 48:46">paske fis nou yo vin prizonye e fi nou yo ale an kaptivite.<verse eid="JER 48:46"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="47" style="v" sid="JER 48:47"/>“Malgre sa, Mwen va <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">48:47 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="JER 12:14-17">Jr 12:14-17</ref></char></note>restore Moab nan dènye jou yo,”</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 48:47">deklare SENYÈ a.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="JER 48:47">Jiska prezan, jijman an rive sou Moab.<verse eid="JER 48:47"/></para>
  <chapter eid="JER 48"/>
  <chapter number="49" style="c" sid="JER 49"/>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="JER 49:1"/>Konsènan fis a <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">49:1 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="DEU 23:3-4">Det 23:3-4</ref></char></note>Ammon yo. Konsa pale SENYÈ a:</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 49:1">“Èske Israël pa gen fis?</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 49:1">Oswa èske li pa gen eritye?</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 49:1">Alò poukisa Malcom te pran posesyon sou Gad,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 49:1">e se pèp li ki vin rete nan vil pa yo?<verse eid="JER 49:1"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="JER 49:2"/>Pou sa, gade byen, jou yo ap vini”,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 49:2">deklare SENYÈ a:</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 49:2">“ke Mwen va fè yon twonpèt fè son lagè</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 49:2">kont Rabbath, fis a Ammon yo;</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 49:2">epi li va devni pil dezole, e <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">49:2 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="JOS 17:11-16">Jos 17:11-16</ref></char></note>vil li yo va limen ak dife.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 49:2">Konsa, Israël va pran posesyon de sila ki posede l yo,”</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 49:2">pale SENYÈ a.<verse eid="JER 49:2"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="JER 49:3"/>“Rele anmwey, O Hesbon! Paske Aï fin detwi!</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 49:3">Kriye fò, O fi a Rabbath yo!</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 49:3">
    <note caller="+" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">49:3 </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="ISA 32:11">És 32:11</ref>
      </char>
    </note>Mare senti nou ak twal sak ak gwo kri</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 49:3">e kouri fè ale retou anndan miray yo;</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 49:3">paske Malcom va ale an egzil</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 49:3">ansanm ak prèt li yo ak prens yo.<verse eid="JER 49:3"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="JER 49:4"/>Pouki sa ou ògeye pou vale yo! Vale yo kap koule,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 49:4">O fi ki chite fè bak, ki plase konfyans li nan trezò li yo?</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 49:4">E k ap di: ‘Kilès ki va vini kont mwen?’<verse eid="JER 49:4"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="JER 49:5"/>Gade byen, m ap fè gwo laperèz rive sou ou,”</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 49:5">deklare Senyè BONDYE dèzame yo:</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 49:5">“Soti nan tout kote ki antoure ou yo;</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 49:5">epi nou chak va chase sòti tèt devan,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 49:5">san pèsòn ki pou rasanble sila ki gaye yo.<verse eid="JER 49:5"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="JER 49:6"/>“Men apre, Mwen va restore fòtin a fis a Ammon yo,”</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 49:6">deklare SENYÈ a.<verse eid="JER 49:6"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="JER 49:7"/>Konsènan Édom. Konsa pale SENYÈ dèzame yo:</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 49:7">“Èske pa gen sajès ankò nan <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">49:7 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="GEN 36:11-34">Jen 36:11-34</ref></char></note>Théman?</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 49:7">Èske tout konsèy a sila ki pridan yo fin pèdi?</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 49:7">Èske sajès yo vin pouri?<verse eid="JER 49:7"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="JER 49:8"/>Chape poul ou, retounen, rete nan pwofondè yo,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 49:8">O sila ki rete Dedan yo! Paske Mwen va mennen</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 49:8">
    <note caller="+" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">49:8 </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="JER 46:21">Jr 46:21</ref>
      </char>
    </note>dezas Ésaü a sou li nan lè M ap pini li a.<verse eid="JER 49:8"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="JER 49:9"/>Si sila k ap ranmase rezen yo te vin kote ou,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 49:9">èske yo pa t ap kite kèk grenn fwi tonbe atè?</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 49:9">Si yon <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">49:9 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="OBA 1:5">Ab 5</ref></char></note>vòlè te vini lannwit,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 49:9">yo ta vole sèlman kont yo pou yo ta jwenn ase.<verse eid="JER 49:9"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="JER 49:10"/>Men Mwen te rete rad sou Ésaü.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 49:10">Mwen te dekouvri kote kache li yo</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 49:10">jiskaske li pa t ka kache menm.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 49:10">Desandan li yo, moun fanmi li yo, vwazen li yo ak</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 49:10">
    <note caller="+" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">49:10 </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="ISA 17:14">És 17:14</ref>
      </char>
    </note>li menm pa egziste menm ankò.<verse eid="JER 49:10"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="JER 49:11"/>Kite òfelen ou yo dèyè; Mwen va konsève yo.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 49:11">Kite <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">49:11 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ZEC 7:10">Za 7:10</ref></char></note>vèv ou yo mete konfyans yo nan Mwen.”<verse eid="JER 49:11"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="JER 49:12"/>Paske konsa pale SENYÈ a: “Gade byen, sila ki pa t kondane pou bwè <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">49:12 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="JER 25:15">Jr 25:15</ref></char></note>tas yo va, anverite, bwè l, e èske se ou sèl k ap epanye? Nou p ap epanye, men anverite, nou va bwè l. <verse eid="JER 49:12"/><verse number="13" style="v" sid="JER 49:13"/>Paske Mwen te <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">49:13 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="GEN 22:16">Jen 22:16</ref></char></note>sèmante pa Mwen menm”, deklare SENYÈ a: “ke Botsra va devni yon objè degoutan, yon repwòch, yon pil mazi kraze ak yon malediksyon. Tout vil li yo va vin pil mazi.”<verse eid="JER 49:13"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="JER 49:14"/>Mwen te tande yon mesaj soti nan SENYÈ a</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 49:14">e yon <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">49:14 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ISA 18:2">És 18:2</ref></char></note>mesaje vin voye pami tout nasyon yo, t ap</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 49:14">di: “Rasanble nou ansanm.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 49:14">Vin kont li!</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 49:14">Leve pou batay!”<verse eid="JER 49:14"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="JER 49:15"/>“Paske gade byen, Mwen te fè nou piti pami nasyon yo,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 49:15">meprize pami lòm.<verse eid="JER 49:15"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="JER 49:16"/>Men pou laperèz a ou menm,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 49:16">awogans a kè ou te twonpe ou;</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 49:16">ou menm ki rete nan twou wòch yo,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 49:16">ki okipe wotè a kolin nan.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 49:16">Malgre ou fè nich ou wo tankou èg,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 49:16">M ap <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">49:16 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="AMO 9:2">Am 9:2</ref></char></note>rale ou desann soti la,”</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 49:16">deklare SENYÈ a.<verse eid="JER 49:16"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="JER 49:17"/>“Édom va devni yon <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">49:17 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="JER 18:16">Jr 18:16</ref></char></note>objè degoutan;</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 49:17">chak moun ki pase bò kote li va etone,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 49:17">e va sifle kon koulèv sou tout blesi li yo.<verse eid="JER 49:17"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="JER 49:18"/>Tankou <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">49:18 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="GEN 19:24-25">Jen 19:24-25</ref></char></note>boulvèsman Sodome ak Gomorrhe</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 49:18">ak vwazen li yo”, di SENYÈ a:</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 49:18">“pèsòn p ap viv la, ni p ap gen youn nan</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 49:18">fis a lòm ki rete la.<verse eid="JER 49:18"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="JER 49:19"/>“Gade byen, youn va monte kon yon lyon</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 49:19">ki soti nan rakbwa Jourdain an kont yon patiraj ki</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 49:19">tèlman byen wouze;</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 49:19">pou yon moman, mwen va fè l kouri kite li</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 49:19">e nenpòt moun ki <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">49:19 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="NUM 16:5">Nonb 16:5</ref></char></note>deziye,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 49:19">Mwen va bay li pouvwa sou li.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 49:19">Paske se kilès ki tankou Mwen menm?</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 49:19">E se kilès k ap voye pwosè vèbal tribinal ban Mwen?</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 49:19">Alò, se kilès ki bèje ki ka kanpe devan Mwen?”<verse eid="JER 49:19"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="JER 49:20"/>Pou sa, koute <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">49:20 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ISA 14:24-27">És 14:24-27</ref></char></note>plan ke SENYÈ a fòme kont Édom</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 49:20">ak objektif ke Li te fòme kont moun ki rete Théman yo:</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 49:20">Anverite, yo va trennen yo deyò,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 49:20">menm pi piti nan bann mouton an.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 49:20">Anverite, Li va fè patiraj yo vin dezole akoz de yo menm.<verse eid="JER 49:20"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="JER 49:21"/>
    <note caller="+" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">49:21 </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="JER 50:46">Jr 50:46</ref>
      </char>
    </note>Latè te souke akoz bri chit yo. Gen yon gwo kri anmwey!</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 49:21">Bri li te rive jis nan Lamè Wouj.<verse eid="JER 49:21"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="JER 49:22"/>Gade byen, Li va monte, desann kon yon èg</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 49:22">e lonje zèl li kont Botsra.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 49:22">
    <note caller="+" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">49:22 </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="ISA 13:8">És 13:8</ref>
      </char>
    </note>Kè a moun pwisan yo va tankou</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 49:22">kè a yon fanm k ap pouse pitit.<verse eid="JER 49:22"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="JER 49:23"/>Konsènan <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">49:23 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="GEN 14:15">Jen 14:15</ref></char></note>Damas.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 49:23">“Hamath ak Arpad fè wont nèt,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 49:23">paske yo te resevwa move nouvèl.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 49:23">Yo dekouraje. Kouraj yo ba nèt.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 49:23">Gen enkyetid bò lanmè a;</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 49:23">li pa ka kalme.<verse eid="JER 49:23"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="JER 49:24"/>Damas vin enpwisan nèt;</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 49:24">li te vire sove ale, e gwo laperèz fin sezi li.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 49:24">Gwo doulè ak sezisman pran l</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 49:24">tankou yon fanm k ap akouche.<verse eid="JER 49:24"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="JER 49:25"/>Ki jan <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">49:25 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="JER 33:9">Jr 33:9</ref></char></note>vil lwanj Mwen an pa vin dezète,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 49:25">vil lajwa Mwen an!<verse eid="JER 49:25"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="JER 49:26"/>Konsa, <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">49:26 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="JER 11:22">Jr 11:22</ref></char></note>jennonm pa l yo va tonbe nan ri li yo</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 49:26">e tout mesye lagè yo va tonbe an silans nan jou sa a,”</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 49:26">deklare SENYÈ dèzame yo.<verse eid="JER 49:26"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="JER 49:27"/>Mwen va mete dife nan miray Damas lan</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 49:27">e li va devore tou bèl palè Ben-hadad yo.<verse eid="JER 49:27"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="JER 49:28"/>Konsènan Kédar ak wayòm a Hatsor yo,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 49:28">ke Nebucadnetsar, wa Babylone nan, te pran nan batay.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 49:28">Konsa pale SENYÈ a:</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 49:28">“Leve monte Kédar e detwi <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">49:28 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="JOB 1:3">Job 1:3</ref></char></note>mesye nan lès yo.<verse eid="JER 49:28"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="JER 49:29"/>Yo va pran tant yo ak bann mouton yo;</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 49:29">yo va pote pou kont yo tout rido tant yo,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 49:29">tout byen yo ak tout <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">49:29 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="1CH 5:21">I Kwo 5:21</ref></char></note>chamo yo</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 49:29">e yo va rele a youn lòt: ‘Gwo laperèz tout kote!’<verse eid="JER 49:29"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="30" style="v" sid="JER 49:30"/>“Kouri, sove ale! Rete nan pwofondè yo, o pèp Hatsor a”,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 49:30">deklare SENYÈ a:</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 49:30">“Paske <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">49:30 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="JER 25:9">Jr 25:9</ref></char></note>Nebucadnetsar, wa Babylone nan,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 49:30">te pran konsey kont nou,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 49:30">e te fome yon plan kont nou.<verse eid="JER 49:30"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="31" style="v" sid="JER 49:31"/>Leve monte kont yon nasyon <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">49:31 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="JDG 18:7">Jij 18:7</ref></char></note>ki alèz, ki viv ansekirite,”</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 49:31">deklare SENYÈ a:</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 49:31">“Li pa gen pòtay, ni fè fòje;</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 49:31">yo rete pou kont yo.”<verse eid="JER 49:31"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="32" style="v" sid="JER 49:32"/>Chamo pa yo va devni piyaj,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 49:32">gran kantite bèt yo va sèvi kon bagay sòlda pran,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 49:32">Mwen va <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">49:32 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="EZK 5:10">Éz 5:10</ref></char></note>gaye bay tout van yo a sila ki</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 49:32">koupe kwen cheve yo;</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 49:32">e Mwen va mennen sou yo gwo dezas ki sòti tout kote,”</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 49:32">deklare SENYÈ a.<verse eid="JER 49:32"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="33" style="v" sid="JER 49:33"/>“Hatsor va vin yon kote pou chen mawon,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 49:33">yon kote dezole jis pou tout tan.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 49:33">P ap gen moun ki rete la,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 49:33">ni yon grenn nan fis a lòm p ap rete ladann.”<verse eid="JER 49:33"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="34" style="v" sid="JER 49:34"/>Sa ki te sòti kon pawòl SENYÈ a konsènan Élam, nan kòmansman règn a Sédécias, wa Juda a, t ap di: <verse eid="JER 49:34"/><verse number="35" style="v" sid="JER 49:35"/>“Konsa pale SENYÈ dèzame yo:</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 49:35">‘Gade byen, Mwen va <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">49:35 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="PSA 46:9">Sòm 46:9</ref></char></note>kraze banza Élam nan,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 49:35">pi fò nan pwisans pa yo.<verse eid="JER 49:35"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="36" style="v" sid="JER 49:36"/>Mwen va mennen sou Élam kat van</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 49:36">ki sòti nan kat pwent syèl yo,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 49:36">e Mwen va <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">49:36 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="JER 49:32">Jr 49:32</ref></char></note>gaye pèp yo a tout van sa yo.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 49:36">P ap gen nasyon kote moun rejte a Élam yo pa prale.<verse eid="JER 49:36"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="37" style="v" sid="JER 49:37"/>Konsa, Mwen va kraze Élam devan lènmi yo</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 49:37">ak devan sila k ap chache lavi yo.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 49:37">Mwen va <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">49:37 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="JER 6:19">Jr 6:19</ref></char></note>mennen gwo kalamite sou yo,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 49:37">menm kòlè sovaj Mwen’, deklare SENYÈ a.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 49:37">‘Mwen va voye nepe kont yo</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 49:37">jiskaske Mwen fin manje yo nèt.<verse eid="JER 49:37"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="38" style="v" sid="JER 49:38"/>Epi Mwen va mete twòn pa Mwen nan Élam,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 49:38">e Mwen va detwi wa pa yo ak ofisye pa yo,’ deklare SENYÈ a.<verse eid="JER 49:38"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="39" style="v" sid="JER 49:39"/>‘Men li va vin rive nan dènye jou yo,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 49:39">ke Mwen va <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">49:39 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="JER 48:47">Jr 48:47</ref></char></note>restore fòtin Élam yo’, deklare SENYÈ a.”<verse eid="JER 49:39"/></para>
  <chapter eid="JER 49"/>
  <chapter number="50" style="c" sid="JER 50"/>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="JER 50:1"/>Pawòl ke SENYÈ a te pale konsènan <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">50:1 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="GEN 10:10">Jen 10:10</ref></char></note>Babylone, peyi Kaldeyen yo, pa Jérémie, pwofèt la:<verse eid="JER 50:1"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="JER 50:2"/>“Deklare e pwoklame pami nasyon yo.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 50:2">Pwoklame sa e leve yon drapo.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 50:2">Pa kache sa, men di: <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">50:2 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="JER 51:31">Jr 51:31</ref></char></note> ‘Babylone te kaptire</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 50:2">Bel gen tan plen regre,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 50:2">Merodac fin nan gwo twoub!</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 50:2">Imaj li yo fè wont, e zidòl li yo fin sans espwa.’<verse eid="JER 50:2"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="JER 50:3"/>Paske yon nasyon gen tan monte kont li soti nan <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">50:3 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ISA 13:7">És 13:7</ref></char></note>nò;</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 50:3">sa va fè peyi li vin yon objè degoutan</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 50:3">e p ap genyen moun ki rete ladann.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 50:3">Ni moun, ni bèt fin egare ale; yo ale nèt!<verse eid="JER 50:3"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="JER 50:4"/>“Nan jou sa yo ak nan lè sa a,” deklare SENYÈ a:</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 50:4">“Fis Israël yo va vini, ni yo menm, ni fis a Juda yo tou;</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 50:4">yo va avanse ap kriye <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">50:4 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="EZK 3:12-13">Éz 3:12-13</ref></char></note>pandan yo prale</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 50:4">e se SENYÈ a, Bondye ke yo va chache a.<verse eid="JER 50:4"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="JER 50:5"/>Yo va <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">50:5 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ISA 35:8">És 35:8</ref></char></note>mande pou chemen ki ale nan Sion an,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 50:5">e vire figi yo vè direksyon li.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 50:5">Yo va di ‘Vin mete tèt nou ak SENYÈ a,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 50:5">nan yon akò k ap dire jis pou tout tan,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 50:5">youn ki p ap janm bliye.’<verse eid="JER 50:5"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="JER 50:6"/>Pèp Mwen an gen tan vin <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">50:6 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ISA 53:6">És 53:6</ref></char></note>mouton ki pèdi.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 50:6">Bèje yo te egare yo.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 50:6">Yo te fè yo vire akote mòn yo.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 50:6">Yo te avanse soti sou mòn pou rive sou kolin,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 50:6">e yo te bliye plas repo yo.<verse eid="JER 50:6"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="JER 50:7"/>Tout moun ki rive sou yo te devore yo;</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 50:7">epi advèsè yo te di: <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">50:7 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="JER 2:3">Jr 2:3</ref></char></note> ‘Nou pa koupab,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 50:7">paske se yo ki te peche kont SENYÈ</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 50:7">ki se abitasyon ladwati a,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 50:7">menm SENYÈ a, espwa a papa zansèt yo.’<verse eid="JER 50:7"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="JER 50:8"/>“Detounen kite <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">50:8 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ISA 48:20">És 48:20</ref></char></note>mitan Babylone!</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 50:8">Sòti nan peyi Kaldeyen yo.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 50:8">Fè konsi se mal kabrit k ap mache nan tèt bann an.<verse eid="JER 50:8"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="JER 50:9"/>Paske gade byen, Mwen va <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">50:9 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="JER 51:1">Jr 51:1</ref></char></note>leve fè parèt kont Babylone,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 50:9">yon gwo foul nasyon pwisan soti nan peyi nò a.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 50:9">Yo va rale lign batay yo kont li.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 50:9">Depi la, yo va vin an kaptivite.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 50:9">Flèch yo va tankou yon gèrye ekspè,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 50:9">ki pa janm retounen men vid.<verse eid="JER 50:9"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="JER 50:10"/>Chaldée va vin yon viktim;</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 50:10">tout moun ki piyaje li va jwenn kont yo,”</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 50:10">deklare SENYÈ a.<verse eid="JER 50:10"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="JER 50:11"/>“Akoz nou kontan, akoz nou ap fete,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 50:11">o nou menm ki te konn <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">50:11 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="JER 12:14">Jr 12:14</ref></char></note>piyaje eritaj Mwen an;</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 50:11">akoz nou fè sote tankou yon jenn gazèl</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 50:11">k ap foule sereyal;</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 50:11">epi ki vin ranni kon jenn poulen,<verse eid="JER 50:11"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="JER 50:12"/>
    <note caller="+" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">50:12 </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="JER 15:9">Jr 15:9</ref>
      </char>
    </note>manman nou va tèlman wont,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 50:12">sila ki te bay nou nesans lan va imilye.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 50:12">Gade byen, li va pi piti pami nasyon yo,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 50:12">yon savann, yon peyi sèch, yon dezè.<verse eid="JER 50:12"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="JER 50:13"/>Akoz endiyasyon SENYÈ a, li p ap abite,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 50:13">men li va dezole nèt.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 50:13">Tout moun ki pase kote Babylone va vin sezi.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 50:13">E va sifle kon koulèv akoz tout dega li yo.<verse eid="JER 50:13"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="JER 50:14"/>Monte lign batay ou kont Babylone tout kote,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 50:14">nou tout ki konn koube banza.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 50:14">Tire sou li.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 50:14">Pa konsève flèch nou yo,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 50:14">paske li te peche kont SENYÈ a.<verse eid="JER 50:14"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="JER 50:15"/>Leve kriye batay la kont li tout kote!</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 50:15">Li te tonbe. Mi defans li yo fin tonbe,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 50:15">miray li yo fin demoli.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 50:15">Paske sa se <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">50:15 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="PSA 137:8">Sòm 137:8</ref></char></note>vanjans SENYÈ a.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 50:15">Pran vanjans sou li.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 50:15">Jan li te konn fè a, fè l konsa.<verse eid="JER 50:15"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="JER 50:16"/>Koupe retire <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">50:16 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="JOL 1:11">Jl 1:11</ref></char></note>kiltivatè Babylone nan;</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 50:16">ak sila ki voye kouto nan lè rekòlt la.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 50:16">Akoz krent nepe opresè a,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 50:16">yo chak va retounen vè pwòp pèp pa yo,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 50:16">e yo chak va sove ale nan pwòp peyi yo.<verse eid="JER 50:16"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="JER 50:17"/>“Israël se yon <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">50:17 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="JOL 3:2">Jl 3:2</ref></char></note>bann moun kap kouri devan lachas</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 50:17">lyon an te chase yo ale.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 50:17">Premye ki te devore li a se te wa Assyrie a,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 50:17">e dènye ki te kraze zo li yo se te Nebucadnetsar, wa Babylone nan.”<verse eid="JER 50:17"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="JER 50:18"/>Pou sa, konsa pale SENYÈ dèzame yo, Bondye Israël la:</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 50:18">“Gade byen, Mwen va pini wa Babylone nan ak peyi li a,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 50:18">menm jan ke M <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">50:18 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ISA 10:12">És 10:12</ref></char></note>te pini wa Assyrie a.<verse eid="JER 50:18"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="JER 50:19"/>Epi Mwen va <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">50:19 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ISA 65:10">És 65:10</ref></char></note>mennen Israël retounen nan patiraj li</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 50:19">e li va jwen manje li sou Carmel ak sou Basan;</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 50:19">epi dezi li va satisfè nan peyi kolin Éphraïm ak Galaad yo.<verse eid="JER 50:19"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="JER 50:20"/>Nan jou sa yo ak nan lè sa a”, deklare SENYÈ a:</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 50:20">“rechèch va fèt pou jwenn inikite Israël la,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 50:20">men <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">50:20 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ISA 43:25">És 43:25</ref></char></note>p ap genyen;</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 50:20">epi pou peche a Juda yo, men yo p ap jwenn;</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 50:20">paske Mwen va padone sila ke M kite kon retay yo.”<verse eid="JER 50:20"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="JER 50:21"/>“Kont peyi Merathaïm nan monte;</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 50:21">kont li ak kont moun <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">50:21 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="EZK 23:23">Éz 23:23</ref></char></note>Pékod yo.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 50:21">Touye yo e detwi yo nèt,” deklare SENYÈ a;</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 50:21">“epi fè selon tout sa ke M te kòmande nou yo.<verse eid="JER 50:21"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="JER 50:22"/>Bri batay la nan peyi a</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 50:22">ak destriksyon an vin gran.<verse eid="JER 50:22"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="JER 50:23"/>Gade kijan <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">50:23 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="JER 51:20-24">Jr 51:20-24</ref></char></note>mato k ap frape tout latè a</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 50:23">fin koupe an moso e kraze!</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 50:23">Gade kijan Babylone te vin yon objè degoutan pami nasyon yo!<verse eid="JER 50:23"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="JER 50:24"/>Mwen te <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">50:24 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="JER 48:43-44">Jr 48:43-44</ref></char></note>poze yon pèlen pou ou</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 50:24">e ou menm te kenbe tou, o Babylone.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 50:24">Pandan ou pa t menm konnen,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 50:24">ou tou te dekouvri, ou e te pran,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 50:24">akoz ou te goumen kont SENYÈ a.”<verse eid="JER 50:24"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="JER 50:25"/>SENYÈ a te ouvri depo zam Li.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 50:25">Li te fè parèt <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">50:25 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ISA 13:5">És 13:5</ref></char></note>zam endiyasyon Li yo,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 50:25">paske Senyè BONDYE Dèzame yo</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 50:25">gen travay ki pou fèt nan peyi Kaldeyen yo.<verse eid="JER 50:25"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="JER 50:26"/>Vin kote li soti nan lizyè ki pi lwen an.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 50:26">Ouvri depo li yo.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 50:26">Anpile li kon gwo pil.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 50:26">
    <note caller="+" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">50:26 </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="ISA 14:23">És 14:23</ref>
      </char>
    </note>Detwi li nèt.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 50:26">Pa kite anyen rete pou li.<verse eid="JER 50:26"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="JER 50:27"/>
    <note caller="+" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">50:27 </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="ISA 34:7">És 34:7</ref>
      </char>
    </note>Mete tout jenn towo li yo a nepe.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 50:27">Kite yo desann nan masak la!</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 50:27">Malè a yo menm, paske jou pa yo a rive,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 50:27">lè pinisyon pa yo a.<verse eid="JER 50:27"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="JER 50:28"/>Tande <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">50:28 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ISA 48:20">És 48:20</ref></char></note>bri a sila k ap sove ale yo,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 50:28">ak sila k ap pran flit kite tè Babylone nan,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 50:28">pou deklare an Sion vanjans a SENYÈ Bondye nou an;</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 50:28">vanjans pou tanp Li an.<verse eid="JER 50:28"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="JER 50:29"/>“Rele anpil kont Babylone,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 50:29">tout sila ki konn koube banza yo.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 50:29">Fè kan kont li tout kote,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 50:29">pa bay li mwayen pou chape menm.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 50:29">Rekonpanse li selon zèv li yo.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 50:29">Selon tout sa li te fè yo, konsa fè li;</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 50:29">paske li te vin <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">50:29 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="EXO 10:3">Egz 10:3</ref></char></note>awogan kont SENYÈ a,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 50:29">kont Sila Ki Sen an Israël la.<verse eid="JER 50:29"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="30" style="v" sid="JER 50:30"/>Pou sa, <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">50:30 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ISA 13:17">És 13:17</ref></char></note>jennonm pa l yo va tonbe nan lari;</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 50:30">e tout mesye lagè li yo va tonbe an silans</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 50:30">nan jou sa a,” deklare SENYÈ a.<verse eid="JER 50:30"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="31" style="v" sid="JER 50:31"/>“Gade byen, <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">50:31 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="JER 21:13">Jr 21:13</ref></char></note>Mwen kont ou,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 50:31">O sila ki plen awogans lan”, deklare Senyè BONDYE dèzame yo,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 50:31">“Paske jou pa ou a fin rive,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 50:31">lè ke M va pini ou a.<verse eid="JER 50:31"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="32" style="v" sid="JER 50:32"/>
    <note caller="+" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">50:32 </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="ISA 10:12-15">És 10:12-15</ref>
      </char>
    </note>Sila ki awogan an va glise tonbe, san pèsòn pou leve li;</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 50:32">epi Mwen va mete dife nan vil li yo</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 50:32">e li va devore tout andwa l yo.”<verse eid="JER 50:32"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="33" style="v" sid="JER 50:33"/>Konsa pale SENYÈ dèzame yo:</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 50:33">“Fis Israël yo vin oprime, ansanm ak fis a Juda yo.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 50:33">
    <note caller="+" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">50:33 </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="ISA 14:17">És 14:17</ref>
      </char>
    </note>Tout moun ki te pran yo an kaptivite yo</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 50:33">te kenbe yo di.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 50:33">Yo te refize lage yo.<verse eid="JER 50:33"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="34" style="v" sid="JER 50:34"/>Redanmtè yo a fò.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 50:34">SENYÈ dèzame yo se non Li;</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 50:34">Li va plede ka yo ak gwo fòs</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 50:34">pou L ka mennen lapè sou tè a,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 50:34">ak gwo twoub sou sila ki rete Babylone yo.<verse eid="JER 50:34"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="35" style="v" sid="JER 50:35"/>“Yon nepe kont Kaldeyen yo”, deklare SENYÈ a:</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 50:35">“Kont moun ki rete Babylone yo,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 50:35">kont <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">50:35 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="DAN 5:1-8">Dan 5:1-8</ref></char></note>ofisye li yo ak mesye saj li yo!<verse eid="JER 50:35"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="36" style="v" sid="JER 50:36"/>Yon nepe kont <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">50:36 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ISA 44:25">És 44:25</ref></char></note>moun anfle yo;</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 50:36">yo va devni moun fou!</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 50:36">Yon nepe kont mesye pwisan li yo;</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 50:36">yo va twouble nèt!<verse eid="JER 50:36"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="37" style="v" sid="JER 50:37"/>Yon nepe kont <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">50:37 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="PSA 20:7">Sòm 20:7</ref></char></note>cheval li yo,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 50:37">kont cha lagè yo,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 50:37">kont tout etranje ki rete nan mitan l yo</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 50:37">e yo va vin tankou fanm!</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 50:37">Yon nepe rete sou trezò li yo,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 50:37">e yo va piyaje!<verse eid="JER 50:37"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="38" style="v" sid="JER 50:38"/>Yon sechrès sou dlo li yo,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 50:38">e yo va vin sèch nèt!</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 50:38">Paske se yon peyi <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">50:38 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ISA 46:1-7">És 46:1-7</ref></char></note>imaj taye,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 50:38">e yo fou pou zidòl sa yo.<verse eid="JER 50:38"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="39" style="v" sid="JER 50:39"/>Akoz sa, <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">50:39 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ISA 13:21">És 13:21</ref></char></note>bèt dezè yo va viv la,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 50:39">ansanm ak chen mawon.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 50:39">Anplis, otrich va viv ladann,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 50:39">e li p ap janm gen moun ladann ankò,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 50:39">ni moun k ap viv la de jenerasyon an jenerasyon.<verse eid="JER 50:39"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="40" style="v" sid="JER 50:40"/>“Tankou lè Bondye te boulvèse <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">50:40 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="GEN 19:24-25">Jen 19:24-25</ref></char></note>Sodome ak Gomorrhe</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 50:40">ak vwazen li yo,” deklare SENYÈ a:</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 50:40">“Nanpwen moun k ap viv la, ni fis a lòm k ap rete ladann.<verse eid="JER 50:40"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="41" style="v" sid="JER 50:41"/>“Gade byen, yon pèp ap vini <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">50:41 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ISA 13:2-5">És 13:2-5</ref></char></note>soti nan nò,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 50:41">Yon gwo nasyon ak anpil wa</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 50:41">va leve soti nan dènye pwent latè.<verse eid="JER 50:41"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="42" style="v" sid="JER 50:42"/>Yo sezi banza yo, ak lans yo;</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 50:42">yo mechan e yo san mizerikòd.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 50:42">
    <note caller="+" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">50:42 </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="ISA 5:30">És 5:30</ref>
      </char>
    </note>Vwa yo gwonde tankou lanmè.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 50:42">Yo monte sou cheval yo,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 50:42">chaken byen òdone tankou moun</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 50:42">pou fè batay kont ou, O fi a Babylone nan.<verse eid="JER 50:42"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="43" style="v" sid="JER 50:43"/>Wa Babylone nan te tande rapò de yo,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 50:43">e men li pann san fòs.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 50:43">
    <note caller="+" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">50:43 </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="JER 30:6">Jr 30:6</ref>
      </char>
    </note>Gwo dekourajman sezi li;</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 50:43">gwo doulè tankou yon fanm k ap pouse pitit.<verse eid="JER 50:43"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="44" style="v" sid="JER 50:44"/>Gade byen, youn va monte kon yon lyon</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 50:44">soti nan rakbwa Jourdain an,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 50:44">rive nan yon abitasyon byen fò;</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 50:44">paske nan yon moman, Mwen va fè yo kouri kite li.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 50:44">Epi nenpòt moun ki <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">50:44 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="NUM 16:5">Nonb 16:5</ref></char></note>chwazi,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 50:44">Mwen va dezinye l mete sou li.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 50:44">Paske se kilès ki tankou Mwen?</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 50:44">E se kilès k ap fè m tan lè M?</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 50:44">Kilès ki bèje ki ka kanpe devan M?”<verse eid="JER 50:44"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="45" style="v" sid="JER 50:45"/>Pou sa, tande <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">50:45 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="PSA 33:11">Sòm 33:11</ref></char></note>konsèy SENYÈ a,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 50:45">ke li te fè kont Babylone;</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 50:45">plan a ke Li deja fome kont peyi Kaldeyen yo:</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 50:45">Anverite, yo va vin trennen deyò,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 50:45">menm piti nan bann mouton yo.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 50:45">Anverite, li va fè abitasyon yo dezole sou yo.<verse eid="JER 50:45"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="46" style="v" sid="JER 50:46"/>Latè vin souke ak gwo kri “Babylone te vin pran!”</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 50:46">E <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">50:46 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ISA 5:7">És 5:7</ref></char></note>gwo kri sa a vin tande pami nasyon yo.<verse eid="JER 50:46"/></para>
  <chapter eid="JER 50"/>
  <chapter number="51" style="c" sid="JER 51"/>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="JER 51:1"/>Konsa pale SENYÈ a:</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 51:1">“Gade byen, Mwen va fè leve kont Babylone</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 51:1">e kont moun k ap viv Chaldée yo,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 51:1">
    <note caller="+" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">51:1 </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="JER 4:11-12">Jr 4:11-12</ref>
      </char>
    </note>lespri a yon van kap detwi.<verse eid="JER 51:1"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="JER 51:2"/>Mwen va voye etranje yo Babylone</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 51:2">pou yo ka <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">51:2 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ISA 41:16">És 41:16</ref></char></note>vannen l,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 51:2">pou yo kapab devaste peyi li a;</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 51:2">paske tout kote nan jou gwo malè li a,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 51:2">yo va kontra li toupatou.<verse eid="JER 51:2"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="JER 51:3"/>Kontra sila a ki <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">51:3 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="JER 50:14-29">Jr 50:14-29</ref></char></note>koube a,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 51:3">kite achè koube banza li.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 51:3">Kontra sila a ki leve nan pwotèj li yo,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 51:3">pa kite jennonm li yo chape!</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 51:3">Touye tout lame li nèt!<verse eid="JER 51:3"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="JER 51:4"/>Yo va tonbe atè mouri nan peyi Kaldeyen yo,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 51:4">
    <note caller="+" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">51:4 </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="ISA 13:5">És 13:5</ref>
      </char>
    </note>frennen nèt, kouche nan lari yo.<verse eid="JER 51:4"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="JER 51:5"/>Paske ni Israël, ni Juda te abandone pa Bondye li,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 51:5">SENYÈ dèzame yo;</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 51:5">sepandan, peyi yo <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">51:5 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="HOS 4:1-2">Os 4:1-2</ref></char></note>plen koupabilite devan</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 51:5">Sila Ki Sen an Israël la.<verse eid="JER 51:5"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="JER 51:6"/>
    <note caller="+" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">51:6 </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="JER 50:8-28">Jr 50:8-28</ref>
      </char>
    </note>“Sove ale soti nan mitan Babylone!</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 51:6">Nou chak sove lavi nou!</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 51:6">Pa vin koupe retire nan inikite l,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 51:6">paske sa se lè vanjans SENYÈ a.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 51:6">Li va rann rekonpans bay li.<verse eid="JER 51:6"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="JER 51:7"/>Babylone te yon tas fèt an lò nan men SENYÈ a,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 51:7">ki te fè tout mond lan vin sou.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 51:7">Nasyon yo te bwè nan diven li an;</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 51:7">akoz sa, nasyon yo ap vin anraje.<verse eid="JER 51:7"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="JER 51:8"/>Sibitman, <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">51:8 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ISA 21:9">És 21:9</ref></char></note>Babylone vin tonbe e kraze nèt;</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 51:8">rele anmwey sou li!</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 51:8">Pote pomad pou doulè li.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 51:8">Petèt li ka geri.<verse eid="JER 51:8"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="JER 51:9"/>“Nou te pito gerizon pou Babylone,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 51:9">men li pa t geri.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 51:9">Abandone l.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 51:9">Kite nou chak ale nan pwòp peyi pa nou;</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 51:9">paske jijman li an <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">51:9 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="EZK 9:6">Éz 9:6</ref></char></note>fin rive nan syèl la,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 51:9">e leve wo rive jis nan syèl yo.<verse eid="JER 51:9"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="JER 51:10"/>‘SENYÈ a te <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">51:10 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="PSA 37:6">Sòm 37:6</ref></char></note>mennen ladwati nou an.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 51:10">Vini, annou rakonte depi nan Sion</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 51:10">zèv a SENYÈ a, Bondye nou an!’<verse eid="JER 51:10"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="JER 51:11"/>
    <note caller="+" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">51:11 </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="JER 46:4-9">Jr 46:4-9</ref>
      </char>
    </note>“File flèch, plen fouwo yo!</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 51:11">Kenbe pwotèj yo djanm!</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 51:11">SENYÈ a te fè leve lespri a wa yo nan Médie,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 51:11">paske volonte L kont Babylone, pou detwi li.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 51:11">Paske se vanjans SENYÈ a,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 51:11">vanjans pou tanp Li an.<verse eid="JER 51:11"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="JER 51:12"/>Leve yon sinyal kont miray Babylone yo!</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 51:12">Plase yon gad byen fò!</para>
  <para style="b" vid="JER 51:12"/>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 51:12">Pozisyone santinèl yo,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 51:12">mete gason an anbiskad.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 51:12">Paske SENYÈ a pa t sèlman <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">51:12 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="JER 4:28">Jr 4:28</ref></char></note>fè plan,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 51:12">men te acheve objektif sa Li te pale</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 51:12">konsènan sila ki rete Babylone yo.<verse eid="JER 51:12"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="JER 51:13"/>O nou menm ki rete bò kote anpil dlo yo,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 51:13">plen ak richès yo,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 51:13">dènye lè nou an gen tan rive,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 51:13">mezi <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">51:13 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ISA 57:17">És 57:17</ref></char></note>gwo lanvi nou.<verse eid="JER 51:13"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="JER 51:14"/>SENYÈ dèzame yo te sèmante pa kont Li.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 51:14">Li te di:</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 51:14">‘Anverite, mwen va plen nou ak moun</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 51:14">kon yon gwo foul krikèt volan</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 51:14">e yo va kriye fò ak gwo kri laviktwa sou nou.’<verse eid="JER 51:14"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="JER 51:15"/>“Sila ki te fè latè a ak fòs pouvwa Li a,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 51:15">ki te etabli lemonn ak sajès Li,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 51:15">e ak bon konprann Li, te <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">51:15 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="JOB 9:8">Job 9:8</ref></char></note>etabli syèl yo.<verse eid="JER 51:15"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="JER 51:16"/>Lè <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">51:16 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="JOB 37:2-6">Job 37:2-6</ref></char></note>vwa L sone,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 51:16">yon gwo kaskad dlo desann nan syèl yo,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 51:16">e Li fè nwaj monte soti nan dènye pwent latè yo.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 51:16">Li fè loray pou lapli,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 51:16">e mennen van parèt sòti nan depo Li yo.<verse eid="JER 51:16"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="JER 51:17"/>“Tout lòm gen tan fè bèt, san okenn konesans;</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 51:17">tout òfèv yo fè wont akoz imaj fonn yo,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 51:17">paske imaj fonn yo se yon desepsyon</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 51:17">e nanpwen souf nan yo.<verse eid="JER 51:17"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="JER 51:18"/>Yo <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">51:18 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="JER 18:15">Jr 18:15</ref></char></note>san valè, yon zèv pou moke moun;</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 51:18">nan tan pinisyon yo, yo va peri.<verse eid="JER 51:18"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="JER 51:19"/>
    <note caller="+" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">51:19 </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="PSA 73:26">Sòm 73:26</ref>
      </char>
    </note>Pòsyon Jacob pa tankou sa yo;</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 51:19">paske Sila ki fè tout bagay la se Li menm</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 51:19">e selon tribi eritaj Li a,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 51:19">SENYÈ dèzame yo se non L.<verse eid="JER 51:19"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="JER 51:20"/>“Li di: “Ou se baton lagè M ak zam lagè M yo;</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 51:20">epi avèk ou, Mwen kraze nasyon yo.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 51:20">Avèk ou, Mwen detwi wayòm yo.<verse eid="JER 51:20"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="JER 51:21"/>Avèk ou, Mwen <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">51:21 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="EXO 15:1">Egz 15:1</ref></char></note>kraze cheval la</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 51:21">ak sila ki monte sou li.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 51:21">Avèk ou, mwen kraze cha lagè a,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 51:21">ak sila ki monte ladann nan.<verse eid="JER 51:21"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="JER 51:22"/>Avèk ou, Mwen kraze ni gason, ni fanm.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 51:22">Avèk ou, Mwen kraze jennonm nan ak vyèj la.<verse eid="JER 51:22"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="JER 51:23"/>Avèk ou, Mwen kraze bèje a ak bann mouton li an.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 51:23">Avèk ou, Mwen kraze kiltivatè a ak bèf cha li yo</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 51:23">Avèk ou, Mwen kraze majistra yo ak prefè yo.<verse eid="JER 51:23"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="JER 51:24"/>“Mwen va rekonpanse Babylone ak tout pèp Chaldée a pou <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">51:24 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="JER 50:15-29">Jr 50:15-29</ref></char></note>tout mechanste ke yo te fè nan Sion devan zye nou”, deklare SENYÈ a.<verse eid="JER 51:24"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="JER 51:25"/>“Gade byen, <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">51:25 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="JER 50:31">Jr 50:31</ref></char></note>Mwen kont ou O mòn k ap detwi,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 51:25">ki detwi tout tè a,” deklare SENYÈ a:</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 51:25">“Mwen va lonje men M kont ou,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 51:25">fè ou woule desann soti nan kwen falèz byen wo yo</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 51:25">e Mwen va fè ou vin yon mòn ki fin brile nèt.<verse eid="JER 51:25"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="JER 51:26"/>Yo p ap pran nan men ou,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 51:26">menm yon wòch pou fè kwen,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 51:26">ni yon wòch pou fondasyon yo,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 51:26">men ou va <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">51:26 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ISA 13:19-22">És 13:19-22</ref></char></note>dezole jis pou tout tan,” deklare SENYÈ a.<verse eid="JER 51:26"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="JER 51:27"/>“Leve yon sinyal nan peyi a,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 51:27">soufle yon twonpèt pami nasyon yo!</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 51:27">Konsakre nasyon yo kont li!</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 51:27">Rele kont li wayòm <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">51:27 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="GEN 8:4">Jen 8:4</ref></char></note>Ararat, Minni ak Aschkenaz yo!</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 51:27">Chwazi yon gwo chèf kont li;</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 51:27">leve cheval tankou yon foul krikèt volan voras.<verse eid="JER 51:27"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="JER 51:28"/>Konsakre nasyon yo kont li,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 51:28">Wa a Médie yo, majistra pa yo ak prefè yo,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 51:28">ak tout peyi ke yo konn domine yo.<verse eid="JER 51:28"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="JER 51:29"/>
    <note caller="+" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">51:29 </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="JER 8:16">Jr 8:16</ref>
      </char>
    </note>Peyi a ta tranble e tòde;</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 51:29">paske volonte a SENYÈ a kont Babylone kanpe,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 51:29">pou fè peyi Babylone vin yon dezolasyon san moun.<verse eid="JER 51:29"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="30" style="v" sid="JER 51:30"/>Mesye pwisan a Babylone yo te sispann goumen;</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 51:30">yo rete nan sitadèl fòtifye yo.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 51:30">Fòs yo fin epwize nèt.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 51:30">Yo vin tankou fanm.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 51:30">Lakay yo pran dife.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 51:30">Fè fòje sou pòtay li yo fin kraze.<verse eid="JER 51:30"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="31" style="v" sid="JER 51:31"/>
    <note caller="+" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">51:31 </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="2CH 30:6">II Kwo 30:6</ref>
      </char>
    </note>Youn kouri rankontre yon lòt;</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 51:31">yon mesaje rankontre yon lòt,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 51:31">pou pale wa Babylone nan ke vil li a fin kaptire,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 51:31">soti nan yon pwent pou rive nan yon lòt.<verse eid="JER 51:31"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="32" style="v" sid="JER 51:32"/>Kote pou yo janbe rivyè yo fin sezi tou.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 51:32">Yo te brile marekaj yo ak dife,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 51:32">e sòlda lagè yo vin sezi ak gwo laperèz.”<verse eid="JER 51:32"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="33" style="v" sid="JER 51:33"/>Paske konsa pale SENYÈ dèzame yo, Bondye Israël la:</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 51:33">“Fi Babylone nan tankou yon <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">51:33 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ISA 21:10">És 21:10</ref></char></note>glasi vannen.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 51:33">Nan lè li, li foule byen solid, men nan yon ti tan,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 51:33">sezon rekòlt la rive sou li.”<verse eid="JER 51:33"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="34" style="v" sid="JER 51:34"/>“Nebucadnetsar, wa Babylone nan, te devore mwen.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 51:34">Li te kraze mwen.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 51:34">Li te depoze mwen tankou yon boutèy vid.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 51:34">Tankou yon dragon, li te <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">51:34 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="JOB 20:15">Job 20:15</ref></char></note>vale mwen.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 51:34">Li te plen vant li ak bagay liks mwen yo.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 51:34">Li te lave mwen ale nèt.<verse eid="JER 51:34"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="35" style="v" sid="JER 51:35"/>Ke <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">51:35 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="PSA 137:8">Sòm 137:8</ref></char></note>vyolans anvè mwen an,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 51:35">e anvè chè mwen an,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 51:35">kapab tonbe sou Babylone.”</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 51:35">Pèp Sion an va di:</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 51:35">“Ke san mwen kapab tonbe sou moun Chaldée yo”,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 51:35">Jérusalem va di.<verse eid="JER 51:35"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="36" style="v" sid="JER 51:36"/>“Akoz sa”, pale SENYÈ a:</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 51:36">“Gade byen, Mwen va <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">51:36 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="PSA 140:12">Sòm 140:12</ref></char></note>plede ka ou,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 51:36">e egzije vanjans nèt pou ou.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 51:36">Mwen va seche lanmè li,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 51:36">e fè sous li yo vin sèch.<verse eid="JER 51:36"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="37" style="v" sid="JER 51:37"/>
    <note caller="+" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">51:37 </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="REV 18:2">Rev 18:2</ref>
      </char>
    </note>Babylone va devni yon gwo pil ranblè,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 51:37">yon kay pou chen mawon,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 51:37">yon objè degoutan, ak sifle kon koulèv,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 51:37">san gen moun ki rete ladann.<verse eid="JER 51:37"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="38" style="v" sid="JER 51:38"/>Yo va gwonde ansanm kon <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">51:38 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="JER 2:15">Jr 2:15</ref></char></note>jenn lyon,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 51:38">yo va gwonde kon pitit a lyon.<verse eid="JER 51:38"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="39" style="v" sid="JER 51:39"/>Lè yo vin rive cho ase, mwen va sèvi yo bankè yo,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 51:39">e fè yo sou, pou yo ka fè kè kontan nèt e <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">51:39 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="PSA 76:5">Sòm 76:5</ref></char></note>dòmi nèt,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 51:39">pou yo pa leve ankò menm”, deklare SENYÈ a.<verse eid="JER 51:39"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="40" style="v" sid="JER 51:40"/>“Mwen va bese yo tankou jenn mouton <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">51:40 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="JER 48:15">Jr 48:15</ref></char></note>nan labatwa,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 51:40">kon belye ansanm ak mal kabrit.<verse eid="JER 51:40"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="41" style="v" sid="JER 51:41"/>“Gade kijan <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">51:41 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="JER 25:26">Jr 25:26</ref></char></note>Schéschac fin kaptire!</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 51:41">Kijan glwa a tout tè a vin pran!</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 51:41">Gade kijan Babylone devni yon objè degoutan pami nasyon yo!<verse eid="JER 51:41"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="42" style="v" sid="JER 51:42"/>
    <note caller="+" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">51:42 </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="ISA 8:7-8">És 8:7-8</ref>
      </char>
    </note>Lanmè fin monte sou Babylone;</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 51:42">li te anvayi pa move vag li yo.<verse eid="JER 51:42"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="43" style="v" sid="JER 51:43"/>Vil li yo te devni yon objè degoutan e lèd,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 51:43">yon peyi sèk, yon dezè, yon peyi kote</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 51:43">
    <note caller="+" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">51:43 </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="ISA 13:20">És 13:20</ref>
      </char>
    </note>moun pa viv</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 51:43">e pami sila, yon fis a lòm pa menm pase.<verse eid="JER 51:43"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="44" style="v" sid="JER 51:44"/>Mwen va pini Bel nan Babylone</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 51:44">e Mwen va fè sa li te vale a <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">51:44 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="EZK 1:7-8">Éz 1:7-8</ref></char></note>sòti nan bouch li.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 51:44">Nasyon yo p ap kouri ankò kote li.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 51:44">Menm miray Babylone nan va tonbe!<verse eid="JER 51:44"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="45" style="v" sid="JER 51:45"/>
    <note caller="+" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">51:45 </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="ISA 48:20">És 48:20</ref>
      </char>
    </note>“Sòti nan mitan li, pèp Mwen an</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 51:45">e nou chak sove tèt nou de kòlè SENYÈ a.<verse eid="JER 51:45"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="46" style="v" sid="JER 51:46"/>Alò, pa kite kè nou vin febli e pa pè <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">51:46 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="2KI 19:7">II Wa 19:7</ref></char></note>rapò</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 51:46">k ap tande nan tout peyi a,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 51:46">paske rapò a va rive nan yon ane,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 51:46">e apre yon lòt rapò nan yon lòt ane,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 51:46">gen vyolans nan peyi a,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 51:46">e yon wa kont yon lòt wa.<verse eid="JER 51:46"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="47" style="v" sid="JER 51:47"/>Pou sa, gade byen, jou yo ap vini lè Mwen va pini</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 51:47">
    <note caller="+" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">51:47 </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="ISA 21:9">És 21:9</ref>
      </char>
    </note>zidòl taye a Babylone yo.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 51:47">Konsa, tout peyi li a va vin wont,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 51:47">e tout mò li yo va tonbe nan mitan li.<verse eid="JER 51:47"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="48" style="v" sid="JER 51:48"/>Answit, syèl ak tè a ak tout sa ki ladann va</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 51:48">rele fò ak jwa sou Babylone;</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 51:48">paske <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">51:48 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="JER 50:3">Jr 50:3</ref></char></note>destriktè yo va vin kote li soti nan nò,” deklare SENYÈ a.<verse eid="JER 51:48"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="49" style="v" sid="JER 51:49"/>“Anverite, Babylone gen pou tonbe</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 51:49">pou sila ki te touye an Israël yo.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 51:49">Menm jan pou Babylone an,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 51:49">
    <note caller="+" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">51:49 </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="REV 18:24">Rev 18:24</ref>
      </char>
    </note>moun de tout peyi a va tonbe.<verse eid="JER 51:49"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="50" style="v" sid="JER 51:50"/>Nou menm ki te chape anba nepe yo, sòti!</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 51:50">Pa rete menm!</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 51:50">
    <note caller="+" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">51:50 </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="DEU 4:29-31">Det 4:29-31</ref>
      </char>
    </note>Sonje SENYÈ a de lwen;</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 51:50">kite Jérusalem parèt nan lespri ou.<verse eid="JER 51:50"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="51" style="v" sid="JER 51:51"/>
    <note caller="+" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">51:51 </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="PSA 44:15">Sòm 44:15</ref>
      </char>
    </note>“Nou vin wont akoz nou te tande repwòch.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 51:51">Wont lan fin kouvri figi nou,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 51:51">paske etranje yo te antre kote ki sen lakay SENYÈ a.”<verse eid="JER 51:51"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="52" style="v" sid="JER 51:52"/>“Pou sa, gade byen, jou yo ap vini”, deklare SENYÈ a:</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 51:52">“Lè Mwen va fè jijman sou <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">51:52 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="JER 50:38">Jr 50:38</ref></char></note>zidòl taye yo.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 51:52">Konsa, sila ak blesi mòtèl yo</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 51:52">va plenyen nan tout peyi li a.<verse eid="JER 51:52"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="53" style="v" sid="JER 51:53"/>Malgre Babylone ta monte nan syèl la,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 51:53">e malgre li ta ranfòse sitadèl li a;</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 51:53">destriktè yo va soti kote <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">51:53 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ISA 13:3">És 13:3</ref></char></note>Mwen,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 51:53">e destriktè yo va rive kote li”, deklare SENYÈ a.<verse eid="JER 51:53"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="54" style="v" sid="JER 51:54"/>
    <note caller="+" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">51:54 </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="JER 48:3-5">Jr 48:3-5</ref>
      </char>
    </note>“Bri a gwo kri k ap sòti Babylone,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 51:54">ak gwo destriksyon k ap soti nan peyi Kaldeyen yo!<verse eid="JER 51:54"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="55" style="v" sid="JER 51:55"/>Paske SENYÈ a va detwi Babylone.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 51:55">Li va fè gran vwa a li te konn fè a sispann;</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 51:55">
    <note caller="+" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">51:55 </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="PSA 18:4">Sòm 18:4</ref>
      </char>
    </note>vag lanmè yo ki tap gwonde kon anpil dlo,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 51:55">ak gwo son a vwa yo ki tap retanti toupatou.<verse eid="JER 51:55"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="56" style="v" sid="JER 51:56"/>Paske sila k ap detwi a fin rive sou li,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 51:56">sou Babylone nan menm.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 51:56">Mesye pwisan li yo fin kaptire.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 51:56">Banza yo fin kraze nèt.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 51:56">Paske SENYÈ a se yon Bondye k ap bay rekonpans.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 51:56">L ap rekonpanse nèt.<verse eid="JER 51:56"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="57" style="v" sid="JER 51:57"/>Mwen va fè prens li yo ak saj li yo sou;</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 51:57">menm majistra li yo ak prefè li yo.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 51:57">Konsa, yo ka dòmi yon <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">51:57 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="PSA 76:5-6">Sòm 76:5-6</ref></char></note>dòmi san rete pou yo pa leve menm”,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 51:57">deklare Wa a, ki rele SENYÈ dèzame yo.<verse eid="JER 51:57"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="58" style="v" sid="JER 51:58"/>Konsa pale SENYÈ dèzame yo:</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 51:58">“Miray Babylone nan ki tèlman laj</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 51:58">va vin demoli nèt.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 51:58">Wo <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">51:58 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ISA 45:1-2">És 45:1-2</ref></char></note>pòtay li yo va pran dife.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 51:58">Donk, pèp yo va travay di pou ryen,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 51:58">e nasyon yo va bouke nèt akoz dife a.”<verse eid="JER 51:58"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="59" style="v" sid="JER 51:59"/>Mesaj ke Jérémie, pwofèt la, te kòmande Seraja, fis a Nérija a, pitit pitit gason a Machséja, lè l te ale ak <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">51:59 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="JER 28:1">Jr 28:1</ref></char></note>Sédécias, wa Juda a, Babylone nan katriyèm ane règn li a. (Alò, Seraja te chèf dirijan lakay wa a.) <verse eid="JER 51:59"/><verse number="60" style="v" sid="JER 51:60"/>Konsa, Jérémie te <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">51:60 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ISA 30:8">És 30:8</ref></char></note>ekri nan yon sèl woulo tout malè ki ta rive sou Babylone yo, sa vle di tout pawòl sila ki te ekri konsènan Babylone yo. <verse eid="JER 51:60"/><verse number="61" style="v" sid="JER 51:61"/>Epi Jérémie te di a Seraja: “Depi ou vini Babylone, alò, fè si ke ou li tout pawòl sila yo a wot vwa, <verse eid="JER 51:61"/><verse number="62" style="v" sid="JER 51:62"/>Epi di: ‘Ou menm, O SENYÈ! Ou te pwomèt, konsènan plas sa a pou koupe retire l nèt, pou pa menm gen <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">51:62 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="JER 51:43">Jr 51:43</ref></char></note>anyen ki rete ladann, ni lòm, ni bèt, men li va yon kote dezole jis pou tout tan’. <verse eid="JER 51:62"/><verse number="63" style="v" sid="JER 51:63"/>Konsa, li va fèt ke depi ou fin li woulo sa a, ou va mare yon wòch sou li e <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">51:63 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="JER 19:10">Jr 19:10</ref></char></note>jete l nan mitan rivyè Euphrate la. <verse eid="JER 51:63"/><verse number="64" style="v" sid="JER 51:64"/>Ou va di: ‘Se konsa Babylone va fonse desann pou l <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">51:64 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="NAM 1:8">Na 1:8</ref></char></note>pa leve ankò, akoz malè ke Mwen va mennen sou li; epi yo va vin bouke nèt.’”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="JER 51:64">Jiska prezan, sa se pawòl a Jérémie yo.<verse eid="JER 51:64"/></para>
  <chapter eid="JER 51"/>
  <chapter number="52" style="c" sid="JER 52"/>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="JER 52:1"/>
    <note caller="+" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">52:1 </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="2KI 24:18">II Wa 24:18</ref>
      </char>
    </note>Sédécias te gen laj a venteyen ane lè l te devni wa a e li te renye pandan onz ane Jérusalem. Non manman l te Hamuthal, fi a Jérémie nan Libna a. <verse eid="JER 52:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="JER 52:2"/>Li te fè mal nan zye SENYÈ a tankou tout sa ke <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">52:2 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="JER 36:30-31">Jr 36:30-31</ref></char></note>Jojakim te fè yo. <verse eid="JER 52:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="JER 52:3"/>Paske akoz kòlè SENYÈ a, bagay sa a te rive Jérusalem ak Juda jiskaske Li te jete yo deyò prezans Li.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="JER 52:3">Epi Sédécias te <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">52:3 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="2CH 36:13">II Kwo 36:13</ref></char></note>fè rebèl kont wa Babylone nan. <verse eid="JER 52:3"/><verse number="4" style="v" sid="JER 52:4"/>Alò, li te vin rive nan nevyèm ane règn li an, nan dizyèm jou nan dizyèm mwa a, ke Nebucadnetsar, wa Babylone nan te vini, li menm ak tout lame li a, kont Jérusalem, te fè kan kont li e te bati yon miray <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">52:4 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="JER 32:24">Jr 32:24</ref></char></note>syèj ki te antoure li. <verse eid="JER 52:4"/><verse number="5" style="v" sid="JER 52:5"/><note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">52:5 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="2KI 25:2">II Wa 25:2</ref></char></note>Konsa, vil la te anba syèj jis rive nan onzyèm ane a wa Sédécias.<verse eid="JER 52:5"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="JER 52:6"/>Nan Nevyèm jou nan katriyèm mwa a, <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">52:6 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="2KI 25:3">II Wa 25:3</ref></char></note> gwo grangou a te tèlman rèd nan vil la ke pa t gen manje pou pèp peyi a. <verse eid="JER 52:6"/><verse number="7" style="v" sid="JER 52:7"/>Konsa yo te <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">52:7 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="2KI 25:4">II Wa 25:4</ref></char></note>kase antre nan vil la, e tout mesye lagè yo te kouri kite vil la pandan lannwit lan bò kote pòtay ki te antre de miray ki te akote jaden a wa a. Sepandan, Kaldeyen yo te antoure vil la nèt. Yo te ale pa chemen Araba a vle di dezè a. <verse eid="JER 52:7"/><verse number="8" style="v" sid="JER 52:8"/>Men lame Kaldeyen an te kouri dèyè wa a. Li te <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">52:8 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="JER 21:7">Jr 21:7</ref></char></note>rive sou Sédécias nan plèn Jéricho e tout lame li a te gen tan gaye kite li. <verse eid="JER 52:8"/><verse number="9" style="v" sid="JER 52:9"/>Epi yo te kaptire wa a. Yo te mennen li monte kote wa Babylone nan nan <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">52:9 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="NUM 34:11">Nonb 34:11</ref></char></note>Ribla nan peyi Hamath, e li te kondane li la. <verse eid="JER 52:9"/><verse number="10" style="v" sid="JER 52:10"/>Wa Babylone nan <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">52:10 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="2KI 25:7">II Wa 25:7</ref></char></note>te touye fis a Sédécias yo devan zye l e anplis, li te touye tout prens Juda yo Ribla. <verse eid="JER 52:10"/><verse number="11" style="v" sid="JER 52:11"/>Anplis, li te <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">52:11 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="JER 39:7">Jr 39:7</ref></char></note>avegle zye a Sédécias. Konsa, wa Babylone nan te anprizone l ak braslè an bwonz, te mennen li Babylone, e te mete l nan prizon jis rive jou ke li te mouri an.<verse eid="JER 52:11"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="JER 52:12"/>Alò, nan dizyèm jou nan senkyèm mwa a, ki te diz-nevyèm ane a wa Nebucadnetsar, wa Babylone nan, <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">52:12 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="JER 39:9">Jr 39:9</ref></char></note>Nebuzaradan, chèf an tèt kò gad la, ki te nan sèvis wa a Babylone nan, te rive Jérusalem. <verse eid="JER 52:12"/><verse number="13" style="v" sid="JER 52:13"/>Li te <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">52:13 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="1KI 9:8">I Wa 9:8</ref></char></note>brile kay SENYÈ a lakay wa a, ak tout kay Jérusalem yo; menm tout gwo kay yo, li te brile yo ak dife. <verse eid="JER 52:13"/><verse number="14" style="v" sid="JER 52:14"/>Konsa, tout lame Kaldeyen ki te avèk chèf kò gad yo, te <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">52:14 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="2KI 25:10">II Wa 25:10</ref></char></note>demoli tout miray ki te antoure Jérusalem yo. <verse eid="JER 52:14"/><verse number="15" style="v" sid="JER 52:15"/>Epi Nebuzaradan, chèf kò gad yo, te <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">52:15 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="2KI 25:11">II Wa 25:11</ref></char></note>mennen, pote an egzil kèk nan moun ki pi malere pami pèp la, tout lòt moun ki te rete nan vil la, sila ki te dezète Jérusalem yo pou ale kote wa Babylone nan ak tout rès moun metye yo. <verse eid="JER 52:15"/><verse number="16" style="v" sid="JER 52:16"/>Men <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">52:16 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="2KI 25:12">II Wa 25:12</ref></char></note>Nebuzaradan, chèf kò gad la, te kite kèk moun nan pi malere yo pou okipe chan rezen yo, e pou laboure tè a.<verse eid="JER 52:16"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="JER 52:17"/>Alò, pilye an bwonz, ki te apatyen a lakay SENYÈ a, baz yo, ak gwo <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">52:17 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="1KI 7:23-26">I Wa 7:23-26</ref></char></note>lanmè an bwonz ki te lakay SENYÈ a, Kaldeyen yo te kraze yo an mòso e te pote tout bwonz yo Babylone. <verse eid="JER 52:17"/><verse number="18" style="v" sid="JER 52:18"/>Anplis, yo te pran <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">52:18 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="EXO 27:3">Egz 27:3</ref></char></note>veso yo, pèl yo, etoufè yo, basen yo, po yo ak tout veso an bwonz ki te sèvi nan tanp lan. <verse eid="JER 52:18"/><verse number="19" style="v" sid="JER 52:19"/>Anplis, chèf kò gad la te retire <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">52:19 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="1KI 7:49-50">I Wa 7:49-50</ref></char></note>bòl yo, plato sann yo, basen yo, po yo, chandelye yo, sa ki te fèt an lò fen ak sa ki te fèt an ajan fen.<verse eid="JER 52:19"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="JER 52:20"/>De pilye yo, sèl lanmè a, douz towo an bwonz ki te anba lanmè a, ak baz yo, ke Wa Salomon te fè pou lakay SENYÈ a——bwonz nan tout veso sa yo te <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">52:20 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="1KI 7:47">I Wa 7:47</ref></char></note>depase kontwòl nan pwa. <verse eid="JER 52:20"/><verse number="21" style="v" sid="JER 52:21"/>Epi pou pilye yo, wotè a chak pilye te diz-uit koude, li te mezire douz koude <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">52:21 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="1KI 7:15">I Wa 7:15</ref></char></note>sikonferans lan, kat dwat nan epesè e vid nan mitan. <verse eid="JER 52:21"/><verse number="22" style="v" sid="JER 52:22"/>Alò, yon <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">52:22 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="1KI 7:16">I Wa 7:16</ref></char></note>tèt kouvèti an bwonz te sou li; epi wotè a chak tèt kouvèti te senk koude, ak yon sistèm mèch fèt avèk chèn an fil tòde pou tèt kouvèti ak grenad sou tèt kouvèti ki antoure l yo, tout nan bwonz nèt. Epi dezyèm pilye a te tankou sila a, menm ak grenad yo. <verse eid="JER 52:22"/><verse number="23" style="v" sid="JER 52:23"/>Te gen <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">52:23 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="1KI 7:20">I Wa 7:20</ref> </char></note>katre-ven-sèz grenad byen parèt; tout nan grenad yo te kontwole an santèn, sou sistèm mèch la toupatou.<verse eid="JER 52:23"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="JER 52:24"/>Epi chèf kò gad la te pran Seraja, chèf prèt la, Sophonie, dezyèm wo prèt la, ak twa <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">52:24 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="1CH 9:19">I Kwo 9:19</ref> </char></note>ofisye a tanp yo. <verse eid="JER 52:24"/><verse number="25" style="v" sid="JER 52:25"/>Anplis, li te pran soti nan vil la, yon ofisye ki te yon sipèvizè pou mesye lagè yo, sèt nan <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">52:25 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="2KI 25:19">II Wa 25:19</ref></char></note>konseye wa ki te twouve nan vil yo, grefye a wo kòmandan ki te òganize pèp peyi a ak swasant mesye a pèp ki te twouve nan mitan vil yo. <verse eid="JER 52:25"/><verse number="26" style="v" sid="JER 52:26"/>Nebuzaradan, chèf kò gad la te pran yo e te <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">52:26 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="2KI 25:20">II Wa 25:20</ref></char></note>mennen yo kote wa Babylone nan Ribla. <verse eid="JER 52:26"/><verse number="27" style="v" sid="JER 52:27"/>Epi wa Babylone nan te <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">52:27 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="2KI 25:21">II Wa 25:21</ref></char></note>frape yo mete a lanmò nan Ribla nan peyi Hamath la.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="JER 52:27">Konsa, Juda te mennen ale an egzil kite peyi li. <verse eid="JER 52:27"/><verse number="28" style="v" sid="JER 52:28"/>Sila yo se moun ke <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">52:28 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="2KI 24:2-16">II Wa 24:2-16</ref></char></note>Nebucadnetsar te pote ale an egzil nan setyèm ane a: twa-mil-venn-twa Jwif;<verse eid="JER 52:28"/></para>
  <para style="m">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="JER 52:29"/>nan diz-uityèm ane Nebucadnetsar a, ui-san-trant-de moun ki sòti Jérusalem;<verse eid="JER 52:29"/></para>
  <para style="m">
    <verse number="30" style="v" sid="JER 52:30"/>nan venn-twazyèm ane a Nebucadnetsar a, <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">52:30 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="2KI 25:11">II Wa 25:11</ref></char></note>Nebuzaradan, chèf kò gad yo te pote an egzil sèt-san-karant-senk Jwif. Nom de moun antou te kat-mil moun.<verse eid="JER 52:30"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" sid="JER 52:31"/>Alò, li te vin rive nan trant-setyèm ane egzil Jojakin, wa Juda a, nan douzyèm mwa a, sou venn-senkyèm jou a mwa a, ke Évil-Merodac, wa Babylone nan, nan premye ane règn li a, te montre favè li a Jojakin, wa Juda a, e te lage li nan prizon. <verse eid="JER 52:31"/><verse number="32" style="v" sid="JER 52:32"/><note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">52:32 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="2KI 25:28">II Wa 25:28</ref></char></note>Konsa, li te pale dousman avèk li e te mete twòn li pi wo pase twòn a wa ki te avèk li Babylone yo. <verse eid="JER 52:32"/><verse number="33" style="v" sid="JER 52:33"/>Konsa, Jojakin te chanje rad prizonye li a, e te <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">52:33 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="2SA 9:7-13">II Sam 9:7-13</ref></char></note>pran repa li nan prezans a wa a pandan tout rès jou lavi li yo. <verse eid="JER 52:33"/><verse number="34" style="v" sid="JER 52:34"/>Pou okipe li, li te resevwa yon <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">52:34 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="2SA 9:10">II Sam 9:10</ref></char></note>pòsyon nòmal chak jou pandan tout rès jou lavi li, jis rive jou li te mouri an.<verse eid="JER 52:34"/></para>
  <chapter eid="JER 52"/>
</usx>
